window.FWN_CHAOTIC_SWORD_GOD_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_CHAOTIC_SWORD_GOD_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3801,"title":"Chapter 3801: Important Evidence","paragraphs":["Looking at how speechless and emotional the Warring Old Freak had become, Jian Chen was surprised as well.","He had told him the truth to avoid antagonising a peak organisation like the War sect over some trifling matters. He had only wanted to make them stand down.","He had never imagined that the Warring Old Freak still held such sentiment towards the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. That was unexpected.","“Can you give me the memory crystal in your hand?” After a moment of silence, the Warring Old Freak spoke up. His attitude had changed significantly from before, no longer giving off any sense of aggression or forcefulness.","“Of course!” Jian Chen handed the memory crystal over to the Warring Old Freak without any hesitation.","The Warring Old Freak accepted the memory crystal sternly. He looked at Jian Chen calmly and said, “Don’t worry, I won’t divulge your identity. I can’t help the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, but I definitely won’t go out of my way to harm anyone from the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. That’s not just my promise, but also my bottom line when it comes to cultivation.”","“You’re worrying too much, senior Warring. Actually, I was hoping that you’d tell the Immortal Feather sect about me,” said Jian Chen.","“You want to kill the Wayless Immortal Exalt of the Immortal Feather sect?” The Warring Old Freak seemed to read Jian Chen’s thoughts, which led to an immediate frown. He said sternly, “That’s not a good idea. The Wayless Immortal Exalt is different from an Immortal Emperor great elder. He’s one of the ancestors of the Immortal Feather sect. If someone like that perishes, the Immortal Feather sect will definitely be infuriated. It’ll lead to a terrifying storm. Unless you possess the strength to crush everything, the outcome will be unimaginable.”","“And, if an Immortal Exalt ancestor of the Immortal Feather sect were to die on our Hall Brilliance Heaven, that would be a disaster for our Hall Brilliance Heaven.”","The Warring Old Freak shook his head without hesitation. “I can’t help you with this, nor do I have the courage to.”","With the memory crystal in his possession, the Warring Old Freak left. As soon as he emerged from the guest room, the power that shrouded the place instantly vanished as well.","“How is it, senior Warring?”","“Did you find any clues, senior Warring?”",".....","...","The dozen or so Immortal Exalts from peak organisations waiting outside all spoke up in concern.","“I’ve already found important evidence regarding the Fiend Soul Banner. We’ll talk about it once we head back!” The Warring Old Freak did not say much. He called out to everyone and left.","“He’s already found important evidence? This Immortal Emperor called Yang Yutian really has left me surprised...”","“We spent many days searching arduously, only to find nothing. As soon as we came here, we grasped important evidence. Looks like this person is anything but simple...”","......","...","The dozen or so Immortal Exalts glanced at Jian Chen in surprise. He had already emerged from the guest room. However, they did not talk much, leaving with the Warring Old Freak.","After these Immortal Exalts had left, a middle-aged woman in white robes suddenly appeared near the courtyard where Jian Chen was located. Her presence was concealed, where none of it leaked out. She was silent like a ghost. Even regular Immortal Exalts would struggle to detect her existence.","She was one of the three ancestors of the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment, the Flying Leaf Ancestor, a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt!","The Flying Leaf Ancestor stood outside the courtyard quietly. Her eyes were frosty, filled with chilling killing intent as she stared straight at the entrance of the courtyard.","At this moment, an old man in embroidered robes made his way over from the distance. The old man radiated with the vague presence of an Immortal Emperor. He seemed to be walking, but he would traverse a very great distance with each step.","The old man was elder Ling of the Merchant Union of Star Brilliance.","In just a few steps, elder Ling arrived outside the courtyard. Immediately, he noticed the Flying Leaf Ancestor who was nearby. His elderly eyes narrowed, clearly having recognised her. He stopped and clasped his fist towards the Flying Leaf Ancestor from afar.","However, right when he was about to speak up, the Flying Leaf Ancestor suddenly looked at him. Her chilling gaze made him stiffen as coldness filled his bones.","Elder Ling was startled; he became unprecedentedly stern.","However, the gaze vanished as quickly as it came. In merely a few seconds, the gaze vanished. The Flying Leaf Ancestor was gone as well.","Elder Ling’s expression changed. He stood where he was in silence for a while before sucking in a deep breath in the end. He entered the courtyard politely and personally handed over the batch of heavenly resources to Jian Chen.","The batch of heavenly resources were all for refining recovery pills. Jian Chen had specially prepared them for the Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal disciples who participated in the Divine Formation of the Heavens.","“Oh right, I saw the Flying Leaf Ancestor of the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment near the entrance earlier. You must be careful, fellow.” Elder Ling described what he saw before he left.","“The Flying Leaf Ancestor of the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment? She still has the spare energy to come here? If nothing goes wrong, the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment will face great trouble very soon.” Jian Chen smiled without much concern.","When he heard that, elder Ling shuddered inside. His eyes flickered with light. He realised something very soon, leaving in a hurry.","“The Warring Old Freak went to the Immortal Rising City. Soon after, he said he had grasped important evidence. Senior brother Transcension, I think I already know who senior brother Space-purging’s murderer is,” the Flying leaf Ancestor said resentfully in one of the three towers standing in the forbidden grounds of the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment.","“Are you saying the person who killed junior brother Space-purging is the person who took the Energy-devouring Furnace and the Heaven-locking Chains?” the Transcension Ancestor’s clone said.","“That’s right. After all, senior brother Space-purging’s murderer is the only person that could possess the evidence that the Fiend Soul Banner was in his possession,” the Flying Leaf Ancestor said as she ground her teeth in hatred.","But shortly afterwards, the Flying Leaf Ancestor became worried. “Senior brother Transcension, I’m worried that the Warring Old Freak will come after us now that he has obtained so-called important evidence.”","“What are you panicking for? I refuse to believe they have actually obtained important evidence...” the Transcension Ancestor said extremely calmly.","However, as soon as he said that, tremendous presences enveloped the entire Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment.","Figures hovered around the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment. There were over a hundred of them, surrounding the entire sect.","Apart from around a dozen Immortal Exalts, the rest were all Immortal Emperors. All of them were murderous. Their gazes were frosty.","There were not a lot of them, but they already represented the will of the entire Hall Brilliance Heaven to a certain extent.","The Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment immediately became chaotic. A dozen or so Immortal Exalts and several dozen Immortal Emperors. This was a group even larger than last time.","“Oh no, they’ve come with such aggression. Don’t tell me they’ve really come into possession of some kind of evidence?” The Flying Leaf Ancestor also sensed the situation outside. Her expression changed as she became frantic.","She could already delicately sense that the situation this time was completely different from last time.","“Don’t panic!” The Transcension Ancestor seemed much more composed. His clone also looked outside as the light in his eyes flickered with surprise and uncertainty.","In the next moment, the Transcension Ancestor had already vanished from the tower, appearing before the Immortal Exalts."]},{"number":3802,"title":"Chapter 3802: The Aural Heavens Elder","paragraphs":["Each of the dozen or so Immortal Exalts represented a peak organisation on the Hall Brilliance Heaven. At this moment, they all still followed the Warring Old Freak.","“Transcension, I know you won’t admit it unless you’re faced with the grim reality. Take a look at this memory crystal,” the Warring Old Freak said emotionlessly as he radiated with pressure. He directly tossed a memory crystal over to the Transcension Ancestor.","The Transcenion Ancestor accepted the memory crystal and took a look. His face immediately sank. He crushed the memory crystal furiously and said in pain, “What a Space-purging. He appeared all righteous on the surface, but never did I imagine he would actually... actually... actually do something so vicious. Our sect is truly unfortunate, truly unfortunate...”","The Transcension Ancestor’s face was filled with self-blame. He acted as if he was too ashamed to stand before everyone. He clasped his fist towards them and said, “I’m truly at fault. Space-purging defied the orthodoxy, and my Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment was completely unaware of it. That is shameful of our sect. Please don’t worry, everyone. Our Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment will definitely get to the bottom of what Space-purging has done on the Hall Brilliance Heaven over the years.”","When he reached there, the Transcension Ancestor paused. He gritted his teeth as if he had made some kind of important decision and said, “And from this day onwards, Space-purging is no longer a disciple of our Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment. He will be eliminated from the sect register forever.”","The Flying Leaf Ancestor appeared behind the Transcension Ancestor. Listening to his words, she was filled with anguish.","“Transcension, stop playing the fool. I’ve already received precise information. The person behind the smaller organisations of the Hall Brilliance Heaven, as well as the person who ordered them to kill innocent cultivators, is you.”","“You needed them to do that to nurture the Fiend Soul Banners. You are the person forging the Fiend Soul Banners.”","The Warring Old Freak’s voice boomed thunderously, echoing through the surroundings and making the mountains shake.","“Fiend Soul Banners? What are those?”","“From the name, it seems like a demonic item...”","......","...","Many disciples in the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment were puzzled. They had never heard about Fiend Soul Banners before. Only a few Immortal Emperor great elders who were senior enough and had been cultivating for long enough possessed the right to know some incomplete information about Fiend Soul Banners. Everyone’s faces changed drastically.","“Impossible. Senior Warring, senior brother Transcension is a man of great prestige on the Hall Brilliance Heaven. With senior brother Transcension’s status, why would he forge such a vicious demonic god artifact? After all, that is a tremendous taboo. It’s enough to doom the entire sect. Senior brother Transcension cherishes the sect more than anything, so why would he do that?” The Flying Leaf Ancestor immediately denied the accusation. She was aware that she could not let them establish a connection between the Fiend Soul Banners and the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment no matter what.","“You can’t just make claims like that, Warring Old Freak. You’re saying that I forged the Fiend Soul Banner, so do you have any evidence to prove it? Don’t tell me you’ve concluded this just from what you divined? Or are you trying to forcefully impose the crimes that Space-purging committed outside onto our Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment?” The Transcension Ancestor’s clone rebuked with composure.","It was true that the memory crystal did not contain any explicit mention of the Fiend Soul Banner. It only mentioned some heinous deeds that had been committed.","However, heinous deeds covered a wide range of actions. It did not necessarily point to forging Fiend Soul Banners.","Using this hole in the evidence, the two ancestors of the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment put on an aggressive defence, denying any connections to the Fiend Soul Banners. They engaged the various organisations that had come to punish them in an intense verbal battle above the sect.","In the end, the Transcension Ancestor opened all of the forbidden grounds of the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment to everyone again, letting these Immortal Exalts search through them freely.","Afterwards, everyone carried out a second close search of the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment. They were clearly even more careful this time. They used all sorts of secret techniques and abilities, but they still found nothing. They did not find any useful information.","At this moment, the Warring Old Freak stood inside the three towers where the Immortal Exalts had gathered. He glanced around and said sternly, “Out of the entire sect, the three towers are the only place where we can’t find anything. All of the traces here have been erased. We cannot recover the past.”","When he heard that, the Transcension Ancestor furrowed his brows and said unhappily, “This is where the three of us spend most of our time cultivating. It’s regularly rinsed by the laws. If you want to turn back time using secret techniques, you obviously won’t find anything.”","“After all, how can a place where an Immortal Exalt cultivates be peered into so easily?”","The Warring Old Freak smiled slightly and said, “The Fiend Soul Banner is such a powerful demonic artifact, so it must have left behind some traces. In the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment, this is the only place that remains unknown to us, so I believe that the three towers are the only point of vulnerability.”","“Warring Old Freak, if you insist that there are some unspeakable secrets hidden here, then go on ahead and search for it. However, let me make this clear. I’ll only give you three days. If you still haven’t found clear evidence after three days, then you better all give our Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment an explanation,” the Transcension Ancestor said coldly. He was completely composed.","The Flying Leaf Ancestor who stood behind him had been unsettled the entire time. She was extremely uneasy.","That was because for a very long period of time, the three of them had held all of their secret conversations within the three towers. They concealed their secret conversations with their powers each time and had erased all traces. Even if a late Immortal Exalt was present, they would not be able to find anything.","However, something could always go wrong.","In particular, the Warring Old Freak’s confidence left her feeling even more uneasy.","“Three days? No, we won’t need that long.” The Warring Old Freak smiled mysteriously. He slowly turned around and suddenly looked outside the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment with his sombre eyes. He clasped his fist and said firmly, “Fellow Aural Heavens, I’ll have to trouble you with everything to follow.”","With the Warring Old Freak’s strength and status, it was as clear as day just how great this person’s status was with how politely he referred to him.","The Immortal Exalts gathered within the towers all narrowed their eyes after hearing the Warring Old Freak’s words. They looked outside the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment with some surprise and curiosity.","An old man with white hair and eyebrows silently appeared where they were looking. His presence was perfectly concealed, so none of it leaked out.","The old man’s eyes shone brilliantly, giving off a sense of vigour. His white robes glistened with light that resembled the stars, giving off a profound presence like the manifestation of the laws.","“The Aural Heavens Elder!” The Transcension Ancestor immediately recognised the old man. His eyes narrowed slightly as he blurted out uncontrollably.","When the Immortal Exalts of the Hall Brilliance Heaven heard the Transcension Ancestor’s cry, they were surprised at first. They started trying to recall who the Aural Heavens Elder was.","But very soon, they seemed to remember something, and their faces immediately changed, becoming filled with seriousness and respect.","“The Aural Heavens Elder! It’s actually the Aural Heavens Elder! That’s a supreme expert of the Merchant Union of Star Brilliance. He spends most of his time at the headquarters of the Merchant Union of Star Brilliance on the Plain Subtlety Heaven.”","“The Aural Heavens Elder has actually come to our Hall Brilliance Heaven personally. That’s a supreme expert of the Seventh Heavenly Layer...”","......","...","The arrival of the Aural Heavens Elder immediately caused quite a stir among the Immortal Exalts of the Hall Brilliance Heaven. Many of the early Immortal Exalts looked at him in reverence.","On the Hall Brilliance Heaven, even the strongest, the Warring Old Freak, was only a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. He was the undisputed greatest expert of the Hall Brilliance Heaven. Although the Warring Old Freak had already remained at his present cultivation for several million years, it was still unknown whether he could reach the Seventh Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt in his lifetime.","However, the Aural Heavens Elder was different. He was a true Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt.","The Sixth Heavenly Layer belonged to mid Immortal Exalt, while the Seventh Heavenly Layer belonged to late Immortal Exalt. There was an intrinsic difference between the two.","As a result, when an expert like this suddenly appeared on the Hall Brilliance Heaven, it had an unimaginable impact on the heaven."]},{"number":3803,"title":"Chapter 3803: The World Wheel","paragraphs":["The Aural Heaven Elder strode through the air. Apart from his robes that glistened brightly and seemed extraordinary, his appearance was extremely simple. He did not give off the presence of a late Immortal Exalt at all.","The Aural Heaven Elder directly arrived at the tower in the back mountains of the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment, appearing before the Warring Old Freak.","Inside the tower, the dozen or so Immortal Exalts all clasped their fists and bowed. They demonstrated deep respect.","The Transcension Ancestor of the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment clasped his fist as well, except his expression was rather ugly. Not only was the Aural Heavens Elder powerful, but the organisation he represented was like an unshakable pillar, enough to strike awe into him.","With the arrival of such an expert, the Transcenion Ancestor was overcome by a feeling of uneasiness.","“Fellow Aural Heavens, you must have noticed as well. All of the organisations of our Hall Brilliance Heaven have already done everything that we can to look for the person forging the Fiend Soul Banners, but our abilities are limited. Consequently, we could only trouble you.” The Warring Old Freak clasped his first towards the Aural Heavens Elder.","“Whenever our Merchant Union of Star Brilliance uses the World Wheel, it comes at a tremendous cost. Not only does it require the efforts of several Immortal Exalts, but it also consumes a tremendous amount of resources. If it were not for the fact that someone is forging a demonic god artifact as vicious as the Fiend Soul Banner, our Merchant Union of Star Brilliance really would have been reluctant to use the World Wheel.”","“As a result, we can only activate the World Wheel once. This opportunity is extremely precious. Are you certain you can find crucial evidence here?” the Aural Heavens Elder said to the Warring Old Freak sternly.","Clearly, he also treasured the opportunity to activate the World Wheel.","“What? The World Wheel...”","“The Merchant Union of Star Brilliance is actually prepared to use the World Wheel. Heavens, that’s a sovereign god artifact...”","“It’s said that the World Wheel contains the mysteries of time and space. It can peer into the past of a region and even recover the history of the place. Before this sovereign god artifact, even if an Immortal Exalt erases the traces of the ways, it can still reassemble it all together.”","“Fantastic. With a sovereign god artifact like the World Wheel, we’ll be able to know whether the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment is actually guilty or not.”","The Immortal Exalts discussed. They were all reinvigorated as their eyes shone brightly.","Some of them were eager to find out the truth of this matter, while others were elated since they could soon witness the supreme might of a sovereign god artifact.","Despite being Immortal Exalts, many of them had yet to personally witness a sovereign god artifact’s true appearance.","Some of the poorer Immortal Exalts had never even touched a high quality god artifact before.","Faced with the Aural Heavens Elder’s request for confirmation, the Warring Old Freak’s eyes were determined. He nodded without hesitation and said, “I’m certain we won’t be disappointed here.”","“Everyone, we’ve already opened the entirety of the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment to you. We’ve even let you enter the place where the three of us cultivate. We’ve gone above and beyond our duty, which is enough to prove our sincerity, so you better not take things too far. After all, our Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment should still be respected.” The Transcension Ancestor was rather displeased, speaking up to object. He wanted to stop the Aural Heavens Elder from using the World Wheel here.","“This is where we cultivate. There will definitely be some of our private secrets hidden here. Our Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment will not allow you to use the World Wheel here.” The Flying Leaf Ancestor spoke up firmly as well, trying her best to stop them.","“Have you begun to panic?” The Warring Old Freak looked at the two ancestors of the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment with a slight smile. “Actually, I wasn’t completely confident before this, but from how you’ve responded, you’ve only confirmed my doubts.”","“Flying Leaf, Transcension, stand aside and watch for now.” The Warring Old Freak pressed down with his hand. A terrifying force immediately took shape in the space there, condensing into two cages that enveloped the Flying Leaf Ancestor and the Transcension Ancestor.","“Warring Old Freak, what are you doing?” The Transcension Ancestor bellowed fiercely. He could no longer maintain the same composure as before. His face became extremely sunken.","He was a Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, but there was nothing he could do since this was only a clone. He obviously stood no chance against the Warring Old Freak.","“Our Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment is a renowned peak organisation of the Hall Brilliance Heaven after all. Senior Warring, you’re going too far with this.” The Flying Leaf Ancestor spoke up righteously, voicing that this was injustice, but she was panicking inside.","After all, this was a sovereign god artifact, the World Wheel. It possessed unfathomable power.","When they erased the traces in the three towers, they never imagined that they would be searched by a sovereign god artifact some day.","“Please don’t panic, the two of you. If you truly are innocent, the Warring Old Freak and the other fellows of the Hall Brilliance Heaven will definitely compensate you satisfactorily.” The Aural Heavens Elder comforted them before taking action.","He formed a seal with both hands, and a profound presence flowed through the surroundings. He chanted away like he was performing a spell.","At the same time, the presence of a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt slowly erupted from him, growing stronger and stronger, gradually stirring up a storm of energy at the top of the tower.","As for the other Immortal Exalts present apart from the Warring Old Freak, many of them struggled to endure this tremendous presence. They slowly backed away until they retreated to the edge of the tower.","“Open!” At this moment, the Aural Heavens Elder completed his seal. An ancient imprint had already taken shape between his hands, radiating with startling pulses of energy. With his bellow, the imprint suddenly slammed into the space there.","Immediately, the space above everyone’s heads split open. Energy surged inside as multicoloured light churned. In the end, a dim space that resembled a secret room appeared.","It was an entirely different space. Who knew how far away it was from the Hall Brilliance Heaven.","“Fellows, please activate the World Wheel!” the Aural Heavens Elder said to the empty secret room.","As soon as he finished speaking, four figures silently appeared in the secret room. They were all ruddy old men, radiating with powerful presences.","At this moment, the four old men seemed to see the Immortal Exalts on the distant Hall Brilliance Heaven. One of them said, “A Fiend Soul Banner has appeared on the Hall Brilliance Heaven. The union leader cares very much about this, so he’s specially sent us to cooperate with you in your investigation with the World Wheel. However, the World Wheel can only be used once. Aural Heavens, are you certain you want to use it now?”","The Aural Heavens Elder looked towards the Warring Old Freak. Seeing the Warring Old Freak’s confident gaze, he immediately made up his mind and turned towards the four figures. “Fellows, let’s begin!”","The old men in the secret room immediately stopped hesitating. As they formed various seals, the dim room lit up. A wheel several metres across appeared out of nowhere, shining with dazzling light and radiation with a terrifying presence enough to bring chills to Immortal Exalts.","This was a sovereign god artifact, the World Wheel!"]},{"number":3804,"title":"Chapter 3804: Turning Back Time","paragraphs":["The World Wheel had been left behind by a Grand Exalt who grasped the Ways of Space and the Ways of Time. It contained the mysteries of space and time. In terms of offensive power, the World Wheel was not particularly powerful among sovereign god artifacts, but it had an unimaginable effect when it came to recovering the past.","In the next moment, the World Wheel glowed brighter. Under the combined efforts of the Immortal Exalts in the secret room, it finally began to demonstrate its power as a sovereign god artifact. It projected a gorgeous beam of white light, which possessed the secrets of space and time, instantly traversing the distance between them and arriving in the tower in the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment, enveloping the space there.","As the sovereign god artifact demonstrated its might, the four Immortal Exalts responsible for powering it were solemn. They seemed slightly strained. They circulated their energy, clearly using their full strength already.","The World Wheel was not a complete sovereign god artifact. It had been heavily damaged in the past. Although it was later repaired, it had yet to nurture another artifact spirit.","Without the assistance of an artifact spirit, powering a sovereign god artifact was anything but easy.","Only Grand Exalts could unleash the power of sovereign god artifacts freely.","When the beam of light from the World Wheel enveloped the space in the tower, all of the Immortal Exalts present were overcome with an illusion. In a daze, they seemed to feel that the shattered ways were being reassembled, and the erased traces were gradually being recovered.","The World Wheel was currently shifting the world with its great power, forcefully recovering the past.","Under such great power, the methods that regular Immortal Exalts used to erase the ways seemed like a joke.","“It truly is a sovereign god artifact. Despite such a great distance, it can still descend from the Plain Subtlety Heaven with such terrifying power. I struggle to imagine how I would be able to endure this pressure from the sovereign god artifact.”","“The Plain Subtlety Heaven is extremely distant from the Hall Brilliance Heaven, but this distance seems to be completely negligible before the World Wheel.”","“It is a sovereign god artifact that contains the Ways of Time and the Ways of Space after all. The Immortals’ World may be vast, but it is all within arm’s reach for the World Wheel.”","......","...","Many of the Immortal Exalts in the tower were shocked. They had already realised that the dim room that appeared in the sky was actually located on the distant Plain Subtlety Heaven. Although the spatial tunnel seemed to be opened by the Aural Heavens Elder, it was actually due to the World Wheel’s power.","The Aural Heavens Elder used a special secret technique to connect with the World Wheel before using a wisp of its power to construct this spatial tunnel that connected the two places.","At the same time, everyone in the tower felt their vision blur. Everything around them was the same, but time seemed to recede rapidly. Everyone saw two Flying Leaf Ancestors and two Transcension Ancestors at the same time.","The two additional people were both from the past. Everything displayed before everyone receded rapidly.","Inside the two cages created by the Warring Old Freak’s power, the Transcension Ancestor stood emotionlessly. His eyes were extremely cold.","Meanwhile, the Flying Leaf Ancestor was extremely pale. Her eyes were filled with deep despair.","These matters of the past had all been erased by them. At this moment, they were being forcefully recovered by the World Wheel. It was not just what had happened, but even their conversations had been recovered perfectly.","They had spoken about the Fiend Soul Banner far too much in the tower.","Moreover, the details of the conversations were enough for all of the Immortal Exalts present to find out who was truly forging the Fiend Soul Banners.","After all, the Transcension Ancestor had said it himself.","......","...","“Do not be careless. This is a secondary banner of the Fiend Soul Banners. It can disturb the soul. Even with my cultivation, I am still affected by it. Take it with you just in case.”","“Remember, this is a demonic object. Many members of the orthodox of the Immortals’ World cannot allow something like this to exist, so do not use it unless you run out of choices. Once you do use it, leave none alive.”","......","...","“Brother, the Fiend Soul Banners are for dealing with the War sect. They’re a set of extremely outstanding weapons. I’m only going to the Immortal Rising City to retrieve our Energy-devouring Furnace and Heaven-locking Chains this time. There’s no need for me to take a Fiend Soul Banner with me.”","......","...","The old bastard from the War sect is a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. Senior brother Transcension, are we really able to destroy the War sect with the Fiend Soul Banners?”","......","...","“The two secondary banners have already been forged successfully. It all comes down to the most important primary banner now. However, the primary banner has also reached a critical moment in its forging. Perhaps in another ten thousand years, we’ll be able to go after the War sect.”","......","...","“Hahahaha, once the War sect is destroyed, we will reign over the Hall Brilliance Heaven. We will rise up as the greatest organisation of this heaven.”","......","...","Everything that occurred in the tower was presented before everyone in utmost clarity. The Immortal Exalt ancestors of the Hall Brilliance Heaven were all bewildered. Many of them subconsciously looked towards the Warring Old Freak.","The Warring Old Freak’s face had darkened. He clenched his fists firmly as his eyes burned with the flames of fury. They shone with terrifying killing intent that startled many of the Immortal Exalts present.","With the World Wheel, basically all of the secrets of the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment had been revealed.","“Since we’ve already gotten to the bottom of this, we should stop. After all, we’re doing this to investigate the Fiend Soul Banner, not to infringe upon the privacy of others.” As an elderly voice rang out from the dim secret room, the power projected down by the World Wheel vanished. The scenes in the tower suddenly vanished as well.","“We’ve already completed the mission that the union leader gave us. We have no more business here now. As for the Fiend Soul Banner, hopefully your Hall Brilliance Heaven can handle it properly. You must not disappoint the rest of the Immortals’ World.”","“Reaping the lives of billions from lower worlds just to forge a demonic god artifact. This defies nature itself and is punishable by death.”","The four Immortal Exalts from the Plain Subtlety Heaven all sighed. Shortly afterwards, the spatial tunnel over their heads gradually vanished.","Everything returned to normal in the tower.","“Transcension, what else do you have to say!?” Suddenly, a bellow rang out. An Immortal Exalt glared at the Transcension Ancestor furiously as his eyes burned with rage."]},{"number":3805,"title":"Chapter 3805: Reduced to Ruins","paragraphs":["The Warring Old Freak also looked at the Transcension Ancestor coldly, radiating with killing intent. As it turned out, the Transcension Ancestor’s ultimate objective for forging the Fiend Soul Banners was actually to deal with his War sect.","Fortunately, this matter had been prematurely exposed. If they really managed to make all of their arrangements and forge the Fiend Soul Banners, the consequences would be unthinkable.","The Flying Leaf Ancestor collapsed onto the ground powerlessly. Her eyes were hollow and empty. Clearly, she had already given up on everything.","There was not just the Immortal Exalts of the Hall Brilliance Heaven gathered here but also the Warring Old Freak, a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, and the Aural Heavens Elder from the Merchant Union of Star Brilliance who was clearly even stronger.","Faced with such a force, she did not even have the courage to flee.","The Transcension Ancestor was calm. Despite everything having been exposed already, he still behaved like nothing had happened at all.","He turned his gaze and looked at the Flying Leaf Ancestor. “Junior sister, do you blame me for everything that’s happened today?”","The Flying Leaf Ancestor shook her head numbly. She said nothing in response.","“However, I was entirely responsible for forging the Fiend Soul Banners. Neither you nor your senior brother Space-purging took part in this, so this has nothing to do with you. It has nothing to do with the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment either,” the Transcension Ancestor said calmly before glancing past the dozen or so Immortal Exalts present slowly. “You must have heard what I’ve just said. I’m entirely responsible for the Fiend Soul Banners. It has nothing to do with anyone else, much less the sect.”","“As a result, feel free to come and find me, but if you want to drag junior sister Flying Leaf and the sect into this...” Reaching there, the Transcension Ancestor paused. His eyes surged with endless coldness. “Then I swear that when I return, I will make you all pay an unimaginable price.”","After saying that, the Transcension Ancestor’s clone began to burn, turning into ash and dissipating into the surroundings.","“How blatant, how utmostly blatant!” Many of the Immortal Exalts in the tower were angered, but they recalled the Transcension Ancestor’s threats and shivered after calming down.","The Hall Brilliance Heaven mostly had early Immortal Exalts. There were only a measly total of three or four people who had reached the Fourth Heavenly Layer. Faced with the threats of a Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, probably only an expert like the Warring Old Freak could remain unfazed.","Most importantly, the Transcension Ancestor’s strength ranked a terrifying second on the Hall Brilliance Heaven.","It was also because of the Transcension Ancestor’s presence that the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment could stand as the second greatest organisation of the Hall Brilliance Heaven, only second to the War sect!","Simply the thought of any expert like that becoming unchained and going after them for revenge was terrifying.","“This person does indeed deserve to die. He puts on the facade of a righteous member of the orthodoxy, yet he commits deeds even more heinous than the demons of the Demons’ World.” The normally amicable Aural Heavens Elder was angered as well. His expression became slightly cold before he extended two fingers gently towards the space where the Transcension Ancestor’s clone had vanished.","The profound presence of ways flowed through the tip of his fingers, possessing the secrets of how the ways operate. It was as if his fingers could rewrite the laws in the surroundings.","This was the comprehension of a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt!","Shortly afterwards, a presence seemed to silently condense on the tips of his fingers.","It was the Transcension Ancestor’s presence. Originally, when he destroyed his clone and incinerated all of his clone’s presence and traces, it was to ensure that he left behind no clues connected to his main body.","But despite that, the Aural Heavens Elder had used his laws to revert this process and turn back time, forcefully extracting a wisp of the Transcension Ancestor’s presence.","The Aural Heavens Elder trapped the Transcension Ancestor’s presence in one hand as he formed seals with his other hand. His eyes became deep like the starry sky. Laws seemed to weave through his pupils as the complex ways manifested.","He was using his cultivation at the Seventh Heavenly Layer to deduce the location of the Transcension Ancestor’s true body with the presence as a medium.","In the tower, all of the experts understood what the Aural Heavens Elder was doing. They all held their breaths, staring straight at him as they waited eagerly.","As long as the Transcension Ancestor was still alive, none of them dared to move recklessly. On the Hall Brilliance Heaven, none of them stood a chance against the Transcension Ancestor’s vengeance apart from the War sect.","Even for the War sect, it would be tremendous trouble if a Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt hidden in the shadows decided to go after them.","“Hopefully, we can find the Transcension Ancestor’s true body and kill him in one fell stroke before the main banner of the Fiend Soul Banners is forged.”","“Yeah, if we let him forge the main banner successfully, he’ll probably be able to rival senior Warring with the power of the Fiend Soul Banner.”","Many of the Immortal Exalts were filled with worry.","A while later, the Aural Heavens Elder stopped. Before he could say anything, some of the Immortal Exalts already began to ask him for the result.","The Aural Heavens Ancestor sighed gently. “This person is extremely cautious. Although he left a clone here, he’s already severed all connection with the clone. Moreover, I’ve deduced that it’s extremely likely that he possessed a treasure that can obscure the heavenly secrets and hide him from all attempts at searching for him.”","When they heard that, the hearts of many Immortal Exalts sank.","“In other words, unless the Transcension Ancestor shows himself, it’ll be almost impossible for us to find him?” the Warring Old Freak said sternly. The Transcension Ancestor was forging the Fiend Soul Banner to come after his War sect. He was in greater urgency to eliminate this threat than any of the people present.","The Aural Heavens Elder nodded and said in thought, “Right now, his main body should be hidden in a lower world, but there are innumerable lower worlds. With his strength, if he wants to hide, finding him is almost impossible.”","The Warring Old Freak fell silent.","“However, this person is forging the Fiend Soul Banners. He’s already committed a great taboo. Our union leader cares very much about this, so the union leader should make some arrangements later.” The Aural Heavens Elder glanced at the Warring Old Freak first before glancing past all of the Immortal Exalts present slowly. “In short, this is no longer just a matter of the Hall Brilliance Heaven anymore, so you don’t have to feel too much pressure.”","Only when they heard that did some of the Immortal Exalts present ease up. They all knew the strength of the Merchant Union of Star Brilliance. With the Merchant Union of Star Brilliance’s participation, everything would become much easier.","“I still have to report back to the union leader about what had happened here, so I’ll be taking my leave first!” The Aural Heavens Elder seemed very amicable. He did not put on the airs of a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt at all. He clasped his fist towards everyone before vanishing."]},{"number":3806,"title":"Chapter 3806: Destruction of the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment","paragraphs":["Due to the Aural Heavens Elder’s words, the Immortal Exalt ancestors of the Hall Brilliance Heaven suddenly became filled with confidence about dealing with the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment. They no longer feared the Transcension Ancestor’s threats.","Afterwards, with the Warring Old Freak of the War sect leading them, the dozen or so Immortal Exalts took action against the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment.","They did not kill everyone. Instead, they set up a rather high-level formation, a Conscience Formation. Not only did the Conscience Formation have the ability to reflect the thoughts of cultivators that were not particularly powerful, but it could also test their moral alignment and reveal if they had committed any horrifying massacres in the past.","All of the virtuous disciples of the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment that had not committed any ill deeds only had to renounce their membership and they could live.","If there were any malicious disciples or disciples who had committed various heinous crimes, then they would be executed.","Of course, the Conscience Formation could only test disciples below Immortal Monarch. Immortal Monarchs were capable of disguising themselves through various ways to deceive the Conscience Formation.","As a result, the Immortal Monarchs and Immortal Emperors of the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment were asked to open their souls and allow their souls to be searched.","These experts of the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment were obviously hostile to this request, some choosing death over obliging. However, after the Warring Old Freak had killed a few of them swiftly, the remaining people could only oblige in order to live.","The people responsible for searching their souls were the Immortal Exalts from the peak organisations.","However, even when the Immortal Monarchs and Immortal Emperors opened their souls entirely and cooperated, it still took quite a toll on these Immortal Exalts.","If there was only a small number of them, then they could still withstand it, but even Immortal Exalts could not endure searching through so many souls in such a short time.","As a result, the various Immortal Exalts of the Hall Brilliance Heaven had quite an objection to the matter of soul searching. They believed that this was a pointless and arduous endeavour. They instead suggested destroying the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment completely without sparing anyone.","However, the Warring Old Freak and a few Immortal Exalts refused to kill the innocent, which was why they suggested this method, giving them a chance at survival.","In the end, after several days of searching, only a few hundred people in the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment had committed sinful deeds. After being executed on the spot by the various organisations, the other disciples and experts all managed to scrape by with their lives.","Under the rules set down by the various organisations, they handed over all of their resources and god artifacts and swore that they had severed all connection with the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment before leaving dejectedly.","The Flying Leaf Ancestor of the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment was not fortunate enough to enjoy such treatment. In the hearts of all of the Immortal Exalts of the Hall Brilliance Heaven, she had already received the death sentence.","The Warring Old Freak personally destroyed her body, seized her soul, and brought her back to the War sect!","In the blink of an eye, the second greatest organisation on the Hall Brilliance Heaven, the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment, had been destroyed without any conflict.","Originally, the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment’s strength could even challenge the War sect. Even if they stood no chance, they could make the War sect pay a heavy price.","However, the matter of the Transcension Ancestor forging the Fiend Soul Banners had been exposed, turning them into public enemies of the entire Hall Brilliance Heaven. Obviously, they stood no chance as they faced a dozen or so peak organisations when the Transcension Ancestor was not currently present and the Space-purging Ancestor was already dead.","The destruction of the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment stirred up great ripples across the Hall Brilliance Heaven. It became the hottest topic of conversation. It was possible to hear cultivators talking about this everywhere.","“It’s said that forging the Fiend Soul Banners requires billions of lives. To think that the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment was actually willing to do something so vicious...”","“I heard that the Transcension Ancestor’s Fiend Soul Banners weren’t forged in the Immortals’ World. Instead, he hid in lower worlds and destroyed an entire world in the process of gathering materials for the Fiend Soul banner.”","“Some of the relatively populous lower worlds have far more than billions of lives. Who knows how many lower worlds he’s destroyed to forge the Fiend Soul Banners. To think that the Transcension Ancestor is actually able to commit such heinous deeds.”","“Although there is conflict and death in the Immortals’ World, it is primarily a conflict of cultivation, a conflict of interest, and conflict from personal grievances. There’s an intrinsic difference from the Transcension Ancestor’s brutal massacre of innocent lives.”","......","...","Many cultivators criticised the Transcension Ancestor on the Hall Brilliance Heaven. In particular, fanned on by the various peak organisations, the Transcension Ancestor’s reputation was completely reduced to ruins. He was lumped with other heretic crooks.","At the same time, under the announcements of the various organisations, more cultivators learnt about the Fiend Soul Banners.","The Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment had already been reduced to ruins. The spiritual veins underground were unearthed and taken away, and the medicinal gardens had been emptied out.","In short, all of the precious resources stored in the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment had been split up among the various organisations.","However, regardless of how turbulent the outside world became, it did not influence Jian Chen at all as he resided in the Immortal Rising City.","Over the past few days, Jian Chen remained in his courtyard, rarely setting foot outside and without paying any attention to the situation happening around him.","In the beginning, very few people in the Immortal Rising City knew about his existence, but ever since the Warring Old Freak personally visited him with a group of Immortal Exalts, his renown was spread far and wide. Not only did many organisations of various sizes in the Immortal Rising City notice this place, but even some peak organisations that resided at the apex of the world cast their attention over.","Endless visitors came after he had risen to renown. The organisations rooted in the Immortal Rising City, including the eight clans, all visited him with bountiful gifts in an attempt to form a bond with the mysterious expert who resided in the courtyard.","Apart from these organisations native to the Immortal Rising City, various peak organisations on the Hall Brilliance Heaven came to visit as well.","However, Jian Chen was only a passerby on the Hall Brilliance Heaven. He did not want any connections with these organisations here. After running out of patience, he directly raised a spatial barrier around the courtyard, blocking everyone from disturbing him.","After receiving Jian Chen’s approval, the city lord of the Immortal Rising City, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu, immediately dispatched a group of guards to closely watch the surroundings of the courtyard, using the forces of the Immortal Rising City to help alleviate the disturbances from the outside world.","Elder Ling of the Merchant Union of Star Brilliance had visited several times. Each time, he would bring Jian Chen a batch of heavenly resources for forging supreme grade Immortal Tier pills. At the same time, he became even more respectful of Jian Chen.","He was only purchasing some heavenly resources that were not of particularly high quality, yet it required a person like elder Ling to deliver it personally. There were not a lot of people on the entire Hall Brilliance Heaven that enjoyed such treatment.","The heavenly resources for refining the recovery pills were even easier to gather than the heavenly resources for the Godking pills.","As a result, under the Merchant Union of Star Brilliance’s assistance, Jian Chen gathered several tens of thousand batches in a very short amount of time.","That was enough to satisfy even some peak organisations for a thousand years.","But to Jian Chen, these several tens of thousand batches of heavenly resources could only sustain a few activations of the Divine Formation of the Heavens."]},{"number":3807,"title":"Chapter 3807: Ten Years","paragraphs":["Of course, these recovery pills were all strategic resources. They would only be used under special circumstances when Jian Chen needed the Divine Formation of the Heavens to be available at all times.","Jian Chen gave all of the heavenly resources to Dan Chenzi. Afterwards, he mobilised the entire Hall of Alchemy in the Primeval Divine Hall. All of the alchemists began refining various kinds of Immortal Tier pills.","Dan Chenzi did not idle around either. He personally fired up a cauldron and spent all his time refining high grade Godking pills.","Apart from him, a few of the Immortal Monarchs that possessed extremely great mastery over the Way of Alchemy in the Hall of Alchemy also participated in refining high grade Godking pills under the cooperation of a few Immortal Emperors.","As a result, explosions would constantly ring out from the Hall of Alchemy for a very long time into the future.","High grade Godking pills were extremely difficult to refine. Not only were they a harsh test for an alchemist’s level of mastery, but the Immortal Emperors responsible for suppressing the violent power within the Godking pills also influenced the success rate.","If Dan Chenzi were to refine them personally, then the success rate would be over ninety percent.","However, these Immortal Monarchs only had a success rate of around seventy percent.","However, Jian Chen no longer cared about the twenty or thirty percent of materials that were lost in the process since he wanted to increase efficiency. As long as he could assemble fifty thousand Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals in the shortest time possible, he did not mind wasting some high grade Godking grass.","As he waited for the Skyscraping World to open, Jian Chen also finally made up his mind and sent Jing Mumu outside alone to train. He personally sent her out of the city and gave her a small number of cultivation resources before stepping aside without interfering with her actions anymore.","However, for the sake of her safety, not only did Jian Chen leave a soul imprint on her, but he also let the Immortal Devouring Orchid out of the Primeval Divine Hall. He made it hide in a mountainous forest so that it could have a “coincidental encounter” with Jing Mumu as a spiritual plant. Then it could follow her by going with the flow.","The Immortal Devouring Orchid did not interfere with what Jing Mumu did either. Only when she faced life-threatening danger would it lend some assistance secretly.","Jing Mumu never would have imagined that she actually “carried” an Immortal Exalt on her!","Even among courts of heaven, Immortal Exalts were regarded as ancestors, possessing lofty statuses. However, such an expert actually personally guarded a junior who had not even reached Golden Immortal. That was probably unprecedented across the entire Immortals’ World.","Time trickled by silently. Before he knew it, a decade had already passed.","During the ten years, the Transcension Ancestor did not come for revenge, while the ripples stirred up by the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment gradually settled down on the Hall Brilliance Heaven, gradually fading from the view of the public.","During this time, they gathered numerous peak organisations on the Hall Brilliance Heaven under the lead of the Warring Old Freak and constructed a colossal teleportation formation to move between worlds. They personally chose a group of cultivators to send to a lower world to search for the Transcension Ancestor’s traces.","These people responsible for searching for the Transcension Ancestor did not just include experts native to the Hall Brilliance Heaven. The headquarters of the Merchant Union of Star Brilliance located on the Plain Subtlety Heaven also sent its own force to search for the Transcension Ancestor.","It was said that these orders had been personally issued by the union leader.","It was rumoured that the leader of the Merchant Union of Star Brilliance seemed to have come into conflict with a expert who wielded a Fiend Soul Banner in the Demons’ World in the past. Ever since then, he had utterly loathed Fiend Soul Banners.","Whenever a Fiend Soul Banner appeared in the Immortals’ World, it would definitely face the Merchant Union of Star Brilliance’s opposition.","The secondary banner that they collected from the Space-purging Ancestor was also destroyed. In front of all the experts of the Hall Brilliance Heaven, the Warring Old Freak set up a Divine Formation of Skyfire that contained the power of utmost yang. After a total of three years, it completely destroyed the banner.","Meanwhile, Jian Chen had already gathered all the heavenly resources for raising fifty thousand Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals bit by bit through the Merchant Union of Star Brilliance. He even had quite a surplus. On top of that, Jian Chen had stockpiled over a hundred thousand sets of heavenly resources for refining the recovery pills.","The branch of the Merchant Union of Star Brilliance on the Hall Brilliance Heaven also made a great profit from Jian Chen, so both parties were left satisfied.","Meanwhile, the Immortal Rising City also carried out a great operation during this decade. After recovering, the city lord, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu, personally led the experts of the eight clans to kill their way over to the Sword Sect of Mountain Kun. They were taking revenge for the Wukun Master working together with the Void-perceiving Ancestor to attack the Immortal Rising City.","However, by the time they reached the Sword Sect of Mount Kun, less than seventy percent of their disciples remained. The other thirty percent had already anticipated the Immortal Rising City’s actions after learning about the Wukun Master’s disappearance and the Void-perceiving sect’s destruction, so they left the sect very early. Who knew where they went.","Immortal Exalt Tan Yu did not massacre everyone this time like when he handled the Void-perceiving sect. Instead, he gave them a chance at survival, which was to serve the Immortal Rising City unconditionally for a million years.","If they refused, then only death awaited them.","In the end, the disciples above Golden Immortal all chose to serve the Immortal Rising City for a million years.","They did not make things difficult for the disciples beneath Golden Immortal. They released them all.","As a result, after returning to the Immortal Rising City, the Immortal Rising City’s strength had grown substantially.","“ Looks like it won’t be that easy for me to recover from this injury to my soul. Regular God Tier heavenly resources don’t seem to have much of an effect. ” At this moment, Jian Chen slowly opened his eyes inside the secret room in his courtyard. He was slightly worried.","When he fused the twin swords, his soul had been injured by the backlash. Over the years, he had attempted various methods and ingested many God Tier pills and heavenly resources beneficial to the soul, but he was unable to close this injury.","At this moment, the city lord came to visit him. Jian Chen immediately emerged from secluded cultivation, welcoming him personally.","“Fellow Yang Yutian, I’ve just received the news that all one hundred and eight pages of the Skyscraping Sword Scripture have appeared. In the next few years, at most a century, the Skyscraping World will open, so please make your preparations.” This time, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu brought with him the news that Jian Chen had been anticipating all this time.","“However, there are some rules to entering the Skyscraping World that you should bear in mind, fellow. The Skyscraping Sword Venerable set up multiple formations around the Skyscraping World. One of the formations had been arranged by a few formation experts renowned throughout the Immortals’ World at the behest of the Skyscraping Sword Venerable. They possess various wondrous effects. As a result, when you enter the Skyscraping World, do not bring any living creatures with you. If you disobey that rule, you will be mercilessly slain by the formations.”","“Before these formations of the Skyscraping World, it’s said that even Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts have only a very slim chance at survival, so there’s basically no chance for anyone beneath the Ninth Heavenly Layer to survive.”","Immortal Exalt Tan Yu was stern. He seemed to know that Jian Chen possessed a spatial god artifact, so he stressed this point.","Jian Chen nodded. He was unconcerned.","So what if the formations of the Skyscraping World were impressive? As long as they were not the formations of Grand Exalts, they could not detect the Primeval Divine Hall.","“A single page of the Skyscraping Sword Scripture comes with three spots for entry. I’ve already taken back the two spots that I originally agreed to give to the Azure Afterglow City and the Yi Immortal City. I only need one of the spots, so you can distribute the other two spots as you wish, fellow,” Immortal Exalt Tan Yu continued.","“Thank you!’ Jian Chen clasped his fist. He knew that the additional spot Immortal Exalt Tan Yu had given him was actually for Jing Mumu. He did not know if Immortal Exalt Tan Yu noticed Jing Mumu’s Sword Constitution of Soul Connection, but just her Sword Immortal Constitution could allow her to benefit tremendously in the miniature world opened by the Skyscraping Sword Venerable.","The Skyscraping World had much more than those seeds of ways!","There were also numerous other legacies for the Ways of the Sword."]},{"number":3808,"title":"Chapter 3808: The Skyscraping World Opens","paragraphs":["Afterwards, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu explained a few other matters worthy of attention regarding the Skyscraping World to Jian Chen before preparing to take his leave.","“Oh right, I have something that I’d like to ask you.” Jian Chen remembered something and suddenly stopped Immortal Exalt Tan Yu who was about to leave.","“Please ask away, fellow. I’ll definitely tell you everything that I know.” Immortal Exalt Tan Yu smiled.","“Do you know about puresouls?” Jian Chen asked.","“Puresouls?” Immortal Exalt Tan Yu furrowed his brows. “I’ve obviously heard about them before. It’s said that each puresoul is forcefully refined from a soul, erasing all of its owner’s intelligence and memories, refining away all impurities until only the purest power of the soul remains.”","“However, this is a secret technique of the Demons’ World. It’s said that even in the Demons’ World, there’s only a small handful of people that know the technique of refining puresouls. May I ask why you’re asking about this, fellow?”","“I want to know where I can purchase puresouls.” Jian Chen looked at Immortal Exalt Tan Yu in interest, without any attempt to avoid this taboo.","“In the Immortals’ World, there are some members of the orthodox cultivation traditions that oppose the existence of puresouls, so they’re very difficult to purchase openly. However, puresouls do appear from time to time in underground black markets. Although many experts of the Immortals’ World appear to be righteous members of the orthodoxy on the surface, they will secretly consume these items under extreme circumstances.”","“When it comes to this, the deeds of many experts of the Immortals’ World are actually beneath the Demons’ World. Although some people of the Demons’ World commit vicious deeds, at least they’re open about it. However, there are many righteous figures in the Immortals’ World who shout slogans about purging demons and enforcing justice, opposing all demonic deeds. In reality, once the need arises for themselves, they’ll often secretly scheme to gather everything beneficial to them. When it comes to that, they no longer care about what is right or wrong.”","“Puresouls are one of those items! On top of that, that’s a rare and extremely popular item in our Immortals’ World. As long as the price isn’t absurd, they’re sold out basically the moment they appear.”","“That’s because they greatly benefit the soul.”","“Moreover, when it comes to refining some pills beneficial to the soul, adding in puresouls will greatly strengthen their effects and often lead to wonders.”","“However, these underground black markets can’t be accessed on a whim. If you require puresouls, I can send some people to investigate.”","Immortal Exalt Tan Yu smiled.","“Then I’ll have to trouble the city lord with investigating this! However, I would like puresouls that have reached the level of Immortal Emperors at the very least!” Jian Chen clasped his fist with a smile. He did not hide anything.","At this moment, he could not help but think of Mo Tianyun. If senior Mo Tianyun were around, obtaining puresouls would not be this troublesome.","He wanted to see if puresouls could heal his soul.","Immortal Exalt Tan Yu agreed without hesitation. After returning to the city lord’s estate, he immediately called over vice city lord Qiu Wanqian. He told Qiu Wanqian to personally visit the underground black market and ask about puresouls.","Immortal Exalt Tan Yu did not make Jian Chen wait for too long. In just three days, he visited again with news regarding the puresouls.","“Right now, there’s only one puresoul for sale in the underground black market. It’s refined from the soul of an Immortal Emperor. However, the price is extremely high as well. They want one and a half million five-coloured immortal crystals,” said Immortal Exalt Tan Yu.","“What? They want one and a half million five-coloured immortal crystals for an Immortal Emperor puresoul?” Jian Chen leapt in fright when he heard the price. After all, it was not supreme grade immortal crystals but five-coloured immortal crystals.","“There has always been more demand than supply for puresouls in the Immortals’ World. As long as it’s not too expensive, they’re sold the moment they appear. All the ones that remain have prices that reach unacceptably absurd levels, which is why this Immortal Emperor puresoul is still available on the market,” Immortal Exalt Tan Yu said helplessly.","Jian Chen could only give up on it given the price. Let alone the fact that he no longer possessed that sum even if he took all of his immortal crystals into account after purchasing so many heavenly resources from the Merchant Union of Star Brilliance, he would not spend that much for an Immortal Emperor puresoul even if he did have enough immortal crystals.","After Immortal Exalt Tan Yu left, Jian Chen entered secluded cultivation again to comprehend the Laws of the Sword.","This lasted for twenty years!","However, Jian Chen made insignificant progress on the Laws of the Sword during these twenty years of secluded cultivation.","At his realm of cultivation, each breakthrough was calculated in tens of millennia. If his fortunes had not aligned, even millions of years were not enough to make progress.","The higher the cultivation, the more difficult it was to break through!","“Fellow Yang Yutian, the Skyscraping World will open in ten years’ time, but we have quite a journey ahead of us. We need to set off early.” On this day, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu’s voice rang out in Jian Chen’s head, interrupting his cultivation.","“ Is it finally going to open? ” A hint of eagerness appeared in Jian Chen’s eyes. In the next moment, he vanished from the secret room and instantly appeared outside. He gazed into the distance and beckoned softly, “My dear disciple, your training is over. You can come back!”","Hundreds of million kilometres away from the Immortal Rising City, a girl in tattered clothes sat within a dim and damp cave, ingesting some low grade Immortal Tier pills to heal.","She had many wounds on her. A few had even penetrated her entire body. They were terrifying and extremely horrific.","This person was Jing Mumu!","During the thirty years of training, Jing Mumu had undergone an upheaval of emotions. She faced tests of life and death again and again, witnessing the merciless betrayal of close friends and also understanding the complexity of the human heart.","During these thirty years, she was away from her seniors with no one to rely on, roaming the world with only a small number of resources. The experiences she went through, the sweetness and bitterness she encountered, was more than all she had gone through previously combined.","Jing Mumu seemed to be reborn through the thirty years, undergoing a complete metamorphosis. Her strength had not increased much, but her mind was like tempered steel.","Although she still came nowhere close to those ancient freaks who had lived through eons, she had truly matured at least. She had grown accustomed to this brutal world.","As for Jing Mumu’s cultivation, she had successfully reached Golden Immortal!","Golden Immortal in the Immortals’ World was equivalent to Deity in the Saints’ World!","“My dear disciple, your training is over. You can come back!”","At this moment, a voice that Jing Mumu found to be extremely familiar seemed to traverse through space and time, echoing through the cave she was hiding in extremely clearly.","Her eyes had already developed a layer of coldness, but the nostalgic voice filled Jing Mumu’s eyes with mixed emotions."]},{"number":3809,"title":"Chapter 3809: Mysterious Little Grass","paragraphs":["In her head, she could not help but recall the pain and hurt she had experienced during the thirty years she spent wandering the Immortals’ World alone.","In the past, when she followed her master, she spent extravagantly. She truly spent money in the Immortal Rising City without worry. The supreme grade immortal crystals formed a mountainous pile in her Space Ring. There was no such concept as poverty.","However, she passed the years she spent training outside in destitution. The good friends she made turned against her over a single supreme grade Immortal Tier pill, devolving into a battle to the death.","For the sake of a pitiful amount of supreme grade immortal crystals, thousands of Golden Immortals and even Daluo Golden Immortals would fight to the death.","She spent these years in utmost caution and anxiety. Even when she entered some smaller cities, she moved carefully, afraid of provoking any cultivators she could not afford to offend.","During the years without her master, Jing Mumu truly experienced the various faces of society. She witnessed the vile nature of the world. She could not find a single person that she could trust.","The only companion that she could trust was a spiritual plant that she accidentally found in a forest in the past.","A spiritual plant that was even slightly weaker than her in strength!","At this moment, when the nostalgic, familiar voice rang out in her head, Jing Mumu immediately felt like she had found a cove of safety in this cold and brutal world.","In the dim and damp cave, Jing Mumu’s lips trembled gently. The coldness and caution that filled her eyes gradually vanished, replaced by a layer of mist. Eventually, it turned into tears of many emotions that fell to the ground.","“ Little Grass, do you hear this? Master has returned. Master has come to collect me. As long as we return to master’s side, we’ll be completely safe. We won’t have to live in constant anxiety anymore. ” Jing Mumu looked at her wrist. There was a bracelet formed from a tender blade of grass.","This was Little Grass, the spiritual plant that Jing Mumu had encountered in a forest. It was her only trustworthy companion during the years she spent training outside.","The plant did not have a name originally. Jing Mumu had given it the name Little Grass.","“ Little Mumu, you may get whatever you want under master’s protection, but you must not overly rely on your master. Possessing strength yourself is the root of survival. ” Little Grass’s voice rang out in Jing Mumu’s head.","At this moment, Little Grass gave off the presence of an early Golden Immortal. Despite possessing the same cultivation as Jing Mumu, it was clearly slightly weaker.","Jing Mumu knew that Little Grass had intelligence. Although it could not take a human form or converse with the human tongue, it could communicate using the senses of the soul.","“ I obviously understand that. ” Jing Mumu nodded. She looked at Little Grass on her wrist sincerely and said seriously, “However, possessing backing still makes a very big difference. With a powerful backing, some precious cultivation resources come relatively easy. Without backing, you need to risk your life in exchange for all resources.”","“ Little Grass, you’ve had it difficult as well during the years you accompanied me. In the future, I might still suffer, but I can’t let you suffer. ”","“ As a result, when I see my master again, I will definitely ask my master to treat you well. As long as you have my master’s assistance, I’m certain you’ll reach Daluo Golden Immortal very soon. Even becoming a Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal won’t be a dream. ”","“ Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal? Hahahaha. ” Little Grass laughed.","Jing Mumu could distinctly feel that something was amiss from Little Grass’s casual response, but her eagerness and excitement from being about to return to her master’s side made her subconsciously miss this detail.","Boom!","At this moment, a rumble seemed to shake the earth. A large number of cracks appeared on the walls of the cave that Jing Mumu was hiding in. Boulders crashed down.","“Jing Mumu, did you think we wouldn’t be able to find you by hiding here? We’ve already arranged the Net of Ensnarement in this region. You’re done for this time.” An elderly voice rang out from above, erupting in the cave like thunder.","Under the impact of the sound wave, the cave on the brink of collapse finally gave in, completely collapsing with a rumble.","“ Oh no, I’ve been found by the Xi family. ” Jing Mumu’s expression changed slightly. A low quality Immortal Tier sword immediately appeared in her hand. She thrust out with it, and dazzling light shot out and sliced apart the rock above her. Forcefully, she carved a path to the outside world using sword Qi. Afterwards, she shot out as a streak of light.","However, as soon as she appeared outside, a net unfurled in the air and enveloped a region of a hundred kilometres across, trapping Jing Mumu inside.","“Jing Mumu, I know your battle prowess is unparalleled. None of your peers match you, and you can fight on equal footing with Daluo Golden Immortals as an early Golden Immortal. Multiple Daluo Golden Immortals pursued you, but you managed to escape with ease in the end. As a result, the clan specially sent me this time.”","“I am a mighty peak Xuan Immortal, yet today, I have to personally deal with an early Golden Immortal junior. Jing Mumu, you may die, but you should feel honoured.”","A bald old man hovered in the air in front of Jing Mumu. He wore striped robes as he radiated with the presence of a peak Xuan Immortal.","He only needed a single step to reach Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal!","“Do you see the net over you?” The bald old man pointed above and smiled. “This is a high quality immortal artifact. I’ve enveloped a hundred kilometres of this place already.”","“Jing Mumu, I know you possess an immortal technique that turns you into lightning, allowing you to vanish in a split second. However, I wonder if you can escape from this net!”","As soon as he said that, the old man’s pupils narrowed slightly. In his eyes, a blinding streak of light rapidly grew larger. It seemed like a bolt of lightning.","Jing Mumu wielded the low quality immortal artifact and used the Linear Lightning Release to instantly approach the peak Xuan Immortal old man. The low quality immortal artifact in her hand shone brilliantly, thrusting towards his forehead.","She moved like lightning. At that moment, Jing Mumu demonstrated her decisive side. She went straight for the kill.","She possessed both the Sword Immortal Constitution and the Sword Constitution of Soul Connection. Any sword technique in her hands would skyrocket in strength. In the past, she could already unleash many sword techniques to a hundred and twenty percent of their force before she had even reached Golden Immortal.","Now, with her breakthrough, the power she unleashed from these sword techniques went from a hundred and twenty percent to a hundred and fifty percent.","In other words, with her current strength, any sword technique in her hands would break through their limits in power and perform extraordinarily.","And, that was only one aspect. The benefits brought on by the two constitutions were not limited to this.","At the same time, it also strengthened the Laws of the Sword, strengthened her energy, and so on.","When Jing Mumu used the Laws of the Sword, it would be much stronger than other cultivators at the same level.","The energy cultivated by the two constitutions was also more pure than other cultivators at the same level.","If the energy of other cultivators could be described as a trickle, then Jing Mumu’s energy would be a raging river.","At this moment, Jing Mumu’s full-powered strike could even threaten Daluo Golden Immortals.","All while she had only broken through to Golden Immortal recently!"]},{"number":3810,"title":"Chapter 3810: Little Grass’s Strength","paragraphs":["However, she was not facing a Daluo Golden Immortal right now but a peak Xuan Immortal only a step away from Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal. The difference was so great that it was no different from an untraversable chasm.","As a result, when Jing Mumu’s low quality Immortal Tier sword was about to pierce the old man’s forehead, it was blocked by the energy around him.","Unfortunately, even if Jing Mumu condensed all of her strength, she could not pierce the protective energy of a peak Xuan Immortal by an inch.","The seemingly-thin layer of energy was like a wall of steel before Jing Mumu. It was impregnable.","“If you were a Xuan Immortal, I probably would not even be able to receive a single attack from you. But unfortunately, you’ve only just broken through to Golden Immortal after all.” The peak Xuan Immortal old man praised her from the bottom of his heart. He raised his hand and touched the tip of the sword before his eyes gently.","In the next moment, the low quality immortal artifact in Jing Mumu’s hand seemed to be struck by a heavy blow. It immediately shattered, turning into countless fragments.","Jing Mumu staggered back. Blood oozed out from the corner of her lips. Her sword-wielding right hand had already become a bloody mess.","Moreover, the attack this time had set off her other wounds. Many of the wounds on her slender body that had just stopped bleeding recently began to bleed again. Many of them even reopened, widening compared to before.","The attack this time had left her even more hurt than before!","“A prodigy like you is about to die by my hand today. Jing Mumu, you will be the first prodigy to die by my hand, but you definitely won’t be the last.” The peak Xuan Immortal old man sighed gently.","“Elder, please wait. Jing Mumu possesses such great battle prowess, so she’s definitely hiding a secret. Please preserve her soul so that we can take it back and soul search her for the secret she’s hiding.” Around a dozen cultivators appeared behind the old man. There were both men and women, varying in age. They gave off the presence of Daluo Golden Immortals.","“Fair enough. Then I’ll destroy her body and imprison her soul!” The Xuan Immortal old man nodded.","“ Little Grass, don’t be afraid. My master will come. We won’t die. ” Under the pressure of a peak Xuan Immortal, Jing Mumu gave up on resisting or struggling. She sat on the ground feebly and gazed at the spiritual plant curled around her wrist, comforting it gently. Her face was pale.","“ Little Mumu, you’re wrong about this. Your master won’t come. ” Little Grass pulsed with the senses of its soul. Faced with such dangers, there was not the slightest panic or nervousness in its voice. It only sighed gently. “ Sigh, your training has ended anyway, so leave the rest up to me. ”","“ Little Grass, you- ” Jing Mumu was in doubt. She felt like Little Grass seemed a little different from usual.","“ Little Mumu, watch closely. I’ll turn these little ants to dust with a single breath. ” As soon as the senses of Little Grass’s soul emerged, Jing Mumu felt a green pulse spread from Little Grass on her wrist.","The green pulse did not give off any pressure or energy. In short, it did not possess any offensive capabilities at all to Jing Mumu.","However, when the green pulse reached the dozen or so cultivators, including the strongest peak Xuan Immortal, all of them turned to dust and dispersed in the wind. They perished.","In the sky, the high quality immortal artifact that spanned a hundred kilometres also shattered, scattering as dust.","At that moment, all of the people that threatened Jing Mumu’s life perished in a way that left her bewildered.","Jing Mumu was completely dumbstruck. She widened her eyes and looked at this in complete disbelief, unable to return to her senses.","“ Little Mumu, c’mon, I’ll take you to get revenge. It’s about time you return the suffering and hardship you went through these years to those people. ” Little Grass’s voice rang out. Afterwards, Jing Mumu felt a tremendous power envelop her in an extremely gentle manner. Then she was hoisted up, flying into the distance at an unbelievable speed.","In Jing Mumu’s view, everything in the surroundings turned to blur, drifting past her as colourful streaks.","She moved far too quickly. Not only was she unable to distinguish the surrounding scenery with her eyes anymore, but even her soul could not keep up.","In the blink of an eye, Jing Mumu discovered that she had already arrived above a city.","This was a small city called Xi City. It was in a remote location and experts never visited this place. The strongest organisation in the city, the Xi family, had a First Heavenly Layer Immortal Monarch.","Ten years ago, Jing Mumu fell out with the Xi family. She faced the Xi family’s pursuit and had close scrapes with death several times.","Since “Little Grass” had remained by Jing Mumu’s side the entire time, it obviously understood just how deep her grievance with the Xi family was.","“ Little Mumu, you must understand that it wasn’t that I refused to help you in the past, but as soon as I intervened, your training would lose all meaning. Since your period of training has come to an end, it means we’re about to leave the Hall Brilliance Heaven. I don’t know if we’ll be returning here again. ”","“ As a result, I’ll have to end this feud for you, one that you should have ended with your own hands. With that, you can leave this place without anything holding you back. ”","“Little Grass’s” voice rang out in Jing Mumu’s head. However, she had yet to recover from the shock from earlier.","Afterwards, “Little Grass” slowly lowered a tendril that was as thin as a strand of hair. It extended through the air and instantly landed in the Xi family down below.","The thin-like strand touched the empty space gently, and a terrifying force immediately erupted. The space where the Xi family resided collapsed, replaced by a colossal spatial crack. The destructive presence was earth-shaking. Even some of the Immortal Emperors that resided in the surrounding region could not help but become shocked.","The presence vanished as quickly as it appeared. By the time that everything settled down again, the Xi family had already been razed to the ground with nothing remaining. Everything had been sucked into the spatial crack.","“ Little Mumu, you’ve already gotten your revenge. I hope you don’t blame me for interfering with this. We don’t have that much time. ” Little Grass said gently. In the next moment, Jing Mumu suddenly vanished. Under the great power, they left at a speed dozens of times faster than before.","In just a few seconds, Jing Mumu traversed over ten million kilometres before finally vanishing into one of the three great cities of the Hall Brilliance Heaven, the Immortal Rising City.","In the Immortal Rising City, the dazed Jing Mumu suddenly appeared in the courtyard where Jian Chen resided. He stood right before her in white clothes with his hands behind his back. All of his presence was concealed. He seemed like a mortal.","At this moment, “Little Grass” chose to leave Mumu’s wrist, flying over and wrapping around Jian Chen’s wrist instead with great intimacy."]},{"number":3811,"title":"Chapter 3811: Master","paragraphs":["“Master!” At this moment, Jing Mumu finally returned to her senses. Her nose began to burn as her eyes reddened. Tears began to flow.","It was as if she had found a safe cove after returning to her master’s side. She could cast aside all of her caution and vigilance, no longer needing to worry about the feuds and dangers outside.","“As long as you’re back. You haven’t disappointed me. You actually reached Golden Immortal through your own strength in just a few decades. Not bad, not bad.” Jian Chen studied Jing Mumu and nodded in gladness.","In the past, he was still considering helping Jing Mumu reach Golden Immortal in one fell stroke after she completed her training so that she could accept the Nine Limits Saint’s legacy.","However, he never imagined that Jing Mumu’s talent would be even greater than his expectations. She actually completed such a great breakthrough in just a few decades.","“Master, Little Grass-” At this moment, Jing Mumu’s attention finally turned to Little Grass. Her recent experiences felt entirely like a dream to her.","She had spent all these years with Little Grass and thought that its strength was beneath hers. Suddenly, it demonstrated such terrifying strength, deeply shocking her.","“You’re talking about it?” Jian Chen raised his hand and looked at the Immortal Devouring Orchid curled around it. He smiled gently and said, “This is the Immortal Devouring Orchid. It’s already accompanied me for many years. It’s also one of my most trustworthy companions.","“B-b-but how is that possible?” Jing Mumu was rather saddened. Her heart felt empty all of a sudden. She was unable to describe what she felt.","The first time she met “Little Grass” was in a forest. Back then, Little Grass’s cultivation had not even reached Golden Immortal. It was on the brink of death from the pursuit of an immortal beast. In the end, she had killed the immortal beast and saved Little Grass.","Ever since then, Little Grass had accompanied her as she roamed the world, going through thick and thin and facing all enemies together. They went through a trial of fire and blood.","When she was out training, she had faced many emotional setbacks. She had experienced various betrayals, and her emotions were on the brink of collapse.","When she was in pain, in sorrow, lost, and in despair, it was Little Grass who had remained by her side. It encouraged her again and again, giving her guidance again and again, which allowed her to reach her current level.","Over all those years, Little Grass had already become her most trustworthy companion and the greatest source of support that allowed her to complete this training.","She had never thought that Little Grass was actually a supreme expert her master had planted by her side. Its past weakness and injuries were all an act.","For a moment, Jing Mumu was filled with extremely mixed feelings. There was both disappointment and elatement.","She was disappointed over how Little Grass was not actually her companion.","She was elated over the fact that her master still cared about her so much.","“ Little Mumu, you’re your master’s precious disciple. You don’t understand at all just how much your master cares about you. Why would he actually send you outside alone to train? You are too naive after all. When you travel alone outside, it’s very easy for something unexpected to happen, which was why he got me to remain by your side. ” Little Grass communicated with Jing Mumu using the senses of its soul.","“ You better not think you’re very impressive. Many times, it was you who was protecting me, but in reality, I had been secretly resolving many dangers that you could not handle. You just did not know, hahahaha... ”","Jing Mumu bit her lip and looked at the Immortal Devouring Orchid on Jian Chen’s wrist. With mixed feelings, she asked, “T-then can I still call you Little Grass?”","“ You’re my master’s beloved disciple, so I obviously can be your Little Grass. Hahaha. ” The Immortal Devouring Orchid laughed.","“We’re going to be leaving the Hall Brilliance Heaven. My disciple, I’ll take you to another world to take a look,” said Jian Chen. Shortly afterwards, he sent Jing Mumu and Jing Feng into the Primeval Divine Hall. He brought them to the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens.","Jian Chen’s main body was still in the courtyard, but he entered the Primeval Divine Hall with a soul clone. He brought Jing Mumu around to familiarise her with the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens.","After several decades of construction, the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens had truly been turned into a paradise. Jade towers stood everywhere with paths paved from gold. Mountains after mountains levitated in the air. The dense spiritual Qi turned into thick fog, covering the entire sky.","Compared to the past, the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens now occupied an area that was several dozen times larger.","Of course, this was entirely due to the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants.","“Woah, what a beautiful world. Master, where is this place?” Jing Mumu immediately took a liking to this paradise-like world. Jing Feng stood behind her; he felt shocked as well. In his knowledge, even many peak organisations on the Hall Brilliance Heaven did not possess a blessed land like this.","“Greetings, sect master!” At this moment, Nong Fugui and Chen Shifang both appeared in front of Jian Chen and bowed politely.","Jian Chen introduced Jing Mumu and Jing Feng to Nong Fugui and Chen Shifang. When they heard how she was the sect master’s disciple, they immediately began to treat her warmly.","Very soon, Jing Mumu and Jing Feng learnt that this was a sect called the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. However, due to their limited status and insight, neither of them had any concept of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, nor did they know about the sect’s past glory.","Afterwards, elder Nong personally introduced the situation of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens to Jing Mumu and Jing Feng. However, when they heard how the sect currently possessed several dozen Immortal Monarchs, nine Immortal Emperors, and two Immortal Exalts, they were both dumbfounded.","After familiarising them with the rough situation of the sect, Jian Chen allocated a high grade spiritual mountain to Jing Mumu and Jing Feng each. These mountains would serve as their future places of cultivation.","“I said I would give you the Nine Limits Saint’s legacy after you reached Golden Immortal. Now that you’ve already broken through, it’s also time for me to give it to you.” Jian Chen took out the world that resembled a speck of dust on the spiritual mountain and personally handed it over to Jing Mumu.","“Moreover, this miniature world is an impressive treasure too. It’s been transformed from the remains of the Nine Limits Saint. Not only is it indestructible, but it also possesses paramount camouflage abilities. If you encounter any dangers that you can’t resolve, you can hide inside the miniature world.”","“Thank you for your guidance, master!” For a moment, Jing Mumu felt very warm inside. After personally experiencing the various dangers and betrayals in the world, she gained a deeper appreciation for just how precious her master’s care was.","After helping them settle down, Jian Chen appeared on the main peak of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. The sect treasury had already been constructed to one corner of the main peak. They had stored a large number of resources inside sorted according to their grade.","With a flip of his hand, several high quality god artifacts appeared, which were the Void-perceiving Ancestor’s three-legged cauldron and a high quality god artifact armour.","There was also the Wukun Master’s high quality god artifact, the Heaven-lifting sword!"]},{"number":3812,"title":"Chapter 3812: Starflame Demon Lion","paragraphs":["Jian Chen also took out the Space-purging Ancestor’s Heaven-locking Chains and the bracelet high quality god artifact!","Apart from the Heaven-lifting sword left behind by the Wukun Master, he had no use for the other high quality god artifacts, so he stored them all in the sect treasury as the main treasures of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens.","They were inside the Primeval Divine Hall, so he did not have to worry about losing these precious artifacts.","In the end, Jian Chen’s gaze turned towards the Heaven-lifting sword. He said softly, “The struggle for opportunity and fortune in the Skyscraping World will come with an intense struggle. Heaven-lifting sword, you will accompany me in facing my opponents in the future. You will clear all my obstacles for me.”","The Heaven-lifting sword was a high quality god artifact that the Wukun Master had spent all of his resources to forge. However, over the past few decades, Jian Chen had completely refined the sword. He was now its master.","Thrum!","The Heaven-lifting sword resonated clearly and gave off a sense of bleakness, surging with light.","This was the Heaven-lifting sword’s artifact spirit responding to Jian Chen!","Jian Chen waved his hand, and the Heaven-lifting sword immediately turned into a streak of light, vanishing inside his sleeve. Afterwards, he left the Primeval Divine Hall.","Then he left the courtyard that he had stayed in for several decades without any reluctance, arriving at the city lord’s estate.","“Fellow Yang Yutian, are you all prepared?” Immortal Exalt Tan Yu personally received Jian Chen. There was a hint of eagerness in his eyes.","That was eagerness to enter the Skyscraping World!","“I’m all prepared. I’m only waiting for you now.” Jian Chen nodded. Shortly afterwards, he thought of something and asked, “Has there been any news of the Transcension Ancestor of the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment over the years?”","When he heard this question, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu became stern. “The people we sent down from the Hall Brilliance Heaven have been searching many lower worlds over the past few decades, but they still have no clues. The Transcension Ancestor has hidden himself away very carefully. In my opinion, it truly is almost impossible to find him in a lower world.”","“After all, there are far too many lower worlds, more than we can count. They’re not as sturdy as the Immortals’ World either, so the people we send down face numerous restrictions. They can’t use their full strength, and they can’t use immortal or god artifacts either. Even when they move about, they have to be careful, just in case their powers lead to devastation to the lower worlds.”","“The Transcension Ancestor is already extremely powerful, so finding any clues connected to him while he intentionally conceals himself is already very difficult. Moreover, our hands are basically tied. Unless a Grand Exalt personally takes action, we can only wait for the Transcension Ancestor to show himself.”","“However, why would the matter regarding the Transcension Ancestor raise the attention of Grand Exalts?” Immortal Exalt Tan Yu gave off a deep feeling of helplessness towards the end.","Jian Chen was slightly disappointed as well. The Transcension Ancestor had killed so many people to forge such a vicious demonic artifact, which also roused his fury and killing intent. He was tempted to kill the Transcension Ancestor as well.","“By the time the Transcension Ancestor appears on the Hall Brilliance Heaven again, he will have forged the main banner of the Fiend Soul Banners successfully. It’s just a pity that so many people have to die for that.” Jian Chen sighed sorrowfully.","Afterwards, Jian Chen and Immortal Exalt Tan Yu left the Immortal Rising City. They did not take a teleportation formation. Instead, they directly entered outer space. Afterwards, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu took out a small immortal vessel and invited Jian Chen inside. He powered the immortal vessel with his cultivation, and they set off.","“The Skyscraping World that the Skyscraping Sword Venerable originally set up is not located on any of the thirty-three heavens. Instead, it is located in an extremely remote region of space. The closest heaven to it is the Conquering Judgement Heaven.”","“As a result, we need to reach the Conquering Judgement Heaven first and then activate the page from the Skyscraping Sword Scripture near the Conquering Judgement Heaven. The page will indicate the correct direction.”","Along the way, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu explained the situation to Jian Chen.","The immortal vessel they took was extraordinary. Although it was only a medium quality god artifact, it was covered with spatial formations. Once activated, it could erupt with startling speed. It was no slower than early Immortal Exalts.","“Oh right, fellow Yang Yutian, I took back the two spots I gave away, which left the city lord of the Yi Immortal City, the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt, extremely displeased. In the past, I obviously would not care about him, but the situation is different now. One of his sons has entered the Courtyard of Ways.” Immortal Exalt Tan Yu furrowed his brows. When he mentioned the Courtyard of Ways, he clearly became more stern.","“The Courtyard of Ways?” When he heard that, a gleam of light shot through Jian Chen’s eyes. He had spent many years in the Immortals’ World already, so he obviously knew what kind of existence the Courtyard of Ways was.","The Immortals’ World had twelve courts of heaven, which were known as the greatest organisations beneath Grand Exalt. Of course, that was excluding the Waymight clan now.","The Courtyard of Ways was one of the twelve courts of heaven!","At the same time, they were one of the stronger courts of heaven.","However, the greatest difference with the Courtyard of Ways was it existed as an academy. It was open to the entire Immortals’ World. Regardless of their organisation or clan, as long as a person passed the various tests of the Courtyard of Ways, they could become a student there and obtain their legacy.","As a result, over all these years, the experts produced by the Courtyard of Ways basically filled the entire Immortals’ World. Of the current day, many supreme experts and deviant geniuses had cultivated in the Courtyard of Ways before.","Even some Grand Exalts had received the support and teachings of the Courtyard of Ways during their growth.","As a result, in terms of influence, the Courtyard of Ways was unparalleled in the Immortals’ World.","Immortal Exalt Tan Yu continued, “I’m very worried that the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt will use this opportunity to make things difficult for us. After all, one of his sons has entered the Courtyard of Ways. There will be plenty of Immortal Exalts who enter the Skyscraping World this time, with a few that were once students in the Courtyard of Ways. If they know that the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt’s son has entered the Courtyard of Ways, they might develop a sense of closeness. If the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt uses this relationship, it’ll be extremely disadvantageous to us.”","“That’s fine. We’ll just deal with it when it happens,” Jian Chen said fearlessly.","The immortal vessel moved extremely quickly. The numerous spatial formations seemed to deform space, allowing them to cover an extremely great distance in just a few days. They were about to reach the Conquering Judgement Heaven.","However, at this precise moment, something unexpected happened. Jian Chen only felt a stiflingly-powerful pressure suddenly descend. Before he could even respond, the immortal vessel he rode with Immortal Exalt Tan Yu exploded with a boom. A great force tore it to pieces with ease.","The force was far too great. Let alone Jian Chen, even the Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu, paled on the spot. After spurting out blood, he was knocked away helplessly.","Jian Chen was also heavily injured. He felt like his entire body was about to split apart. Every single inch of skin racked with agony. Even his organs had ruptured. His Chaotic Body that had reached the seventeenth layer could not withstand it.","He also spurted with blood. He was like a single leaf getting blown far away by the powerful energy storm.","But shortly afterwards, warmth flowed through his body. The Source of Life’s regeneration immediately took effect, rapidly healing all of his injuries.","In a split second, Jian Chen made a complete recovery. He seemed unkillable.","However, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu did not have something like that. His face was pale; he was seriously injured.","However, he completely ignored his injuries. He stared straight ahead as his face became extremely ugly.","“It’s a Starflame Demon Lion. It’s actually that Starflame Demon Lion. I-it’s actually still alive!” Immortal Exalt Tan Yu said sternly. There was undisguised fear in his eyes.","Jian Chen was solemn as well, staring straight ahead.","An enormous lion hovered in the sea of stars. It burned with fire that resembled the stars. From afar, it seemed like a colossal meteor hovering there. It basically rivalled a small city in size."]},{"number":3813,"title":"Chapter 3813: Immortal Exalt Tan Yu in Danger","paragraphs":["The terrifying pressure it gave off flooded the surroundings. Even some Immortal Exalts would feel overwhelmed.","“City lord, do you know this space beast?” Jian Chen said sternly. He could tell with a single glance that it was not some immortal or divine beast but a space beast that lived among the sea of stars.","There were many space beasts like this in both the Immortals’ World and the Saints’ World.","However, space beasts as powerful as the one right before them were rare.","“This Starflame Demon Lion appeared a million years ago. It wandered outer space and hunted Immortal Exalts everywhere, feeding off of them. It’s said that back then, there were over ten Immortal Exalts that died to it. The situation became so terrible that many Immortal Exalts lost the courage to venture into outer space, forced to travel using teleportation formations.”","“Afterwards, peak organisations from several heavens banded together. They assembled a total of five Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts. Under the lead of a Seventh Heavenly Layer expert, they hunted down the Starflame Demon Lion. After an intense battle, they slew the Starflame Demon Lion in outer space.”","Immortal Exalt Tan Yu’s eyes were filled with deep fear. “The Starflame Demon Lion back then was only a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, yet it required several times more experts than it to kill it successfully. This only indicated how powerful it was. I never imagined that it’s actually still alive.”","“Is it really the same one?” Jian Chen said sternly. With the current strength of the Divine Formation of the Heavens, even the formation would struggle to kill a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt Starflame Demon Lion.","“There’s a very slim chance that it isn’t. Finding a second Starflame Demon Lion that has reached such a cultivation is virtually impossible in outer space.” Immortal Exalt Tan Yu turned towards Jian Chen. He was unprecedentedly stern. “Not only is the Starflame Demon Lion extremely powerful, but it can even borrow power from the surrounding stars as it dwells in outer space, allowing it to move extremely quickly. Let alone the fact that we’re weaker than it, but even Immortal Exalts whose strength rivals it will struggle to escape unless they’re particularly fast. Fellow Yang Yutian, can the senior behind you deal with this Starflame Demon Lion?”","“That will be difficult.” Jian Chen also became stern. At this moment, he could already sense a great pressure from the surrounding space that made his bones creak.","The Starflame Demon Lion controlled the power in the surroundings to restrain him and Immortal Exalt Tan Yu.","At this moment, both Jian Chen and Immortal Exalt Tan Yu felt immobilised. Even lifting a finger seemed to take all of their strength.","“Looks like we’re done for today.” A hint of despair appeared in Immortal Exalt Tan Yu’s eyes. He clearly gave up on fleeing before the Starflame Demon Lion.","Suddenly, a great power appeared. The colossal Starflame Demon Lion opened its mouth and sucked in.","A great restraining force appeared. Both Jian Chen and Immortal Exalt Tan Yu felt like the restraint over them had intensified by several fold. Jian Chen could still hold on due to the Chaotic Body, but Immortal Exalt Tan Yu began to ooze with blood from his pores, as his body was much more feeble. He became covered in blood in the blink of an eye.","Immortal Exalt Tan Yu felt despair. “The Starflame Demon Lion only has its attention on me, as it only preys on Immortal Exalts. Fellow Yang Yutian, you haven’t reached Immortal Exalt, so you might still have a chance at survival.”","As soon as he said that, sharp sword Qi erupted from Immortal Exalt Tan Yu. At that moment, he glowed brightly, radiating with shining light.","Afterwards, all of the light contracted, turning into a glorious strand of sword Qi that suddenly slashed out.","Boom!","Under the slash, the space immediately let out a startling rumble. The Laws of the Sword of a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt surged forth like a volcano under pressure, blooming with the brilliance of a sun as it contended against the Starflame Demon Lion’s power.","The Starflame Demon Lion was extremely powerful, so powerful that it could already overwhelm Immortal Exalt Tan Yu. As a result, his attack stood no chance against the Starflame Demon Lion, but it could make the frozen space loosen slightly.","Using this opportunity, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu condensed great power in his hand before striking Jian Chen with it without hesitation.","Boom! With a bang, Jian Chen was knocked far away by Immortal Exalt Tan Yu, sending him out of this thickened region of space.","“Fellow Yang Yutian, if you manage to escape today, please pay a visit to the Immortal Rising City and let the eight clans know about my death-”","Immortal Exalt Tan Yu only managed to say that before the space he resided in suddenly vanished as if it had been swallowed. It turned into an eerie void.","Immortal Exalt Tan Yu and that entire region of space had been swallowed by the Starflame Demon Lion.","Despite his cultivation as a mighty Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, he could not put up any resistance against the Starflame Demon Lion.","In the distance, Jian Chen continued to fly away. The power behind Immortal Exalt Tan Yu’s palm strike was far too great. It managed to injure him, but it also sent him away from the Starflame Demon Lion. As such, he escaped the fate of being swallowed.","At this moment, Jian Chen regained control over himself. He hovered in the distant space and stared at the region where Immortal Exalt Tan Yu vanished from. He was filled with extremely mixed feelings.","He had never imagined that Immortal Exalt Tan Yu would actually save him in a life-threatening situation.","Although being swallowed by the Starflame Demon Lion would not kill him, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu’s actions still touched Jian Chen deeply.","After all, he did not have any particularly deep ties with Immortal Exalt Tan Yu. Strictly speaking, the only reason why they were together was because their interests aligned.","After all, he needed the spot from the Skyscraping Sword Scripture that was in Immortal Exalt Tan Yu’s possession to enter the Skyscraping World!","There was absolutely no need for Immortal Exalt Tan Yu to do this over such a flimsy relationship.","“ No wonder the eight clans of the Immortal Rising City are so loyal to you. Immortal Exalt Tan Yu, you truly are an exceptional person, ” Jian Chen thought.","At this moment, a terrifying presence suddenly filled Jian Chen’s mind, which immediately made him tighten.","After swallowing Immortal Exalt Tan Yu, the Starflame Demon Lion turned its attention towards Jian Chen. There was gluttony in its eyes.","It was as if it still could not resist the temptation of eating Jian Chen even though he had yet to reach Immortal Exalt.","Jian Chen shivered inside. He used the mask from the Illusionary Daemon race to conceal all of his presence before activating the Divine Armour of Heavenflight. He disappeared from the space there, vanishing into nothingness.","The Starflame Demon Lion immediately lost track of Jian Chen. It constantly scanned the surrounding space with its huge eyes and sniffed around, wanting to capture his presence.","However, it found nothing even after searching for a good while.","After all, Jian Chen could even conceal himself from a few Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts when he used the mask from the Illusionary Daemon race combined with the Divine Armour of Heavenflight. Hiding from a space beast whose intelligence was limited was not an issue.","As a space beast, even if they possessed unparalleled strength, they would suffer from a problem that they could do nothing about—their limited intelligence. Most of them moved around based on instinct.","In the end, the Starflame Demon Lion shook its head and left the place.","After it had left, Jian Chen appeared silently in the distant sea of stars. He looked in the direction that the Starflame Demon Lion had disappeared in. His face was very ugly.","He had realised a severe issue. The Skyscraping Sword Scripture was on Immortal Exalt Tan Yu. Now that Immortal Exalt Tan Yu had been eaten, the Skyscraping Sword Scripture was lost as well.","He had lost his ticket to the Skyscraping World.","“ Thousand Soul Demon Exalt, Primeval artifact spirit, check if the current power of the Divine Formation of the Heavens can threaten Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts right now or not. ” With a sunken face, Jian Chen immediately sent a wisp of the senses of his soul into the Primeval Divine Hall."]},{"number":3814,"title":"Chapter 3814: Revisiting an Old Place","paragraphs":["“Don’t worry, sect master. I witnessed the power of the Divine Formation of the Heavens last time. Logically speaking, it can indeed threaten Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts. However, if you were to truly face a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, there would be far too many variables at play. You’re aware of the reason as well—it’s very difficult to stop them from escaping,” the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt immediately replied. He appeared before Jian Chen’s soul clone and said confidently, “Sect master, are we going to be facing the Transcension Ancestor of the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment?”","Jian Chen shook his head and gave the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt a simple explanation of what had happened outside.","“A Starflame Demon Lion? If your target is a space beast, then it’ll be much simpler. Most of these species possess limited intelligence and colossal bodies. Despite their impressive battle prowess, they’re not as flexible and agile as powerful cultivators. The only thing you have to be worried about is their vitality. They’re very difficult to kill,” the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt said in thought.","“Master, with the Divine Formation of the Heavens’ current power, it can only injure the Starflame Demon Lion. It can’t slay it. Even heavily injuring it will be rather difficult,” said the Primeval artifact spirit. His opinion contrasted tremendously against the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt’s answer.","It continued, “Perhaps if you wait a few more years and assemble fifty thousand Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals for the Divine Formation of the Heavens, you’ll be able to heavily injure or even kill this Starflame Demon Lion.”","“That’s because the Starflame Demon Lion already rivals Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts in strength. Its body is tough, and its vitality is tenacious. Killing a space beast like that often requires the strength of the Seventh Heavenly Layer.”","The Primeval artifact spirit’s words left the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt slightly surprised. He immediately stopped talking.","“Is it that troublesome?” With a great frown, Jian Chen quickly left the Primeval Divine Hall.","At this moment, he used the Laws of Space to travel through outer space at full speed. He moved so quickly that he was no slower than Immortal Exalts.","Extremely far ahead of him was a tiny speck that shone with starlight, moving through the sea of stars with similarly great speed.","That was the Starflame Demon Lion.","Jian Chen had already pushed his speed to his limits, but he could only barely keep up with the Starflame Demon Lion.","And the Starflame Demon Lion had not even used its full speed yet. Instead, it wandered around like it was on a leisurely stroll. Otherwise, with Jian Chen’s current level with the Laws of Space, he could never keep up with the Starflame Demon Lion.","The Starflame Demon Lion was not smart, but it instinctively sensed danger, so it basically intentionally avoided the thirty-three heavens along the way. It seemed to be fearful of these colossal pieces of land that floated through outer space. Whenever it encountered a heaven, it would maintain a safe distance. Even late Immortal Exalts would not be able to sense it.","From beginning to end, Jian Chen did not expose his tracks. He was like a ghost, hidden deep within the darkness as he tailed the Starflame Demon Lion quietly.","This pursuit lasted for several months. During this time, the Starflame Demon Lion never stopped moving, advancing aimlessly through outer space. It crossed galaxies after galaxies, seemingly on the prowl for Immortal Exalts in outer space.","On this day, the Starflame Demon Lion who had spent several months travelling suddenly entered a huge asteroid field before falling completely silent.","Using the disguise from the Divine Armour of Heavenflight and the mask from the Illusionary Daemon race, Jian Chen entered the asteroid field carefully. He discovered the Starflame Demon Lion lying on a dead planet several times larger than it. Its eyes were closed as if it was asleep.","“ Is it digesting its food? Oh no, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu probably can’t last much longer. ” When he saw this, Jian Chen’s heart immediately sank. The Starflame Demon Lion before him possessed the strength of a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. Due to its special characteristics as a space beast, its vitality was extremely tenacious. Injuring it without the strength of the Seventh Heavenly Layer would be difficult.","Under these circumstances, his chances of saving Immortal Exalt Tan Yu with his own strength were extremely minimal.","“The white jade oil lamp I obtained from the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants can heavily injure Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts, but I still haven’t found the way to use this treasure yet. Apart from that, only the twin swords can threaten the Starflame Demon Lion.”","“ However, the cost of fusing the swords far outweighs the benefits. I can’t use this move unless I run out of options. ” Jian Chen dismissed the idea very quickly. Shortly afterwards, he took out a star chart to confirm his location.","The star chart clearly marked out the location of the thirty-three heavens. Although it could not measure their distance accurately, at least it could prevent people from becoming lost in outer space.","Very soon, Jian Chen found his current location. To his surprise, the Starflame Demon Lion he followed had travelled in a great circle in outer space. In the end, they had actually returned to somewhere near the Hall Brilliance Heaven.","“ The Hall Brilliance Heaven has a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. ” Very soon, Jian Chen’s eyes lit up as he thought of the Warring Old Freak.","“ With senior Warring’s strength, he might not be able to defeat the Starflame Demon Lion, but it might be possible if I’m assisting him on the side with the Divine Formation of the Heavens. ” Jian Chen’s eyes became brighter and brighter. With his speed, reaching the Hall Brilliance Heaven would only take half a day. A journey there and back would not take too much time, so he did not have to worry about the Starflame Demon Lion leaving during this time.","Thinking up to there, he immediately stopped hesitating. He left the asteroid field with determination and pushed his Laws of Space to the limits. With each step, the surroundings would change. He crossed galaxies with each step.","In just half a day, the Hall Brilliance Heaven appeared in Jian Chen’s view as the size of a rice grain.","Looking at the slightly familiar land before him, Jian Chen was filled with mixed feelings.","Originally, he thought it would be a very long time before he would return to the Hall Brilliance Heaven when he left.","He never thought that the heavens would play him for a fool. He actually returned here so quickly.","Spatial ripples appeared beneath Jian Chen’s feet. Each step he took was like teleportation. In under a minute, he had already crossed the tremendous distance and arrived on the Hall Brilliance Heaven.","The War sect was located in the centre of the Hall Brilliance Heaven. They occupied the spiritual mountain that was most abundant in spiritual Qi.","On this day, Jian Chen silently appeared outside the War sect. Looking at the spiritual mountain shrouded in mist, he said loudly, “Junior Yang Yutian has come to visit. I hope to meet with senior Warring!”","Jian Chen’s voice boomed thunderously, rumbling through several hundred thousand kilometres and reaching the entire War sect.","Three figures hovered in the air with their legs crossed in the forbidden grounds of the War sect. They all radiated with the presence of Immortal Exalts.","They were the three ancestors of the War sect. Apart from the strongest, the Warring Old Freak, the other two were a Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt and a Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt.","The three ancestors gathered together to discuss matters related to the Transcension Ancestor. Apart from the Warring Old Freak, the other two ancestors were filled with concern.","It was as if the two of them could not find peace as long as the Transcension Ancestor was still wandering the world.","That was because under the Merchant Union of Star Brilliance’s intervention, they had already learnt that the Transcenion Ancestor’s primary objective for forging the Fiend Soul Banners was to destroy their War sect.","At this moment, basically everyone in the War sect felt like a sword was hanging over them at all times. Who knew when it would fall.","At this moment, Jian Chen’s voice echoed through the surroundings, drifting over clearly."]},{"number":3815,"title":"Chapter 3815: Finding Reinforcements","paragraphs":["The sudden voice immediately made the other two ancestors of the War sect frown. They were extremely displeased.","“Yang Yutian? Don’t tell me it’s the person from the Immortal Rising City? Isn’t he far too rude with his visit to our War sect? He is stirring up a great ruckus. What kind of visit is this?”","“Yeah. Our War sect is not like the Immortal Rising City. How can he be so impolite-”","The Warring Old Freak raised his hand to stop the two. His eyes shone with a strange light, together with some mixed feelings. “Enough. You don’t have to say anything more. Yang Yutian is anyone but ordinary. We can’t afford to slight him.”","In the War sect, the Warring Old Freak’s words were clearly paramount. With that, the two ancestors directly fell silent. Despite their dissatisfaction, they did not have the courage to add anything.","The Warring Old Freak stood up and said, “Stay here. I’ll go see him personally!” Before he had even finished talking, the Warring Old Freak had already vanished. When he appeared again, he was already in front of Jian Chen.","At this moment, many disciples had already taken to the skies in the War sect, directly approaching Jian Chen. Clearly, they had come to investigate the situation.","They were all Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals. There was even an Immortal Monarch elder among them. They clearly possessed quite the status in the War sect, so they recognised the Warring Old Freak.","Immediately, they stopped behind the Warring Old Freak. Their eyes burned with enthusiasm as they bowed politely towards him in admiration.","“You can all back down,” the Warring Old Freak said to the disciples behind him without even turning around. Afterwards, he looked at Jian Chen with mixed emotions and said, “This is not a place to speak. C’mon, let’s go elsewhere.”","The Warring Old Freak waved his hand, and Jian Chen felt an irresistibly powerful force envelope him. In the next moment, he appeared on a sword-shaped mountain a hundred million kilometres away from the War sect. A sea of clouds surged beneath his feet.","The Warring Old Freak was dressed in clothes made from coarse cloth. He had a thin figure, and his white hair draped down casually. He seemed like an old farmer, except his eyes shone with startling light.","“During the several decades you spent on the Hall Brilliance Heaven, you never came to find me, yet this time, you’ve suddenly returned after leaving with Tan Yu just recently. Don’t tell me you’ve encountered some kind of trouble?” the Warring Old Freak looked at Jian Chen and said calmly.","“I did encounter some trouble, so I need your help, senior Warring.” Jian Chen did not deny it.","“You are the sect master of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. From that identity alone, I won’t refuse your request, given that it is within my capabilities,” the Warring Old Freak said without hesitation.","“Senior Warring, you won’t just be helping me with this. You will also be helping Immortal Exalt Tan Yu and all the Immortal Exalts of the Immortals’ World,” Jian Chen said seriously.","“What do you mean?” The Warring Old Freak narrowed his eyes slightly.","“Senior Warring, do you remember the Starflame Demon Lion that appeared in the Immortals’ World a million years ago?” Jian Chen stared at the Warring Old Freak with shining eyes.","When he heard that, the Warring Old Freak’s expression changed slightly. He blurted out, “Don’t tell me the Starflame Demon Lion has appeared again?” But shortly afterwards, he shook his head and said, “Impossible. That can’t be the case. I participated in the operation against the Starflame Demon Lion back then. We clearly shattered it to pieces. It had completely perished, without any chances of surviving. Don’t tell me a second Starflame Demon Lion has appeared?”","“Oh right, what is the strength of the Starflame Demon Lion?” the Warring Old Freak asked.","“The Sixth Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt!” Jian Chen said.","“The Sixth Heavenly Layer... the Sixth Heavenly Layer... the Starflame Demon Lion we killed in the past was also at the Sixth Heavenly Layer. Don’t tell me it’s the same one as back then?” The Warring Old Freak entered a daze, but he became extremely stern soon. “If that really is the case, we have to kill the Starflame Demon Lion. If it’s still alive, only more Immortal Exalts will end up being eaten by it. However, my strength alone is completely insufficient to kill the Starflame Demon Lion. Even when my true strength already rivals the Seventh Heavenly Layer, it’s nowhere near enough.”","“After all, I fought alongside several Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts and a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt for a total of half a month before shattering it to pieces with difficulty to kill it back then. Its regeneration was far too powerful.”","“As a result, I need to find assistance for this.”","“Senior Warring, we don’t have much time left. City lord Tan Yu has already been devoured by it. He probably can’t last for much longer, so we need to rescue him as soon as possible,” Jian Chen said sternly.","When he heard that, the Warring Old Freak let out a long sigh. He said powerlessly, “If he wasn’t eaten, then he’d be fine, but if he’s already in its belly, then it’ll be difficult to save him with me alone.”","“I can assist you on the side!” Jian Chen said.","“You?” The Warring Old Freak looked at Jian Chen doubtfully, but he soon thought of something. “You plan on using the same methods you used against Space-purging against the Starflame Demon Lion?”","“That’s right, senior!”","“How much confidence do you have?” The Warring Old Freak became reinvigorated. His eyes shone brightly as he stared at Jian Chen closely.","“If I work with senior Warring, I have quite a bit of confidence,” Jian Chen said.","“Since that’s the case, let’s set off right now. I’m also interested in seeing just how powerful the formation you used to kill the Space-purging Ancestor of the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment is.” The Warring Old Freak moved swiftly. As soon as he said that, he left the Hall Brilliance Heaven with Jian Chen, arriving in outer space.","“Which direction is the Starflame Demon Lion located?” The Warring Old Freak looked at Jian Chen.","Afterwards, Jian Chen gave the directions while the Warring Old Freak personally brought him along. With his speed as a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, he moved through the vast sea of stars even more quickly than Jian Chen when he used the Laws of Space.","By the time they returned to the asteroid field where the Starflame Demon Lion rested, they had only used a third of the time that Jian Chen had needed to reach the Hall Brilliance Heaven.","And that was under the circumstances that the Warring Old Freak was not using his full strength. Otherwise, they would only be faster.","“Sure enough, it’s the Starflame Demon Lion from a million years ago. I never thought that it would still survive even after being carved into pieces.” As soon as they entered the asteroid field, the Warring Old Freak noticed the Starflame Demon Lion on a dead planet. His eyes immediately flashed with cold light.","They approached it silently with their presence erased, so the Starflame Demon Lion that lay on the dead planet failed to sense their approach.","“ We’ll come up with a way to save Tan Yu, and then I’ll keep it busy and seek help from other heavens so that we gather more experts. We have to slay it! ” The Warring Old Freak communicated to Jian Chen and said, “ I’m going to do it. Wait for your opportunity and strike when the time is right. Let’s see if you can injure it with the formation. If you can’t, we’ll have to come up with other ideas. ”","Jian Chen nodded sternly. He had already sent a wisp of the senses of his soul into the Primeval Divine Hall to get the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt and everyone else to prepare the Divine Formation of the Heavens.","“ Hmm? ” Right when the Warring Old Freak was about to take action, his expression changed as he scanned the asteroid field with a strange light in his eyes. In the end, his gaze stopped on a region of space; he whispered, “Interesting. I didn’t expect other people to be hidden here.”"]},{"number":3816,"title":"Chapter 3816: The Master of Profound Secrets","paragraphs":["“What? There are other people hidden here?” Jian Chen was slightly surprised. His expression changed.","He had arrived at this asteroid field by following the Starflame Demon Lion. He had been gone for less than a single day. Were the people hidden here already here previously or did they only arrive here when he had returned to the Hall Brilliance Heaven?","Before Jian Chen could think too much about it, the Warring Old Freak had already arrived at a different location in the asteroid field with him. They stopped before a three hundred metre wide asteroid in the end.","Jian Chen studied the asteroid and did not notice anything special about it.","The Warring Old Freak said nothing. He simply stared at the asteroid emotionlessly. He only looked at it and did not do anything else.","At that instant, time seemed to freeze. After an entire minute, the Warring Old Freak finally showed signs of impatience. He let out a gentle pulse of his soul. “ Are you still not coming out? If it weren’t for the concern of alarming the Starflame Demon Lion, I would have shattered this thing with a palm strike already. ”","Perhaps due to the Warring Old Freak’s threats, a gate silently appeared on the ordinary asteroid. Inside stood an old daoist priest with a head full of white hair dressed in priest robes.","The old daoist priest’s presence was completely concealed. None of it leaked out, nor did he create any disturbances. Clearly, he was worried about alarming the Starflame Demon Lion.","The old daoist priest turned to the side slightly, making an inviting gesture to the Warring Old Freak.","The Warring Old Freak did not hesitate. He entered with Jian Chen, directly accessing the interior of the asteroid. He was fearless.","As soon as they entered the asteroid, it was as if they had entered a different world. The space inside was extremely large, at least a thousand kilometres across. Spiritual mountains towered over the land one after another, curling with mist. There were even birds that soared through the sky and sang clearly.","Fancy buildings stood among the mountains with brilliant decoration.","At first glance, it basically seemed like paradise, a land blessed with fortune.","If they looked up, they would notice that the situation outside was completely exposed to them. They could clearly see countless asteroids moving around according to certain patterns.","Even further away, between the cracks that would sometimes appear between the asteroids, they could even vaguely make out the Starflame Demon Lion’s colossal figure.","“This is a high quality god artifact! And one that possesses a concealing ability!” Jian Chen studied the surroundings and shuddered, finally recognising the true form of the asteroid.","“It has only barely made it into the ranks of high quality god artifacts. If I wanted to destroy it, it would just be a matter of two flicks of my hand.” The Warring Old Freak snorted coldly, clearly unhappy about this.","At this moment, the old man in priest robes appeared before the Warring Old Freak. He smiled gently and clasped his fist towards him. “You must be fellow Warring renowned on the Hall Brilliance Heaven. I didn’t expect to encounter fellow Warring in a place like this. It is an absolute honour.”","“And who are you?” The Warring Old Freak stared at the old man in daoist robes.","“I am from Jade’s End Heaven. My daoist title is the Master of Profound Secrets!” the old man said with his head lowered.","“The Master of Profound Secrets? Are you the Master of Profound Secrets of the Azure Light mountain on the Jade’s End Heaven?” Jian Chen’s eyes narrowed.","The old man looked at Jian Chen. However, he could not sense Jian Chen’s presence and discern his strength. As such, he did not have the courage to brush him aside. He smiled amicably. “That’s me! I never thought that you would’ve actually heard of me. However, I don’t think I know who you are. How may I refer to you, fellow?”","“I am Yang Yutian. I once visited the Jade’s End Heaven, which is why I have heard of senior before. It’s actually perfectly normal that you’re not familiar with me, senior. I’m only an Immortal Emperor after all. I’m not anyone impressive.” Jian Chen smiled as his eyes shone with a strange light.","When he first arrived in the Immortals’ World, he discovered the residence of a great elder of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, Immortal Emperor Taihang, on the Grand Sovereign Heaven.","Immortal Emperor Taihang had been targeted by three Immortal Emperor organisations on the Grand Sovereign Heaven together. In the end, even the disciples of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens that he brought with him had perished in the divine hall.","The person behind the three Immortal Emperors was the Master of Profound Secrets of the Azure Light mountain on the Jade’s End Heaven.","At this moment, he actually had a chance encounter with the main culprit behind the death of so many disciples of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens.","Jian Chen was unable to remain calm.","The Warring Old Freak looked back and forth between Jian Chen and the Master of Profound Secrets. He sank into his thoughts before proactively changing the topic. “So it’s the Master of Profound Secrets of the Jade’s End Heaven. I’ve never met you before, but I have heard plenty about you.”","“You’re too kind, senior Warring. Compared to senior Warring whose battle prowess is unparalleled, having never suffered a defeat amongst his peers, my bit of fame is absolutely nothing.” The Master of Profound Secrets smiled. Shortly afterwards, he glanced behind him and said, “Fellows, senior Warring of the Hall Brilliance Heaven has come in person. What are you waiting for? Come and greet him.”","Several figures rose up from the mountains in the distance. Each figure seemed indomitable, giving off a surging presence.","In the next moment, they all vanished. When they appeared again, they all arrived before the Warring Old Freak with their presences erased.","“Greetings, fellow Warring!”","These figures all clasped their fists towards the Warring Old Freak and spoke without being particularly rude or polite.","“Four Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts. This is quite a lineup.” The Warring Old Freak glanced at these people and let out a sigh of surprise.","Afterwards, the Master of Profound Secrets began to introduce them to the Warring Old Freak. The four Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts happened to be the Jade Lotus Master of Mount Penglai on the Jade’s End Heaven.","The Rushing Lightning Immortal Exalt of the Heaven’s Thunder Tower on the Numerous Layer Heaven!","The Blood Butcher Immortal Exalt of the Blood Immortal sect on the Ease Nurturing Heaven!","And the Ancient Virtue Immortal Exalt of the Immortal Courtyard of Four Sages on the Scholarly Attainment Heaven!","The four Immortal Exalts all originated from different heavens. In particular, the Blood Butcher Immortal Exalt of the Blood Immortal sect was the greatest expert on the Ease Nurturing Heaven!","That was because on the entire Ease Nurturing Heaven, he was the only Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt!","The other three were all supreme figures on their respective heavens!","Not every single one of the thirty-three heavens had late Immortal Exalts. Many heavens only had mid Immortal Exalts as their greatest expert.","“What are we compared to senior Warring?” The Jade Lotus Master from the Jade’s End Heaven smiled gently. She was the only female present. She seemed to be in her twenties, possessing natural beauty and a slender figure. She gave off the bearing of a bold and daring woman.","The Jade Lotus Master was the second greatest expert of the Jade’s End Heaven!","“Hahahaha, three million years ago, senior Warring fought a Seventh Heavenly Layer Grand Prime of the Saints’ World to a stalemate. You’re completely right, fellow Jade Lotus. Even if we combined our efforts, we might not be able to withstand a blow from senior Warring.” The Rushing Thunder Immortal Exalt of the Numerous Layer Heaven laughed.","That was what they said, but they did not show any sign of fear or reverence when they faced the Warring Old Freak.","That was because they were all peak experts who ruled over a region of their own. They possessed the heart of the strong.","“So many of you have gathered here. Don’t tell me you plan on dealing with the Starflame Demon Lion?” the Warring Old Freak said as he glanced past these people slowly.","“You’re right about that, senior Warring. I’m refining an ancient pill. Some of its primary materials are sourced from space beasts, the stronger the better. I just happened to know about a Starflame Demon Lion that was active in outer space, so I invited a few fellows. We plan on dealing with this Starflame Demon Lion together,” said the Master of Profound Secrets.","“Four Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts and a Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt does form a very powerful group, but it’s nowhere near enough to deal with the Starflame Demon Lion.” The Warring Old Freak shook his head and said, “If it’s just the five of you, then I’d advise you to give up early, or it might not bode well.”"]},{"number":3817,"title":"Chapter 3817: The Illusionary Ancestor","paragraphs":["“Thank you for your concern, senior Warring. I’m also aware that this Starflame Demon Lion is very powerful. With us alone, we definitely won’t be able to collect the materials I require from the Starflame Demon Lion. As a result, I’ve invited an extremely respectable senior. As long as that senior is here, everything will be smooth sailing,” the Master of Profound Secrets clutched his fist and said. When he mentioned this respectable senior, he gave off a sense of undisguised complacency.","It was as if simply being able to invite this person as a Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt left him feeling extremely proud.","The Warring Old Freak narrowed his eyes slightly. From the Master of Profound Secrets’ expression, he could sense that the person he invited was probably of extraordinary origins.","At this moment, the Master of Profound Secrets’ expression changed. Some joy immediately appeared as he said, “That senior is here already. Please wait here, senior Warring. I’ll go and receive her immediately.” As soon as he said that, the Master of Profound Secrets vanished.","The Warring Old Freak raised his head subconsciously and stared straight into the depths of space. Sure enough, he discovered a figure in the distance, currently approaching them with terrifying speed that even left him in awe.","After making out who it was, the Warring Old Freak’s eyes narrowed as he became solemn.","“ This person is anything but ordinary. Be sure to be courteous later. Do not show any signs of disrespect. ” The Warring Old Freak communicated with Jian Chen.","Jian Chen’s heart sank. The Warring Old Freak was already a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt with exceptional battle prowess. In the past, he had been evenly-matched in battle against a Seventh Heavenly Layer Grand Prime. Although he did not know about the state of the Seventh Heavenly Layer Grand Prime back then, that was still enough to prove the Warring Old Freak’s strength.","Yet even someone like him became so solemn, so Jian Chen struggled to imagine just how impressive the expert that the Master of Profound Secrets invited was.","The stronger the Master of Profound Secrets’ background, the more disadvantageous it was to Jian Chen.","At this moment, the Master of Profound Secrets returned in the lead, guiding a middle-aged woman in black robes over to this place.","Jian Chen looked at the middle-aged woman. She seemed like she was in her forties, giving off a sense of nobility and coldness. Her delicate facial features that seemed like a creation of nature hinted at her startling beauty during her youth.","At this moment, she had erased her presence, so she seemed like a mortal. However, she still gave off a sense of undeniable authority.","“Greetings, Illusionary Ancestor!” The four Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts invited by the Master of Profound Secrets all went up and bowed with their fists clasped. They showed deep respect.","When they faced the greatest expert of the Hall Brilliance Heaven, they treated him without any fear. They had not been particularly polite nor rude to him.","But at this moment, when they faced this woman in black clothes, they demonstrated reverence from the bottom of their hearts.","Even the Warring Old Freak was solemn, proactively clasping his fist towards the woman in black. He did not dare to show any disrespect.","At this moment, the woman in black suddenly stopped. She turned her head and immediately looked at Jian Chen.","From the moment the woman looked at him, Jian Chen’s heart lurched. All of his blood seemed to surge. His blood flow actually accelerated uncontrollably.","He raised his vigilance, lowering his head in a hurry and bowing towards the woman in black.","The woman in black stared straight at Jian Chen. Her eyes shone with a strange light. Shortly afterwards, she set the Immortal Exalts aside and changed direction, turning towards Jian Chen instead.","She did not use any of her abilities. She simply approached Jian Chen on foot, step by step like a regular mortal. She did not move quickly, but it made Jian Chen’s heart tighten for some reason.","The woman’s actions piqued the interest of all the Immortal Exalts present. They immediately looked at Jian Chen as if the outstanding talents from the various heavens had only begun to truly evaluate him now.","The Warring Old Freak furrowed his brows. He seemed to realise something, and his heart weighed extremely heavily. As he watched the woman in black approach them, he became conflicted inside.","In the end, he made up his mind and stood in front of Jian Chen. He clasped his fist towards the woman in black. “Illusionary Ancestor, this is only an Immortal Emperor junior. With the Illusionary Ancestor’s status, why personally make things difficult for a mere junior?”","The woman in black stopped and frowned slightly. She stared at the Warring Old Freak in displeasure and said, “Warring Old Freak, what do you mean by that? Since when did I say I would make things difficult for this little brother?”","The Warring Old Freak was taken aback before letting out a laugh. “Looks like I’m overthinking. This little brother doesn’t know who the Illusionary Ancestor is, so if he’s disrespected you in any way, please be tolerant with him, Illusionary Ancestor.”","The Warring Old Freak eased up inside and immediately stood aside.","The woman in black slowly approached Jian Chen. She studied Jian Chen closely with her deep gaze that gave off a sense of pressure. A hint of doubt that no one could sense flashed through the depths of her eyes.","“Little brother, what... is your name? Who is your master?” the woman in black asked. Her gentle voice was filled with a sense of affinity.","To one side, the Master of Profound Secrets and the four Immortal Exalts exchanged glances. They seemed extremely surprised by how much the woman in black cared about Jian Chen.","In particular, the Master of Profound Secrets felt strangely shocked.","He had a slight understanding about the woman in black’s temperament. In his knowledge, the woman in black was not exactly frosty, but she would never behave like this and reveal an amicable side.","For a moment, the way the Master of Profound Secrets looked at Jian Chen changed in a subtle way. It became filled with suspicion and curiosity.","“Illusionary Ancestor, I am Yang Yutian. As for who my master is, forgive me because I cannot disclose it.” Jian Chen clasped his fist.","When he heard that, the Warring Old Freak’s expression changed slightly, while the Master of Profound Secrets’ face sank. He bellowed at Jian Chen, “How dare you, Yang Yutian! Do you know who the Illusionary Ancestor is? Being personally questioned by the Illusionary Ancestor is a great honour. How can you be so thankless?”","“Profound Secrets, shut your mouth.” The woman in black seemed to be extremely dissatisfied with how the Master of Profound Secrets behaved. She furrowed her brows and spoke up sternly. There was clearly a hint of impatience in her voice.","The Master of Profound Secrets immediately paled. He bowed apologetically towards the woman in black and directly shut up.","The woman in black looked at Jian Chen again. Her eyes shone with a strange light as she said gently, “If you don't want to tell me, I obviously won’t make things difficult for you, but why are you lying to me?”","“Your true name is not Yang Yutian at all!”","When the Illusionary Ancestor said that, Jian Chen’s face changed slightly. The Warring Old Freak’s heart sank as well, suddenly developing an ill omen.","The Illusionary Ancestor seemed to sense something. She glanced at the Warring Old Freak and said in interest, “Warring Old Freak, you seem to be very nervous? What are you afraid of?”","The Warring Old Freak smiled wryly. “I brought this little fellow here. Now, he’s displeased the Illusionary Ancestor. Of course, I’d be worried.”","Then he turned towards Jian Chen and berated him. “In front of the Illusionary Ancestor, you must never lie. With your measly cultivation, the Illusionary Ancestor can immediately discern your lies from the truth.”"]},{"number":3818,"title":"Chapter 3818: Mystifying Kindness","paragraphs":["Jian Chen was startled inside. He had already realised that he probably needed to be an Immortal Exalt at the very least to hide his lies before the Illusionary Ancestor and prevent her from discerning the truth.","That made his caution rise to the limit. He did not dare to speak so easily anymore.","On the other side, the Master of Profound Secrets, the Jade Lotus Immortal Exalt, the Rushing Lightning Immortal Exalt, the Blood Butcher Immortal Exalt, and the Ancient Virtue Immortal Exalt all sneered inside. He was basically asking to die by lying in front of the Illusionary Ancestor.","In their minds, they could already imagine how severe the consequences would be once the Illusionary Ancestor lost her temper. Even the Warring Old Freak might be drawn into the matter.","However, to everyone’s surprise, the Illusionary Ancestor did not lose her temper as they had imagined. Instead, she smiled gently and said, “Little brother, I’ve suddenly become very interested in your true identity. Is it convenient for you to tell me?”","The Illusionary Ancestor’s attitude immediately left the Immortal Exalts stunned. At that moment, they basically doubted whether the person right before them was the rumoured Illusionary Ancestor.","The Warring Old Freak’s eyes flickered with doubt. For a moment, he was uncertain about what the Illusionary Ancestor was after.","Jian Chen was troubled as well. He was unable to understand why an expert like the Illusionary Ancestor would take an interest in him, leaving him at a momentary loss.","After a moment of hesitation, Jian Chen clasped his fist towards the Illusionary Ancestor and said, “Senior Illusionary Ancestor, could you tell me who you are?”","The Warring Old Freak’s expression immediately changed. He barked at Jian Chen, “Yang Yutian, show some respect. Do you think the Illusionary Ancestor’s identity is something that you can ask about? Hurry up and apologise to the Illusionary Ancestor.”","The Warring Old Freak’s reaction made Jian Chen’s heart sink. He had already realised that the origins of the Illusionary Ancestor before him were probably even more terrifying and astonishing than he had imagined. After all, it could make the greatest expert of the Hall Brilliance Heaven, the Warring Old Freak, so fearful.","“It’s not a problem. Since you want to know my identity, it’s fine if I tell you.” The Illusionary Ancestor still did not lose her temper, smiling gently and pleasantly. It also made Jian Chen develop a strange sense of closeness in the depths of his heart.","“My name is Daowei Huanru. I come from the Waymight clan. As of right now, I am the second ancestor of the Waymight clan. People call me the Illusionary Ancestor!” The woman in black smiled gently.","The Master of Profound Secrets, the Jade Lotus Immortal Exalt, the Rushing Lightning Immortal Exalt, the Blood Butcher Immortal Exalt, and the Ancient Virtue Immortal Exalt all exchanged glances. Their eyes were filled with shock and astoundment.","The Illusionary Ancestor was a supreme expert who had made a name for herself a long time ago. Very few people in the Immortals’ World knew her true name. In fact, not a lot of people possessed the right to know her true name.","Even they, Fourth and Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts, only knew her by her title, the Illusionary Ancestor. They did not know her by Daowei Huanru.","Yet at this moment, the Illusionary Ancestor divulged her true name to a junior who was a measly Immortal Emperor. No one would believe this news if it made it out.","Jian Chen was shocked. Daowei Huanru? The second ancestor of the Waymight clan?","His heart immediately sank.","To the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, the Waymight clan was not kind folk.","“Please forgive me, senior. It is still inconvenient for me to disclose my identity to you right now, senior. However, there will be a day when you know, senior,” Jian Chen said reluctantly. He never imagined that he would actually encounter the second ancestor of the Waymight clan here.","Moreover, she had even been invited by the Master of Profound Secrets.","And yet, lying happened to be impossible before the Illusionary Ancestor. All lies would be seen through.","The Illusionary Ancestor’s face hardened as if she did not expect a reply like this after stating her esteemed identity.","The Warring Old Freak, the Master of Illusionary Secrets, and everyone else held their breaths. They all believed that Jian Chen had made a huge mistake.","After all, the person before him was the second ancestor of the Waymight clan. For someone so significant to be treated with such disrespect by an Immortal Emperor junior, it was an unforgivable crime.","Right when the Warring Old Freak contemplated on how to handle this, the Illusionary Ancestor suddenly laughed gently. “Little guy, looks like you’re quite suspicious of me. Whatever. Since this makes things difficult for you, I won’t make things difficult for you.”","The Illusionary Ancestor opened her hand. Immediately, a simple talisman appeared out of thin air before drifting over to Jian Chen.","Jian Chen looked at the talisman; his eyes suddenly narrowed. From the talisman, he could sense a terrifying force that could be described as devastating.","It was not just him. When the Warring Old Freak noticed the talisman, his expression changed drastically. He became unprecedentedly stern.","“This talisman is refined from the power of my primary body. Once activated, it will instantly erupt with the force of a strike from my primary body. It is so powerful that even the Warring Old Freak beside you cannot receive it. Even if he survives, he’ll be left with half a life.”","“Right now, I am giving this talisman to you. With it around, even if you don’t use it, it will serve as a great deterrence and help you resolve many problems.” The Illusionary Ancestor looked at Jian Chen as if she wanted to see through him completely.","“Illusionary Ancestor, a-a-are you gifting this talisman to him?” The Warring Old Freak was stunned. Actually, when Jian Chen refused to divulge his identity to the Illusionary Ancestor, the Warring Old Freak was already prepared to deal with all of the consequences.","In the end, the consequences never arrived. Instead, the Illusionary Ancestor gave him such a precious talisman. Even the Warring Old Freak struggled to adjust to this turn of events.","Nearby, the Master of Profound Secrets, the Jade Lotus Immortal Exalt, the Rushing Lightning Immortal Exalt, the Blood Butcher Immortal Exalt, and the Ancient Virtue Immortal Exalt were all stunned.","The Illusionary Ancestor’s attitude today was truly mystifying. She was completely different from normal.","But shortly afterwards, they all looked at the talisman floating before Jian Chen. Their eyes burned with undisguised desire.","This talisman contained the power of a strike from the Illusionary Ancestor’s main body; it could easily heavily injure an expert like the Warring Old Freak. They knew exactly how startling its value was.","If the talisman ended up in their hands, it would truly be a supreme treasure that could protect an entire peak sect.","At this moment, the Illusionary Ancestor was giving such a precious talisman to an Immortal Emperor junior she had never met before, which made these peak experts turn green with envy.","“Senior, this item is far too precious. I’m afraid I can’t take it.” However, Jian Chen did not have the courage to take it. Perhaps to others, the Illusionary Ancestor’s talisman was a life-preserving measure, but in Jian Chen’s hand, it was no different from a hot potato. He did not want much contact with it.","“You refuse to tell me your identity, and you even tried lying to me with a fake name. I can ignore all of that, but if you don’t accept my talisman, then I’m really going to lose my temper.”","“If I lose my temper, the consequences are very severe. Even the Warring Old Freak won’t be able to get out of this, even if this is just my secondary body.”","The Illusionary Ancestor’s smile gradually vanished. Her gaze sharpened like she was about to be angered.","“Yang Yutian, a gift from the Illusionary Ancestor is a treasure that leaves me utterly envious. To you, it’s an impressive fortune. What are you waiting for? Thank the Illusionary Ancestor!” The Warring Old Freak urged Jian Chen on the side.","The Illusionary Ancestor had already said that. Jian Chen knew that even if the talisman was a source of trouble, he had to accept it.","He did not dilly-dally. He carefully caught the talisman that drifted over to him with both hands.","When the talisman entered his hands, he gained an even deeper appreciation for just how vast the power inside was.","The power was so great that it gave him chills.","Even if the Divine Formation of the Heavens operated at full strength right now, its might came nowhere close to the power inside the talisman.","“ This item can threaten late Immortal Exalts! ” Jian Chen was stern. He was not a fool. He understood just how startlingly precious the talisman was.","“That’s more like it.” The Illusionary Ancestor smiled warmly again as if only then did she feel a little better.","Afterwards, the Illusionary Ancestor arrived before the Master of Profound Secrets. Her smile and gentleness had already vanished. She became indifferent and said flatly, “Master of Profound Secrets, how are your preparations going?”","“Illusionary Ancestor, I’ve already made all the preparations on my end. I’m just waiting for you to take action and suppress this Starflame Demon Lion,” the Master of Profound Secrets said politely, but he felt very perplexed. He struggled to understand what was so special about Jian Chen. Why did the Illusionary Ancestor treat him so differently from how she treated him?","“Are you certain that the Starflame Demon Lion possesses important materials for refining the ancient pill?” The Illusionary Ancestor stared at the Master of Profound Secrets like she was judging him.","“Don’t worry, Illusionary Ancestor. After numerous revisions and much research, I’m certain that as long as I collect the essence of the Starflame Demon Lion’s five organs and its soul essence, I’ll be able to refine the ancient pill successfully. Moreover, to ensure that this ends in complete success, I’ve invited several fellows to assist me,” the Master of Profound Secrets said politely. At the same time, he introduced the Jade Lotus Immortal Exalt, the Rushing Lightning Immortal Exalt, the Blood Butcher Immortal Exalt, and the Ancient Virtue Immortal Exalt beside him."]},{"number":3819,"title":"Chapter 3819: The Illusionary Ancestor’s Strength","paragraphs":["“Why did you invite a bunch of Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts when you’re facing a Sixth Heavenly Layer Starflame Demon Lion?” The Illusionary Ancestor furrowed her brows.","The Jade Lotus Master and everyone else felt awkward. The Illusionary Ancestor looked down on them, yet they were unable to muster any feeling of displeasure.","“You may not be aware, Illusionary Ancestor. It is indeed a little too much for these fellows to deal with the Starflame Demon Lion, but they will be of great use when it comes to collecting the essence of its five organs and its soul essence. After all, the ancient pill I’m refining is of extremely great importance to the crown prince. I cannot afford to be careless at all over something so important, which was why I made these arrangements,” said the Master of Profound Secrets.","The Illusionary Ancestor eased up and said, “I’ll go and suppress the Starflame Demon Lion. You can adapt to the circumstances. I only have one request. Don’t disappoint me!”","“Please don’t worry, Illusionary Ancestor. I definitely won’t disappoint you!” The Master of Profound Secrets guaranteed.","In the next moment, the Illusionary Ancestor suddenly vanished. When she appeared again, she had already arrived in outer space, directly over the Starflame Demon Lion’s head.","The Master of Profound Secrets’ high quality god artifact that blended in as an asteroid seemed to be non-existent in the Illusionary Ancestor’s eyes. She could come and go as she pleased.","Boom!","In the next moment, a great rumble rang out in the asteroid field. Earlier, the Illusionary Ancestor had been extremely discreet, no different from an ordinary person. Now, she demonstrated startling might. A terrifying presence swept out from her body, flooding the surroundings and crushing outer space, making countless asteroids in the surroundings explode.","The colossal dead planet that the Starflame Demon Lion rested on also collapsed immediately under the Illusionary Ancestor’s pressure. The Starflame Demon Lion jerked awake and raised its colossal head, immediately locking onto the Illusionary Ancestor above with its huge eyes. It subconsciously opened its huge mouth, wanting to let out a roar instinctively.","However, before it could even let out its roar, the Illusionary Ancestor’s hand had already fallen. Her gentle-looking hand contained terrifying and shocking power, piercing outer space and landing on the Starflame Demon Lion’s head instantly.","With a bang, a huge handprint appeared on the Starflame Demon Lion’s head. Its skull cracked open, and blood flowed uncontrollably.","It should have been knocked far away by the great force, but an invisible power surrounded it, fixing it firmly in place. In the end, the Starflame Demon Lion’s body was locked into place in an extremely strange posture.","“Fellows, it’s time for us to take action.” The Master of Profound Secrets no longer cared about the Warring Old Freak inside the high quality god artifact. He signalled the experts beside him and left.","Now, only Jian Chen and the Warring Old Freak were left inside the high quality god artifact.","The Warring Old Freak looked outside and sighed. “With the Illusionary Ancestor taking action personally, this matter is none of our business now. I never thought someone as venerable as her would actually personally come out to deal with a Starflame Demon Lion.”","“ Senior Warring, just how powerful is the Illusionary Ancestor? ” Jian Chen asked.","When he heard that, the Warring Old Freak immediately became stern. “The Illusionary Ancestor reached the peak of the Eighth Heavenly Layer many years ago. She’s only a step away from the Ninth Heavenly Layer. She is the second strongest figure of the Waymight clan.”","“Afterwards, it was said that in order to break through to the Ninth Heavenly Layer, the Illusionary Ancestor took a different path and condensed a clone, which is the secondary body you see right now. She’s preparing to cultivate her secondary body to the Eighth Heavenly Layer as well. Then she will merge it with her primary body and use this opportunity to reach the Ninth Heavenly Layer.”","“And now, the Illusionary Ancestor’s secondary body has already reached the Seventh Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt.”","Jian Chen was shocked and struggled to calm down. Her primary body at the peak of the Eighth Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt and her secondary body at the Seventh Heavenly Layer. The Illusionary Ancestor was truly much more than powerful.","The part that left him even more confused was why a supreme expert as powerful as her would treat him so amiably.","“Senior Warring, why do you think the Illusionary Ancestor treats me a little differently from everyone else?” Jian Chen asked in doubt.","“Who knows.” The Warring Old Freak shot a glance at Jian Chen with his shining eyes and said in exasperation, “Even to this moment, I can’t understand why someone like the Illusionary Ancestor would be so nice to you for no reason.”","“In particular, the talisman she gave you. Do you have any idea just how precious it is? Even in our War sect, we would enshrine it as a sect treasure. Right now, even I feel envious of you.”","“Oh right, Yang Yutian, who is your ancestor?”","Jian Chen was taken aback. “Senior Warring, why do you ask this?”","“I suspect that you might be a descendant of the Illusionary Ancestor.” The Warring Old Freak stared at Jian Chen strangely.","Jian Chen let out a laugh and said, “You must be joking, senior Warring. I come from a lower world, and my ancestors have all been regular people. How can I be a descendant of the Illusionary Ancestor.”","“Of course, I know you’re now. If you really were a descendant, the Illusionary Ancestor would have recognised you with a single glance with her cultivation. Moreover, you don’t have the bloodline of the Waymight clan.” The Warring Old Freak shook his head and discarded these random thoughts. He began to focus on the battle outside.","Outside, all of the asteroids had already been destroyed. Residing in the high quality god artifact, their view completely opened up as well. They could clearly see the battle between the Illusionary Ancestor and the Starflame Demon Lion.","The Starflame Demon Lion was already a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. Due to the toughness of its body and its regeneration, it was difficult for cultivators of the same level to heavily injure it, let alone kill it.","A million years ago, it took a group of Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts led by a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt to kill it after quite some effort.","But right now, an intense battle did not erupt between the Starflame Demon Lion and the Illusionary Ancestor’s secondary body.","That was because the Starflame Demon Lion was unable to resist at all. Their strength was on completely different levels.","By now, the Starflame Demon Lion was covered in wounds. Its huge skull had already cracked open. Several large handprints were embedded in its head, creating a brutal scene.","Powerful energy lingered around each handprint, preventing the Starflame Demon Lion from healing.","As a result, the Starflame Demon Lion struggled to heal from all of the wounds caused by the Illusionary Ancestor.","In just half a minute, the Starflame Demon Lion seemed to be incapacitated. It collapsed in outer space.","The Illusionary Ancestor stood over its head. Her black clothes ruffled despite the absence of wind. The presence she gave off was so powerful that the surrounding space contorted, making the Starflame Demon Lion tremble from the bottom of its heart.","The Illusionary Ancestor waved her hands. Chains of order manifested from the surrounding space, plunging mercilessly into the Starflame Demon Lion’s body like sharp spears and restraining it in the air."]},{"number":3820,"title":"Chapter 3820: Essence of the Five Organs","paragraphs":["The Starflame Demon Lion let out a miserable howl filled with pain. It began to put up a fierce struggle with its colossal body.","But under the Illusionary Ancestor’s restraints, the Starflame Demon Lion was unable to budge the chains of order that pierced its body even with its full strength.","The Warring Old Freak was dazed by that sight inside the high quality god artifact. He was filled with both shock and amazement. He murmured, “The Illusionary Ancestor is far too powerful. Although this secondary body of hers is a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, her actual battle prowess is probably even beyond some regular Eighth Heavenly Layer experts.”","“However, a major reason for why the Illusionary Ancestor is so powerful is due to her bloodline. After all, that’s the bloodline of a Grand Exalt. She possesses a natural advantage.”","At this moment, Jian Chen thought of something. He became slightly stern and said, “Senior Warring, I heard the Master of Profound Secrets mention earlier that the ancient pill he’s refining is prepared for the crown prince. May I ask who the crown prince is?”","The Warring Old Freak glanced at Jian Chen in a bizarre banner and said, “Don’t tell me you don’t even know about this? Of the entire Waymight clan, there is only one person who possesses the title of crown prince.”","“That would be Daowei Chengqing!”","When he mentioned that name, the Warring Old Freak’s expression immediately became mixed. “Daowei Chengqing is a legend of the Immortals’ World. He’s the only person who’s managed to return from the Hole of Reincarnation across all these years. He’s also the only person who managed to nurture all of his attendants into Immortal Exalts in just a short hundred thousand years.”","“The reason why the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance could become so powerful is also connected to the crown prince of the Waymight clan.”","“And the Grand Exalt of the Waymight clan...” The Warring Old Freak did not continue, seemingly having qualms. He refused to discuss matters regarding the Grand Exalts so carelessly.","A hint of coldness appeared in Jian Chen’s eyes. He recalled how he had encountered Daowei Chengqing back then in the sacred land of the Observance Heaven City.","At the time, Daowei Chengqing was out to harm him.","“Senior Warring, what kind of relationship exists between crown prince Daowei Chengqing and the Illusionary Ancestor?” Jian Chen suppressed his feelings and asked.","“He’s the Illusionary Ancestor’s descendant, countless generations apart. He’s also the descendant that the Illusionary Ancestor spoils and loves the most,” said the Warring Old Freak.","“ In other words, the Illusionary Ancestor is Daowei Chengqing’s great grandmother? With a relationship like that, that’s even more reason why I can’t accept the Illusionary Ancestor’s talisman. ” Jian Chen’s heart weighed heavily. The Illusionary Ancestor originated from the Waymight clan, so he had always been very cautious of her.","He was so cautious that he did not even have the courage to place the talisman that the Illusionary Ancestor gave him inside the Primeval Divine Hall, afraid that she could discreetly spy on him through the talisman.","After all, the Illusionary Ancestor’s cultivation was far too high. Her methods were exceptional. He had to guard against her.","In the space outside, the Starflame Demon Lion had already been firmly bound by the criss-crossing chains of order. Apart from letting out furious roars, it was capable of nothing more.","The Master of Profound Secrets, the Jade Lotus Master, the Rushing Lightning Immortal Exalt, the Blood Butcher Immortal Exalt, and the Ancient Virtue Immortal Exalt were already standing on the Starflame Demon Lion. They happened to be located at the Starflame Demon Lion’s heart.","“The essence of the five organs cannot be collected recklessly. We need to follow a specific order. The heart comes first,” said the Master of Profound Secrets. With a wave of his hand, a pill cauldron immediately appeared. Then it expanded to three hundred metres across and floated over the Master of Profound Secrets’ head, radiating with the pressure of a high quality god artifact.","“Let’s begin, everyone!” The Master of Profound Secrets formed a seal, and the cauldron over his head immediately turned upside down, facing the Starflame Demon Lion’s heart.","The Jade Lotus Master, the Rushing Lightning Immortal Exalt, the Blood Butcher Immortal Exalt, and the Ancient Virtue Immortal Exalt stopped hesitating. Their presences as Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts erupted. They all wielded high quality god artifacts that they swung towards the Starflame Demon Lion’s heart.","Boom! Boom! Boom! Boom!","Immediately, several deafening rumbles erupted. The powerful shockwave turned into a violent storm of energy that swept through the surrounding sea of stars.","However, the four of them were stunned very soon. The area that they attacked together was unscathed. The Starflame Demon Lion had not suffered any damage.","“Why is this animal’s hide so thick? Even with our strength, we’ve failed to harm it.” The Blood Butcher Immortal Exalt cried out as if he was deeply impacted. After all, he was known as the greatest expert on the Ease Nurturing Heaven.","“No, it’s not because its hide is thick, but because this animal has been rendered helpless by the Illusionary Ancestor. It has concentrated all of its energy on its defences. Our attack just now failed to penetrate its protective energy,” the Master of Profound Secrets said sternly.","At this moment, everyone discovered that extremely powerful energy circulated beneath the Starflame Demon Lion’s hide. This energy merged perfectly with its body, which immediately made it extremely tough. It was basically indestructible to Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts.","Perhaps only Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts were capable of harming the Starflame Demon Lion.","The faces of the Jade Lotus Master, the Rushing Lightning Immortal Exalt, the Blood Butcher Immortal Exalt, and the Ancient Virtue Immortal Exalt all became ugly. The Starflame Demon Lion was actually even more troublesome than they had imagined.","“Please assist us, Illusionary Ancestor!” With no other choice, the Master of Profound Secrets could only seek help from the Illusionary Ancestor.","Above the Starflame Demon Lion’s head, the Illusionary Ancestor seemed like a queen of spiders. Chains extended out from around her, where part of them served as restraints, trapping the Starflame Demon Lion’s body, while the others served as sharp spears, penetrating various critical points of the Starflame Demon Lion’s body and limiting its movements.","When she heard the Master of Profound Secrets’ call for help, the Illusionary Ancestor immediately looked over. With a gesture of her finger, the laws immediately manifested in the space there, condensing into a colossal spear three hundred metres long. It turned into a bolt of lightning that plunged viciously into the Starflame Demon Lion’s heart.","Boom! With a heavy bang, the Starflame Demon Lion’s flesh ruptured, turning into a huge, bloody hole. It was three thousand metres across and several tens of thousand metres deep, leading straight into its body.","However, with the Starflame Demon Lion’s colossal body, this injury was even smaller than a finger-sized hole on an adult.","The four Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts could not harm it at all even after combining their strength, yet it seemed utterly fragile before the Illusionary Ancestor, unable to withstand a single blow.","The Master of Profound Secrets and the four other experts arrived at the edge of the bloody hole. As they stood there, they could clearly see a colossal heart at the bottom of the pit, beating away forcefully.","With each beat, it would produce a thunderous tremor that could pierce everything.","However, they still could not see the entirety of the Starflame Demon Lion’s heart in the hole. It only exposed a part of it.","The Master of Profound Secrets did not hesitate at all. He formed seals with both hands, and the giant cauldron over his head immediately shone with dazzling light. A great suction force appeared, planning on devouring the essence of the Starflame Demon Lion’s five organs.","Under the terrifying suction force, it took around a minute before he drew out a single feeble strand of essence of the five organs, sealing it away inside the cauldron.","“Just as I had expected, it’s extremely difficult to collect the essence of the five organs from the Starflame Demon Lion. Everyone, assemble the formation,” the Master of Profound Secrets said with a growl."]},{"number":3821,"title":"Chapter 3821: Sudden Drop in Strength","paragraphs":["When they heard that, the Jade Lotus Master, the Rushing Lightning Immortal Exalt, the Blood Butcher Immortal Exalt, and the Ancient Virtune Immortal Exalt exchanged glances. In the next moment, surging energy erupted from within them, mixing together in space and rapidly forming a profound formation.","The formation originated from the Master of Profound Secrets. It was not capable of offence or defence. Its only purpose was to assist the Master of Profound Secrets in collecting the essence of the five organs faster.","As soon as the formation took shape, the Master of Profound Secrets’ cauldron immediately began to absorb the essence of the five organs several dozen times faster than before. The essence of the five organs turned into a stream the thickness of a finger, forcefully stripped from the Starflame Demon Lion’s heart. Eventually, it flowed into the cauldron.","After losing the essence, the Starflame Demon Lion’s massive heart immediately began to shrink at a visible rate.","The Starflame Demon Lion began to panic. It let out furious growls, wanting to put up a desperate struggle, but it was immobilised by the Illusionary Ancestor’s suppression.","“We already have enough essence of the heart. Let’s go to the liver!” A while later, the Master of Profound Secrets yelled out and stopped gathering the essence of the heart. With the four Immortal Exalts, he made his way over to the location of the Starflame Demon Lion’s liver.","Afterwards, they repeated the process. The Illusionary Ancestor struck personally, penetrating the Starflame Demon Lion’s defences, and the residual presence of laws prevented its wounds from closing up. Afterwards, the Master of Profound Secrets collected its essence of the five organs.","But at this moment, the Illusionary Ancestor’s expression suddenly changed. Shortly afterwards, her surging presence receded like the tide. Her strength regressed severely, dropping from her peak, the Seventh Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt, to the Sixth Heavenly Layer.","Afterwards, she fell all the way from the Sixth Heavenly Layer to the Fifth Heavenly Layer.","In just a short while, the Illusionary Ancestor’s supreme cultivation faced a severe decline. Even the chains of order that restrained the Starflame Demon Lion weakened with her.","Since she had regressed to a Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, the Illusionary Ancestor could no longer suppress the Starflame Demon Lion as easily as before despite her bloodline as a Grand Exalt, her powerful cultivation method, and her ancient secret techniques.","The Starflame Demon Lion let out a furious roar, and the chains that penetrated its body all snapped apart. It immediately broke free from all restraints, recovering its freedom.","Even its wounds that previously struggled to close rapidly healed at a visible rate.","As the Illusionary Ancestor’s strength fell, she could no longer stop the Starflame Demon Lion from healing itself.","“Oh no! Retreat!” The expressions of the Master of Profound Secrets and the others who were currently collecting the Starflame Demon Lion’s essence of the five organs changed. They pulled away from the Starflame Demon Lion, flying into the distance.","But it was already too late. The Starflame Demon Lion’s colossal eyes had already locked onto the five of them. It opened its colossal mouth and bit down towards them.","They directly felt their bodies sink. In the next moment, tremendous force seemed to squeeze in from all sides, wanting to freeze the space and limit their movements. They could only watch helplessly as the huge mouth of the Starflame Demon Lion approached them.","“You want to eat all of us in one gulp? Your appetite is just too great, you animal. Aren’t you afraid of a stomach ache?” The Blood Butcher Immortal Exalt sneered. In the next moment, the four Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts struck at the same time. Blinding light wove together as four high quality god artifacts struck out with great might, devastating the space there and landing against the Starflame Demon Lion’s head heavily.","Boom!","A storm was kicked up in outer space. Under the combined attack from four Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts, the Starflame Demon Lion halted and was momentarily repelled.","It had yet to recover from its heavy injuries it suffered from the Illusionary Ancestor. Otherwise, four Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts would have never been enough to shake it.","However, the four experts did not try to engage it any further. After repelling the Starflame Demon Lion’s attack, they gathered around the Master of Profound Secrets and quickly fled into the distance while protecting him.","The Starflame Demon Lion’s colossal eyes were fixed on the Master of Profound Secrets, filled with bloodthirstiness and madness. It seemed to hate this man to its core. After all, he had harvested its essence of the five organs.","Right when it wanted to pursue, the Illusionary Ancestor strode over from afar. A golden lotus bloomed beneath her feet. Every lotus petal contained the profound aura of ways as if it possessed a mysterious power that could communicate with the world and mobilise the power of laws.","The golden lotus grew larger and larger underneath the Illusionary Ancestor, blotting out the sky. The terrifying shockwave it gave off filled the Starflame Demon Lion’s eyes with caution.","In the next moment, the golden lotus that had become enormous suddenly closed together. Its petals bunched up firmly, completely covering the Starflame Demon Lion’s huge body.","Immediately, the Starflame Demon Lion vanished from the sea of stars. Only a colossal golden lotus stood there, where its closed petals bulged.","Roar! The Starflame Demon Lion let out a growl inside the golden lotus. It struggled furiously as its tremendous power as a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt shook up the interior, making the surrounding space twist violently. Countless spatial cracks appeared.","The Golden lotus was gradually dyed blood-red. Copious amounts of blood squeezed out from the inside.","The golden lotus clearly possessed unfathomable power. Having been cast by the Illusionary Ancestor with her strength as a Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, not only could it momentarily trap the Sixth Heavenly Layer Starflame Demon Lion, but it even made it suffer inside.","At this moment, the Illusionary Ancestor was no longer as relaxed as before. She became extremely stern. Her terrifying energy circulated inside her body, surging furiously into the golden lotus.","But after only a few seconds, a rumble erupted in outer space. The Illusionary Ancestor’s golden lotus immediately collapsed, turning into countless golden fragments that dissipated into the surroundings as pure energy.","The Starflame Demon Lion had broken out. It was bloodied and covered in injuries. Each injury was like a chasm, which formed a horrific sight.","It roared furiously; its huge eyes turned scarlet red. It opened its mouth, and a huge beam of energy blasted out, piercing through space right towards the Illusionary Ancestor.","The beam of energy possessed great might. When the Jade Lotus Master, the Blood Butcher Immortal Exalt, the Rushing Lightning Immortal Exalt, and the Ancient Virtue Immortal Exalt sensed it, their expressions all changed.","The Illusionary Ancestor was unfazed. She produced a series of seals and used an ultimate secret technique. Her presence immediately faded away; the space she resided in underwent some minute changes as well.","It all happened in a split second. The energy blast from the Starflame Demon Lion arrived, but before it could even make contact with the Illusionary Ancestor, it was rebounded by the space in front of her.","Boom! The Starflame Demon Lion’s mouth immediately exploded. It was injured by its own attack, reduced to a bloody mess."]},{"number":3822,"title":"Chapter 3822: The Warring Old Freak’s Entry","paragraphs":["However, its recovery rate was extremely startling. The injury that had just appeared closed up at a visible rate.","After the Illusionary Ancestor’s strength had plummeted, she was still able to suppress the Starflame Demon Lion with her strength as a Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. She still had various advantages including her bloodline, cultivation method, and so on, but she clearly could not suppress it to the extent where the Master of Profound Secrets and everyone else could continue collecting the essence of its five organs.","In the distance, the Master of Profound Secrets hovered in the sea of stars with the four Fifth Heavenly Layer experts around him, staring at the Illusionary Ancestor in the distance sternly.","“Master of Profound Secrets, what’s wrong with the Illusionary Ancestor? Why has her cultivation suddenly fallen?” the Jade Lotus Master asked in confusion.","When he heard that, the Master of Profound Secrets let out a gentle sigh and said, “I’ve heard about the Illusionary Ancestor’s situation before. It’s said that it’s a result of her cultivation method, which makes her experience a tribulation of decline every once in a while.”","“Once the tribulation of decline occurs, the Illusionary Ancestor’s strength will suffer dramatically and plummet. Both her primary and secondary body will be affected.”","“The situation happening right now closely resembles the tribulation of decline.”","“When will this tribulation of decline be over? If we can’t completely suppress the Starflame Demon Lion, we can’t collect the essence of the five organs.” The Ancient Virtue Immortal Exalt frowned.","The Master of Profound Secrets shook his head. “That I do not know.”","As he said that, the Master of Profound Secrets returned to the high quality god artifact that resembled an asteroid with the other experts.","“Fellow Warring, the Illusionary Ancestor is currently under the influence of a tribulation of decline, so her strength has fallen severely. As a result, I can only shamelessly ask you to take action and assist the Illusionary Ancestor in suppressing the Starflame Demon Lion.” The Master of Profound Secrets arrived before the Warring Old Freak and made his request.","The Warring Old Freak was a peak Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. Although he was still a step away from the Seventh Heavenly Layer, his battle prowess already paralleled the Seventh Heavenly Layer. He was the only expert present apart from the Illusionary Ancestor that could threaten the Starflame Demon Lion.","However, before the Warring Old Freak could say anything, Jian Chen stepped forward and took out the talisman that the Illusionary Ancestor had bestowed upon him. “Why don’t we use this talisman to deal with the Starflame Demon Lion?”","Jian Chen was basically all too tempted to use up the talisman. He was unable to find any peace keeping it on him.","The Jade Lotus Master, the Rushing Lightning Immortal Exalt, the Blood Butcher Immortal Exalt, and the Ancient Virtue Immortal Exalt were dazed. They were fixated on the talisman in Jian Chen’s hand as their eyes became filled with burning desire and greed, tempted to snatch it immediately.","“No, definitely not. The power of the talisman is equivalent to a strike from the Illusionary Ancestor’s primary body. With how powerful the Illusionary Ancestor is, it might end up killing the Starflame Demon Lion if you’re not careful. Even if it survives, once its organs are destroyed, the Starflame Demon Lion will still lose its value.” The Master of Profound Secrets shook his head. He was also filled with indescribable envy.","After a pause, the Master of Profound Secrets looked at the Warring Old Freak and said, “The Starflame Demon Lion is extremely important to the Illusionary Ancestor, as she needs to collect the essence of the five organs and the soul essence of the Starflame Demon Lion to refine the ancient pill. The ancient pill is prepared for the crown prince of the Waymight clan, so we can’t destroy the Starflame Demon Lion. Otherwise, finding a replacement in outer space won’t be that easy.”","The Warring Old Freak understood the importance of the matter. He said seriously, “As long as the Illusionary Ancestor requires me, I will give it my all.”","When he heard that, the Master of Profound Secrets completely eased up. With the Warring Old Freak’s entry, they still could not suppress the Starflame Demon Lion as easily as before. However, they could successfully pin it down and give them the opportunity to collect the essence of the five organs at the very least. RÂꞐoВΕṦ","The Warring Old Freak turned towards Jian Chen and said, “I’m going to work with the Illusionary Ancestor to suppress the Starflame Demon Lion. You only have to protect yourself now. Don’t be injured by the shockwaves of the battle.”","Jian Chen knew that the Warring Old Freak was hinting that he did not have to participate. He nodded understandingly.","“This god artifact of mine might not be able to withstand a few blows from senior Warring, but it’s still a high quality god artifact. It’ll be able to withstand the shockwaves of the battle if it’s a little further away. If you don’t mind, fellow Yang Yutian, you can stay here for the time being.” The Master of Profound Secrets smiled. Due to the Illusionary Ancestor, he treated Jian Chen extremely politely.","Very soon, only Jian Chen remained in the spatial god artifact. The Warring Old Freak, the Master of Profound Secrets, and the four Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts had already gone outside.","The high quality god artifact drifted away from the battlefield. Jian Chen stood inside the god artifact and gazed into the distance, watching the battle in outer space closely.","By now, the Warring Old Freak had already entered the battle. His body swelled, turning into a thirty thousand metre tall giant that stood in the sea of stars. He gave off extremely great vitality, shining with endless light like a sun.","A set of gloves forged from scales had already covered his huge fists, radiating with the presence of high quality god artifacts. As he swung his fists, they erupted with a brutal force, crushing the space and smashing viciously into the Starflame Demon Lion.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The Warring Old Freak’s attacks were like a furious storm, raining down on the Starflame Demon Lion fist after fist. Each punch produced a deep boom, rupturing its body with terrifying force. It was even possible to make out the clear cracking of bones.","The Illusionary Ancestor hovered above the Starflame Demon Lion’s head. Dense chains danced behind her, weaving into a huge net that quickly extended towards the Starflame Demon Lion.","Very soon, the Illusionary Ancestor used the chains condensed from the power of laws to tie up the Starflame Demon Lion again.","The Starflame Demon Lion produced constant furious roars. It struggled desperately, and the chains showed signs of snapping.","Seeing this, the Warring Old Freak leapt behind the Starflame Demon Lion. His figure that stood thirty thousand metres tall still seemed slightly small compared to the Starflame Demon Lion. With a bellow, he erupted with surging energy. His fingers wove together to form a single hammerfist that he smashed down heavily on the Starflame Demon Lion’s head with devastating force.","Boom! Flesh and blood exploded where the Warring Old Freak’s fist landed. Its skull cracked rapidly.","The Starflame Demon Lion winced in pain and let out a growl. It swayed from the attack, struggling to gather the strength to shake off the restraints.","Under the combined efforts of the Illusionary Ancestor and the Warring Old Freak, the Starflame Demon Lion was finally placed under control. The Master of Profound Secrets also grasped the timing with the four experts, arriving near the Starflame Demon Lion’s liver again. Under the assistance of the Warring Old Freak, he pierced the Starflame Demon Lion’s defences and began to repeat the process, using the cauldron to absorb the essence of the five organs.","“Faster. We can’t keep it suppressed for too long,” the Warring Old Freak said sternly. After saying that, he retreated in a hurry, arriving near the Starflame Demon Lion and swinging his fists. He unleashed a furious barrage of attacks, preventing the Starflame Demon Lion from dealing with anything else.","It had to be mentioned that the Starflame Demon Lion truly possessed very great endurance. Even the Warring Old Freak’s strength that rivalled the Seventh Heavenly Layer could not kill it, only injuring it at most.","On top of this, these wounds did not last long at all. They constantly healed.","As a space beast, the Starflame Demon Lion lacked intelligence. It struggled to develop anything more than instincts, but certain other aspects had instead been magnified.","“We have enough essence of the liver. Let’s go to the next place.” A while later, the Master of Profound Secrets stowed the cauldron away and proceeded to the spleen with the Jade Lotus Master, the Rushing Lightning Immortal Exalt, the Blood Butcher Immortal Exalt, and the Ancient Virtue Immortal Exalt.","They moved in a hurry, clearly in great urgency. They knew they could not keep the Starflame Demon Lion suppressed for long even with the Warring Old Freak’s assistance after the Illusionary Ancestor had been impacted by the tribulation of decline. As a result, they seized every moment.","Just like that, under the efforts of the two experts, the Master of Profound Secrets proceeded to the Starflame Demon Lion’s heart, liver, spleen, lungs, and kidneys, collecting the essence of the five organs.","In the end, he arrived near the Starflame Demon Lion’s head with the four Immortal Exalts and said, “We already have enough essence of the five organs. Fellow Warring, we just need to collect the soul essence now. Please shatter its skull for us, fellow Warring. Remember to not harm its soul, or it will be very difficult to collect its complete soul essence.”"]},{"number":3823,"title":"Chapter 3823: On the Brink of Danger","paragraphs":["“Warring Old Freak, I owe you one for this.” The Illusionary Ancestor’s voice rang out from above. She was currently using everything to restrain the Starflame Demon Lion. She no longer had much strength left.","“It’s just a trifle. You don’t have to be so polite, Illusionary Ancestor.” The Warring Old Freak let out a laugh. He closed his hands in the air, and a spear appeared out of nowhere. Its tip glistened with sharp, cold light, targeting the Starflame Demon Lion’s head.","In the next moment, the spear erupted with blinding light. With a splatter of blood, it pierced the Starflame Demon Lion’s head mercilessly.","However, it became stuck when it had only penetrated half way. The Warring Old Freak’s attack had failed to pierce the head completely.","However, that was already sufficient for the Master of Profound Secrets. He immediately controlled the cauldron, absorbing the Starflame Demon Lion’s soul essence at full force under the assistance of the Jade Lotus Master, the Blood Butcher Immortal Exalt, the Rushing Lightning Immortal Exalt, and the Ancient Virtue Immortal Exalt.","By now, the Starflame Demon Lion had already become extremely feeble. With a major loss of its essence of the five organs, it seemed to lose a majority of its strength. Its colossal figure hovered in outer space feebly. It did not even have much strength left to break free from the Illusionary Ancestor’s restraints.","Its resistance also became even flimsier.","But despite that, its body was still very powerful.","Wisps of power of the soul drifted out from the wound on its head, translucent and glistening like gentle ribbons of light. They were entirely absorbed by the cauldron.","That was the Starflame Demon Lion’s soul essence. It was not some regular power of the soul but a concentrate of the power of the soul.","“This is the last part. As long as we collect enough soul essence, we’ll have gathered all the hard-to-find materials to refine the ancient pill.” Looking at the wisps of soul essence, the Master of Profound Secrets eased up. He felt like a great burden had been lifted from his shoulders.","After all, this was the mission that the second ancestor of the Waymight clan, the Illusionary Ancestor, had personally allocated to him. If he could not complete it, he truly could not answer back to the Illusionary Ancestor.","At this moment, as the soul essence was being collected, the Starflame Demon Lion seemed to be triggered by something. It began to struggle desperately.","The Illusionary Ancestor was stern; the laws rapidly manifested in her eyes. Her energy was being depleted at a terrifying rate.","She did everything that she could to maintain the chains, keeping the Starflame Demon Lion firmly suppressed.","The Warring Old Freak did not idle around either. His energy surged like a tsunami, striking out with full force. He struck the Starflame Demon Lion’s head again and again with his fists as if he was trying to knock out the space beast.","Under the Warring Old Freak’s vicious attacks, the Starflame Demon Lion became dazed, but the depleting soul essence ignited its fury deep within its bloodline. It began to resist fiercely under its instincts.","A powerful force slowly emerged from its body, merging with its flesh and allowing it to recover some strength.","“Not good! This animal is refining Tan Yu!” The Warring Old Freak’s expression changed when he saw this.","“Senior Warring, don’t tell me someone you’re familiar with has been devoured by the Starflame Demon Lion?” the Master of Profound Secrets said in surprise.","The Warring Old Freak nodded and said, “The person who was devoured is called Tan Yu. He’s an Immortal Exalt of the Hall Brilliance Heaven. I actually came here to save him.”","The Master of Profound Secrets sighed gently when he heard that. “Given the circumstances, it’ll probably be difficult to save him. Otherwise, it might lead to tremendous problems for the Illusionary Ancestor.”","The Warring Old Freak fell silent. He was filled with a sense of powerlessness.","He could tell that the ancient pill was extremely important to the Illusionary Ancestor. If rescuing Tan Yu would result in the failure of collecting the materials for it, the consequences would be beyond severe.","After all, the Illusionary Ancestor was not simply an Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. She was also the second greatest ancestor of the Waymight clan.","In this day and age, the influence of that identity alone surpassed the prestige of Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts.","“ The Starflame Demon Lion is clearly desperately trying to refine Tan Yu to replenish its strength. Looks like Tan Yu is truly beyond saving, ” The Warring Old Freak sighed inside. He understood the Starflame Demon Lion. He was aware that under these circumstances, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu could not last very long with his strength.","“Senior Warring, pry open the Starflame Demon Lion’s mouth. I’ll go in and save Immortal Exalt Tan Yu!” At this moment, Jian Chen flew over from afar. The space beneath his feet rippled. In just a few flashes, he covered the great distance and arrived before the Starflame Demon Lion.","Then he approached the Starflame Demon Lion’s mouth directly without slowing down, his eyes filled with determination.","Jian Chen’s action made the Warring Old Freak hesitate. On the other side, the Illusionary Ancestor’s expression changed drastically as she suppressed the Starflame Demon Lion with all of her might. She withdrew part of her strength without hesitation and swung her hand at Jian Chen from afar.","Immediately, the space in front of Jian Chen split open. A colossal spatial crack appeared. It was like a giant chasm, blocking him from reaching the Starflame Demon Lion.","“What are you doing? Is this a place where you should come to? With your measly cultivation, just the shockwaves of the battle can claim your life. Back off this instance.” The Illusionary Ancestor’s face was sunken as she yelled at Jian Chen from afar. There was undisguised fury in her voice.","It was as if Jian Chen’s suicidal actions had truly angered her.","“Senior Illusionary Ancestor, I am going to enter the Starflame Demon Lion’s body to rescue someone. I definitely won’t affect your collection of the soul essence,” Jian Chen said sternly. Afterwards, the Laws of Space circulated, and he seemed to merge into space. He actually made his way around the giant chasm produced by the Illusionary Ancestor, rushing directly towards the Starflame Demon Lion’s body.","But in the next moment, the Illusionary Ancestor suddenly appeared in front of Jian Chen. Her black clothes surged about as a terrifying presence pulsed in the space there like waves, bringing Jian Chen great pressure.","Looking at the Illusionary Ancestor before him, Jian Chen felt like a wall that connected the earth and the heavens stood before him. He felt like he could not traverse it no matter what.","It felt like as long as the Illusionary Ancestor refused to give way, he could not bypass her no matter what he tried.","“You will be very close to death once you enter the Starflame Demon Lion’s stomach. You might not even be able to return alive.” At that moment, the Illusionary Ancestor was no longer as amiable as she was in the god artifact. She stared at Jian Chen frostily, giving off paramount authority that could not be defied.","“Thank you for your concern, Illusionary Ancestor. I must enter to save him.” Jian Chen felt extremely pained. Only he knew that it was impossible for the Starflame Demon Lion to kill him, but he had some trump cards that he could not expose. However, under the Starflame Demon Lion’s desperate digestion, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu was already at the brink of death.","If he wasted even an extra moment, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu would be in more danger.","Time was extremely tight.","“Is this person very important to you?” The Illusionary Ancestor gradually eased up when she faced Jian Chen’s determined gaze.","Jian Chen was rather surprised, staring at the Illusionary Ancestor in bewilderment. With her great status, why did she suddenly care about these measly things?","“Senior Illusionary Ancestor, this seems to be of no significance to you.”","“That is true.” The Illusionary Ancestor’s gaze towards Jian Chen deepened. An indetectable hint of doubt flashed through the depths of her eyes.","At this moment, several of the chains that restrained the Starflame Demon Lion suddenly snapped. The Starflame Demon Lion struggled harder and harder, showing signs of breaking free from her restraints."]},{"number":3824,"title":"Chapter 3824: The Illusionary Ancestor’s Assistance","paragraphs":["Near its huge head, the expression of the Master of Profound Secrets changed in expression as well. Currently, he was still collecting the soul essence under the cooperation of the four experts.","The rate at which they collected the soul essence had slowed down all of a sudden.","“Illusionary Ancestor, the Starflame Demon Lion is about to lose control!” the Master of Profound Secrets yelled out.","On the other side, the Illusionary Ancestor who blocked Jian Chen furrowed her brows slightly. After a moment of hesitation, determination filled her eyes as she said to Jian Chen, “You’re too weak. Don’t endanger yourself. Since the trapped person is very important to you, I’ll help you rescue him.”","After saying that, the Illusionary Ancestor waved her hand at Jian Chen. Immediately, the power of ways surged out. He felt like he had been immobilised, forcefully taken away from the battlefield and sent back inside the Master of Profound Secrets’ high quality god artifact.","At this moment, the remaining chains on the Starflame Demon Lion began to snap. Its range of movement became greater and greater.","“Illusionary Ancestor, with me alone, I can only restrain the Starflame Demon Lion at most. I can’t keep it suppressed!” the Warring Old Freak said sternly. His battle prowess was very powerful, basically unmatched amongst his peers. He could challenge those of the Seventh Heavenly Layer, so the Starflame Demon Lion could not overpower him.","However, he could not overpower the Starflame Demon Lion either. He could only injure it at most.","Only now did the Illusionary Ancestor turn her attention away from Jian Chen. Her gaze focused on the Starflame Demon Lion that gradually recovered its freedom, but she did not do anything.","However, in the next moment, the Illusionary Ancestor’s presence swelled like a dormant volcano erupting. She exploded with startling might, actually rising from the Fifth Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt to the Sixth Heavenly Layer all of a sudden.","Afterwards, she went from the Sixth Heavenly Layer to the Seventh Heavenly Layer.","She continued to rise until she reached the peak of the Seventh Heavenly Layer, only a step away from the Eighth Heavenly Layer. Only then did it stop.","At this moment, the Illusionary Ancestor was like the eye of a storm. A terrifying storm of energy revolved around her. The surrounding space twisted and everything paled. Even the surrounding stars seemed to stop glowing.","Nearby, the Warring Old Freak who attacked the Starflame Demon Lion with all of his strength paused as well. He subconsciously looked back at the Illusionary Ancestor. Surprise filled his eyes.","He could delicately sense that the Illusionary Ancestor’s strength was even greater than before she experienced the tribulation of decline.","“Don’t tell me the Illusionary Ancestor’s tribulation of decline has already passed,” the Warring Old Freak murmured.","The Master of Profound Secrets, the Jade Lotus Master, the Rushing Lightning Immortal Exalt, the Blood Butcher Immortal Exalt, and the Ancient Virtue Immortal Exalt were all shaken up as well. At this moment, the pressure from the Illusionary Ancestor was far too powerful. Even Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts found it suffocating.","It was not just them. Even the Starflame Demon Lion became much quieter. Its colossal body trembled gently in the air as if it instinctively sensed fear.","The Illusionary Ancestor strode over from afar. With each step, the space beneath her feet would crack as if it could not withstand her current power.","“Master of Profound Secrets, do you have enough essence of the five organs?” The Illusionary Ancestor’s voice was filled with might and awe like a lofty king looking down on the world.","“I-Illusionary Ancestor, we already have enough essence of the organs. We only need soul essence now,” the Master of Profound Secrets said rather nervously.","“Earlier, in order to collect the essence of the five organs, we did not harm this animal’s body, but now, since we have enough essence of the five organs, we don’t need to keep its body around anymore,” the Illusionary Ancestor said coldly. She raised her hand slowly, and the space in front of her pulsed violently. Profound laws condensed before forming a blinding blade that illuminated the entire space.","In the next moment, the blinding blade slashed out, shattering space and disturbing the laws. It was like judgment from the world, immediately cutting through the Starflame Demon Lion’s colossal body.","The Starflame Demon Lion let out a shrill howl. The powerful body that it prided itself in was no different from a sheet of paper before the Illusionary Ancestor. It was directly split into two along its waist.","In the blink of an eye, the colossal Starflame Demon Lion had been bisected.","“ That strike already possesses the might of the Eighth Heavenly Layer. ” The Warring Old Freak’s mind shook.","The Master of Profound Secrets and the other experts standing near its colossal head were stunned as well.","A Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt Starflame Demon Lion had been cut in half like this by the Illusionary Ancestor.","The great strength that the Illusionary Ancestor currently demonstrated shocked them deeply.","“What are you waiting for? Collect the soul essence!” the Illusionary Ancestor called out with furrowed brows as she looked at the dazed experts there.","When they heard that, the Master of Profound Secrets and the others immediately dismissed their thoughts and suppressed their internal shock, continuing to absorb the Starflame Demon Lion’s soul essence with their full strength.","However, the heavy injury clearly had a great impact on the Starflame Demon Lion’s resistance. The Master of Profound Secrets could sense that the absorption rate had increased significantly.","The Illusionary Ancestor did not pay any more attention to them. She arrived near the lower half of the Starflame Demon Lion with a step and extended a finger at the space there. The laws were like an arrow, instantly piercing a part of the abdomen.","Boom!","An explosion rang out from the lower half of the Starflame Demon Lion’s body and surging energy spilled out from there. Space fragmented in large chunks.","It felt like the Starflame Demon Lion’s body contained a world; this world had been completely destroyed by the Illusionary Ancestor’s finger.","At this moment, a blinding streak of light erupted from the world inside the body, fleeing from there like a bolt of lightning.","In the end, the streak of light stopped in the distance. Through the light, it was possible to make out a figure hidden inside.","He was the city lord of the Immortal Rising City, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu!","At this moment, the light around Immortal Exalt Tan Yu seemed blinding, but in reality, his face was already pale. He gave off a deep sense of exhaustion and feebleness.","He had not perished, but a large amount of his energy had been depleted, most of it devoured by the Starflame Demon Lion.","If a few more hours had passed and Immortal Exalt Tan Yu had run out of energy, he would have been doomed.","The Illusionary Ancestor looked at Immortal Exalt Tan Yu and said to herself, “You’re the only person inside. Looks like you’re the one who needed to be saved.”","Under the Illusionary Ancestor’s gaze, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu felt a tremendous pressure surge in from all directions, which made his heart lurch. His breath came to a halt.","“Junior Tan Yu thanks senior for saving my life!” Immortal Exalt Tan Yu immediately demonstrated respect, bowing towards the Illusionary Ancestor.","“Go there. The person who saved you is there.” The Illusionary Ancestor pointed at the asteroid in the distance.","The Master of Profound Secrets’ high quality god artifact was the only object in the nearby region of space, so Immortal Exalt Tan Yu discovered it immediately.","The Illusionary Ancestor’s words were like an edict to Immortal Exalt Tan Yu. He could not defy them. Even when he still had doubts about what she had said, he did not dare to ask about it.","As a result, after bowing and thanking her again, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu immediately followed the Illusionary Ancestor’s instructions and made his way over to the high quality god artifact."]},{"number":3825,"title":"Chapter 3825: Annihilation","paragraphs":["During this time, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu recognised the Warring Old Freak. After all, he stood out far too much with his colossal figure. However, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu could not approach him because the Warring Old Freak was busy suppressing the upper half of the Starflame Demon Lion’s body.","“ I never thought senior Warring would actually be here as well. Looks like they’ve come specially to kill the Starflame Demon Lion. ”","“ Even with senior Warring’s supreme strength at the Sixth Heavenly Layer, he can only barely suppress the upper half of the Starflame Demon Lion’s body, so who cut the Starflame Demon Lion in half? ” Immortal Exalt Tan Yu subconsciously looked back at the Illusionary Ancestor. His heart began to thump uncontrollably, filled with a deep sense of reverence.","He was unable to sense the Illusionary Ancestor’s strength, but he knew that even Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts would need to expend tremendous effort to slay the Starflame Demon Lion before him. Meanwhile, he could clearly tell that the clean face of the cut had been the result of a single stroke.","“ Don’t tell me it’s this female senior? ” Immortal Exalt Tan Yu felt both shock and dread. Just how terrifying was her strength to be able to cut the Starflame Demon Lion in a single strike?","Very soon, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu arrived before the high quality god artifact that blended in as an asteroid. He found the open entrance. After slightly hesitating, he stepped inside decisively.","“Fellow Yang Yutian, why is it you?” As soon as he entered the god artifact, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu was taken aback. He subconsciously recalled what the Illusionary Ancestor had said and became filled with mixed emotions.","In the air, the two severed halves of the Starflame Demon Lion rapidly approached one another, wanting to join back together. With its powerful body and startling recovery, the Illusionary Ancestor’s strike was not fatal. As long as its consciousness and body remained, it could revive even if it was sliced to a thousand bits.","However, the Illusionary Ancestor clearly did not plan on letting the Starflame Demon Lion reassemble its body. She surged with pressure, and a powerful storm of energy raged like tidal waves. The laws manifested around her, condensing into another blinding blade that slashed towards the Starflame Demon Lion.","After several attacks from the Illusionary Ancestor, the bottom half of the Starflame Demon Lion had been sliced into over a dozen pieces. Each piece was relatively far away from one another, preventing them from joining back together.","At this moment, a powerful pulse of energy suddenly appeared from one of the pieces. Shortly afterwards, surging essence dispersed from the pieces scattered through outer space, all pouring into that specific piece like rivers flowing into an ocean.","As the essence vanished, those pieces of the Starflame Demon Lion’s extremely tough body immediately lost all signs of life and vitality. They withered away.","At this moment, all of the vitality and life force in the bottom half of the Starflame Demon Lion’s body began to condense together, forming a fist-sized inner core inside the piece of flesh.","In the next moment, the inner core broke out of the flesh, turning into a streak of red light that shot towards the Starflame Demon Lion.","The Starflame Demon Lion opened its mouth and faced the inner core, planning on swallowing it.","It was trying to recover the energy in the bottom half of its body through this method.","However, right when the inner core was about to reach its mouth, a gentle hand extended out from the space there, catching the inner core lightly.","Immediately, the inner core came to a halt, having been forcefully trapped in the hand by a startling power. It was unable to break free.","The Illusionary Ancestor slowly appeared. She gripped the fist-sized inner core in her hand. She was surprised.","“An inner core condensed by a space beast’s energy, life force, and vitality. This is rare,” the Illusionary Ancestor murmured softly. Afterwards, she struck out with her hand, landing a blow on the Starflame Demon Lion’s head with terrifying force. R","With that, the Starflame Demon Lion directly began seeing stars before giving up on all resistance and falling unconscious.","The Master of Profound Secrets’ process of absorbing the soul essence immediately became extremely smooth. The speed skyrocketed. Pure soul essence turned into an illusionary white beam, sucked into the cauldron like it was a bottomless pit.","In under a minute, the Starflame Demon Lion had been drained of soul essence, without a single drop remaining.","That did not mean the Starflame Demon Lion was dead. Soul essence was a kind of energy condensed from the power of the soul. Without soul essence, the Starflame Demon Lion could still survive, but the power of its soul would become much weaker.","“It’s enough. We’ve already gathered enough essence of the five organs and soul essence to refine the ancient pill.” The Master of Profound Secrets stowed the pill cauldron away in relief.","The four Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts that assisted him in gathering the essence of the five organs all let out sighs of relief as well.","“Since you’ve already gathered everything that the Illusionary Ancestor requires, we should completely kill this Starflame Demon Lion here. It will only serve as a source of trouble if left alive, threatening the weaker Immortal Exalts of our Immortals’ World,” said the Warring Old Freak. He immediately stopped holding back. The high quality god artifact gloves on his hands erupted with blinding light as he smashed the Starflame Demon Lion’s head with full force.","Bang! The Warring Old Freak’s punch destroyed a tenth of its head. Much of its flesh vanished.","Both the Starflame Demon Lion’s toughness and recovery was no longer as great as before.","“With your speed, killing it would still take some time. Let me do it instead,” the Illusionary Ancestor said. She opened her hand, and a fist-sized bronze cauldron appeared out of nowhere.","In the next moment, the cauldron rapidly swelled, growing to the size of a planet. It radiated with the might of a powerful high quality god artifact.","When the Master of Profound Secrets saw the cauldron, his eyes were filled with undisguised envy. The quality of the pill cauldron was extremely high, having reached the peak of high quality god artifacts. It only needed one more step to evolve into a sovereign god artifact.","“ The Illusionary Ancestor is not skilled in the Way of Alchemy, yet she possesses such a high quality cauldron. How envious. ” The Master of Profound Secrets gulped. Even with his strength as a Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, his desires burned when he saw the Illusionary Ancestor’s cauldron.","At this moment, the cauldron’s lid opened, and an extremely vicious flame of alchemy poured out. It created a sea of fire that could incinerate space, covering the Starflame Demon Lion’s body.","Under the roaring flames, the Starflame Demon Lion’s body dissolved at a visible rate. The energy, vitality, and so on in its body dissipated into the surroundings. Eventually, it turned into something like nutrients, nourishing the surging flames that emerged from the cauldron.","The flames of the cauldron burned even brighter. It seemed like it was rapidly growing stronger.","The Starflame Demon Lion awakened from its slumber. It began to struggle and roar instinctively, but it was unable to rush out of the vicinity of the flames even with its full strength.","The Illusionary Ancestor was far too powerful. Earlier, she mostly focused on restraining and suppressing the Starflame Demon Lion to gather its essence of the five organs and soul essence. She did not think about harming it.","Now that she had already gathered everything that she needed, the Illusionary Ancestor’s killing intent stirred. The Starflame Demon Lion immediately became like a lamb to a slaughterhouse. It was completely feeble.","Very soon, under the extremely vicious flames, the Starflame Demon Lion was completely reduced to ashes. All of its body had vanished. It could not be any more dead.","Its strength, vitality, and the inner core condensed from the lower half of its body all ended up in the Illusionary Ancestor’s hands.","The upper half had been entirely absorbed by the alchemy flames.","Even if the Starflame Demon Lion possessed an undying body, there were no chances of being reborn after suffering a fate like this.","The alchemy flames seemed alive. They suddenly swept back into the cauldron. The lid was closed, and the cauldron shrank back to the size of a fist, returning to the Illusionary Ancestor’s hand."]},{"number":3826,"title":"Chapter 3826: The Illusionary Ancestor’s Gift","paragraphs":["After stowing away the cauldron, the Illusionary Ancestor’s surging presence immediately receded like the tide, instantly falling back down to the Fifth Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt.","Her face turned pale and seemed far more haggard than before. In the next moment, her presence fell once again, only stopping when it reached the Fourth Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt.","“Illusionary Ancestor, d-didn’t your tribulation of decline pass already? W-why is this happening?” The Master of Profound Secrets arrived before the Illusionary Ancestor with the four experts. Looking at the Illusionary Ancestor whose strength had plummeted severely, his elderly face was filled with surprise.","The Illusionary Ancestor’s tribulation of decline seemed even more severe than before.","“The tribulation of decline doesn’t just pass that easily. I used a forbidden technique, which temporarily suppressed the impact of the tribulation of decline, allowing me to recover my peak strength momentarily,” the Illusionary Ancestor said easily.","However, everyone present understood that the Illusionary Ancestor must have paid a certain price.","“You didn’t have to do this, Illusionary Ancestor. With fellow Warring’s assistance, even if you were impacted by the tribulation of decline, it still wouldn’t have affected us collecting the Starflame Demon Lion’s soul essence,” the Master of Profound Secrets said in perplexion. Who was the Illusionary Ancestor? A mere Starflame Demon Lion did not possess the right for the Illusionary Ancestor to pay such a price.","The Warring Old Freak stowed his gloves away. His colossal figure returned to normal as he withdrew his presence. He hovered in the nearby space in silence.","He could vaguely guess why the Illusionary Ancestor had used the forbidden technique despite the price, but it only left the Warring Old Freak even more confused.","The Illusionary Ancestor did not give an explanation. She turned her attention towards the inner core in her hand. The inner core was equivalent to the concentrated power of the lower half of the Starflame Demon Lion’s body. It contained extremely terrifying energy. In the Immortals’ World, it was a priceless item.","The Master of Profound Secrets clearly noticed the inner core, and his eyes lit up. Immortal Exalt space beasts had always been rare, while the chances that they could condense their energy into an inner core were almost negligible.","“Illusionary Ancestor, if you give the inner core to me, I’d definitely be able to refine a cauldron of Divine Pills of Way Accumulation.” The Master of Profound Secrets’ voice sounded rather urgent. The materials for Divine Pills of Way Accumulation were extremely difficult to find. He already possessed all the supplementary materials. All he lacked was the main ingredient.","The inner core was the perfect main ingredient.","Even among high quality God Tier pills, Divine Pills of Way Accumulation ranked towards the top. They were tremendously beneficial to Immortal Exalts and were extremely difficult to refine. In the entire Immortals’ World, there were no more than ten people that could refine Divine Pills of Way Accumulation.","When she heard him mention the Divine Pill of Way Accumulation, the Illusionary Ancestor also became rather interested.","At this moment, Jian Chen and Immortal Exalt Tan Yu strode over from afar. They both thanked the Illusionary Ancestor.","When she saw Jian Chen, the Illusionary Ancestor’s eyes lit up. Casually, she tossed the inner core over to Jian Chen. She smiled and said, “This thing is useless to me, so I’ll give it to you.”","Looking at the inner core hovering before his eyes, Jian Chen became dazed. He could tell from the terrifying energy in the inner core just how precious it was, yet the Illusionary Ancestor had given it to him like this for free? ŕA","She had given him a talisman. Now, she was giving him a precious inner core. The Illusionary Ancestor’s friendliness left Jian Chen puzzled.","The Master of Profound Secrets panicked and said, “Illusionary, this inner core is crucial to...”","“Do you have any objections?” However, before the Master of Profound Secrets could finish what he was saying, the Illusionary Ancestor looked at him coldly.","“H-how could I have any objections. You must be joking, Illusionary Ancestor.” The Master of Profound Secrets’ heart suddenly tightened as he smiled apologetically. Despite the fact that the Illusionary Ancestor’s strength had already dropped to the Fourth Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt due to the tribulation of decline, the Master of Profound Secrets still did not dared to disrespect her.","“What are you waiting for?” The Illusionary Ancestor turned her attention away from the Master of Profound Secrets and shot a glance towards Jian Chen.","From his experiences with the talisman, Jian Chen knew he could not turn down the Illusionary Ancestor’s gift. With no other choice, he could only thank her before accepting the inner core with strange feelings.","The Master of Profound Secrets felt pity. He opened his mouth, wanting to negotiate with Jian Chen so that he could refine the inner core in his possession into a cauldron of Divine Pills of Way Accumulation. However, after considering the Illusionary Ancestor beside him, the Master of Profound Secrets could only hold in this urge.","“ Who exactly is this person who lied to the Illusionary Ancestor about their identity? Why does the Illusionary Ancestor treat him like this? But this doesn’t make sense. The Illusionary Ancestor doesn’t seem to know his true identity either. ” The Master of Profound Secrets looked towards Jian Chen with deep curiosity.","The Jade Lotus Master, the Rushing Lightning Immortal Exalt, the Blood Butcher Immortal Exalt, and the Ancient Virtue Immortal Exalt standing behind the Master of Profound Secrets also looked at Jian Chen in a strange light.","Jian Chen noticed the Master of Profound Secrets’ gaze that burned with pity and regret. He suddenly thought of something and said, “Master of Profound Secrets, you seem to want this inner core very much.”","When she heard that, the Illusionary Ancestor glanced at the Master of Profound Secrets. A glint of cold light flashed through her eyes. She did not make any attempts to hide her threats.","The Master of Profound Secrets shivered inside and immediately smiled wryly. “You must be joking, my friend. Even if I were a hundred times bolder, I’d never desire something that the Illusionary Ancestor gave to you. I just thought that if I used this inner core as the main ingredient for refining Divine Pills of Way Accumulation, coupled with some supplementary materials, the quality of the pills will definitely be exceptional. This will also maximise the value of this inner core.”","“I will visit the Jade’s End Heaven in the future. By then, perhaps I can consider giving the inner core to the master so that the master can refine the pill you mentioned.” Jian Chen smiled gently.","When she heard Jian Chen’s words, the Illusionary Ancestor furrowed her brows slightly. She could delicately sense a vibe that was different from Jian Chen’s polite words.","“ This kid has murderous intent towards the Master of Profound Secrets? ” The Illusionary Ancestor was extremely surprised.","However, the Master of Profound Secrets failed to sense this. Instead, he smiled from ear to ear and said eagerly, “Then I’ll await your visit on the Azure Light mountain on the Jade’s End Heaven. Moreover, I’ll make this promise in front of the Illusionary Ancestor. If I manage to refine the Divine Pills of Way Accumulation successfully, sixty percent of them will go to you.”","“Of course, I will personally provide the supplementary materials required for the Divine Pills of Way Accumulation!”","“If the refinement of the Divine Pills of Way Accumulation ends in failure, I will give you other items of value as compensation.”","The four other experts were left clicking their tongues when they heard the Master of Profound Secrets’ offer.","That was because all pills had a certain failure rate. There were far too many factors at play, which could not all be controlled.","As a result, there was a rule within the alchemy profession. If the refinement failed, the alchemist did not have to pay any compensation.","As a result, all cultivators who sought alchemists to refine God Tier pills would not only find alchemy masters that they trusted, but they would also often prepare several sets of materials to refine a single kind of God Tier pill.","Yet right now, the Master of Profound Secrets had instead offered to compensate for any losses, which was unheard of.","“Then I prematurely thank you, Master of Profound Secrets.” Jian Chen clasped his fist towards him.","The Master of Profound Secrets smiled even more brightly. He still did not know Jian Chen’s true identity and origins, but none of that was important anymore. After all, the Illusionary Ancestor’s attitude towards him was worth the most.","“This is my keepsake. If you come to the Azure Light mountain on the Jade’s End Heaven in the future, you only need to show this keepsake to move around unobstructed.” In the end, the Master of Profound Secrets took out a delicately-crafted tablet and passed it to Jian Chen.","The four Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts who were familiar with the Master of Profound Secrets immediately recognised that the Master of Profound Secrets’ tablet was of the highest level.","Obtaining a tablet like that from the Master of Profound Secrets was no easy feat.","Jian Chen did not decline it. He smiled as he accepted the tablet that the Master of Profound Secrets passed over."]},{"number":3827,"title":"Chapter 3827: Discarded","paragraphs":["“City lord Tan Yu, it’s not just senior Illusionary Ancestor that you have to thank this time. You also need to thank senior Warring. After all, senior Warring came here specially to rescue you,” Jian Chen said to Immortal Exalt Tan Yu.","Immortal Exalt Tan Yu was calm. He quickly bowed and thanked senior Warring. His face was filled with the gratitude of being saved.","“No need to thank me. Although I came here because of you, I didn’t do anything in the process of rescuing you. The person you should thank the most is Yang Yutian. If he had not stood forward at the critical moment, you probably would not have been able to avoid death,” the Warring Old Freak said directly. He was well aware that they were originally planning to give up on Immortal Exalt Tan Yu. After all, they had to gather the soul essence and could not spare the effort to save him. Otherwise, it could have very easily ruined the entire operation.","If the Illusionary Ancestor had not changed her mind because of Jian Chen, using a forbidden technique to temporarily recover her peak strength, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu would have never been saved.","Immortal Exalt Tan Yu was secretly startled. He subconsciously looked towards Jian Chen who stood on the side.","“City lord Tan Yu, there’s no need to be so polite between us,” Jian Chen said with a smile before he could say anything.","Afterwards, Jian Chen bade farewell to the Warring Old Freak and the Illusionary Ancestor, leaving with the feeble Immortal Exalt Tan Yu.","Watching Jian Chen leave, a strange light flickered through the Illusionary Ancestor’s eyes. She dazedly stared in the direction that Jian Chen had vanished.","The Warring Old Freak silently observed the Illusionary Ancestor’s expression on the side as he sank into his thoughts.","By now, Jian Chen and Immortal Exalt Tan Yu had already departed from the region of space where the Starflame Demon Lion had perished completely. They hurried through the sea of stars at an extremely great speed.","“Fellow Yang Yutian, where are we headed? This doesn’t seem to be the direction of the Conquering Judgement Heaven.” Immortal Exalt Tan Yu looked at Jian Chen in confusion.","From beginning to end, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu had never underestimated Jian Chen. He knew he was a powerful figure with the ability to deal with a Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt like the Space-purging Ancestor.","In particular, ever since the Illusionary Ancestor killed the Starflame Demon Lion, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu became even more unwilling to underestimate Jian Chen. At this moment, he even showed the tendency of following Jian Chen’s lead.","“Oh right, fellow Yang Yutian, who was that Illusionary Ancestor just now? Her strength makes the bottom of my heart tremble,” Immortal Exalt Tan Yu continued to ask. He was very curious about her identity.","“The Illusionary Ancestor is no regular expert. She’s the second ancestor of the Waymight clan. She has already reached the peak of the Eighth Heavenly Layer, only a step away from the Ninth Heavenly Layer,” Jian Chen said with deep emotion.","“What? The second ancestor of the Waymight clan?” Immortal Exalt Tan Yu was deeply shocked, not by how powerful the Illusionary Ancestor was, but because her origins were far too impressive.","After all, the Waymight clan was well and truly a Grand Exalt’s clan. They had already surpassed the other courts of heaven.","It went without saying just how extraordinary her status was as the second ancestor of a Grand Exalt’s clan.","“City lord Tan Yu, I must trouble you momentarily. Please enter this divine hall for a moment.” At this moment, Jian Chen suddenly stopped and took out a medium quality divine hall.","Immortal Exalt Tan Yu was doubtful, but he realised that Jian Chen was doing this for a particular reason when he saw his seriousness. As such, he stopped hesitating and entered the medium quality god artifact divine hall decisively.","Ever since he survived the encounter with the Starflame Demon Lion, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu completely trusted Jian Chen. He completely set aside all of his vigilance towards him.","With his life saved twice by him, what could he not let go of for him?","Jian Chen stowed away the medium quality god artifact divine hall before pushing the Laws of Space to the limit. He rushed through the vast outer space aimlessly like a headless fly.","After he crossed who knew how many galaxies, Jian Chen suddenly stopped, perhaps because he felt like he was far away enough. With a flip of his hand, a talisman appeared.","The talisman had been given to him by the Illusionary Ancestor, possessing the power of a strike of her primary body. Once activated, even someone as powerful as the Warring Old Freak would not be able to withstand it. Even if they scraped by, they would be left half dead.","However, Jian Chen did not have any interest in keeping such a precious talisman. He threw it away without hesitation before teleporting away with the Laws of Space. He did not even look back at it.","After teleporting, Jian Chen used the mask from the Illusionary Daemon race to erase his presence while activating the Divine Armour of Heavenflight. He turned completely invisible, vanishing from the world without any trace or presence remaining.","Just like that, he maintained the absolute concealment of the mask from the Illusionary Daemon race and the Divine Armour of Heavenflight as he travelled towards the Conquering Judgement Heaven.","Meanwhile, the talisman he discarded hovered in outer space, radiating with energy and pressure.","Around a minute later, a figure in black appeared near the talisman. It was the second ancestor of the Waymight clan, the Illusionary Ancestor!","Looking at the talisman floating in outer space that had clearly been discarded, the Illusionary Ancestor was stunned at first before slowly becoming angry. Her anger intensified. She seemed extremely mad.","There was no killing intent. There was no seething rage. She just seemed very angry.","“This kid actually discarded the thing I gave him. Don’t tell me he doesn’t realise just how precious this talisman is? In the Immortals’ World, even if most Immortal Exalts kneel down and beg, they can’t obtain a copy, yet he’s just discarded it like this?”","The Illusionary Ancestor stowed the talisman away with a sunken face. Her anger did not dissipate. She swept through the surrounding space. A peering light flickered in her eyes. She merged with the world and resonated with the ways as if she wanted to find Jian Chen’s traces with her great cultivation.","However, her efforts resulted in nothing.","“He sure hid well. I didn’t realise that this kid was even capable of something like this. He can actually even reach the level of fooling me.” The anger in the Illusionary Ancestor’s eyes slowly vanished as she calmed down. She murmured, “Don’t tell me he knows there’s my soul imprint in the talisman, which is why he’s afraid to keep it?”","The Illusionary Ancestor’s expression changed before she looked at the vast sea of stars. She sighed gently and said to herself, “Though, I’m more curious about exactly who you are. Why do you give me a very strange feeling whenever I see you?”","“In particular, when you were eager to rescue that person, throwing yourself into the mouth of the Starflame Demon Lion without any regard for your personal safety, I actually felt worried at that moment...”","“Yang Yutian, looks like I need to properly investigate you...”","As the Illusionary Ancestor murmured to herself, she suddenly looked in the direction of the Hall Brilliance Heaven. In the next moment, she suddenly vanished.","In the vast sea of stars, the Warring Old Freak dressed in his simple, coarse clothes strode through the air, making his way back to the Hall Brilliance Heaven.","He did not use his full strength, instead making his way back by strolling. As a result, he was much slower than when he came.","“ Why does the Illusionary Ancestor treat him so differently? Just what aspect of this kid makes him unique? ” On the way back, the Warring Old Freak constantly recalled how differently the Illusionary Ancestor had treated him. He was very puzzled.","Suddenly, the Warring Old Freak stopped and stared ahead in complete surprise.","The Illusionary Ancestor stood silently in front of him, blocking the Warring Old Freak’s path."]},{"number":3828,"title":"Chapter 3828: Investigation","paragraphs":["“Greetings, Illusionary Ancestor!” After a moment of surprise, the Warring Old Freak clasped his fist.","“I want to know everything about him.” The Illusionary Ancestor’s voice was slightly cold. As she spoke, it was filled with undefiable authority.","“Illusionary Ancestor, I really don’t know too much about Yang Yutian. I’m not as close with him as you may imagine,” said the Warring Old Freak.","“If you’re not close with him, why does it seem like you care quite a bit about him?” the Illusionary Ancestor said coldly.","The Warring Old freak smiled wryly and said, “That’s because he exposed the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment for forging Fiend Soul Banners on the Hall Brilliance Heaven. He helped out our War sect tremendously. He basically helped out our Hall Brilliance Heaven as well, so both our War sect and the Hall Brilliance Heaven technically owe him a very big favour.”","“As for Yang Yutian’s identities and origins, I’m in the dark as well. I only know that he possesses a very powerful trump card, which previously killed a Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt on the Hall Brilliance Heaven.”","The Warring Old Freak was spouting blind lies. With his cultivation, he did not have to worry about the Illusionary Ancestor seeing through his lies. However, he only kept Jian Chen’s identity a secret. He confessed everything else, including some of the deeds Jian Chen had committed on the Hall Brilliance Heaven.","It was impossible to hide some of these things after all.","“That’s all I know about Yang Yutian. However, Yang Yutian did stay in the Immortal Rising City for a period of time on the Hall Brilliance Heaven, and I didn’t really pay attention to the Immortal Rising City,” said the Warring Old Freak.","“The Hall Brilliance Heaven, is it?” The Illusionary Ancestor murmured before vanishing.","After the Illusionary Ancestor departed, the Warring Old Freak remained stationary. He gradually became stern and thought, “ From the looks of things, the Illusionary Ancestor is going to personally investigate Yang Yutian’s matters on the Hall Brilliance Heaven? I just wonder if he can keep his identity as the sect master of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens hidden. ”","The Warring Old Freak was concerned, but it soon turned into a gentle sigh. Regardless of the outcome, he could not interfere with this matter.","As Jian Chen sped through outer space under the disguises of the mask from the Illusionary Daemon race and the Divine Armour of Heavenflight, the Illusionary Ancestor had already arrived on the Hall Brilliance Heaven silently, appearing in the Immortal Rising City.","At this moment, she hovered in the air. Beneath her feet were the bustling streets, flowing with people. Despite countless cultivators shuffling about beneath her, no one sensed her existence.","Even those who glanced past the Illusionary Ancestor’s position failed to notice her.","“He seems to have stayed here for the longest on the Hall Brilliance Heaven, so I’ll start here,” the Illusionary Ancestor murmured.","She scanned the city before settling on the city lord’s estate. In the next moment, she suddenly vanished.","At this moment, in the main hall of the city lord’s estate, the two vice city lords, Qiu Wanqian and He Luo, were discussing some important matters. Ever since Immortal Exalt Tan Yu’s departure, all of the matters, whether large or small, fell on their shoulders.","However, as vice city lords, there were very few matters that they had to attend to personally. They basically left it all to their subordinates. They only had to handle the decision making when it came to some important matters.","“Are the two of you entirely in charge of the city?” At this moment, they suddenly heard a voice, which made Qiu Wanqian and He Luo leap in fright.","They subconsciously looked over and saw a middle-aged woman in black clothes. Currently, she sat on the throne that only belonged to the city lord. Her presence was entirely erased, so it was impossible to tell her strength. However, she gave off a lofty sense of authority. Under her gaze, Qiu Wanqian and He Luo could not help but lower their heads, afraid to meet her eyes.","“We are the vice city lords of the Immortal Rising City. As the city lord is currently gone, we are indeed the highest authority in this city right now,” Qiu Wanqian clasped his fist and said.","As they faced the woman in black, they did not even have the courage to raise their heads. They realised that the woman must have been an Immortal Exalt of extremely terrifying strength. As a result, they did not dare to disrespect her.","“You should know about a person called Yang Yutian, right?” The Illusionary Ancestor sat on the city lord’s throne casually and stared at Qiu Wanqian and He Luo like she was studying them.","Qiu Wanqian and He Luo were startled. They exchanged glances. Qiu Wanqian answered, “Senior Yang Yutian showed great kindness to our Immortal Rising City. We obviously know of him.”","“Tell me everything you know about Yang Yutian,” the Illusionary Ancestor said demandingly.","“Senior, we don’t know much about senior Yang Yutian,” He Luo said carefully.","“Being able to serve the Illusionary Ancestor is your greatest honour. Remember, you must answer whatever questions the Illusionary Ancestor asks. Do not hide anything.” At this moment, an elderly voice rang out. In the next moment, an old man in coarse clothes appeared silently in the empty main hall. ꞦἈ","He was the Warring Old Freak!","Qiu Wanqian and He Luo recognised the old man, and they shuddered inside. They showed great respect, rushing forward to greet him.","After all, the person before them was the undisputed greatest expert of the Hall Brilliance Heaven, as well as the strongest ancestor of the greatest organisation on the Hall Brilliance Heaven, the War sect!","Both Qiu Wanqian and He Luo felt extremely uneasy when they faced the Warring Old Freak. They were afraid of disrespecting him in the slightest.","“You don’t need to be so polite with me. The Illusionary Ancestor is the one with the greatest status here,” the Warring Old Freak said to Qiu Wanqian and He Luo. He clasped his fist towards her.” Illusionary Ancestor, I possess some prestige on the Hall Brilliance Heaven, so why don’t I help you resolve some of the more miscellaneous affairs during the next few days? What do you think, Illusionary Ancestor?”","“That can work.” the Illusionary Ancestor nodded.","Qiu Wanqian and He Luo widened their eyes in shock. Who exactly was the woman in black? Even the greatest expert of the Hall Brilliance Heaven, the Warring Old Freak, demonstrated such modesty when facing her.","It had to be mentioned that the Warring Old Freak’s attitude towards the Illusionary Ancestor left Qiu Wanqian and He Luo extremely shocked. They immediately lost the courage to hide anything and confessed everything that they knew about Jian Chen without holding back.","After leaving the city lord’s estate, the Illusionary Ancestor visited the Merchant Union of Star Brilliance, Falling Cloud City, and the area of wilderness where Jian Chen killed had the Void-perceiving Ancestor and the Wukun Master.","In the end, accompanied by the Warring Old Freak, she went to the ancient mountain range where one of the three ancestors of the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment, the Space-purging Ancestor, had perished.","The bottomless pit remained there. It seemed like a mark on the land that silently recounted how an Immortal Exalt had perished here.","The Illusionary Ancestor stood on the edge of the pit as she studied and probed the surroundings.","Very soon, she seemed to find something. She furrowed her brows, and her eyes gradually became filled with surprise.","“Illusionary Ancestor, have you discovered something?” the Warring Old Freak asked out of curiosity when he saw her expression changed.","He had once studied this place as well. In the end, he could only conclude that the huge pit was the product of a powerful formation."]},{"number":3829,"title":"Chapter 3829: An Answer","paragraphs":["The Illusionary Ancestor did not say anything. Instead, she closed her eyes and sensed closely. From the moment she shut her eyes, the Warring Old Freak could sense that the laws in the surroundings were flowing according to a certain pattern. This was a deeper usage of the laws of the world. Even the Warring Old Freak came nowhere close to her in terms of mastery.","Although the Illusionary Ancestor was affected by the tribulation of decline, leading to a plummet in strength, her comprehension of the laws was still there. Her understanding of the laws far surpassed Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts.","Several seconds later, the flowing ways in the surroundings suddenly settled down, and the Illusionary Ancestor’s eyes snapped open. She gazed deeply at the pit and said softly, “Sure enough, this is the presence of the Divine Formation of the Heavens. However, why would the Divine Formation of the Heavens appear here? After all, there are only a handful of ancient organisations who still possess the Divine Formation of the Heavens in the Immortals’ World, and they all treat it as sect treasures. They will only use it when they face life-threatening danger.”","“Who would use a formation like that against a mere Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt?”","The Illusionary Ancestor furrowed her brows deeply. As the second ancestor of the Waymight clan, she was very knowledgeable. She knew many major secrets of the world, so she understood exactly how stringent the conditions for obtaining a formation scroll of the Divine Formation of the Heavens from the Observance Heaven City were.","“What? The Divine Formation of the Heavens?” The Warring Old Freak was shocked as well when he heard the Illusionary Ancestor’s murmur. He was not unfamiliar with the supreme formation in the Observance Heaven City on the Reverent Observance Heaven.","This was a Grand Exalt’s formation of paramount might. Any expert who possessed some status in the Immortals’ World would know this supreme formation.","When the Warring Old Freak looked at the bottomless pit before him again, he struggled to remain calm.","He had noticed right from the beginning that this was due to an extremely powerful formation, but he never thought it would actually be the Divine Formation of the Heavens that was renowned throughout the Immortals’ World!","“Warring Old Freak, are you certain that this was all caused by Yang Yutian?” the Illusionary Ancestor asked sternly.","This time, the Warring Old Freak did not reply. Instead, he felt strangely shocked as well. After all, he had heard of the stringent conditions required to assemble the Divine Formation of the Heavens. It required fifty thousand Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals, five hundred Immortal Monarchs, fifty Immortal Emperors, and ten Immortal Exalts.","Apart from the Observance Heaven City, there was no other peak organisation in the Immortals’ World that could achieve such a line-up.","“This isn’t the complete Divine Formation of the Heavens. The limits of its power are equivalent to me at most. As a result, I believe this was done by my little friend Yang Yutian.” After a moment of silence, the Warring Old Freak replied sternly.","“In other words, there’s quite a lot of people hiding behind him. Otherwise, how could he assemble a supreme formation like the Divine Formation of the Heavens so easily?” The Illusionary Ancestor’s lips curled into a slight smile. Combining this with the information that she had purchased from the Merchant Union of Star Brilliance, that Jian Chen had purchased a vast amount of heavenly resources from them, she seemed to piece something together.","“However, with the important clue of the Divine Formation of the Heavens, finding his true identity isn’t as difficult as I imagined anymore. After all, the only way to obtain the Divine Formation of the Heavens is from the Observance Heaven City.”","“Illusionary Ancestor, why do you care so much about Yang Yutian?” the Warring Old Freak asked curiously.","“I want an answer. If I can’t get to the bottom of this, I’ll struggle to find peace,” said the Illusionary Ancestor. She basically knew everything that Jian Chen had done on the Hall Brilliance Heaven. She even knew that Jian Chen was making his way to the Skyscraping World.","However, she had no interest in visiting the Skyscraping World, as this would not be particularly helpful for her investigation of Jian Chen’s identity.","“An answer?” The Warring Old Freak was puzzled.","However, the Illusionary Ancestor did not care about how the Warring Old Freak felt. She tossed a tablet over to the Warring Old Freak and said indifferently, “Earlier when we dealt with the Starflame Demon Lion, I said I owed you a favour. Take this tablet. If you encounter any difficulties, come to the Waymight clan with the tablet and find me.”","The tablet hovered before the Warring Old Freak with a hint of power and presence. Meanwhile, the Illusionary Ancestor had already vanished, completely departing from the Hall Brilliance Heaven.","Gazing at the tablet before him, the Warring Old Freak’s eyes were filled with mixed feelings. He understood all too well just how precious the Illusionary Ancestor’s favour was. His War sect might have been the greatest organisation on the Hall Brilliance Heaven, but in the eyes of certain peak organisations with late Immortal Exalts, that was all the War sect was.","However, everything was different now that they possessed the tablet, as the seemingly-ordinary tablet possessed the great power to deter late Immortal Exalts.","“If it weren’t for this kid, even if I assisted the Illusionary Ancestor in suppressing the Starflame Demon Lion, I probably would have never gained a favour from the Illusionary Ancestor.” The Warring Old Freak sighed gently. Let alone someone like the Illusionary Ancestor, even he might not necessarily owe someone a favour over a trifle like this.","Favours from people like them did not come so cheaply.","“The Illusionary Ancestor is going to the Reverent Observance Heaven. I wonder how much information she can find. However, I am powerless over whatever happens next...”","......","...","On the Jade’s End Heaven, at the top of the Azure Light mountain, several streaks of light flew over from afar before turning into five figures that hovered in the air.","Out of the five of them, one was the master of the Azure Light mountain, the Master of Profound Secrets.","The four others were the Jade Lotus Master of Mount Penglai on the Jade’s End Heaven.","The Rushing Lightning Immortal Exalt of the Heaven’s Thunder Tower on the Numerous Layer Heaven.","The Blood Butcher Immortal Exalt of the Blood Immortal sect on the Ease Nurturing Heaven.","And the Ancient Virtue Immortal Exalt of the Immortal Courtyard of Four Sages on the Scholarly Attainment Heaven.","“Everyone, I will begin refining the pill immediately. This cauldron of ancient pills is a mission that the Illusionary Ancestor personally handed to me. It’s said that these pills are for Daowei Chengqing and will play an extremely important role in his breakthrough to Immortal Exalt. In order to ensure that nothing goes wrong, I must ask you to watch over me for a period of time.” The Master of Profound Secrets clasped his fist towards the four of them.","“Hahahaha, you’re too polite, fellow Profound Secrets. Being able to serve the crown prince is a great honour for us.” The Ancient Virtue Immortal Exalt of the Scholarly Attainment Heaven smiled gently. He seemed extremely willing.","The three other Immortal Exalts happily agreed without any objections. In the Immortals’ World, Daowei Chengqing was a living legend. Despite the fact that he had yet to become a supreme expert, his level of influence already surpassed certain older and reputed figures.","That was because Daowei Fatian became a Grand Exalt because of him.","The elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance also became a supreme expert renowned throughout the Immortals’ World because of him.","Even his three servants had their fates changed because of him, becoming existences that many experts in the Immortals’ World could only look up to.","Apart from that, who knew what other fortunes Daowei Chengqing had obtained from the Hole of Reincarnation.","As a result, many Immortal Exalts in the Immortals’ World treated Daowei Chengqing as a heaven-sent blessing. They tried everything that they could to establish a connection with him and earn an opportunity to rise up.","There was no one who did not want to become a second Fang Jing.","Even if they took it a step down, countless people racked their brains to become figures like Daowei Chengqing’s three servants.","In order to grasp greater power and rise to a higher realm, far, far too many people were willing to give up everything, forsaking their dignity without any regard.","Afterwards, the Master of Profound Secrets vanished into the peak of the Azure Light mountain, making the final preparations to refine the ancient pill.","The Jade Lotus Master, the Rushing Lightning Immortal Exalt, the Blood Butcher Immortal Exalt, and the Ancient Virtue Immortal Exalt scattered in the surroundings, watching over the north, south, east, and west to personally guard the Master of Profound Secrets."]},{"number":3830,"title":"Chapter 3830: Traversing Through Outer Space","paragraphs":["A huge piece of land hovered in the tremendous sea of stars. Billions of cultivators occupied this place.","This tremendous piece of land was one of the thirty-three heavens of the Immortals’ World, the Conquering Judgement Heaven!","At this moment, a figure appeared in a region of space extremely distant from the Conquering Judgement Heaven. He was clad in armour and not a single wisp of his presence leaked out. He blended in perfectly, so he was invisible to all physical senses and senses of the soul.","That was Jian Chen who had just arrived!","“City lord Tan Yu, we’ve already reached the Conquering Judgement Heaven. I’ll leave the navigation to you now.” Jian Chen called Immortal Exalt Tan Yu out from the divine hall. A medium quality god artifact divine hall could not contain an Immortal Exalt for long.","Immortal Exalt Tan Yu appeared before Jian Chen. His face was still pale; he seemed extremely feeble.","However, compared to when he first escaped from the Starflame Demon Lion’s body, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu had visibly recovered quite a bit.","“Brother Yutian, there will probably be a fierce struggle inside the Skyscraping World. My strength has yet to return to its peak condition, so I’ll probably struggle to obtain any benefits if I enter the Skyscraping World like this. As a result, I’ll have to trouble brother Yutian with the travelling. I need to use every moment to recover,” Immortal Exalt Tan Yu said to Jian Chen. Even the way he referred to Jian Chen changed.","Following that, with a flip of his hand, a ball of blinding light appeared out of nowhere, radiating with the heavy presence of the Ways of the Sword.","Up close, it was possible to make out a palm-sized jade plate inside like the page of a book.","“This is the Skyscraping Sword Scripture. There are a hundred and eight pages to the Skyscraping Sword Scripture. This is one of them.” Immortal Exalt Tan Yu handed the page over to Jian Chen without hesitation. “Brother Yutian, as long as you channel a wisp of the power of the ways into the Skyscraping Sword Scripture, you will be able to sense the precise location of the Skyscraping World.”","“However, it only works near the Conquering Judgement Heaven that is closest to the Skyscraping World. If you’re too far away, it will have no effect.”","After hearing that, Jian Chen tried channelling a wisp of laws into the Skyscraping Sword Scripture. In the next moment, the Skyscraping Sword Scripture in his hand became scorching hot. A profound feeling filled his mind, allowing Jian Chen to sense the rough location of the Skyscraping World immediately.","Afterwards, Jian Chen let Immortal Exalt Tan Yu back inside the medium quality divine hall to recover. He concealed his traces with the Divine Armour of Heavenflight and the mask from the Illusionary Daemon race, following the direction he sensed from the Skyscraping Sword Scripture before setting off with the Laws of Space.","For the next few days, Jian Chen travelled through outer space. From time to time, he would sense and use the Skyscraping Sword Scripture to adjust his direction.","Along the way, even Jian Chen had no idea how far he had travelled. In the end, he stopped in a region of deathly-silent space.","This area of space was empty. He was already nowhere close to any stars. Even the glow from the stars in the surroundings became very dim.","He had completely departed from the Conquering Judgement Heaven already!","“This is it. This is the place that the Skyscraping Sword Scripture has been pointing to.” Jian Chen hovered in outer space and studied the surroundings. There was absolutely nothing as far as the eye could see nor a single person in sight.","“I shouldn’t be the first one here. If this really is the final destination indicated by the Skyscraping Sword Scripture, there must have been people who arrived here before me,” Jian Chen murmured. With a flip of his hand, he took out the Skyscraping Sword Scripture.","The Skyscraping Sword Scripture in his hand was like a palm-sized leaf, radiating with blinding light and circulating with the dense power of the Laws of the Sword. It seemed to be unending as if it would never dissipate.","Jian Chen clutched the Skyscraping Sword Scripture. With a thought, wisps of the laws manifested from the surroundings before surging into the Skyscraping Sword Scripture under his control.","With the laws, the Skyscraping Sword Scripture’s light grew even brighter. A profound feeling filled Jian Chen’s mind.","This was a special type of sensing, which indicated the location of the Skyscraping Sword Scripture.","Through the feeling, Jian Chen became extremely certain that this was the location.","This time, Jian Chen did not interrupt the laws. Instead, he controlled the laws to continuously channel into the Skyscraping Sword Scripture, making it absorb more and more laws.","Gradually, the Skyscraping Sword Scripture began to change. On the palm-sized page, the blurry image of a small sword slowly floated up, shining with utter sharpness. The dominating and tremendous sword intent gave Jian Chen shivers. �","The tiny sword was only an image carved into the page, but it required enough power of the laws channelled into it to appear.","At this moment, as the Skyscraping Sword Scripture absorbed more and more laws, the tiny sword became clearer and clearer. The sword intent it radiated with became stronger and stronger as well, even startling Jian Chen.","The level of the sword intent was so high that Jian Chen felt like he was facing a vast world. It seemed so insurmountable and out of reach.","After all, this was an imprint left behind by a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt of the Laws of the Sword. Such a realm was far too distant from Jian Chen right now.","A while later, the tiny sword on the Skyscraping Sword Scripture seemed to absorb enough power of the ways. It broke free from the page, turning into an almost-tangible strand of sword Qi that suddenly flew off. The space where it passed by split open like the waves.","However, the space that split open was not pitch-black. Instead, it poured out with multicoloured light and the presence of many cultivators.","These presences varied in strength and totalled to over a hundred. Just the presence of Immortal Exalts that Jian Chen sensed reached almost thirty.","“ Now this is where the Skyscraping World is located. ” Jian Chen smiled gently. He did not hesitate, directly striding over and entering this multicoloured world.","After Jian Chen entered, the spatial crack behind him closed slowly, returning to normal after a few seconds.","“Another person has come? I am from the Crouching Dragon Manor of the Polar Jade Heaven. My daoist title is the Crouching Peace Master. May I ask for your name, fellow?”","“Only one person? And only an Immortal Emperor in strength...”","“So what if he’s an Immortal Emperor? There are plenty of Immortal Emperors entering the Skyscraping World. After all, not everyone has come for the seeds of ways...”","......","...","Soon after he had entered, a few voices rang out from afar. Some people stated their origins and openly greeted Jian Chen.","Jian Chen looked over and saw several figures sitting in the surroundings. Those who spoke up only formed a small minority. Most of them sat without budging. Their eyes remained shut as if they were in a state of cultivation. They paid no regard to what was going on around them.","“I am Yang Yutian, an independent cultivator who roams the Immortals’ World. Greetings, everyone.” Jian Chen returned the gesture to everyone in the surroundings with his fist clasped.","“An independent cultivator? An Immortal Emperor independent cultivator who actually managed to hold onto their Skyscraping Sword Scripture. Now that sure is rare.” As soon as Jian Chen finished speaking, an elderly voice rang out.","The speaker was an old man in a cloak. His voice was slightly hoarse and contained a hint of disdain."]},{"number":3831,"title":"Chapter 3831: The Skyscraping World","paragraphs":["Jian Chen looked over and roughly gauged the cloaked old man’s strength. He should be a Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt.","“Keep your voices down. If you want to talk, communicate secretly or set up a noise-cancelling formation. Don’t bother us.” A gruff voice filled with dissatisfaction rang out. It came from a burly, middle-aged man who was bare-chested, exposing his firm muscles that seemed to be filled with power.","The middle-aged man was a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. However, as soon as he spoke up, even the cloaked old man who was a Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt could not muster the courage to talk back. He shut his mouth obediently.","Jian Chen narrowed his eyes slightly. From the cloaked old man’s response, he had already realised that the middle-aged man probably had impressive origins. Otherwise, it would be impossible for him to deter a Third Heavenly Layer expert with his strength as a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt.","Jian Chen even noticed that from the moment the middle-aged man opened his mouth, many figures seated in the surroundings opened their eyes, but without any exceptions, both the Immortal Emperors and the Immortal Exalts looked at the middle-aged man cautiously.","At this moment, the burly man looked at Jian Chen and said indifferently, “Newcomer, are you alone? A single page from the Skyscraping Sword Scripture has three spots. I’ll purchase your two remaining spots from you.”","As he said that, Jian Chen immediately felt many gazes turn towards him. Even the people who seemed uninterested by his arrival seemed to be intrigued now.","“The three spots for the Skyscraping Sword Scripture in my possession are all filled.” Jian Chen clasped his hands towards the middle-aged man.","The middle-aged man furrowed his brows when he heard that; he was slightly displeased.","“City lord Tan Yu, we’re here. You should come out for some air,” Jian Chen said softly. His voice directly drifted into the medium quality god artifact divine hall he carried on him.","As soon as he said th","...","We are unable to load the verification.","Please unblock any scripts or login to continue reading.","Verify below to continue reading","login to continue reading."]},{"number":3832,"title":"Chapter 3832: Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit","paragraphs":["Perhaps because of the contact between Immortal Exalt Tan Yu and the Illusionary Ancestor, even when Jian Chen only filled two of his three spots, Zuo Dao from the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens never mentioned the spare spot again.","The people who mocked Tan Yu all shut their mouths as well.","Afterwards, Jian Chen and Immortal Exalt Tan Yu crossed their legs and levitated in the air like no one else was around, waiting patiently.","Immortal Exalt Tan Yu had already begun ingesting high quality God Tier pills. Each one was very precious, which left him pained. He seized every moment to recover.","At this moment, a middle-aged man in the robes of a daoist priest arrived before Jian Chen and Immortal Exalt Tan Yu. He smiled amicably and clasped his fist. “Fellows, the visit to the Skyscraping World will be extremely dangerous. Not only will we face the competition of other fellows, we have to be constantly wary about the numerous killing formations as well. As a result, under these perilous conditions, the dangers we face inside will be drastically reduced if many people work together. I was wondering if you wanted to join us and form an alliance?”","Jian Chen remembered the middle-aged man in the robes of a daoist priest. He was the person who introduced himself to Jian Chen as the Crouching Peace Master when he arrived.","He came from the Crouching Dragon Manor on the Polar Jade Heaven.","“There are numerous killing formations in the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s dwelling?” Jian Chen asked with a frown. That was rather illogical. The Skyscraping Sword Venerable had not set up the Skyscraping World for himself but for the people that came after him. The only reason for the dwelling’s existence was to benefit his juniors.","Since it was to benefit the juniors of the Immortals’ World, to leave fortunes to them, there should not have been any powerful killing formations. Otherwise, that would defy the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s original intentions of creating this miniature world.","The Crouching Peace Master had originally come for Immortal Exalt Tan Yu, wanting to rope him over to his side. He was not particularly interested in an Immortal Emperor like Jian Chen. However, upon considering how Jian Chen was with Immortal Exalt Tan Yu, he could only explain to Jian Chen with a smile. “Looks like you’re not particularly aware of the situation inside the Skyscraping World, little friend. The Skyscraping World is indeed riddled with dangers. As a matter of fact, it would be no exaggeration to say there is danger at every step.”","“Of course, none of these dangers were left behind by the Skyscraping Sword Venerable. They were arranged by the experts who had entered the Skyscraping World before us.”","“A large number of heavenly resources are growing inside the Skyscraping World. Some of these heavenly resources are extremely precious. Due to a matter of time, the heavenly resources had not ripened yet when these people entered, so they arranged various powerful formations to protect these heavenly resources, allowing them to collect them the next time the Skyscraping World opened.”","“There are even some peak organisations in the Immortals’ World that have already begun viewing the Skyscraping World as their personal medicinal garden. Whenever the Skyscraping World opens, they will bring the seeds of some heavenly resources to plant in the Skyscraping World. This will allow them to nurture these heavenly resources using the blessed environment of the Skyscraping World. They also arrange numerous powerful killing formations around these heavenly resources to protect them.”","“After all, when it comes to nurturing some kinds of precious resources in the Immortals’ World, it requires an extremely vast amount of spiritual Qi. The spiritual Qi inside the Skyscraping World is so dense that it’s astounding. Let alone these peak organisations, even the twelve courts of heaven come nowhere close. As a result, not everyone enters the Skyscraping World for the fortunes it has to offer whenever it opens. Some of them also enter to harvest the mature heavenly resources.”","“As for the final factor, it is the competition over the fortunes. It is very difficult to complete the journey along the path that leads to the deepest depths of the Skyscraping World without sufficient strength. Often, people will be intercepted and killed half way to reduce the competition.”","Reaching there, the Crouching Peace Master looked at Immortal Exalt Tan Yu and said sternly, “Fellow Tan Yu, you claim that you have met the Illusionary Ancestor before, but you don’t have any tangible connection with her after all. That alone is not enough to scare off other people. Once you enter the Skyscraping World, many Immortal Exalts will definitely come after you with your feeble state. It will be very easy for you to be expelled from the Skyscraping World or even perish inside. However, if you work with us, we can keep an eye out for one another.”","Immortal Exalt Tan Yu fell silent. He understood the Crouching Peace Master was telling the truth. Basically only Immortal Exalts could participate in the struggle for the seed of ways. Under these circumstances, fewer Immortal Exalts would obviously be better.","However, when he turned towards Jian Chen beside him, he sighed gently inside. When he first obtained the Skyscraping Sword Scripture, he was filled with aspirations and determination to reach the Third Heavenly Layer using this opportunity.","But now, he no longer had any hopes for the seed of ways.","He understood just how extraordinary the Immortal Emperor beside him was. The elusive feeling of mysteriousness he gave off often gave a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt like him chills.","Seeing how Immortal Exalt Tan Yu was indecisive, the Crouching Peace Master added to convince him, “Fellow Tan Yu, we already have four Immortal Exalts with us. Apart from one at the First Heavenly Layer, the other three are all at the Second Heavenly Layer. With your participation, we will have five Immortal Exalts. When we work together, our main objective will just be to last to the very end. We want to avoid being eliminated along the way. Once it comes to the seed of ways, it’ll come down to everyone’s individual ability.”","“Brother Yutian, what are your thoughts?” Immortal Exalt Tan Yu asked Jian Chen. He wanted to borrow the Crouching Peace Master and everyone else’s strength to assist Jian Chen in making it to the very end. This method could reduce the troubles they would encounter along the way.","“The decision is yours, city lord. I plan on moving alone in the Skyscraping World and taking a look around the place,” Jian Chen answered.","“With your strength, I’m afraid you’ll struggle to protect yourself from the shockwaves of battles between Immortal Exalts if you make it to the final destination. As a result, taking a look around the place is a good idea. After all, the Skyscraping World is chock full of fortunes. As long as your luck isn’t too poor, you will benefit.” The Crouching Peace Master smiled.","“Crouching Peace Master, I am in a poor condition, so I don’t plan on contending for the seed of ways. I also plan on taking a look around the Skyscraping World and trying my luck.” Immortal Exalt Tan Yu declined the Crouching Peace Master’s offer.","When he heard that, the Crouching Peace Master left in disappointment.","At this moment, as the spatial gate opened up nearby, another group of people entered.","There were quite a few people this time, a total of eight. They ranged from Immortal Monarch to Immortal Exalt in strength.","Their leader held one of the pages of the Skyscraping Sword Scripture.","However, as soon as they entered, the eight of them split up quickly and formed several different groups. Clearly, they were not together.","“I have the exact location of a Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit here. If anyone wants it, you can exchange for something that interests me,” a First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt old man said. Ȓ�","“What? A Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit? It’s said that ingesting the fruit leads to an extremely great chance at awakening the memories of your past three lives.”","“Throughout history, some ordinary cultivators might have been supreme experts who ruled over entire regions in their past life or the life before that. After ingesting the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit, they immediately awakened their past memories and inherited everything they knew from their past lives.”","“The Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit is entirely a gamble. If you were a supreme expert in your past life, then so be it. You would immediately receive a great fortune like instant enlightenment. However, if you spent all past three lives as a mortal...”","“Exactly. Some experts might have reached Immortal Emperor or Immortal Exalt in this life, but they could have even been some kind of animal in their past life.”","“Despite that, the value of the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit is still startling. Even in the Immortals’ World, it’s a treasure that is rarely ever exchanged. It’s extremely rare.”","“I didn’t think the Skyscraping World would even have something as rare as the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit. To think that no one discovered it in the past...”","......","...","As soon as news regarding the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit appeared, many people present became interested. Perhaps to certain people, it was worthless.","However, to those who spent their past lives as supreme experts but had yet to awaken their memories, the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit was without a doubt a tremendous fortune that could allow them to rise up and change their fate."]},{"number":3833,"title":"Chapter 3833: The Illusion-condensing Swordmaster","paragraphs":["“Fellow, I have three treasures here. Together, they’re worth no less than a high quality god artifact. I’ll exchange these three treasures for the precise location of the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit,” an Immortal Exalt ancestor said as he tossed over a Space Ring.","The Immortal Exalt with the information on the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit accepted the space ring and took a look before shaking his head in disappointment. “Not enough!”","The Space Ring was returned to its owner without any items removed.","“I have an ancient secret technique here. It is extremely powerful. If those beneath the Third Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt grasp it, they can unleash an attack an entire heavenly layer higher...” another Immortal Exalt said before switching over to a communication technique and telling the person about the rough details of the secret technique.","“I already possess a secret technique like that. I know not to bite off more than I can chew, so I don’t need it.” The Immortal Exalt declined once again.","Afterwards, several other Immortal Exalts spoke up, stating their price. Each offer was very startling in value, enough to make other experts of the same level green with envy.","But without any exceptions, none of them interested the Immortal Exalt.","Even Zuo Dao from the Divine Heavens of the Nine Heavens, the formerly greatest organisation on the Wondrous Success Heaven, took out a priceless object from his Space Ring. He wanted to exchange for the details of the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit, but he was also turned down.","For a moment, the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit became a hot commodity. It was absolutely useless to most experts. After all, it would be of no worth to people who spent their past three lives as regular people.","However, if used carefully, such as on cultivators who knew about their past lives but could not awaken their past memories for various reasons, the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit was equivalent to producing a supreme expert.","“City lord Tan Yu, if you don’t know the precise location in the Skyscraping World, don’t tell me it’s very difficult to find these heavenly resources?” Just the precise location was so precious, which left Jian Chen very curious. He asked Immortal Exalt Tan Yu beside him.","He had indeed obtained a lot of information regarding the Skyscraping World from the Merchant Union of Star Brilliance, but there were still holes in his knowledge.","“ You may not be aware, brother Yutian, but the Skyscraping Sword Venerable set down many formations in the Skyscraping World. One of these formations suppresses the senses of the souls of cultivators. Even Immortal Exalts stand no chance against it, where the senses of their souls can only cover a range of a hundred kilometres at most. Meanwhile, the Skyscraping World is expansive. If someone who entered previously set up a powerful concealing formation around the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit, then it would be difficult to find. ”","Immortal Exalt Tan Yu explained to Jian Chen through a communication technique before looking at the old man. “ This person knows the precise location of the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit, which means he has entered the Skyscraping World before. He must have happened upon an unripe Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit. I suspect he’s set up some kind of formation near the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit to hide it, which can prevent others from detecting it. He wants to trade its precise location for something that he requires. ”","“ If that’s the case, why can’t he enter the Skyscraping World to collect it himself? ” Jian Chen asked.","“ Actually, with his strength as an Immortal Exalt, obtaining a spot to enter the Skyscraping World is not difficult. Perhaps he refuses to collect it himself because it’s not that easy to obtain in the first place. He’s not confident, ” said Immortal Exalt Tan Yu.","Afterwards, more and more experts entered the place, ranging from Immortal Exalts to Daluo Golden Immortals. All of the weaker cultivators were prodigies from various peak organisations, people that the various sects poured their resources into. They followed their Immortal Exalt ancestors into the Skyscraping World for training.","“I have the precise location of a high grade God Tier heavenly resource, a Twin-headed Lotus. You need the strength of a Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt to collect it. I only want five-coloured immortal crystals.”","“This high grade God Tier heavenly resource, the Spiritual Grass of Sword Transformation, is a fantastic material for forging high quality god artifact swords. When I entered the Skyscraping World last time, the Spiritual Grass of Sword Transformation still needed a hundred thousand years before it ripened. With no other choice, I could only give up on it. I set up many formations around the Spiritual Grass of Sword Transformation. Those without the method to navigate the formations will struggle to discover it. As long as you produce something that satisfies me, I can exchange it with you.”","As more and more people arrived, the area gradually became busy. Various cries and voices bargaining rang out endlessly.","Some of these people had entered the Skyscraping World before. They knew many treasures were hidden inside. Some of these people gave up on entering the Skyscraping World because their strength was insufficient, or because the value of the items inside paled in comparison to the value of a spot of entry. Instead, they tried selling the information regarding these heavenly resources to earn a sum of resources.","Without any exception, the various heavenly resources they knew about were of startling value, enough to interest Immortal Exalts.","However, Jian Chen was unfazed. He was not powerful, but after emptying out the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants, the wealth he possessed had already surpassed many peak organisations. Even some high grade God Tier heavenly resources struggled to interest him.","“ Master, someone is using a technique to block my absorption of spiritual Qi from the outside world and is currently trying to deduce where I am through it. I must shut off the energy-gathering formation. ” The Primeval artifact spirit’s voice rang out in Jian Chen’s head.","In the next moment, Jian Chen felt the spiritual Qi in the Primeval Divine Hall rapidly diminish.","All of the disciples of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens and the many heavenly resources inside the Primeval Divine Hall consumed a startling amount of spiritual Qi with each passing moment. Over the past few years, it had been entirely maintained by the spiritual Qi absorbed from the outside world by the Energy-gathering Divine Mountains.","Now, as the flow from the outside world was shut off, the spiritual Qi in the Primeval Divine Hall immediately was in tight supply.","However, Jian Chen had come up with a countermeasure for such a situation a long time ago. He immediately made all the disciples in the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, apart from those at a critical point in their breakthroughs that could not afford any interruption, stop cultivating.","All of the formations that required vast amounts of spiritual Qi stopped operating, while all of the heavenly resources planted in them were maintained with the least amount of spiritual Qi possible.","After a series of steps, the spiritual Qi consumption of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens was reduced to the lowest possible.","At this moment, a small immortal vessel hovered a billion kilometres away from the Skyscraping World.","Around a dozen cultivators of varying strengths stared at a figure that stood with his back to them on the immortal vessel.","He was a middle-aged man in white robes, and he gave off an extremely powerful presence. At this moment, he hovered in the air with his eyes shut as he produced a series of seals. Wisps of a profound and mysterious power circulated around him.","At this moment, he let out a sudden interjection of surprise and opened his eyes slowly. There was a hint of surprise.","“It’s vanished? All of its traces and presence has been cut off? This is not something that any regular person can accomplish. I just wonder who is actually absorbing the spiritual Qi here from so far away,” the middle-aged man murmured softly before returning to the immortal vessel without accomplishing anything.","“Master, did you find their traces?” an old man asked politely on the immortal vessel.","The presence that the old man gave off was a First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt’s, yet he showed great respect towards the middle-aged man.","The way he referred to the middle-aged man was even more shocking.","The middle-aged man was the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster renowned throughout the Immortals’ World. He was an expert of the Way of the Sword who had reached the peak of the Seventh Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt. He was extremely powerful.","The Illusion-condensing Swordmaster was also the strongest expert of the Forbidden High Heaven of the thirty-three heavens!","“Their methods are even more ingenious than I originally suspected, and they immediately sensed that I was looking for them. Once they hid themselves, they left behind no trace at all. I failed to find anything.” The Illusion-condensing Swordmaster sighed gently. Afterwards, his eyes suddenly erupted with blinding light. Endless sword intent flowed as if his eyes nurtured a sea of sharp and terrifying sword Qi. It was impossible to meet his gaze.","Under the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster’s gaze, the nearby space immediately began to change as if many hidden secrets were entirely exposed.","In just a few seconds, the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster’s gaze returned to normal. “So be it. It doesn’t matter. Let’s go to the Skyscraping World.” With that, the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster’s immortal vessel vanished, hurrying off towards the Conquering Judgement Heaven with terrifying speed."]},{"number":3834,"title":"Chapter 3834: The Profound Spirit Master","paragraphs":["“The entrance to the Skyscraping World should be here.”","The Illusion-condensing Swordmaster personally piloted the immortal vessel over to a silent region of space. He studied the surroundings before taking out the Skyscraping Sword Scripture. As the power of ways surged, a sword-shaped imprint immediately appeared on the scripture.","In the next moment, the sword-shaped imprint shot through the space and opened a gate.","The Illusion-condensing Swordmaster personally controlled the immortal vessel, directly entering the gate with his juniors.","“Another person is here. This time, they seem to have two pages of the Skyscraping Sword Scripture, except the leader is only a First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt.”","“Fellow, do you happen to have any spare spots? I am willing to use treasures to trade for them. You definitely won’t be losing out...”","......","...","With the immortal vessel’s arrival, several voices rang out. At the same time, Immortal Exalts radiated with their presences, wanting to exchange for their spots while bearing a slightly threatening tone.","“Hehehe, I’m afraid you can’t afford to purchase the entry spots to the Skyscraping World from us.” A gentle laugh rang out. As he spoke, the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster silently appeared outside. His presence was completely concealed. No one present could sense his strength.","However, when Zuo Dao from the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens saw the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster, his expression immediately changed slightly. He stood up instantly and clasped his fist towards the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster from afar. He said politely, “Greetings, Illusion-condensing Swordmaster!”","“What? The Illusion-condensing Sword Master? This person is the legendary Illusion-condensing Swordmaster?”","“It’s rumoured that the Illusion-condensing Sword Master has two ways. He’s comprehended both the Laws of the Sword and the Laws of Illusion to the Seventh Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt. His strength rivals an Eighth Heavenly Layer expert who’s only grasped one law...”","“To think someone as lofty as the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster would actually come here in person.”","As the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster’s name spread, the surroundings were immediately thrown into an uproar. The seated experts were surprised at first before all standing up and bowing politely towards the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster.","“ Master, the person who tried to find us by following the flow of spiritual Qi earlier is him. ” The Primeval artifact spirit’s voice rang out in Jian Chen’s head.","When he heard that, Jian Chen could not help but study the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster. He was a middle-aged man with large eyes and thick eyebrows. His appearance was simple, but he also gave off a scholarly presence. He seemed quite approachable, without any of the arrogance that peak experts possessed. In particular, after intentionally suppressing his presence, he seemed even more ordinary. He was the kind of person that would not raise any attention if he stood in a large crowd of people.","If it were not for Zuo Dao who recognised the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster, perhaps it would be very difficult for anyone to believe that such an ordinary person was actually a peak expert renowned throughout the Immortals’ World.","Soon after the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster’s arrival, the spatial gate opened again. This time, even more people arrived. There were over thirty of them, ranging from Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals to Immortal Exalts.","“It’s the Courtyard of Ways. I didn’t expect people from the Courtyard of Ways to come with this opening of the Skyscraping World.”","“The Courtyard of Ways is a court of heaven. They have numerous legacies. It’s said that even some of the past Grand Exalts cultivated in the Courtyard of Ways during their youth. Their legacies far surpass what the Skyscraping World can offer.”","“The Courtyard of Ways is a place that we all look up to. It’s said that numerous supreme experts who rose to the peak, and even sovereigns of the world, have left behind important legacies in the Courtyard of Ways.”","......","...","The discussions from the surroundings made Jian Chen look over subconsciously. In the group of around thirty people, nine cultivators stood out. They were dressed in special daoist robes with the word “Ways” embroidered on their chest. It was written with lively characters. It seemed like it was a work of nature, and it seemed to possess a profound power of the ways.","There were both men and women among the nine cultivators, varying in strength. The weakest was only a Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal, while the strongest was only an Immortal Emperor.","However, despite not being particularly powerful, they seemed extremely arrogant. They gave off a sense of haughtiness that they looked down on everyone and everything around them.","“ They must be students of the Courtyard of Ways... ” Jian Chen nodded to himself. Although he did not know their actual battle prowess, he could tell that these nine cultivators were quite extraordinary from their presence alone. They were far more powerful than other cultivators of their level. They could all make the ranks of prodigies.","Among the others, Jian Chen noticed a familiar figure. He was one of the peak experts of the Hall Brilliance Heaven, the city lord of the Yi Immortal City, the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt!","During the years he spent in the Immortal Rising City, Jian Chen had seen some of the experts native to the Hall Brilliance Heaven. The Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt was one of them.","“Hahahaha, Tan Yu, I didn’t expect you to actually reach here before me.” The Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt also noticed Immortal Exalt Tan Yu seated in the distance and immediately let out a laugh.","However, not only was the laughter devoid of any friendliness, but it was instead filled with blatant coldness.","Immortal Exalt Tan Yu opened his eyes and looked at the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt. He immediately frowned. If it were the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt alone, he obviously would not care too much. The issue was the people around the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt were not to be trifled with.","Immortal Exalt Tan Yu was not entirely certain about the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt’s relationship with the people around him.","“Fellow Scarlet Fire, do you have a grievance with this person?” An old man in grey robes asked from beside the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt. He looked at Immortal Exalt Tan Yu with some indifference, clearly looking down on him.","The old man in grey robes was a Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. Of course, his greatest source of pride was not his personal strength but his outstanding background. He was one of the five ancestors of the Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights on the Cloud Extent Heaven, the Profound Spirit Master!","The Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights was a peak organisation with a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt!","“Fellow Profound Spirit, this is the person who went back on his word that I mentioned a few days ago. If he had upheld his promise, I would not have had to run around everywhere for the sake of this entry spot,” the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt said.","“Father, it really has been difficult for you over the past few years for me to be able to enter the Skyscraping World,” a young man with a striking appearance said from behind the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt.","He was the seventh son of the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt, Chi Yun, a prodigy who had already joined the Courtyard of Ways.","Despite still being very weak, only a Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal, no one dared to look down on him due to his identity as a student from the Courtyard of Ways.","A tall and straight middle-aged man stood beside Chi Yun. The way he looked at Immortal Exalt Tan Yu was also filled with hostility.","He was the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt’s eldest son, Chi Yutian, a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor.","“Grandfather, brother Chi Yun has assisted me substantially during the time I spent in the Courtyard of Ways. In the past, during the tests to enter the Courtyard of Ways, if it were not for brother Chi Yun’s encouragement, progressing hand-in-hand with me, I probably would not have passed successfully. As a result, we can’t just watch brother Chi Yun’s family get bullied,” a Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal said from beside the Profound Spirit Master. The way he looked at Immortal Exalt Tan Yu was also filled with hostility.","“My dear grandson, since little friend Chi Yun has been so nice to you, I obviously won’t just stand by and do nothing. Otherwise, people will begin to think that our Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights is just a bunch of ingrates.” The Profound Spirit Master smiled kindly. He looked at his grandson dotingly, but when he shifted his gaze and looked straight at Immortal Exalt Tan Yu, his tone immediately turned cold. “Fellow, I’ll give you one opportunity. Give the spot that you promised to fellow Scarlet Fire, and I’ll treat it as if nothing has happened.”"]},{"number":3835,"title":"Chapter 3835: Severed Arm","paragraphs":["After the Profound Spirit Master spoke, the gazes of a few Immortal Exalts in the area became strange. They were all the people who had reached here first. They knew about the encounter between Immortal Exalt Tan Yu and the second ancestor of the Waymight clan.","Although this encounter could not truly represent earning the good graces of a figure like the Illusionary Ancestor, it was enough to leave many people wary. Unless it conflicted tremendously with their personal interests, none of them would want to make things difficult for Immortal Exalt Tan Yu over some trifles.","For a moment, many Immortal Exalts glanced between Immortal Exalt Tan Yu and the Profound Spirit Master. No one warned the Profound Spirit Master.","Immortal Exalt Tan Yu’s expression became ugly. His greatest worry had still ended up happening. The city lord of the Yi Immortal City, the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt, had clearly managed to establish connections with a supreme organisation that the Immortal Rising City could never afford to provoke through his seventh son, Chi Yun.","“Fellow Scarlet Fire, I explained everything to you very clearly back then. My three spots are all occupied already. I don’t have any to spare,” Immortal Exalt Tan Yu said to the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt sternly.","“Since you don’t have any spare spots, then I’ll take your arm as the debt,” the Profound Spirit Master said coldly. He reached out, and a simple woodcutter appeared in his hand. It blazed like the sun like it wanted to blind everyone.","In the next moment, the Profound Spirit Master slashed out. The pressure of a high quality god artifact filled the surroundings. The terrifying blade strike slashed towards Immortal Exalt Tan Yu mercilessly. The might of the attack even made the expressions of the Immortal Exalts present change.","The Profound Spirit Master did not hold back. His pressure as a Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt filled the entire area, leaving all of the early Immortal Exalts stern.","Immortal Exalt Tan Yu became unprecedentedly stern, but he did not simply sit there. Blinding light erupted from his body as a high quality god artifact sword appeared in his hand. With a bellow, he produced a powerful strand of sword Qi.","The sword Qi turned into a colossal silver stream that collided with the incoming attack.","Boom! There was a great rumble. Despite the extraordinary power behind Immortal Exalt Tan Yu’s sword Qi, there was still a substantial difference in cultivation. As soon as the attacks collided, the blade strike effortlessly destroyed his sword Qi before directly slashing down on his right arm.","Immortal Exalt Tan Yu paled as blood sprayed out from his mouth. He staggered backwards. As his right arm was cut off, his high quality god artifact was also thrown into the air.","“This sword is not bad. It has some value. Why don’t you just use this sword to compensate fellow Scarlet Fire?” the Profound Spirit Master looked at Immortal Exalt Tan Yu’s high quality god artifact and smiled slightly. He was about to collect it.","“Profound Spirit Master, you’ve already severed his arm. If you even want to take away his high quality god artifact, that would be a little too far,” Zuo Dao, who sat nearby, suddenly spoke up.","The Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt was originally filled with joy. He did not have a powerful background, so a high quality god artifact was a priceless item to an early Immortal Exalt to him. Zuo Dao’s words immediately poured a bucket of cold water over his head.","He looked at Zuo Dao with a gaze filled with hostility, but he did not have the courage to speak up rashly because he did not know Zuo Dao’s background.","The Profound Spirit Master from the Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights did not have as many qualms as the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt. He stared at Zuo Dao coldly and forced a smile. “May I ask who you are, fellow? And which organisation do you belong to?”","“I am Zuo Dao. I come from the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens on the Wondrous Success Heaven!” Zuo Dao said indifferently.","As soon as he heard mention of the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens, the Profound Spirit Master’s eyes narrowed; his expression softened. He clasped his fist politely. “So it’s a fellow from the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens. Forgive me, forgive me!”","The Profound Spirit Master turned towards Immortal Exalt Tan Yu and said, “Since this fellow from the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens is pleading for you, I won’t make things any more difficult for you. You can take back this high quality god artifact.” With that, the Profound Spirit Master waved his hand, and the high quality god artifact sword drifted back over to Immortal Exalt Tan Yu’s side.","The Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt was filled with pity. He glanced at Zuo Dao who levitated in the air without budging. Intense fear flashed through the depths of his eyes.","Immortal Exalt Tan Yu was pale. He silently stowed his sword away before sitting down to heal in a hurry.","“Profound Spirit Master, fellow Tan Yu encountered the Starflame Demon Lion who rampaged through outer space a million years ago on the way here. He was unfortunately devoured by the Starflame Demon Lion, but do you know who saved him in the end?” At this moment, a female Immortal Exalt let out a giggle. She did not look at the Profound Spirit Master with much fear.","The Profound Spirit Master’s eyes narrowed slightly as he subconsciously looked at the female Immortal Exalt.","The female Immortal Exalt laughed. “The person who saved him was the second ancestor of the Waymight clan, the Illusionary Ancestor!”","When he heard her mention the Illusionary Ancestor, the Profound Spirit Master’s eyes narrowed. He became unprecedentedly stern as if he was afraid that Immortal Exalt Tan Yu had developed some kind of connection with the Illusionary Ancestor.","Even the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt leapt in fright. The second ancestor of the Waymight clan possessed tremendous influence even on the Hall Brilliance Heaven. Her name alone could frighten an entire swathe of people to death.","But very soon, the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt seemed to understand something, and he relaxed. He smiled and said, “Profound Spirit Master, Tan Yu and I are both from the Hall Brilliance Heaven. I know everything about his background. It’s impossible for him to know a figure as lofty as the Illusionary Ancestor, much less develop any sort of connection. He was just lucky at most, having encountered the Illusionary Ancestor while she was out to kill the Starflame Demon Lion before being saved out of convenience.”","When he heard the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt’s explanation, the Profound Spirit Master eased up, but he still felt lingering fear. He carefully communicated to the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt, “ This ends here. If we don’t have any particularly great conflicts of interest in the future, it’s best if we don’t provoke him. There might be a chance that he has no connection with the Illusionary Ancestor, but he was still saved by her after all. Who knows what the Illusionary Ancestor is thinking. If the Illusionary Ancestor admires him, then we’ll be in trouble. ”","The Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt nodded. He looked at Immortal Exalt Tan Yu with some resentment and envy. He was vexed inside. “ What kind of luck does Tan Yu have? To think he encountered someone like the second ancestor of the Waymight clan. Now, I can only hope that the Profound Spirit Master’s guesses don’t become true... ”","“Fellow Tan Yu, are you fine?” Jian Chen arrived in front of Immortal Exalt Tan Yu like no one else was around. His expression was quite ugly.","Immortal Exalt Tan Yu shook his head. There were hints of feebleness in his voice. “It’s just a small wound. You don’t have to worry too much, brother Yutian.”","Jian Chen reached out with his hand, retrieving Immortal Exalt Tan Yu’s severed arm with the Laws of Space before personally connecting it back to his shoulder. Afterwards, he took out a high grade God Tier pill from his Space Ring and said, “Use this pill to heal. It can help you recover faster.”","“Brother Yutian...”","“Your injury this time is connected to me, so just take it.” Jian Chen firmly interrupted Immortal Exalt Tan Yu as soon as he tried to say something.","With no other choice, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu could only ingest Jian Chen’s pill. Aas soon as it reached his belly, it erupted with surging vitality.","Under the vitality, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu’s injuries immediately began to heal at a pace that left him tongue-tied.","“T-this...” Immortal Exalt Tan Yu was shocked. He could clearly sense a power of laws of extremely great heights within the vitality."]},{"number":3836,"title":"Chapter 3836: Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star","paragraphs":["Vaguely, he even developed the illusion that as long as he obtained the protection of this power, even dying would be infeasible.","However, the vitality left as quickly as it came. When Immortal Exalt Tan Yu had mostly recovered from his injuries, the vitality vanished. No matter how Immortal Exalt Tan Yu investigated it, he was unable to find any trace of presence. Seemingly, it had never appeared in the first place.","Immortal Exalt Tan Yu was shocked. He immediately felt like Jian Chen was even more difficult to see through.","“ Source of Life, are you certain that you won’t leave behind any revealing traces with all these experts gathered here, including late Immortal Exalts? ” Jian Chen communicated with the Source of Life secretly.","“ Don’t worry. I’ve already recovered some strength over the years. Although it’s nowhere close to my peak condition, it’s still not something that any random person can detect. ” The Source of Life guaranteed.","“ Good! ” Jian Chen smiled. He could clearly sense the changes in the Source of Life’s attitude. She had become more easy going, no longer as proud as before. She no longer looked down on him with scorn either.","Following the conflict involving Immortal Exalt Tan Yu, the wait became extremely peaceful. As people constantly arrived, more and more pages of the Skyscraping Sword Scripture were assembled.","All one hundred and eight pages of the Skyscraping Sword Scripture were about to be gathered.","“The Wind clan that dominates the Fierce Gales Heaven has actually sent people as well...”","“It’s said that the Mistress of Contrary Winds of the Wind clan has reached the peak of the Sixth Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt a long time ago. So many years have passed already, so I wonder if she’s reached the Seventh Heavenly Layer yet...”","......","...","Jian Chen was alerted from his meditative state by a series of soft discussions. He slowly opened his eyes and looked at the people from the Wind clan.","The Wind clan had sent three people. They were a First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt old man accompanied by two late Immortal Emperors. They wore the same clothes, and their faces were slightly cold.","A page of the Skyscraping Sword Scripture was in the possession of the First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt old man.","“ These three people from the Wind clan look like they’re all entering! ” Jian Chen studied the three experts from the Wind clan without raising any attention. A hint of cold killing intent that was difficult to detect flashed through the depths of his eyes.","Before long, three Immortal Emperors entered this place with a page of the Skyscraping Sword Scripture. Two of them were mid Immortal Emperors, while the last one was a late Immortal Emperor.","Despite not being very powerful among this crowd, their arrival was warmly received by many of the Immortal Exalts.","That was because the three Immortal Emperors were from the Immortal Ascension sect of the twelve courts of heaven. The Laws of the Sword revolved around them all.","The three of them had clearly all comprehended several laws, and the Laws of the Sword was only one of them. They all grasped two ways at the very least, while the late Immortal Emperor had grasped three.","At the same time, the three ways had all been comprehended to the level of Immortal Emperor.","“Hmm? Look, it’s people from the Heavenly Star Palace...”","“As one of the twelve courts of heaven, the Heavenly Star Palace is actually also participating in the opening of the Skyscraping World this time. It’s as clear as day that they’ve come for the seed of ways...”","......","...","Only one person arrived from the Heavenly Star Palace. She was a talented young woman. She had a slender finger and wore a set of tight-fitting clothes, carefully outlining her beautiful and curvy figure. Her beauty was alluring, enough to enchant both flowers and the moon. She seemed to be out of this world.","She clutched an ancient sword in her arms. It was wrapped in cloth, obscuring its appearance. It was only possible to vaguely sense a supreme sword Qi of extreme sharpness from within.","As soon as the woman from the Heavenly Star Palace arrived, she stood in an empty region alone. Her face was devoid of emotion, and her eyes were extremely cold, giving off a sense of unapproachable coldness and nobleness.","“ Hmm? That’s the presence of the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star. Ah! Dammit, why would the presence of the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star appear here? ” At this moment, Zi Ying’s voice of disbelief rang out in Jian Chen’s head.","Jian Chen shivered inside. As the sword spirit of a sovereign god artifact, there were not a lot of matters that could trigger an emotional response from Zi Ying, let alone becoming so excited over something called the “Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star”.","Jian Chen subconsciously looked towards the woman from the Heavenly Star Palace.","Coincidentally, the woman from the Heavenly Star Palace also snapped open her eyes and looked over directly at Jian Chen from afar. It seemed like she had sensed something, and her icy gaze had already become filled with shock.","“ Master, the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star has already sensed us. The ancient sword in the arms of the woman from the Heavenly Star Palace is the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star, ” Qing Suo said in complete surprise, expressing a deep sense of helplessness.","“ The Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star has actually sensed you? Don’t tell me the ancient sword in the arms of the woman is also a sovereign god artifact? ” Jian Chen was shocked. He subconsciously looked at the ancient sword wrapped in cloth.","That was because he completely failed to sense the presence unique to sovereign god artifacts despite being so close.","Apart from giving off powerful sword Qi, none of the Immortal Exalts present, including the late Immortal Exalts, sensed the presence of a sovereign god artifact.","“ That’s right. The Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star is indeed a sovereign god artifact, wielded by the greatest expert of the Heavenly Star Palace. But why has it ended up in the hands of an Immortal Emperor now? ” Zi Ying said in doubt.","Jian Chen sank into his thoughts. Apart from the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance, only the artifact spirit of the Observance Heaven City, the master of the Pavilion of Heavenly Secrets, and elder Nong knew about the existence of the twin swords.","Now, it probably would not take long before the twin swords were made known to the upper echelon of the Heavenly Star Palace.","In particular, from the woman’s strange expression, she had clearly learnt this secret from the artifact spirit of the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star already.","“ She’s a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor, yet she carries the supreme treasure of the Heavenly Star Palace with her. What exactly is her status in the Heavenly Star Palace? ” Jian Chen was filled with curiosity. He understood that some sovereign god artifacts were able to sense one another, just like how the twin swords had been discovered in the Observance Heaven City back then.","Even the mask from the Illusionary Daemon race was unable to hide this.","“Caijian, I didn’t expect you to come here. Has your father been well recently?”","At this moment, a middle-aged man in white clothes that gave off a scholarly presence silently appeared in front of the woman from the Heavenly Star Palace with a gentle smile.","He was the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster!","“Greetings, uncle Illusion-condensing. Thank you for your concern. My father is well!” The woman from the Heavenly Star Palace stood up and greeted the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster extremely politely.","The Illusion-condensing Swordmaster’s gaze paused on the cloth-wrapped Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star momentarily before leaving after a short conversation.","With his identity, the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster had actually personally greeted the woman from the Heavenly Star Palace, which immediately made many of the Immortal Exalts present concentrate on her again.","She was from the Heavenly Star Palace, one of the twelve courts of heaven. However, even if she possessed a startling background, that was nowhere near enough for the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster to personally walk over and greet her with her strength as a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor.","For a moment, everyone began guessing at the woman’s identity.","However, the woman known as “Caijian” completely ignored all of their gazes. Her eyes were cold, and her face was devoid of emotion. She seemed completely unapproachable. However, when she glanced towards Jian Chen in the distance every now and then, there would be a hint of surprise and hesitation.","After deliberating for a while, she suddenly stood up and strode over with the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star in her arms, making her way towards Jian Chen.","Her actions piqued the attention of many experts present. Even the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster who sat on an immortal vessel looked over in surprise. He followed her gaze and locked onto Jian Chen.","“ That’s strange. With Caijian’s personality, why would she take an interest in an unknown man for no reason? ” The Illusion-condensing Swordmaster was filled with doubt. He could not help but study Jian Chen closely.","Jian Chen clearly noticed Caijian’s actions as well. As he looked at the woman in white who paced towards him steadily, he furrowed his brows heavily. If she directly exposed the existence of the twin swords here, it would be extremely detrimental to him.","Under everyone’s gazes, the woman who carried the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star in her hands stopped ten metres away from Jian Chen. Her eyes shone brightly as she stared at Jian Chen.","Afterwards, she simply stood there and stared at Jian Chen. She remained cold-faced and without blinking, nor uttering a single word.","“Fellow, is there anything I can help you with?” Jian Chen stood up and clasped his fist reluctantly.","“The Sixth Heavenly Layer of Immortal Emperor? Is that your true cultivation?” the woman from the Heavenly Star Palace asked.","When he heard that, the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster in the distance also frowned. He stared at the woman from the Heavenly Star Palace in surprise and doubt.","“Of course!” Jian Chen replied.","“Too weak!” The woman shook her head gently with a hint of disappointment.","“I am indeed a little weak compared to you, fellow.” Jian Chen smiled wryly. He roughly understood what she was saying. She probably thought he was quite unworthy of the twin swords with his strength.","“What is your name?” the woman from the Heavenly Star Palace then asked.","“Yang Yutian!”","“If I want to find you in the future, where should I go?” the woman from the Heavenly Star Palace said.","However, when she said that, many of the experts present immediately looked at Jian Chen with strange gazes.","Even Immortal Exalt Tan Yu beside Jian Chen glanced at him with deep meaning.","However, the woman from the Heavenly Star Palace ignored the gazes of all others. Her cold eyes were fixed on Jian Chen without any emotions.","“I have no fixed residence. I wander through the Immortals’ World. Finding me will be very difficult, I’m afraid,” Jian Chen said.","The woman from the Heavenly Star Palace did not say anything more. After hearing that, she directly turned around and left.","“Fellow, you already know my name, but I still don’t know how to refer to you.” Jian Chen smiled gently, but he relaxed inside. Fortunately, she knew how to behave and had not directly exposed the existence of the twin swords.","The woman paused. With her back towards Jian Chen, she hesitated slightly and deliberated for a few seconds on the spot before saying emotionlessly,” Xing Caijian!”","Xing Caijian was an extremely unfamiliar name to Jian Chen.","However, when the surrounding Immortal Exalts heard the name, they shuddered inside.","“ Xing Caijian. She’s actually Xing Caijian... ”","“ Five hundred thousand years ago, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor and Venerable Cajian of the Immortal Sect of Sacred Fire from the Plain Subtlety Heaven tied the knot. They gave birth to a daughter ten thousand years later, naming her Xing Caijian. ”","“ Xing Cajian... Xing Caijian... I never thought she’d actually be the daughter of a heavenly emperor... ”","“ Her father is the Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor, while her mother is the Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, Venerable Cajian. S-she truly has been born into a family of experts. She cannot be trifled with, she can never be trifled with... ”","Many Immortal Exalts present were shocked, quite startled by her background. Some of the seniors even warned their juniors immediately to never provoke Xing Caijian in the Skyscraping World."]},{"number":3837,"title":"Chapter 3837: The Sword Scripture Assembled","paragraphs":["For a moment, Xing Caijian’s identity struck fear into all of the experts present.","Her mother, Venerable Caijian, was already enough to strike fear into ninety-nine percent of the peak organisations present. She was an Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. Meanwhile, there was also the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor. His name alone roused dread in the hearts of many Immortal Exalts.","In the present Immortals’ World, only the greatest expert of a court of heaven could bear the title of heavenly emperor. He was the greatest leader of a court of heaven, as well as their spiritual pillar, the basis of their foundations. His status was so great that it was only second to Grand Exalts.","Children of heavenly emperors were even rarer in the Immortals’ World. Even describing them as mythical existences was an understatement.","That was because some heavenly emperors were devoted to the ways. They spent their entire lives alone, without any partners, so they obviously would not have any direct descendants. Those who continued the bloodline were other members of the clan.","There were also some heavenly emperors who lived for an extremely long time, but their children all perished for various reasons, only leaving behind great grandchildren countless generations apart.","As a result, the status of a child of a heavenly emperor like Xing Caijian was so great that very few people in the entire Immortals’ World even came close.","The appearance of a heavenly emperor’s daughter drowned out the glow of all of the prodigies. As a result, all of the supreme prodigies from the peak organisations, all of the experts of extraordinary backgrounds, lost the halo they were supposed to possess.","Xing Caijian’s actions also pulled Jian Chen into the centre of attention of many experts despite previously being extremely discreet. Many had not even noticed him before. Now, they began to keep an eye out for him.","Just how aloof was the daughter of a heavenly emperor? Apart from the renowned Illusion-condensing Swordmaster who was a supreme expert himself, no one else struck up a conversation with her, yet she instead proactively approached Jian Chen.","That was without a doubt a demonstration of how extraordinary Jian Chen was.","“ A Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor, yet he’s able to raise the attention of the Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor daughter of a heavenly emperor. Is this person really an independent cultivator? ”","“ Even if he really is an independent cultivator who wanders the Immortals’ World, he probably isn’t simply that... ”","“ Looks like I better keep an eye out for this Immortal Emperor called Yang Yutian. Perhaps he’s hiding quite the secret. ”","......","...","Many Immortal Exalts and even Immortal Emperors began to secretly make guesses about Jian Chen.","As a matter of fact, some Immortal Exalts from larger organisations arrived before Jian Chen. They sincerely invited him and Immortal Exalt Tan Yu to travel with them and watch each others’ backs.","“Scarlet Fire, do you know about the origins of the Immortal Emperor next to Tan Yu?” the Profound Spirit Master of the five ancestors of the Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights asked the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt secretly. r�","The Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt glanced at Jian Chen. There was a hint of fear in the depths of his eyes, but he soon told everything he knew about Jian Chen to the Profound Spirit Master.","“ Even a Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt had perished because of him? ” After learning about what had occurred on the Hall Brilliance Heaven, the Profound Spirit Master narrowed his eyes. He was stern.","“ It’s not without reason why the daughter of the heavenly emperor, Xing Caijian, would turn her attention towards him. Either this person’s background is frighteningly large, or he’s hiding some great secret, ” the Profound Spirit Master thought as his eyes flickered with uncertainty.","The people here waited for several years before all one hundred and eight pages of the Skyscraping Sword Scripture were gathered. Over three thousand people had amassed in this region.","Some of these people had come here to sell information regarding the precise location of certain precious heavenly resources in the Skyscraping World, while others had come to escort some disciples from their sects like the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster.","“Since all the pages of the Skyscraping Sword Scripture are here, let’s merge them together and formally open the dwelling that the Skyscraping Sword Venerable created.” At this moment, a Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt old man stood forward. He looked around at first. When he saw how there were no objections, he turned to one side and immediately demonstrated great respect. He clasped his fist and said, “Illusion-condensing Swordmaster, in order to avoid any unnecessary troubles, we can only ask you to handle the matter of merging the pages.”","The Illusion-condensing Swordmaster currently sat on a small immortal vessel, meditating. When he heard that, he slowly opened his eyes and smiled gently. “If you all trust me, I’d obviously be happy to do this for you.”","“The Illusion-condensing Swordmaster possesses great faith, virtue, and righteousness, which we all admire. I’m sure no one has any objections to the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster overseeing the merging of the pages.”","“With the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster’s identity, it is our honour that you will handle such a trifle for us.”","......","...","After the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster said that, many of the Immortal Exalts present spoke up immediately. All of them were filled with deep respect.","The Illusion-condensing Swordmaster smiled gently. He seemed very friendly and approachable, without any of the aloofness and coldness of a supreme expert. He stood up from his immortal vessel and strode through the air, making his way towards the centre. “Since everyone trusts me, please hand your pages over.”","After saying that, pages of the Skyscraping Sword Scripture flew over from all directions, shining with dazzling light as they arrived by the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster’s side.","Merging the pages required all of them at the same time. This step was usually completed by an expert of high prestige that everyone trusted. Only then could they guarantee that the pages would return to their respective owners’ hands after the fusion was complete and would not become lost for good.","The Illusion-condensing Swordmaster was without a doubt the best choice here.","Gradually, more and more pages of the Skyscraping Sword Scripture hovered around the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster. Even Jian Chen tossed over his page without any hesitation.","Very soon, all one hundred and eight pages were gathered by the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster’s side.","The Illusion-condensing Swordmaster extended his hand steadily, bringing two fingers together gently in the air.","In the next moment, the one hundred and eight pages that hovered around rapidly joined together, instantly forming a complete book that lay between the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster’s two fingers.","A sharp and brutal sword intent radiated from the palm-sized book. It was extremely powerful, enough to shake up the surroundings. Even many of the Immortal Exalts in the surroundings struggled to withstand the terrifying pressure it gave off, forced back as a result.","This was the supreme sword intent left behind by a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. Even a wisp of his sword intent possessed the might to shatter space and annihilate entire galaxies.","However, as the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster held the book between his two fingers, his scholarly figure seemed particularly tall and straight. Regardless of how powerful the sword intent was, he remained unmoving. He gave off a sense of unshakable strength.","The Illusion-condensing Swordmaster had comprehended two laws to the Seventh Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt. His strength was no less than a regular Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt who had comprehended a single law, so the sword scripture left behind by the Skyscraping Sword Venerable obviously could not threaten the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster."]},{"number":3838,"title":"Chapter 3838: Entering the Skyscraping World","paragraphs":["As the sword intent that erupted from the Skyscraping Sword Scripture became more and more powerful and terrifying, the dazzling light turned the surroundings snowy-white, seemingly trying to blind everyone. It made many cultivators beneath Immortal Exalt close their eyes uncontrollably.","Apart from the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster in the region near the Skyscraping Sword Scripture, all of the Immortal Exalts had backed far away. Under the impact of the extremely powerful sword intent, even some Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts struggled to stay put.","Meanwhile, the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster was like an unshakable mountain. No matter how vicious the storm of sword intent was, he did not budge. He gave off an indomitable feeling as if he could hold up the skies with his powers alone.","“When the pages of the Skyscraping Sword Scripture are assembled, the sword intent that erupts is so powerful that it’s completely beyond anything that regular Immortal Exalts can withstand. When the Skyscraping World opened up in the past few times, it had always been multiple reputed mid Immortal Exalts working together to assemble the Skyscraping Sword Scripture. It’s been completed by the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster alone this time...”","“From the Illusion-condensing Master’s relaxed appearance, it is as if assembling the Skyscraping Sword Scripture brings him no pressure at all...”","......","...","When they looked at the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster relaxed demeanour, the Immortal Exalts in the surroundings all developed feelings of admiration. The Illusion-condensing Swordmaster had behaved with great friendliness and approachability the entire time, keeping his strength well hidden. No one could sense just how powerful he was.","Only when he personally assembled the Skyscraping Sword Scripture did he reveal the tip of the iceberg to everyone.","At this moment, a clear thrum resounded through the region. An extremely powerful strand of sword Qi suddenly shot out from the merged Skyscraping Sword Scripture, sweeping off into the distance.","The sword Qi was like the key to a treasure. As the sword Qi swept past, a colossal mountain suddenly appeared in the empty space.","The mountain was extremely large like a huge planet. It was covered with multiple layers of formations and barriers, shining with multicoloured light that hid everything behind it.","Each one of these formations had reached the Ninth Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt. They were extremely powerful. The tremendous pressure they gave off made all of the Immortal Exalts present pale.","Some of these formations had been personally arranged by the Skyscraping Sword Venerable. At the expense of tremendous amounts of resources, these formations were powerful enough to stop Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts.","Those beneath the Ninth Heavenly Layer would be slain by the formations if they were careless even in the slightest.","The rest were arranged by some supreme experts invited by the Skyscraping Sword Venerable when he was still alive. Their power had also reached the Ninth Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt, possessing various kinds of functions.","With all these Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt formations stacked on top of one another, the defences of the planet had already reached a terrifying level where even other Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts no longer possessed the courage to touch it without good reason.","“ How extravagant of the Skyscraping Sword Venerable! ” Even the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster could not help but let out a sigh in amazement when he saw the formations before him.","Shortly afterwards, he gently slapped the Skyscraping Sword Scripture. In the next moment, it fell apart, turning back into one hundred and eight loose pages that returned to the hands of their respective owners.","At that moment, all of the owners of the pages of the Skyscraping Sword Scripture raised their vigilance to the maximum. They stared at the page that belonged to them as their presences silently churned, clearly already prepared to strike at any moment.","In the past, there had been cases where experts tried to intervene or intercept the pages when they disassembled and returned to their respective owners, leading to a bloody battle. Even Immortal Exalts had ended up perishing.","“Fellows, please do this for me!” At this moment, the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster seemed to sense something. He glanced in a few directions in a slightly threatening manner.","This time, perhaps due to the presence of an Eighth Heavenly Layer supreme expert, nothing ended up happening. The one hundred and eight pages returned to the hands of their respective owners extremely smoothly.","Jian Chen clutched his page, but he frowned slightly. He could clearly sense a few extremely discreet gazes looking at him with burning desire. Clearly, they took an interest in the loose page in his possession.","“ The Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s dwelling has already appeared. Have those harbouring ulterior motives finally reached the end of their patience? ” Jian Chen thought. He understood why these people did not give off any signs earlier. No one knew when the pages would all be assembled. If they moved too soon, there would be far too many factors at play.","When it came to stealing a page of the Skyscraping Sword Scripture, the best time would be now. As long as they obtained the scripture, they could enter the treasured land very quickly.","“If it weren’t for the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster’s deterrence, there probably would have been quite a few battles with this opening of the Skyscraping World. Some of the weaker Immortal Emperors would probably struggle to preserve their pages.” Jian Chen looked in a few directions. The pages of the Skyscraping Sword Scripture were all in the possession of Immortal Exalts there with a few Immortal Monarchs following them. ꭆA","These people clearly did not have particularly powerful backgrounds. They were the best targets to rob.","“Fellow Yang Yutian, I would like to purchase the final spot in your possession. I was wondering if that would be possible...” Right when they were about to enter the Skyscraping World, an Immortal Exalt noticed that Jian Chen and Immortal Exalt Tan Yu did not have a third person, so he came up and expressed his desire to purchase the spot.","Jian Chen stopped hiding. He called Jing Mumu out of the divine hall to show off, just in case any other people wanted to purchase the spot from him.","However, Jing Mumu possessed the Sword Constitution of Soul Connection. Perhaps it was difficult for Immortal Emperors to notice this, but there were plenty of knowledgeable and experienced Immortal Exalts present. In order to prevent these Immortal Exalts from noticing Jing Mumu’s constitution, Jian Chen did not have the courage to leave her outside for too long. As a result, he sent her back inside the divine hall as soon as she appeared.","Jing Mumu’s strength was far too low, which would make it easier for her to attract attention inside the Skyscraping World. He only showed off Jing Mumu this time so that everyone knew that she was entering the Skyscraping World through one of the spots available from a page of the Skyscraping Sword Scripture.","Otherwise, if someone noticed that someone unfamiliar had suddenly appeared in the Skyscraping World, it would be as clear as day that they were a “stowaway”.","If someone wanted to be a stowaway here, they would need a sovereign god artifact. Only such an artifact could fool the formations of Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts.","Afterwards, everyone began to make their way towards the dwelling enveloped in formations with their pages of the Skyscraping Sword Scripture.","The place shaped like a mountain was the true core location of the Skyscraping World. Only those with the spots offered by the pages of the scripture could enter it.","As for this region, while it was also known as the Skyscraping World, it was only the outskirts. As long as the gate was open, anyone could enter.","Jian Chen and Immortal Exalt Tan Yu strode through the air, following the flow of people as they approached the colossal mountain. When they reached within a certain vicinity, Jian Chen felt the powerful force of a formation envelope him. The tremendous pressure seemed to hide some kind of power of laws, which gave Jian Chen the illusion that he was as puny as an ant. Moreover, he felt like all of his secrets had been exposed indiscriminately.","Even the mask from the Illusionary Daemon race was unable to hide him.","“ What a powerful detection formation. Before a formation of such quality, probably only items on par with sovereign god artifacts can fool it. ” Jian Chen was secretly shocked.","The power of the formation withdrew very quickly. In the next moment, Jian Chen and Immortal Exalt Tan Yu only felt the surrounding space change. In the next moment, they vanished from outer space and appeared in a beautiful paradise.","Jian Chen’s first impression was that this place was filled with spiritual Qi that was indescribably dense. It was as if he only needed to reach out. With that, his hand would become coated in dew that was condensed from spiritual Qi."]},{"number":3839,"title":"Chapter 3839: Xing Caijian","paragraphs":["“ Most of the spiritual Qi here is provided by immortal crystals of various kinds. There’s even hints of presence from the divine crystals of the Saints’ World. ” Jian Chen was amazed. As a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s wealth was completely beyond the imaginations of ordinary people. The tremendous amounts of spiritual Qi condensed from immortal crystals and divine crystals was only the tip of the iceberg of wealth that he had accumulated.","As a matter of fact, it was even less than that.","He looked around and discovered that he was standing in a huge square. The ground was paved from priceless spiritual jade, and the entire place was protected by a powerful formation that even Immortal Exalts could not destroy.","At this moment, around three hundred cultivators of varying strength had already gathered on the square. Everyone who entered the Skyscraping World was here.","However, Immortal Exalts only made up for a small portion of these people. The rest of them were all Immortal Emperors, and there was an extremely small number of people beneath Immortal Emperor.","However, as soon as they arrived here, they began to pull together, forming groups of various sizes. Clearly, some organisations had already established alliances before they entered.","However, there was one exception, which was the enchanting daughter of the heavenly emperor, Xing Caijian!","At this moment, she held the same ancient sword and stood in the square alone. With how cold she was, she did not try to approach anyone.","Apart from Jian Chen, there was no other person here that knew the ancient sword in her arms was the sovereign god artifact of the Heavenly Star Palace, the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star!","“Fellow Caijian, would you like to travel with us? That way, we can watch each others’ backs along the way...”","“Fellow Caijian, we sincerely invite you to join as. As long as you’re with us, you won’t have to do anything at all along the way. You can leave everything else to us...”","“Fellow Caijian, we’re willing to serve you like horses and completely follow your arrangements for the rest of the trip in the Skyscraping World.”","Xing Caijian and her extraordinary status obviously pulled her into the centre of attention. Even when she appeared extremely cold, there were still many people who approached her enthusiastically in an attempt to befriend her.","Xing Caijian ignored these people. Even when they were Immortal Exalts, she treated them as if they did not exist.","From beginning to end, apart from the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster and Jian Chen, she did not converse with another person.","“Fellow Tan Yu, we part here.” Jian Chen clasped his fist towards Immortal Exalt Tan Yu, bidding his final farewell.","“Brother Yutian, I won’t be able to help you with what comes next. Take good care of yourself!” Immortal Exalt Tan Yu clasped his fist towards Jian Chen sternly. He knew that Jian Chen was not on the same level as him. They had travelled together for all this time because of the Skyscraping Sword Scripture. Now that their goals had been accomplished, perhaps it was time for them to part.","By now, some people had already left the square with their companions. Jian Chen did not hesitate either. He found his bearings and was prepared to leave as well.","However, right when he was about to leave the square, there was a sudden flash before his eyes, and a slender figure appeared right in front of him, blocking his path.","She was the daughter of the heavenly emperor, Xing Caijian!","“You want to roam this place alone? With your measly strength at the Sixth Heavenly Layer, travelling alone here is fraught with grim possibilities.” Xing Caijian’s eyes were devoid of emotion as she stared straight at Jian Chen.","When he heard that, Jian Chen was surprised, but he soon smiled and clasped his fist. “Thank you for your concern, fellow Caijian. I will be careful with my own safety.”","“With your strength, it’s useless no matter how careful you are. Once you catch the attention of some stronger Immortal Exalts, you’ll be doomed in the end even if you think your strength is extraordinary.” Xing Caijian’s expression did not change at all. After reaching there, she paused and pondered for a moment before continuing, “You’ve entered here for a seed of ways left behind by the sword venerable, right?”","“That’s correct!” Jian Chen did not deny that.","“Travel together with me then. I will do everything that I can to obtain a seed of ways for you,” Xing Caijian said very naturally. Despite knowing that the contention for the seed of ways usually involved a battlefield of Immortal Exalts, there was absolutely no fear in her at all.","Jian Chen did not doubt that Xing Caijian possessed this strength. After all, between her arms was the sovereign god artifact of the Heavenly Star Palace, the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star.","The Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star was different from the Azulet swords. The twin swords were still in a weakened state, while the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star was in peak condition.","Xing Caijian was protected by the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star. As a result, even if she did nothing, the sovereign god artifact alone could butcher a swathe of Immortal Exalts.","However, Jian Chen was extremely surprised over how Xing Caijian was willing to assist him like this.","“You want to help me obtain a seed of ways? You don’t need it?” Jian Chen asked in complete surprise.","Xing Caijian’s expression did not change at all. She said emotionlessly, “I haven’t come here for the seed of ways.”","“Then why do you want to help me? After all, a group of Immortal Exalts will definitely be fighting over the seed of ways. This is a thankless task for you,” said Jian Chen.","“You should know why I’m trying to help you. There are some secrets that you can’t hide from me, just like how you also know some of my secrets.” Xing Caijian looked at Jian Chen.","Their conversation had already drawn over the attention of many Immortal Exalts in the surroundings. After all, Xing Caijian was the daughter of a heavenly emperor. In terms of status, she was without a doubt the loftiest person in the Skyscraping World, so lofty that even the Immortal Exalt ancestors of many peak organisations hoped to forge a tie with her.","As a result, everything she did would draw the attention of many experts.","However, her conversation with Jian Chen left everyone puzzled. It left them guessing.","Only Jian Chen understood what Xing Caijian was referring to. She was talking about the twin swords and the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star.","“Thank you for your kind intentions, fellow, but I’m accustomed to moving alone. I don’t like to travel with others. Farewell!” Jian Chen turned down Xing Caijian’s suggestion without any hesitation.","Xing Caijian possessed the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star, so she would indeed be a great source of help. However, travelling with her would also bring Jian Chen a great deal of inconvenience.","With that, Jian Chen left the huge square alone. He vanished into the thick mist very soon. He left with great determination.","Xing Caijian stood where she was and stared in the direction that Jian Chen had vanished off dazedly. She did not become irritated or angered. From beginning to end, her slightly cold eyes did not show any emotion at all, without a single ripple to be seen.","Several seconds later, Xing Caijian looked away. As if nothing had happened, she left in another direction, vanishing instantly.","There were still some Immortal Exalts present in the square adorned with white jade tiles. They witnessed the entire conversation between Jian Chen and Xing Caijian. Some of the Immortal Exalts had already locked onto the direction that Jian Chen had left in as their eyes flickered with colours."]},{"number":3840,"title":"Chapter 3840: Under Attention","paragraphs":["“ What are the origins of this junior who’s only an Immortal Emperor? He actually has the daughter of the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor caring so much about him, even willing to help him obtain the seed of ways at the risk of opposing a group of Immortal Exalts... ” Zuo Dao from the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens did not leave in a hurry. He also looked in the direction that Jian Chen had vanished; he felt very curious.","“ The judgment of the daughter of a heavenly emperor is anything but ordinary. From how special she treats the independent cultivator, it can only mean that he is nowhere as simple as he seems. Looks like I should follow along and take a look. If it’s possible, I would like to use this opportunity to befriend him. ” With that, Zuo Dao immediately left with his juniors from the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens, leaving in the same direction as Jian Chen.","“ Fellow Scarlet Fire, are you certain this person called Yang Yutian is an independent cultivator? Why does the daughter of the heavenly emperor, Xing Caijian, pay such close attention to him? ” To another side, one of the five ancestors of the Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights, the Profound Spirit Master, communicated to the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt beside him.","The Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt of the Yi Immortal City did not originally possess a spot to enter the Skyscraping World. The only two spots he possessed had been purchased at great costs and were given to his first son Chi Yutian and his seventh son Chi Yun.","However, due to the fantastic relationship between his seventh son Chi Yun and the grandson of the Profound Spirit Master, the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt had benefited. With the Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights personally attending to the matter, he successfully exchanged for a spot in the outskirts of the Skyscraping World, which was gifted to the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt.","As a result, the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt who downright had no plans on entering the Skyscraping World in the first place was fortunate enough to go with them.","“ Fellow Profound Spirit, you heard the conversation between Xing Caijian and Yang Yutian as well. All I am certain about is that Xing Caijian does not know Yang Yutian, but she’s willing to go out of her way to assist him. As a result, I feel more and more certain that this Yang Yutian might be hiding some great secret, ” said the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt. Right now, he felt both fearful and resentful of Yang Yutian whose origins were unknown.","He was fearful of how he had managed to kill the two Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts, the Wukun Master and the Void-perceiving Ancestor, through unknown methods.","Even the Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, the Space-purging Ancestor, had perished by his hands.","Just who on the Hall Brilliance Heaven did not fear such powers? Just who did not experience chills down their spine?","He was resentful over the fact that Jian Chen’s appearance had disrupted his plan. The two spots that were entirely within his arm’s reach were lost, forcing him to obtain these spots through other avenues at great costs.","“ Some great secret? Exactly what kind of secret can pique the interest of the daughter of a heavenly emperor like this? ” After hearing the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt’s thought, the Profound Spirit Master was intrigued.","He silently looked in the direction that Jian Chen had left in before saying slowly, “Fellow Scarlet Fire, fellow Black Wind, are you interested in checking out this independent cultivator called Yang Yutian?”","The Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt smiled and said, “My ticket into the Skyscraping World was provided by you, fellow Profound Spirit, so I’ll follow any of your plans.”","The Profound Spirit Master smiled and said amicably, “Fellow Scarlet Fire, once our trip in the Skyscraping World concludes, you are welcome to visit our Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights at any moment. I’ll receive you personally.”","The Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt was overjoyed. He clasped his fist and thanked him in a hurry. If he managed to forge a tie with the Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights, the Yi Immortal City’s status would rise significantly on the Hall Brilliance Heaven despite being located on a different heaven.","At the very least, if peak organisations on the Hall Brilliance Heaven wanted to go after his Yi Immortal City, they would have to reconsider.","The person regarded as fellow Black Wind was an old man in black robes. He was a Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt.","Under the Profound Spirit Master’s invitation, the Black Wind Immortal Exalt did not decline. He nodded slowly.","Afterwards, the Black Wind Immortal Exalt, the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt, and the Profound Spirit Master allowed their disciples to go and find their own fortunes, while the three Immortal Exalts traveled together and tailed behind Jian Chen.","However, before long, they encountered a familiar figure.","Zuo Dao of the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens!","“Have you also come for Yang Yutian?” Zuo Dao looked at the three of them and said calmly.","The Profound Spirit Master nodded and said, “Fellow Zuo Dao, don’t tell me you’ve also become interested in him?”","Zuo Dao seemed to notice something. He smiled gently. “I’m afraid that my objective might be a little different from yours. I purely think Yang Yutian is an extraordinary person, so I’ve specially come in hopes of befriending him.”","“Fellow Zuo Dao, don’t tell me you failed to catch up to him?” the Profound Spirit Master looked around and said in surprise.","Zuo Dao nodded and sighed gently. “Yang Yutian might only be an Immortal Emperor, but his methods are extraordinary. I chased up to here before completely losing track of him. I have no idea where to find him anymore.”","When he heard that, the Profound Spirit Master narrowed his eyes with some disappointment.","Nearby, Jian Chen wore the Divine Armour of Heavenflight as he blended into the empty space around him silently, watching this.","When he looked at the Profound Spirit Master, an obscure hint of killing intent flashed through his eyes.","“Fellow Zuo Dao, Yang Yutian is probably hiding some great secret. Aren’t you interested at all?” the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt asked.","“I’m obviously aware that he has his secrets, or why would the daughter of a heavenly emperor treat him like that? However, I’ve already said that my interest in Yang Yutian is perhaps different from why you’re interested in him,” Zuo Dao said gently. After saying that, he departed from there, making his way off with the disciples of the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens.","After Zuo Dao had left, the Profound Spirit Master closed his eyes slowly. He used a secret technique to sense around carefully in an attempt to find any clues.","But very soon, he opened his eyes. He glanced around at the mist in the surroundings and said, “I can’t find any traces of him anymore. Yang Yutian’s presence completely vanished here. However, since he’s come for the seed of ways, he’ll make his way to the peak sooner or later.”","“C’mon, let’s wait in a place where he must pass by to reach the peak. It’ll take him tremendous effort to reach there with his strength as an Immortal Emperor, so it’ll be impossible for him to reach there before us.”","With that, the Profound Spirit Master left with the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt and the Black Wind Immortal Exalt.","Afterwards, a few more Immortal Exalts arrived, also having followed Jian Chen’s presence. After finding nothing, they all dispersed.","When no more people appeared, JIan Chen silently appeared inside the thick mist. His presence was entirely erased by the mask from the Illusionary Daemon race. He seemed to have become a part of it. At first glance, it was difficult to discover him.","He looked in the direction that the Profound Spirit Master had left in as his eyes gradually turned cold. He murmured softly, “I didn’t expect Xing Caijian’s actions to put me under the attention of so many people, with even some people prepared to wait for me on the path to the peak.”"]},{"number":3841,"title":"Chapter 3841: Tablet of the Way of the Sword","paragraphs":["“ Xing Caijian wanted to assist me out of good intentions, but she’s also exposed me in front of so many people prematurely. ” Jian Chen sighed inside. Originally, he wanted to move around discreetly in the Skyscraping World, trying his best to not raise the attention of others. That way, it could save him a lot of premature trouble.","But that had done it now. He had become the centre of attention the moment he entered the Skyscraping World, and some Immortal Exalts had begun harbouring ill intentions towards him already.","He feared none of the threats here, but if he could make it to the very end in an easier manner, why go through all of this trouble?","The mask from the Illusionary Daemon race could alter his appearance, but only around three hundred people had entered the Skyscraping World. They were all familiar with one another. If an unfamiliar face appeared, that would not be good.","“ Oh well, what can I do? Since some of these troubles will be unavoidable, I’ll just have to deal with them as they come. ” Jian Chen was calm. He continued to use the Divine Armour of Heavenflight and the mask from the Illusionary Daemon race to cover his tracks, moving along at a speed that could be regarded as extremely slow for an Immortal Emperor.","He was forced to travel like this. The Skyscraping World was riddled with formations. These powerful formations possessed the ability to suppress the senses of the soul. Even Immortal Exalts could only expand the senses of their souls to one hundred kilometres away.","Moreover, the entire world was shaped like a planet-sized mountain. The paths meandered with many boulders and obstacles. As a result, visibility was extremely limited as well. If he moved too quickly, it was very easy to have collisions.","In the outside world, even Immortal Emperors and Immortal Monarchs, let alone Immortal Exalts, could see extremely far into the distance. They could look past all obstacles to a certain extent.","But here, everyone lost this ability, having all been suppressed by the formations.","“ I’m really not used to this place. The senses of my soul have basically been rendered useless. Sometimes, I can’t even sense as far as I can see. ” Jian Chen remained thirty metres above the ground as he flew through the air.","Beneath his feet was a mountain path covered by lush vegetation, which pulsed with the power of formations.","Apart from the plants that grew later, many of the objects here could not be destroyed.","The path had not been created as a result of activity, but specially created by the Skyscraping Sword Venerable when designing this place. It also served as a part of the formations like its vessel, unable to be altered or destroyed.","As a result, even when the Skyscraping World had already been opened several times, none of the intense battles that occurred here managed to alter the terrain.","Only Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts could achieve such a feat.","Jian Chen was not in a hurry to scale the mountain. The seed of ways would only appear at the highest peak, but he would have to wait until the final moments before it appeared. If he went there too early, he would have to sit around and wait, wasting this precious time.","The Skyscraping Sword Venerable had left behind a large number of markings of the Way of the Sword in the Skyscraping World. As an expert of the Way of the Sword, he obviously had to explore the place and check out the precious wealth that the Skyscraping Sword Venerable had left behind in the past.","However, this place was far too large. He remained at a low altitude for a very long time and never ran into anyone.","At this moment, as Jian Chen passed by a valley, he suddenly narrowed his eyes and subconsciously turned towards the depths of the valley.","All he saw was a nine-metre-tall stone tablet standing alone at the end of the lush valley.","The stone tablet was extremely ordinary. It seemed like a regular boulder, except it was engraved with a sword-shaped symbol.","When Jian Chen’s gaze landed on the symbol, a rumble erupted in his mind. He felt sword Qi fill his face, seeming as vast as the ocean and unending. It stunned Jian Chen’s soul with a terrifying pressure of domination. Ȑ","“ Is this an imprint of the Way of the Sword that the Skyscraping Sword Venerable left here? ” Jian Chen immediately became excited. He looked at the tablet inside the valley with burning interest.","He could sense secrets of the Way of the Sword completely beyond his reach from the stone tablet.","Without any hesitation, he arrived before the stone tablet. He shut his eyes and carefully sensed the mysteries of the Way of the Sword on the tablet.","Immediately, wisps of sword Qi condensed around Jian Chen. The laws revolved around him, manifesting according to some kind of pattern.","He was comprehending the mysteries of the Way of the Sword inside the tablet.","However, the comprehension this time did not last very long. In just seven days, Jian Chen opened his eyes and smiled gently.","The seven days were short, but they granted Jian Chen a new understanding of the Way of the Sword.","“ The Skyscraping Sword Venerable truly is a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. His understanding of the Way of the Sword has already reached a level beyond my imaginations. Just the imprint he’s left behind casually has allowed me to benefit significantly. ”","“ But with my current realm of cultivation, the mysteries of the Way of the Sword that can only be regarded as a stream from the stone tablet is nowhere near enough for me to break through. ” Jian Chen murmured. Shortly afterwards, he entered the Primeval Divine Hall with the senses of his soul and arrived where Jing Mumu cultivated in seclusion.","At this moment, Jing Mumu sat on a rock with her eyes shut. She seemed to be cultivating.","However, Jian Chen could tell with a single glance that she was not cultivating. She had only shut her eyes as if she was thinking about something.","“The peak of Golden Immortal, only a step away from Daluo Golden Immortal. Mumu, looks like you’ve already successfully inherited the Nine Limits Saint’s legacy. Otherwise, your strength would have never increased so much in such a short amount of time,” Jian Chen looked at Jing Mumu with a smile. His face was filled with gladness.","As Jian Chen’s voice rang out, Jing Mumu opened her eyes. Her bright eyes were filled with surprise and delight as she said in joy, “Master, you’ve finally come to visit me.”","As she said that, Jing Mumu stood up from the rock and arrived by Jian Chen’s side in a single step. She grabbed his arm intimately and opened her mouth, wanting to say something, but she soon furrowed her brows. Her delicate face turned bright red as if she was conflicted.","“What’s wrong, Mumu?” Jian Chen looked at Jing Mumu in a strange manner.","Jing Mumu’s cheeks puffed up as if she was choking on something. Only after a good while did she recover. Afterwards, she looked at Jian Chen helplessly and said, “Master, I originally wanted to share some of the Nine Limits Saint’s legacy with you, b-b-but as soon as the words reach my mouth, I just can’t say it.”","Jian Chen smiled. “This is your fortune. There’s no need for you to tell me, and you don’t have to try again in the future. If you forcefully divulge it, there might be some kind of backlash.”","Reaching there, Jian Chen continued, “Mumu, you’ve obtained a great legacy, but experience trumps knowledge. I just happen to have encountered something outside today, which you can take a look at.”","Jian Chen brought Jing Mumu out of the Primeval Divine Hall. She appeared before the stone tablet.","Immediately, Jing Mumu shuddered, clearly having been drawn away by the imprint of the Way of the Sword on the tablet.","“Master, i-is this the Laws of the Sword?” Jing Mumu asked in surprise.","“That’s right, this is an imprint of the Way of the Sword previously left behind by the Skyscraping Sword Venerable. However, this marking was clearly left behind very casually by the Skyscraping Sword Venerable. It touches on deep things, but it’s still limited. You can try comprehending it,” Jian Chen said."]},{"number":3842,"title":"Chapter 3842: Enemies","paragraphs":["Jing Mumu immediately smiled resplendently. She said happily, “Master, I’ve obtained the Nine Limits Saint’s legacy, but I can only accept a part of the legacy due to my limited strength. I’m still unable to obtain the deeper knowledge.”","“Most of the legacy consists of the Nine Limits Saint’s cultivation experience and comprehension, as well as some cultivation methods and secret techniques. The comprehension of the Way of the Sword on the stone tablet here is exactly what I lack right now.”","Jing Mumu glanced past the stone tablet as her eyes burned with interest. “Master, if I can comprehend the Laws of the Sword on the stone tablet, my strength will definitely reach a whole new level.”","Jian Chen nodded and said, “There are many legacies of the Way of the Sword left behind by the Skyscraping Sword Venerable here. There is definitely much more than just one stone tablet. Dear disciple, you’ll move around alone for now. How much you can benefit will be entirely up to you.”","“Remember, not a lot of people have entered here, but there are many peak experts. Only move around at the base of the mountain. It’s best if you don’t ascend past its waist. Do you understand?”","“As you wish, master.” Jing Mumu obeyed.","Jian Chen slowly raised his arm. From inside his wide sleeves, a tiny green vine quietly slid out.","“Little Grass!” Jing Mumu’s eyes lit up as she cried out.","The green vine was the Immortal Devouring Orchid that had stowed away in the Primeval Divine Hall.","The Immortal Devouring Orchid left Jian Chen’s wrist and appeared on Jing Mumu like it had teleported. Then it wrapped around her wrist like a bracelet.","“The Immortal Devouring Orchid will stay by your side during the time you are in the Skyscraping World. That way, I can worry a little less. After all, all of the people here are beyond what you can handle.” As he said that, Jian Chen looked at the Immortal Devouring Orchid and sighed inside.","The Immortal Devouring Orchid grew far too quickly. The last time he saw it, it had already reached the peak of the First Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt. It was already close to breaking through to the Second Heavenly Layer.","The Immortal Devouring Orchid’s strength grew much more slowly after reaching Immortal Exalt.","However, even with this slower pace, its growth rate still left him speechless.","Apart from those supreme experts who had reincarnated and awakened their memories, probably no one across the six worlds could rival the Immortal Devouring Orchid.","After issuing these simple instructions, Jian Chen left Jing Mumu and departed alone.","The Immortal Devouring Orchid also concealed its presence, hiding on Jing Mumu quietly.","It also understood that it was a stowaway, so it tried its best to avoid the detection of others.","Jian Chen travelled through the Skyscraping World alone. He did not move quickly, stopping and going from time to time. He carefully sensed every region he passed by, observing carefully.","That was because sometimes, the senses of the soul were even beneath the naked eye here. He needed to check visually often, just in case he missed out on anything.","Finally, after three days, Jian Chen found a second stone tablet on a boulder. These were no imprint of a sword, just the traces left behind by a strand of sword Qi.","The traces shone with blinding light from inside as if they contained endless sword intent. When Jian Chen looked over, he even felt his eyes prick as if the sword Qi was thrusting into his soul, shaking it up and leaving it extremely unstable.","Jian Chen shut his eyes in a hurry and sat down in the air, carefully and cautiously sensing the invisible sword intent that filled the air.","However, right when he was about to comprehend it, his expression suddenly changed. He snapped open his eyes. In the next moment, he silently vanished, without leaving any trace or presence behind.","Several seconds later, two figures appeared. They were both middle-aged men, giving off the presence of Immortal Emperors.","One of them was a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor, while the other was an Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor.","“There was a disturbance just now as if someone was here,” the Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor glanced around and said quietly.","“Perhaps it’s activity from the stone tablet. The sword intent it contains is too powerful. Even I can’t get too close to it,” said the Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor. He looked at the stone tablet sternly.","Jian Chen’s eyes turned cold as he concealed himself with the Divine Armour of Heavenflight. He recognised the two Immortal Emperors. He did not know their names, but he did know that they were from the Wind clan, a peak organisation on the Fierce Gales Heaven.","The Wind clan had sent three people this time. The strongest was a First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt ancestor, while the two here were the late Immortal Emperor great elders.","“ I didn’t think I’d encounter people from the Wind clan so soon. ” Killing intent surged inside Jian Chen. The Wind clan was one of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens’ enemies. Following the war, one of the three remaining Immortal Exalt ancestors of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens had died by the hand of the Mistress of Contrary Winds of the Wind clan.","For several million years after that, the Mistress of Contrary Winds never turned her attention away from the declining Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. Even when she did not have the courage to move against the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens openly, she secretly controlled the Sword Sect of Startling Thunder to constantly oppress the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens.","It was as if the Mistress of Contrary Winds refused to stop until the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens had been annihilated.","At this moment, the Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor from the Wind clan took out a compass. He looked at it and said, “The Divine Fruit of Yin Gales that the ancestor planted in here should be nearby. We better hurry over to it.”","“There’s no rush. We both grasp the Laws of the Sword. Although the ancestor sent us into the Skyscraping World, it is not simply to harvest the Divine Fruit of Yin Gales. We’ve also been presented with an opportunity to find our own fortunes. Now that we’ve encountered one of the fortunes that the Skyscraping Sword Venerable left behind after so much difficulty, we obviously have to comprehend it,” the Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor said.","“Fair enough. The Skyscraping World has only just opened, so we have abundant time. Let’s stay here and comprehend it for some time.” The other Immortal Emperor nodded.","Shortly afterwards, the two great elders from the Wind clan set up a simple formation before sitting down in the air and comprehending the Laws of the Sword here.","“ Divine Fruit of Yin Gales? Now that is something good. It’s said that in order to grow this fruit, not only are there extremely stringent requirements on the environment, but the resources it consumes when growing is startling as well. If it ripens completely, it is a high grade God Tier heavenly resource. Even among all high grade God Tier heavenly resources, the Laws of Wind it contains ranks towards the top. It is priceless. ”","“ The Divine Fruit of Yin Gales seems to have been planted in the Skyscraping World many years ago by an ancestor of the Wind clan. Since they’ve sent someone to harvest it now, it must be completely ripe. ”","Jian Chen’s eyes flickered. He stowed the Heaven-lifting sword away and smiled mysteriously. Then he backed away a certain distance without any trace, waiting patiently nearby."]},{"number":3843,"title":"Chapter 3843: Medicinal Gardens in the Skyscraping World","paragraphs":["By now, the two great elders from the Wind clan had already become submerged in comprehending the Laws of the Sword inside the formation. Dazzling light radiated from them, producing a resplendent haze in the region that was covered in dense fog.","The two of them had grasped the Laws of the Sword, but it clearly was not their main focus of cultivation. Only one of them had barely reached Immortal Emperor with the Laws of the Sword.","The other person’s Laws of the Sword was still at the level of an Immortal Monarch.","The two of them were completely unaware that a pair of eyes, filled with cold killing intent, lurked silently in the shadows, constantly observing their movements.","“ I’ll let the two of you live for a few days longer. ” In the shadows, Jian Chen sneered under the disguise of the Divine Armour of Heavenflight and the mask from the Illusionary Daemon race. The arrival of these two Immortal Emperors had forced to give up on comprehending the imprint here.","The Skyscraping Sword Venerable had left behind many imprints of the Way of the Sword in the Skyscraping World, but the content the imprints contained was limited. As a result, any expert who had reached Immortal Emperor could browse through all of the secrets they contained without a lot of time.","Of course, that was only browsing through. Whether they could comprehend the secrets and how much they got out of it was entirely up to their talent and fortunes.","Jian Chen waited patiently for several days before the two Immortal Emperors from the Wind clan finally roused from cultivation. They smiled gently as if they were extremely satisfied with the comprehension this time.","“The comprehension this time has already allowed my Laws of the Sword to touch on the boundary of the Ninth Heavenly Layer of Immortal Monarch. If I can comprehend a few more imprints left behind by the Skyscraping Sword Venerable, my Laws of the Sword will definitely reach the Ninth Heavenly Layer,” said the Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor great elder. The Laws of the Sword was the second way he comprehended, which currently resided at the peak of the Seventh Heavenly Layer of Immortal Monarch.","“Don’t worry, you’ll get the chance. Hopefully, this visit to the Skyscraping World will let your Laws of the Sword reach Immortal Emperor as well,” the Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor said.","The Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor nodded. There was anticipation in his eyes. “My Laws of Wind have halted at the Seventh Heavenly Layer of Immortal Emperor without advancing. Without sufficient opportunities and good fortune, who knows if I can reach the Eighth Heavenly Layer in my lifetime. Under these circumstances, I can only pursue a second law. Hopefully, I can make it further with the Laws of the Sword.”","“In the history of the Immortals’ World, there have been many dazzling figures who became stuck at a certain bottleneck when comprehending their first law, but when they began comprehending their second or even third law, it was like their fates had been changed. Various opportunities and good fortune came to them one after another, allowing them to become a renowned figure in the end. Since it’s already been almost a million years since you’ve made a breakthrough with your Laws of Wind, why don’t you focus on the Laws of the Sword instead...” the Eighth Heavenly Layer great elder said before removing the formation in the surroundings. He took out the compass and regained his bearings before leaving the place.","Jian Chen hid in the shadows and silently stalked the two of them.","The mountain path beneath them had already become blocked by lush vegetation. All three of them travelled by levitating a few metres in the air, constantly changing directions and avoiding various obstacles in the process.","The Skyscraping World was covered with formations. Not only did it suppress the senses of the soul, but it even locked out the sky. Even Immortal Exalts could not fly higher than three hundred metres, or they would be overwhelmed by the terrifying force of a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt.","As a result, they were forced to follow the rules and travel the correct path to scale the Skyscraping World.","Neither of the Immortal Emperors from the Wind clan were climbing the mountain. Instead, they remained at the foot of the mountain. When they passed by a flatter region, a dazzling haze entered their view.","Several dozen kilometres away from them, a huge formation a hundred kilometres across stood within the dense mist.","As the formation operated, it gave off a powerful pressure. The spiritual Qi in the surroundings was constantly being absorbed by the formation to maintain itself. ŘÃƝòβÈs̩","The people from the Wind clan’s eyes lit up. They changed directions, arriving before the huge formation with a few flashes.","Through the barrier, they could see various heavenly resources being nurtured inside. Each heavenly resource shone with multi-coloured, hazy light. They were gorgeous and resplendent, all at God Tier.","“This should be a medicinal garden set up by a peak organisation, borrowing the tremendous amounts of spiritual Qi from the Skyscraping World to grow these heavenly resources,” one of the Immortal Emperors murmured as his eyes burned with fervour.","There were a total of five hundred God Tier heavenly resources planted in the medicinal garden. The high grade God Tier heavenly resources occupied ten percent of the area. Let alone Immortal Emperors, even Immortal Exalts would be tempted by this sight.","“The formation is too powerful. Probably even some mid Immortal Exalts won’t be able to destroy it.” The Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor sighed in amazement. He glanced around the medicinal garden before quickly discovering a stone tablet. The stone tablet had four words inscribed on it, the Heavenly Sect of Linlang. It was like a work of nature, giving off the charms of the ways.","The four words alone gave off a chilling pressure. Even Immortal Emperors could not help but shudder inside.","“The Heavenly Sect of Linlang... This medicinal garden actually belongs to the Heavenly Sect of Linlang,” one of the great elders murmured as he became stern.","The Heavenly Sect of Linlang was a peak organisation no weaker than their Wind clan.","Although their strongest expert was also a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, at the same cultivation as the Mistress of Contrary Winds, the Heavenly Sect of Linlang had more Immortal Exalt ancestors than the Wind clan.","“How extravagant of the Heavenly Sect of Linlang. They’ve actually set up such a large medicinal garden in the Skyscraping World,” the Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor could not help but say in amazement. His tone contained some jealousy.","Their Wind clan also had a medicinal garden in the Skyscraping World, but it was nothing compared to the Heavenly Sect of Linglang’s.","“What’s there to be jealous about? Once our Mistress of Contrary Winds breaks through and reaches the Seventh Heavenly Layer, what will the Heavenly Sect of Linlang be compared to our Wind clan? C’mon, let’s complete the mission that the ancestor gave us first.”","The two Immortal Emperors continued on their way.","Soon after they had left, Jian Chen also arrived in front of the medicinal garden from the Heavenly Sect of Linlang, still concealed. He stared at the five hundred God Tier heavenly resources growing inside for a while and memorised the location before catching up to the two Immortal Emperors from the Wind clan.","Jian Chen tailed behind them. Several days later, they finally stopped in front of a medicinal garden of a smaller scale.","The medicinal garden was also enveloped in a powerful protective formation, relying on the spiritual Qi of the Skyscraping World to maintain itself. There were around thirty God Tier heavenly resources scattered inside.","On one side of the medicinal garden, there was also a stone tablet with the words “Wind clan” carved on it.","But compared to the Heavenly Sect of Linlang’s medicinal garden, the Wind clan’s medicinal garden seemed quite lacklustre."]},{"number":3844,"title":"Chapter 3844: Assassination","paragraphs":["“ That’s the Divine Fruit of Yin Gales. ” Jian Chen looked at the centre of the medicinal garden. Through the thick mist, he could vaguely make out a fruit gently swaying about. It was the size of a human head and gave off a rather enchanting hazy azure glow.","The thick spiritual Qi around the Divine Fruit of Yin Gales had already formed a small swirl as it was rapidly absorbed.","The Divine Fruit of Yin Gales absorbed spiritual Qi two or three times faster than other high grade God Tier fruits.","“ The Divine Fruit of Yin Gales has a similar effect to the Fruit of Nurturing Ways. They both contain the laws and are precious treasures that can assist people in comprehending the laws. The greatest difference between the two is that the Fruit of Nurturing Ways is elementless, so it has a wondrous effect on all experts. All three thousand ways can be comprehended through it. Meanwhile, the Divine Fruit of Yin Gales only contains the Laws of Wind. Its effects fall slightly below the Fruit of Nurturing Ways, ” Jian Chen thought. In terms of value, the Divine Fruit of Yin Gales was obviously beneath the Fruit of Nurturing Ways, but it still far surpassed many other heavenly resources.","Apart from the Divine Fruit of Yin Gales, the other several dozen God Tier heavenly resources in the medicinal garden managed by the Wind clan did not interest Jian Chen.","The difference compared to the Heavenly Sect of Linlang’s medicinal garden was far too great.","Jian Chen glanced past the protective formation around the Wind clan’s medicinal garden and gradually frowned. He could clearly sense that the Wind clan’s formation possessed even greater defensive power than the Heavenly Sect of Linlang’s formation.","Moreover, there was more than a single defensive formation. There was also a terrifying killing formation, so it was capable of both offence and defence.","“ These formations have all been engraved on formation discs before being assembled together. Let alone everything else, just the value of these formation discs are extravagant. Even the main formations of many peak organisations in the Immortals’ World aren’t as powerful as the formation around the medicinal garden. ”","“ As a result, it’s extremely likely that this formation comes from the Mistress of Contrary Winds. ”","“ Don’t tell me the Mistress of Contrary Winds ordered people to plant the Divine Fruit of Yin Gales here? ” Thinking up to this point, Jian Chen’s eyes lit up. He could vaguely guess that the Divine Fruit of Yin Gales was probably even more important than he had imagined to the Mistress of Contrary Winds.","Otherwise, why would there be such powerful formations here?","The value of the formations alone had far surpassed the heavenly resources planted here.","However, the Divine Fruit of Yin Gales was extremely rare in the Immortals’ World. Often, there were no sellers at all. It was not something that could be obtained through sale. The higher the quality, the rarer it was, so they could only grow it themselves.","“ Sure enough, the Divine Fruit of Yin Gales has completely ripened. ” The two great elders of the Wind clan smiled gently. Afterwards, the Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor took out a tablet. He formed a series of seals and began activating the tablet through a secret technique, planning on entering the medicinal garden.","“Hold on. It’s best if we are careful!” the Seventh Heavenly Layer great elder called out. Alertness filled his eyes.","“You don’t have to worry. Who doesn’t know that the Divine Fruit of Yin Gales was planted here by the Mistress of Contrary Winds? Who would risk offending the Mistress of Contrary Winds just to steal a Divine Fruit of Yin Gales?” The Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor disagreed. The Divine Fruit of Yin Gales was worth a substantial amount, but who it belonged to also played a role.","“You can’t go wrong with being more careful,” said the Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor. He opened his hand slowly. A thumb-sized bead hovered in his hand. As he closed his hand violently, the bead shattered from the great force.","The moment the bead shattered, Laws of Wind that possessed the pressure of an Immortal Exalt expanded out, sweeping through the surroundings as a visible wave. Wherever it passed by, the space rippled as if it was trying to force out everything hidden in the surrounding space.","Jian Chen did not know if the Divine Armour of Heavenflight would be affected, but he backed away silently and hid behind a boulder several dozen kilometres away as a precaution.","When the laws that bore the pressure of an Immortal Exalt came into contact with the boulder, it did not manage to pierce it. It was blocked by the rock.","In the end, the power of laws reached several hundred kilometres away before slowly dissipating.","There was no offensive power behind it. It was merely a trick to prevent others from secretly following them.","“Looks like no one has been tailing us... Yeah, we can open the formation.” The Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor finally stopped worrying.","Shortly afterwards, they took out a tablet and formed a series of hand seals, sending imprints into the tablet. In response, the tablet lit up brightly. A resplendent streak of light emerged from the tablet, directly landing on the protective formation before them.","An entrance silently opened up in the formations capable of offence and defence. The two Immortal Emperors from the Wind clan entered directly.","The entrance immediately closed after they entered.","Jian Chen did not follow them into the formations. Instead, he silently lurked outside, carefully observing the two Immortal Emperors inside.","The two great elders did not pick any other heavenly resources. Instead, they made their way to the centre of the medicinal garden and took out a jade box, carefully picking the Divine Fruit of Yin Gales and placing it inside.","After harvesting the Divine Fruit of Yin Gales, they counted the other heavenly resources growing in the medicinal garden, recording their growth. Afterwards, they took out some tools from their Space Rings and got to work, applying fertilizer and plowing the ground, planting over two hundred heavenly resources one by one.","“When the Skyscraping World opens the next time, these heavenly resources should have all evolved,” the Eighth Heavenly Layer great elder said with a smile as he looked at the seeds they planted together.","“The Skyscraping World sure is a land of treasure. The various organisations have planted so many heavenly resources here. Just the amount of spiritual Qi consumed with each passing year is beyond imagination, yet the Skyscraping World can still maintain itself. If we can claim this entire place for ourselves, just how great would it be?” The Seventh Heavenly Layer great elder sighed in amazement.","“Isn’t that all just because the Skyscraping Sword Venerable was far too wealthy? Otherwise, where else do you think this spiritual Qi comes from? It’s all the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s personal wealth. It’s said that the resources in the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s possession when he was still alive even left courts of heaven envious. C’mon, it’s time for us to leave. We better go and find our own fortunes during the remaining time.”","The two elders exited the protective formations through the same method. Right when the opening in the formation closed behind them, sword Qi erupted out of nowhere. A sword appeared from the empty space with blinding light, thrusting towards the eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor great elder with lightning speed.","When the sword emerged, the surrounding space seemed to change. The strike that was already alarmingly fast became even faster.","With a flash, the sharp tip of the sword arrived near the forehead of the Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor.","“Be careful!” the Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor beside him cried out. His face changed drastically. The eyes of the Eighth Heavenly Layer great elder under attack narrowed to the size of pin tips.","However, the attack was completely unexpected. Coupled with its speed, it was so fast that neither of them were able to respond.","Spurt!","In the next moment, the glowing sword pierced the Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor’s forehead without any obstruction with the pressure of a high quality god artifact."]},{"number":3845,"title":"Chapter 3845: The Cloaked Old Man","paragraphs":["At this moment, the god artifact that Jian Chen wielded was the high quality God Tier sword from the Wukun Master, the Heaven-lifting sword. Apart from the twin swords, it was the strongest sword Jian Chen had wielded so far. When the Heaven-lifting sword pierced the great elder’s forehead, a tremendous might filled his soul, instantly obliterating it.","In an instant, an Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor great elder of the Wind clan had perished, unable to fight back or put up a struggle.","Jian Chen’s battle prowess was already extraordinary. In the past, he was unrivalled among Immortal Emperors with only a medium quality God Tier sword. Now that he had switched his weapon to an even stronger high quality God Tier sword, it was overkill. His battle prowess skyrocketed.","Coupled with a surprise attack, killing an Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor was obviously a piece of cake. It was effortless.","Only the Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor remained, but he was frightened out of his wits. He gazed at the glowing Heaven-lifting sword that had pierced his companion’s head in shock. His eyes were slightly dazed and filled with fright.","Everything occurred far too quickly. In the blink of an eye, his stronger companion had perished. It had a tremendous impact on him.","“W-w-who are you?” the Seventh Heavenly Layer great elder asked subconsciously. His face was filled with fear as his voice trembled.","However, he seemed to realise that the situation was against him after saying that. Without any hesitation or any regards for his deceased companion, he turned around and fled desperately into the distance.","Someone who moved against a great elder of the Wind clan was without a doubt an enemy of the Wind clan. The great strength capable of instantly killing an Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor had also completely obliterated all thoughts of resisting.","The only option that lingered in the Seventh Heavenly Layer great elder’s mind was to flee from this place and reunite with the Immortal Exalt ancestor who entered the Skyscraping World.","However, despite his speed, he was as slow as a snail compared to Jian Chen who grasped the Laws of Space.","Jian Chen drew out the Heaven-lifting sword steadily and casually took a step like he was going on a stroll. In the next moment, he seemed to teleport silently in front of the fleeing Immortal Emperor.","The Seventh Heavenly Layer great elder’s expression changed drastically. He immediately stopped, almost directly running into Jian Chen. He looked at him fearfully and cried out frantically, “Fellow Yang Yutian, I am a great elder of the Wind clan. How has our Wind clan provoked you?”","“You don’t need to know that. All you need to know is that everyone from the Wind clan who entered the Skyscraping World can forget about leaving,” Jian Chen said emotionlessly. Killing intent surged in his eyes as the Heaven-lifting sword erupted with light, turning into a silvery-white streak that swept out.","The great elder from the Wind clan narrowed his eyes. In the blinding light, a medium quality god artifact armour covered his body. A curved blade appeared in his hand; the Laws of Wind revolved around it, slashing out like a bolt of lightning.","Ding!","The Heaven-lifting sword and the curved blade collided. With the crisp sound of colliding metal, the curved blade was cut into two. Then the Heaven-lifting sword continued onwards. The pressure of a high quality god artifact filled the surroundings, slashing towards the great elder’s chest with dazzling light.","It first made contact with the medium quality god artifact armour on the great elder, but the various defences from the armour seemed fragile before the Heaven-lifting sword. It tore through all of the defences like it was unstoppable, slashing the medium quality god artifact armour into two like it was a piece of paper.","Without the protection of the god artifact, the great elder from the Wind clan’s body was feeble. Along his chest, he was cut into two.","Ever since he wielded the Heaven-lifting sword, Jian Chen’s overall battle prowess had risen to an entirely new level. It became even easier for him to deal with Immortal Emperors.","Of course, there was another important reason. Jian Chen’s cultivation had not increased in any evident way, but his consolidation over the years did not come without benefits. In particular, after comprehending the imprint of the Way of the Sword left behind by the Skyscraping Sword Venerable in the Skyscraping World, his usage and grasp over the Way of the Sword even exceeded the past.","The Seventh Heavenly Layer great elder did not perish. His eyes were filled with deep fear, abandoning his body without any hesitation. A ball of blinding light, his soul, fled from his body.","This was the soul of a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor. It was extremely well-formed and firm, shining brightly like a star.","But in the next moment, a layer of invisible fire seemed to spring forth from his soul. At the cost of igniting his soul, he obtained unparalleled speed in an attempt to flee from this danger.","Swish! A streak of light shot over and struck his soul. His soul exploded, dissipating in the wind.","The second great elder from the Wind clan had also perished.","In less than five seconds, a Seventh Heavenly Layer and an Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor had perished like this in the Skyscraping World, unable to resist at all.","“It won’t be long before that Immortal Exalt ancestor of the Wind clan follows in your steps too.” Jian Chen looked at the corpses of the two Immortal Emperors indifferently. Shortly afterwards, he reached out, and their Space Rings immediately ended up in his hands.","He rummaged through the Space Rings before finding a precious jade box. He opened it up. Sure enough, the Divine Fruit of Yin Gales lay inside.","After pausing his gaze on the Divine Fruit of Yin Gales for a moment, Jian Chen’s lips gradually turned into a smile. He murmured, “Wind clan of the Fierce Gales Heaven, this... is only the beginning...”","At this moment, Jian Chen seemed to sense something and turned around.","In the thick mist, a dark figure quickly drifted over, radiating dimly with the might of an Immortal Exalt.","But very soon, the dark figure seemed to sense the abnormal situation here. After a pause, it suddenly accelerated, arriving several kilometres away from Jian Chen in a flash.","He was a person covered in a cloak. The presence he gave off had already reached the Third Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt.","Jian Chen was not unfamiliar with him. He was the cloaked old man who had ignored him in disdain.","“Hmm? It’s actually you?” the cloaked old man said in a hoarse voice as if he was slightly surprised. Shortly afterwards, he turned his gaze hidden within the great cloak towards the corpses of the two great elders from the Wind clan and said in surprise, “Yang Yutian, you killed these two? They’re from the Wind clan, and they possess great authority. Aren’t you worried about revenge from the Wind clan? The Mistress of Contrary Winds from the Wind clan is not someone to be trifled with.”"]},{"number":3846,"title":"Chapter 3846: An Immortal Exalt’s Threats","paragraphs":["“Then I won’t ask you to worry, senior,” Jian Chen said indifferently.","The cloaked old man was not bothered by Jian Chen’s attitude. He snickered and said, “ Yang Yutian, I have some doubts that I hope you could answer.” Reaching there, he paused for a split second, giving Jian Chen no chance to reply. He directly asked, “Who exactly are you? What is your background?”","Jian Chen furrowed his brows and said, “Didn’t I already tell everyone what my identity and background was? Why are you still asking this, senior?”","“You are an independent cultivator, yet you are able to kill two experts whose cultivations are higher than yours. You killed them consecutively as a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor, and you don’t even fear the threat of the Wind clan. In all the years I’ve lived, I’ve never seen an independent cultivator like you.” The cloaked old man chuckled.","“I’ve already said everything. Whether you believe it or not is not something that I should be concerned with,” Jian Chen said indifferently.","“Hehehehe, looks like my strength as a Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt still isn’t enough to pressure an Immortal Emperor junior like you. You don’t seem to hold any fear towards me at all. Yang Yutian, I really wonder what kind of trump card you have that allows you to remain so unfazed before me. After all, the Skyscraping World is an independent world, completely sealed off and isolated from the outside...”","“Whatever. If you refuse to divulge your identity and origins, I won’t make things difficult for you in this respect. However, I do have another doubt that I hope you could answer. Why does the treasured daughter of the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor, Xing Caijian, treat you differently?”","“Senior, do you really like to ask about people’s secrets that much? If someone else asked you to directly tell them all of your trump cards and secrets, what would you do?” Jian Chen said rather impatiently.","“That would depend on who they are. If someone like the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor personally came to ask me that, I’d obviously tell them everything truthfully,” the cloaked old man said extremely seriously. Clearly, he was not joking. Shortly afterwards, his eyes lit up brightly under his cloak like two beams of light shining out from underneath, directly landing on Jian Chen. “I’m nowhere close to a figure as lofty as the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor, but to you, Yang Yutian, I’m no different from the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor.”","“And as such, I should answer every single question you have for me? I’m supposed to tell you even my deepest secrets as long as you want to know?” Jian Chen laughed, looking at the cloaked old man like he was a joke.","“Yang Yutian, whether you’re a real or fake independent cultivator, you only have to understand one principle. In the Skyscraping World, even if you have some actual background, the people outside won’t be able to help you. With your strength as a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor, even if you can kill Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperors, you’re no different from an ant in my eyes. Those who know how to behave are clever. Offending me will bring you no benefit at all.”","The cloaked old man sneered slowly. “As a result, you best cooperate with me obediently. Tell me everything I want to know, without hiding anything.”","“And if I refuse?” Jian Chen smirked.","“Then I’m afraid I’ll have to capture you personally,” the cloaked old man said frigidly as cold killing intent radiated from him without disguise.","He was not a fool. Through the various signs, he had already realised that Jian Chen was hiding secrets, and these secrets were no different from a fortuitous encounter to others.","As a result, the cloaked old man had wanted to capture Jian Chen right from the beginning before turning him inside out and studying all of his secrets.","“You want to capture me? That would depend on whether you have the ability to or not.” Jian Chen sneered slightly. As soon as he said that, he activated the Divine Armour of Heavenflight and silently vanished.","The cloaked old man who was secretly building up power to seize Jian Chen with lightning speed was immediately taken aback. In the next moment, his powerful senses of the soul swept out, instantly enveloping a radius of a hundred kilometres, searching through every region closely.","At the same time, he raised his hand and pressed down gently towards Jian Chen’s earlier location. A great force appeared from nowhere, filling that region with the profound secrets of the way. The space within several dozen kilometres of him shook violently as if he was trying to force out everything hidden.","But after a while, the space continued to shake, but Jian Chen was nowhere to be seen.","He had already anticipated the cloaked old man would do this. As soon as he activated the Divine Armour of Heavenflight, he moved over a hundred kilometres away with the Laws of Space.","This was the Skyscraping World, which was covered in powerful formations. Not even Immortal Exalts were immune to the various forms of oppression, so a hundred kilometres away was a relatively safe distance.","Even the senses of the souls of Immortal Exalts could not reach that far.","On the other side, the cloaked old man’s face was rather sunken. When he noticed that Jian Chen had vanished, he shook up the space immediately. However, he still failed to force out Jian Chen, which left him rather surprised.","However, as a Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, the cloaked old man was very knowledgeable. He had already guessed that Jian Chen was not far, so he stood where he was and said, “Yang Yutian, you better not forget that two great elders from the Wind clan have died by your hand. If you don’t appear, everyone in the Skyscraping World will know about this before long.”","“As a matter of fact, once we leave here, the news will reach the Fierce Gales Heaven very swiftly and be known by the upper echelon of the Wind clan.”","“And you will become a mortal enemy of the Wind clan. I wonder if what you’re relying on can stop the Mistress of Contrary Winds from the Wind clan.”","The cloaked old man’s voice echoed through the forest. After saying that, he stood where he was and began waiting patiently.","On the surface, he seemed very relaxed, but secretly, he had already raised his vigilance to the maximum.","A minute later, there was still no disturbance in the surroundings. There was not even any movement in space.","“Don’t tell me Yang Yutian has already left?” The cloaked old man guessed. He was amazed by Jian Chen’s almost-perfect hiding ability.","After waiting for a little longer and seeing how nothing had happened, the cloaked old man turned around and left the place.","“Not only has he received the attention of the daughter of the heavenly emperor, Xing Caijian, he almost managed to slip away under my watch as a mere Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor. Looks like this Yang Yutian is hiding quite a few secrets. If he really is an independent cultivator, then he must have had a tremendous fortuitous encounter.”","The cloaked old man searched through the foot of the mountain aimlessly. Jian Chen’s figure was like a brand, having been firmly imprinted in his mind. He was unable to discard him from his thoughts no matter what.","“ The Skyscraping World feels both large and small. I’ll run across him again sooner or later. However, when I encounter him again, I have to strike swiftly and take him down as quickly as I can. I can’t give him any opportunity to slip away like earlier. ” The cloaked old man’s eyes burned with interest as if Jian Chen had already become a fortune that belonged to him."]},{"number":3847,"title":"Chapter 3847: Facing an Immortal Exalt","paragraphs":["Gradually, he moved away from the medicinal garden of the Wind clan and completely lowered his guard.","But at this moment, the cloaked old man’s vigilance spiked. A tremendous sense of danger filled his mind, making his heart contract violently.","A sword extended out from the empty space behind his head. All of its glow was completely concealed, giving off no presence at all. It was like a venomous snake hidden in the darkness, darting out silently with lightning speed.","“ Oh no! ” The cloaked old man’s face changed drastically, but the sword was far too fast. Coupled with how suddenly everything had occurred, without any prior signs at all, the tip of the sword had already reached his black cloak by the time he reacted.","The black cloak was no ordinary item, as it was a medium quality god artifact. It possessed a certain amount of defensive power.","When the sword made contact with the black cloak, it halted, momentarily blocked by the black cloak.","However, that only lasted for a split second. In the next moment, the black cloak was pierced by the sword. Afterwards, the sword continued on towards the cloaked old man’s head.","However, the cloak had bought the old man some precious time. A blinding ball of light rushed up as a set of god artifact scale armour completely covered every inch of the old man.","Ding! The sword struck the scale armour and produced a crisp sound. A terrifying storm of energy swept out as the scattered sword Qi sliced all of the surrounding vegetation to bits.","In an instant, a clearing opened up in this overgrown landscape.","The cloaked old man staggered forward by a few steps before quickly turning around. His elderly face hidden under the great big cloak immediately darkened.","“Yang Yutian, it’s actually you? How dare you hide in the shadows and ambush me.” The cloaked old man ground his teeth as if he had never imagined that a mere mid Immortal Emperor would be audacious enough to try and assassinate him.","In particular, the sense of danger Jian Chen gave him for that split second was not something an Immortal Emperor could achieve.","In front of the cloaked old man, Jian Chen was clad in the Divine Armour of Heavenflight, floating there silently. He gripped the high quality god artifact, the Heaven-lifting sword, firmly in his hand, with all of its pressure and presence concealed.","“You truly are a Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. Even under these circumstances, I failed to injure you,” Jian Chen looked at the cloaked old man and said extremely calmly.","However, when the cloaked old man heard that, it sounded particularly jarring. It felt extremely insulting.","With the strength of a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor, it should have been impossible to harm a Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt in perfect condition, no matter what was tried. Even approaching one should have been impossible.","Yet, his medium quality god artifact cloak had actually been pierced by Jian Chen. If it were not for the split second bought by the cloak, he struggled to imagine the outcome.","“I had already stopped looking down on you since you were able to kill the two Immortal Emperors of the Wind clan, but I never imagined that your strength would still far exceed my expectations,” the cloaked old man said hoarsely. His eyes under the cloak were fixed on the Divine Armour of Heavenflight on Jian Chen. He was secretly excited inside as he said, “The reason why you are able to hide your presence and traces perfectly is because of this god artifact armour, right?”","“I never thought that as only a mid Immortal Emperor, you would possess two high quality god artifacts. What surprises me even more is that just wielding a single high quality god artifact is already very arduous for some Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperors, yet you can power two high quality god artifacts at the same time. You can even unleash extraordinary power.”","“I’ve even begun to wonder whether you’re an Immortal Emperor or an Immortal Exalt.”","Before he had even finished talking, the cloaked old man suddenly struck out. As his pressure as a Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt erupted, he appeared in front of Jian Chen instantly. He surged with energy as his hand darted out, slamming down from above with great pressure towards Jian Chen’s head.","At the same time, he formed seals with his left hand. Countless complicated seals were produced. He completed the entire sequence in an instant before he pointed at the space beside him.","With that gesture, the space within several dozen kilometres instantly seized up like it had been frozen.","This was not the Laws of Space but a secret technique, relying on his powerful cultivation to forcefully freeze this space.","It did not restrict Jian Chen’s movements completely. It only restrained his ability to completely hide in this region of space.","Whether it was attacking Jian Chen or freezing this space, he completed it all in a split second. His movements were so fast that they could not be reacted to.","“ Hehehe, Yang Yutian, I’d like to see how you escape from me this time. ” The cloaked old man secretly beamed with joy. His eyes hidden within the black cloak constantly studied Jian Chen’s Divine Armour of Heavenflight, burning with greed.","It was as if to him, Jian Chen was already a sitting duck, completely at his whim.","At this moment, a blinding streak of light erupted. Jian Chen wielded the Heaven-lifting sword as Chaotic Force flowed into it endlessly, thrusting out with his full strength that collided with the cloaked old man’s hand.","Boom!","The two collided, immediately producing a great boom. A powerful storm of energy swept out, forming a terrifying whirlwind that slammed against the rock in the surroundings.","Jian Chen grunted and staggered backwards. He turned slightly pale. Even the Heaven-lifting Sword in his hand dimmed.","Although he had almost injured the cloaked old man through his ambush earlier, there was still an insurmountable difference with his current strength compared to a Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt in direct battle.","The cloaked old man saw how he repelled Jian Chen in a single strike, but he still became surprised as well. “That was only a casual strike of mine, but the power behind that attack was enough to heavily injure any Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. Yang Yutian, there aren’t a lot of people in the entire Immortals’ World who can achieve what you’ve done with the strength of a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor.”","“However, what you cultivate seems to be the Chaotic Body...”","When he mentioned the Chaotic Body, the cloaked old man seemed to think of something. His voice changed slightly as he murmured softly, “Immortal Emperor... Chaotic Body... the Laws of the Sword...”","The cloaked old man gradually began to laugh. “Yang Yutian, I think I know who you are already. In recent years, the Immortal Feather sect of the twelve courts of heaven issued a bounty for an Immortal Emperor to the entire Immortals’ World. Your various characteristics match the Immortal Emperor that the Immortal Feather sect wants perfectly.”","“That’s right, I am the person that the Immortal Feather sect wants. But so what if you know? You won’t survive and spread this news.” Jian Chen sneered.","“You’re a mere Immortal Emperor, yet you want to make such bold remarks?” The cloaked old man’s voice was filled with disdain. He was only a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor. No matter how extraordinary he was, no matter how impressive he was, it was impossible for him to threaten a Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt.","The difference between the two was far too great. It could basically be described as the difference between the heavens and the earth.","But very soon, the cloaked old man’s laughter came to a halt. Surging demon Qi spread out from beside Jian Chen. As the pressure of an Immortal Exalt spread out, the cloaked old man felt chills."]},{"number":3848,"title":"Chapter 3848: Half-man, Half-serpent","paragraphs":["Very soon, an extremely tall and large black figure rose up behind Jian Chen, wrapped in demon Qi and radiating with malice. It was the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt!","“Impossible. I’ve seen all the people who entered the Skyscraping World. You definitely weren’t one of them. Y-you didn’t enter this place using the Skyscraping Sword Scripture,” the cloaked old man cried out. The Skyscraping World was protected by many formations. Each formation was extremely powerful, all the creations of Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts. They covered a wide range of functions, so no one could escape the detection of the formations. Even the strongest high quality god artifact could not fool them.","But right now, a stowaway was standing right in front of him, and they were an Immortal Exalt on top of that!","“I understand now. I finally understand now. Y-y-you are actually... Hahahahahahahaha, this is a fortune, a fortune for me. This is the arrangement of fate, the blessings of the heavens.” Very soon, the cloaked old man began laughing aloud. With his knowledge, he obviously knew what this implied. He immediately became so excited that his heart thumped violently like it was about to explode, making his blood surge through his veins.","“You’re on the brink of death, yet you’re still so happy. What a fool.” The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt shook his head. He turned into a cloud of surging black mist and enveloped the cloaked old man. At the same time, he communicated to Jian Chen, “ Sect master, this is a Third Heavenly Layer expert. With my current strength, I can only match him in battle at most. Even heavily injuring him will be difficult. Even if I had my peak strength, I might not be able to stop him from running away, let alone right now, when my strength is nowhere close to complete recovery. As a result, I will need your help if you want to kill him, sect master. ”","“A Fourth Heavenly Layer Demon Exalt? Hahaha, if you were in peak condition, I’d have to fear you a bit, but with your current state, you can’t threaten me.” The cloaked old man laughed aloud. In the next moment, the black cloak on him was ripped apart, revealing his true appearance.","He was a hunched old man. His white hair was messy like hay, covering more than half of his face. It was possible to make out all of his wrinkles through his hair.","He wore a high quality god artifact armour forged from scales. It was completely black in appearance, reflecting a chilling gleam. It seemed indestructible.","His thin, bony hands suddenly transformed. They turned into a pair of powerful, sharp claws, covered in scales.","In the next moment, his hands suddenly darted forwards, ripping at the incoming Thousand Soul Demon Exalt.","Rip!","Immediately, an ear-splitting sound rang out. A huge, pitch-black crack appeared in the surroundings like a blade, slashing towards the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt with devastating might.","The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt let out a strange laugh. He did not choose to take on the old man’s attack. Instead, he turned into black mist and dodged carefully before suddenly enveloping the cloaked old man. His terrifying power of the soul began to invade the old man’s soul.","“You still think you can mentally disturb me with your feeble soul? You’re dreaming,” the old man bellowed out. His appearance changed again. He was no longer a metre and a half tall, instantly growing to nine metres. His feet turned to claws, and a long tail grew from his backside.","In an instant, the old man turned into a half-man, half-serpent state. He possessed a serpent dragon’s body and limbs and a human’s head.","A powerful sense of vitality radiated from him as if returning to this state drastically amplified all of his abilities.","His claws swiped around viciously in the black mist. Each attack possessed surging energy. He engaged the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The black mist that the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt transformed into shook violently as great rumbles rang out. He was firmly locked in battle against the old man.","After all, he had not completely recovered yet. He did not possess the battle prowess of a Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. Even with his comprehension and battle experience as a Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, he only managed to fight the old man to a stalemate.","“Back away, Thousand Soul Demon Exalt!”","But soon after they began fighting, Jian Chen bellowed out.","When he heard that, the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt did not hesitate at all. The dense demon Qi suddenly dispersed, and the old man was clearly exposed in front of Jian Chen.","However, before he could even catch his breath, supreme sword intent erupted.","When the sword intent appeared, the half-man, half-serpent old man shuddered inside. He looked at Jian Chen in some shock.","From the supreme sword intent, he could sense tremendous danger.","But to his disbelief, this sense of danger actually came from a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor junior.","Before he could have too much time to think about it, two dazzling streaks of light shot towards the old man.","The enemy was a Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, so Jian Chen did not dare to be careless. He directly used two strands of Profound Sword Qi.","The Profound Sword Qi crossed the distance and instantly arrived near the old man’s forehead. It was unbelievably fast.","The old man’s eyes narrowed violently. In that split second, he managed to react in time. His surging energy formed a thick barrier around him. Even the scale armour he wore erupted with dark light. The pressure of a high quality god artifact filled the surroundings.","With a high quality god artifact protecting him, it would be very difficult for him to be injured even if attacks from experts at the same level as him struck him.","However, he did not know about the special characteristics of Profound Sword Qi. In the next moment, the Profound Sword Qi pierced his energy barrier, bypassed the defences of his armour, and ignored all of his attempts at protecting himself, striking his soul.","The old man shuddered violently as his face paled. Having withstood two strands of Profound Sword Qi at the same time, his soul did not have it easy. His consciousness blurred for a moment.","During that moment, his awareness of the outside world plummeted to a minimum.","“ T-this is impossible. W-what is this thing? ” The old man was extremely shocked. The two strands of Profound Sword Qi were nowhere near enough to heavily injure his soul, but they had managed to affect him successfully.","If it was just Jian Chen, the old man could obviously brush off the impact on his soul, as he would recover very quickly. Even if he was momentarily stunned, he still could not be injured by an Immortal Emperor.","However, the issue was there was a powerful Immortal Exalt as well!","“Hehehehe, weren’t you pretty arrogant earlier? Go on, keep being arrogant.” With a strange laugh, the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt turned into black mist and directly infiltrated the old man’s soul.","This time, the old man was no longer able to stop the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt. Immediately, the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt entered the old man’s soul and engaged him in a clash of souls.","The battlefield was in the old man’s body, which gave him the home court advantage, but the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt was an expert in this field. His understanding and usage of the soul was beyond the old man’s.","As a result, as soon as they made contact, the old man lost the upper hand.","However, that was only losing the upper hand. If the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt wanted to heavily injure or even kill the old man, it would still be an insurmountable task."]},{"number":3849,"title":"Chapter 3849: Perfect Collaboration","paragraphs":["By now, the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt and the half-man, half-serpent old man had entered a stalemate. For a short moment, neither of them could overwhelm the other.","If the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt and the old man were the only two present, they would not necessarily reach a conclusion even if they fought for decades or even centuries.","However, Jian Chen was present as well!","At this moment, Jian Chen slowly raised the Heaven-lifting sword in his hand. As the Heaven-lifting sword shone with dazzling light, it hid the pulses of the Laws of Space.","As he swung his sword, the Laws of the Sword and the Laws of Space erupted simultaneously as if the sword had pierced space before instantly vanishing.","At that moment, he used the Shadowless Lifetaking Strike. The Heaven-lifting Sword and half of his forearm vanished from the space there. An invisible strand of sword Qi crossed the distance between the two, bypassing the old man’s defences and directly assaulting him inside his body.","The expression of the old man who was currently caught in a clash of souls with the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt suddenly changed. He felt a powerful strand of sword Qi erupt in his body, rampaging about and destroying his internal organs.","Normally, a strand of sword Qi of such strength would be nowhere near enough to heavily injure him. It would only be a small source of annoyance, but he was engaging the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt in a battle of souls currently. He was virtually using his full strength, with no more energy to deal with anything else. Under these circumstances, the damage from Jian Chen’s Shadowless Lifetaking Strike obviously increased.","Spurt! The old man opened his mouth and sprayed blood that contained pieces of his organs. His presence immediately waned.","In the next moment, he let out a pained grunt and staggered backwards. His face paled.","When he suffered those injuries, the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt used the split-second opportunity to heavily-injure his soul.","It was possible to say that Jian Chen’s existence broke the balance between the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt and the old man. His various methods were far too extraordinary. Even though he was incapable of heavily-injuring a Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt through his strength alone, he still played an extremely great role if he supported on the side, enough to turn the tides of the battle.","“Sect master, destroy his body. If this person doesn’t have his body, I can destroy him with ease.” A hoarse voice rang out from the old man’s mouth. At this moment, the old man’s left eye projected his figure, while his right eye was occupied by the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt.","The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt seemed to have gained control over half of the old man’s body already!","Jian Chen swung his sword and used the Shadowless Lifetaking Strike again. Instantly, another powerful strand of sword Qi erupted in the old man’s body.","But this time, the old man was prepared. Powerful vitality filled his body, guarding his organs.","He possessed the body of half a daemon, so his physique was much more powerful than other cultivators of the same level. Under his full-powered defences, Jian Chen’s second Shadowless Lifetaking Strike did not cause as much damage as the first one.","Jian Chen sensed this as well, so he stopped using the Shadowless Lifetaking Strike. He arrived in front of the old man with a flash and channelled his Chaotic Force into the Heaven-lifting sword, making it erupt with light. Afterwards, he swung it at the old man with full force.","Boom!","With a great rumble, the old man was knocked far away, only stopping when he slammed into a boulder several kilometres away.","He did not suffer any obvious wounds. His high quality god artifact armour woven from scales blocked Jian Chen’s attack.","At this moment, the god artifact dimmed. Its defences had been greatly reduced.","With a thought, the old man circulated his tremendous energy as a Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, about to replenish the depleted energy of the armour.","If he powered a high quality god artifact armour with his cultivation, the defences would be so great that it would be well beyond anything that Jian Chen could overcome. It would be useless even if Jian Chen wielded the Heaven-lifting sword, another high quality god artifact.","Only his two trump cards, the Shadowless Lifetaking Strike and the Profound Sword Qi, could cause some issues to Immortal Exalts.","However, right when the old man was about to activate the defences of the armour, he began to tremble. Shortly afterwards, his tremendous energy that circulated about dissipated.","At that crucial moment, the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt got in his way, interfering with his control over his cultivation.","“Argh! Dammit! Damn you! Get out of my body!” the old man roared furiously and struck the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt with rage and fury. Two terrifying powers of souls clashed again and again violently.","Boom! Using the opportunity, Jian Chen’s Heaven-lifting sword shone with resplendent light and struck the old man again. The powerful force made the old man stagger backwards; his scale armour immediately stopped glowing. The defences that originated from it being a high quality god artifact had already vanished.","Shortly afterwards, Jian Chen slashed out again. Powerful Chaotic Force surged out. Under the Chaotic Force, the Heaven-lifting sword demonstrated might that even some Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperors would struggle to rival.","Normally, only Immortal Exalts could unleash the full power of high quality god artifacts. Even if some Immortal Emperors wielded high quality god artifacts, they could only make use of a small portion of their power. They could not wield them for long either, as it took an extremely great toll on their cultivation.","But at this moment, powered by Chaotic Force, the power unleashed by the Heaven-lifting sword had already reached seventy or eighty percent of its full potential.","With a grunt, the old man was sent flying yet again. The Heaven-lifting sword failed to pierce his high quality god artifact. It failed to even leave behind a mark.","Clearly, with Jian Chen’s current strength, destroying medium quality god artifacts was not an issue, but the strength of his attacks was still nowhere near enough to destroy high quality god artifacts.","However, the high quality god artifact on the old man had run out of energy, so all that remained was its original sturdiness. The great force behind each of Jian Chen’s attacks would penetrate the old man’s body in their entirety.","The old man let out a grunt; his body was severely impacted. His organs felt like they were about to rupture.","He possessed great energy inside him, but he could no longer spare any effort to mobilise it under the influence of the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt.","Half of his body had already fallen into the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt’s control.","“Hehehehe, sect master, keep going. Keep going. Put in a little more effort. Once his body is destroyed, he’ll be a rootless tree. Without his home court advantage, let’s see how he still stands a chance against me.” The old man let out a strange laugh.","But very soon, his laughter subsided as his face darkened. He yelled furiously, “You’re dreaming if you think you can kill me. Get out of my body...” A powerful presence swept into the surroundings. The energy in the old man’s body was like a volcano that had lain dormant for a very long time, about to erupt.","But in the next moment, another will suddenly appeared, fighting over the control of his body, which made the lively energy subside once again like it had been sealed in ice.","Jian Chen’s eyes shone with cold light. He struck out again and again, erupting with Chaotic Force each time. He unleashed thrust after thrust with the Heaven-lifting sword, erupting with sword Qi each time and causing quite a disturbance, like meteor showers forming a beautiful picture in the surroundings, illuminating the wilderness.","The old man was struck again and again. Under the heavy impact each time, his body hidden under the high quality god artifact crumbled piece by piece. His organs were ripped apart.","And, under the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt’s interference, he did not even have the strength to heal himself.","Boom!","At this moment, another rumble rang out. As Jian Chen slashed out, the old man’s body completely collapsed. The high quality god artifact armour on him fell to the ground limply.","“Argh! I’ll never spare you...” The old man ground his teeth and howled. His soul shone with blinding light before turning into a ball of fire that fled into the distance.","“Hehehehe, if you still had your body, you’d have a chance at escaping from me, but since you’re just a soul now, you’re going nowhere.” The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt laughed aloud. He was an expert in this field. Coupled with his advantage in cultivation, the old man who had been reduced to soul form seemed as feeble as a baby before him.","He opened his mouth and inhaled. The old man’s soul directly flew towards the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt uncontrollably."]},{"number":3850,"title":"Chapter 3850: Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing","paragraphs":["At that moment, it could be said that the old man was completely incapable of resistance before the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt. Losing his body was equivalent to losing everything he could rely on, losing all of his abilities.","In truth, even if a Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt was reduced to a soul, they still possessed significant battle prowess. They were nowhere near as feeble as they seemed.","However, his opponent was the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt, an expert in the Way of Souls.","The old man’s soul struggled furiously, letting out hysterical roars, but he was unable to escape from the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt’s control no matter what he tried.","Just like that, his glowing soul was swallowed in a single gulp by the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt.","“Hehehehe, a Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt’s soul is very nourishing. Once I fully refine it, I’ll be able to recover quite a lot of strength yet again.”","“At this rate, it’s only a matter of time before I return to my peak condition. It’ll be much faster than I anticipated.”","The cloud of black mist began to shrink, forming the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt’s figure again. His tall and burly figure seemed like a small giant compared to Jian Chen.","“Sect master, if you can hunt down a few more Immortal Exalts, my strength will return to its peak within a few years. Once I recover completely, I’ll be able to share some more of the sect master’s burden.” The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt looked at Jian Chen. His eyes that burned with demonic flames were filled with excitement and anticipation.","If it were not for Jian Chen, the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt would never consider hunting down Immortal Exalts so easily.","This was the Immortals’ World, where countless experts and organisations antagonised the Demons’ World due to rooted beliefs and various other reasons. When experts of the Demons’ World moved about in the Immortals’ World, they all acted with utter caution, afraid to stir up any trouble.","On top of that, the Immortal Exalts of the Immortals’ World basically all had their own networks. Even if all the experts in their territory had been slain, it was very easy to incur the vengeance of some close friends, let alone the fact that he was an expert of the Demons’ World.","However, Jian Chen was different. His almost-perfect ability to hide and disguise himself left him without any fear for the pursuit or revenge of any organisation, which was the only reason why the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt came up with such a crazy idea.","It was as if only after he had begun following Jian Chen did the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt truly understand what fearlessness meant.","When he heard the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt’s words, Jian Chen glanced at him with a slight smile. “Share my burden? You know all too well just how powerful my enemies are. Let alone the Immortal Feather sect, are you supposed to help me hold off even just the Mistress of Contrary Winds from the Wind clan?”","“Erm... T-this...” The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt immediately began to stutter. He had obviously heard about the Mistress of Contrary Winds before. She was a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. Even at his prime, that was someone he would want to avoid as much as possible.","On top of that, the Mistress of Contrary Winds had already remained at the Sixth Heavenly Layer for several million years. Who knew when she would reach the Seventh Heavenly Layer.","Once she reached the Seventh Heavenly Layer, she would make it into the ranks of late Immortal Exalts. That would be a life-changing moment, stepping into an entirely different realm. There would be a very great difference from the Sixth Heavenly Layer.","“Go back to the Primeval Divine Hall. After all, you’re a stowaway. It wouldn’t be good if someone else discovered you,” Jian Chen said to the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt.","“Hehehe, sect master, then I’ll return to the Primeval Divine Hall for now. I need some time to digest the soul of the Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt I just swallowed anyway.”","“Though, you have to remember to call me if you encounter any more Immortal Exalt enemies, sect master. The Divine Formation of the Heavens comes at far too great of a cost after all. Against those early Immortal Exalts, there’s no need to go that far. I alone will be enough...”","The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt’s words drifted through Jian Chen’s ears, but he had already vanished, having returned to the Primeval Divine Hall already.","Jian Chen looked towards the old man’s corpse. By now, the corpse had already turned into a three-hundred-metre-long serpent dragon that lay quietly on the ground. Its entire body was a bloody mess, without a single inch of intact skin.","This clearly was not a pure-blooded serpent dragon but a mixture between serpent dragon and man. It maintained the body of a serpent dragon and the head of a human. Even its limbs were a mix between human and serpent dragon, resembling neither.","“ The corpse of a Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt is perfect for feeding the Immortal Devouring Orchid, ” Jian Chen thought. Shortly afterwards, he swung his hand and stowed the disfigured corpse away.","Afterwards, he picked up the high quality god artifact armour that the old man wore previously. After studying it for a moment, he placed it into his Space Ring.","Despite both being high quality god artifact armour, the scale armour clearly came nowhere close to the Divine Armour of Heavenflight.","If he really had to appraise them, the scale armour’s grade was around the lower half of high quality god artifacts, while the Divine Armour of Heavenflight had achieved the peak of high quality god artifacts.","After a simple clean-up of the battlefield, Jian Chen left and continued searching through the Skyscraping World.","“ A high quality god artifact, eight medium quality god artifacts, and various resources that add up to three to four hundred thousand five-coloured immortal crystals. As a Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, he sure is poor. ” Jian Chen checked through the old man’s Space Ring as he travelled. He shook his head after tallying everything.","Along the way, the heavenly resources he came across had either been planted there intentionally or had evolved from various wild grasses and flowers due to the overly-dense spiritual Qi.","However, due to their inherent nature, these heavenly resources could never reach God Tier, so basically no one was interested in them.","In the blink of an eye, more than half a month had already passed.","“ Hold on, master. The place you just passed by has a cave that someone hid away intentionally. We can sense a special presence from there, ” suddenly, Zi Ying’s voice rang out in Jian Chen’s head.","When he heard that, Jian Chen immediately stopped and doubled back, arriving at the location that the sword spirits spoke of in the blink of an eye.","Beneath the overgrown shrubbery was a mossy, stone wall. It seemed like nothing special. Even when inspecting it with the senses of the soul, it was impossible to sense any giveaways.","“ Master, try attacking this stone wall, ” said Zi Ying.","Jian Chen did not hesitate. With a wave of his hand, sword Qi immediately condensed in the surroundings, completely covering the stone wall of three hundred metres across like rain.","When the densely-packed sword Qi struck the stone wall, it only left behind shallow, white marks. It failed to destroy it.","However, when the barrage of sword Qi struck one corner of the stone wall, dazzling light flickered.","“ A formation! ” Jian Chen narrowed his eyes. Swiftly, he arrived at a certain location and discovered an impressive concealing formation there. Not only could it block out the senses of the soul, but it was also impossible to notice with the naked eye even when he was standing right in front of it.","“ I sense it, master. There’s the presence of a Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing inside. Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturings are extremely special heavenly resources. They’re not for cultivators to consume but for sword spirits. They’re highly beneficial to sword spirits, ” Zi Ying said excitedly.","“ Master, Zi Ying and I just happen to be in need of Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturings. It can allow us to recover quite a lot of our strength, ” Qing Suo’s voice also rang out in Jian Chen’s head with some anticipation."]},{"number":3851,"title":"Chapter 3851: Destroying the Formation with the Energy-devouring Furnace","paragraphs":["“ A Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing? A heavenly resource that can assist sword spirits in recovering? I didn’t think there’d actually be something like that! ” Jian Chen’s eyes lit up when he heard the sword spirits’ explanation.","Although he already possessed the Primeval Divine Hall, the Source of Life, and the Divine Formation of the Heavens, the twin swords were still his greatest trump card.","After all, they were a pair of powerful weapons that could kill people far stronger than him!","Most importantly, it could be said that the twin swords completely belonged to him. Meanwhile, although the Divine Formation of the Heavens was capable of killing those stronger than him, it only had limited use. It was not his forever.","Moreover, using the Divine Formation of the Heavens came with many limitations as well. The greatest difficulty was assembling enough people. If anything happened to the experts who assembled the Divine Formation of the Heavens, leading to insufficient numbers, it would essentially render Jian Chen’s formation scroll useless.","As a result, if there was a way for the sword spirits to quickly recover, Jian Chen would make every effort to seize the opportunity.","“ We both possess bodies of high quality god artifacts with the help of the Spiritsages, but as sword spirits, neither Qing Suo nor I possess the strength that matches our current bodies. Even if we can control them, it’s only barely. If Qing Suo and I were to recover further, then we would be even more compatible with our high quality god artifact bodies. ”","“ By then, the twin swords will be even more powerful in master’s hand, far more powerful than the Heaven-lifting sword that you’re using right now.” Zi Ying’s voice rang out in Jian Chen’s head, but when he reached there, he paused. After a moment of silence, he continued , “But that way, the backlash from fusing the swords will grow stronger as well... ”","“ Backlash? With me around, what are you afraid of... ” As soon as Zi Ying said that, the Source of Life’s voice of disdain rang out, “ As long as you’re not completely killed in a split second, as long as I don’t run out of energy, I can guarantee that you won’t die. ”","“ I might not be useful when facing enemies, but when it comes to recovery, there are no god artifacts in the world that surpass me. ”","When it mentioned that, the Source of Life’s voice was filled with pride.","“ If we return to our peak condition, you really wouldn’t be enough. By then, not only will you be able to provide no help at all, but you might even be annihilated. ” Qing Suo could not stand the Source of Life’s tone, so she rebuked it mercilessly.","The Source of Life fell silent.","“ We are still a long way away from recovering completely. After all, swords of that level aren’t that easy to forge. However, if master can break through to the eighteenth layer of the Chaotic Body, it will be fine even if Qing Suo and I recover some strength, ” said Zi Ying.","“ Enough. Let’s not talk about these things so distant in the future. I still haven’t obtained the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing after all. The formation in front of me is not that easy to take down, ” said Jian Chen. He stared at the formation in front of him in interest as he gradually grew stern.","After a moment of thought, he called the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt out from the Primeval Divine Hall.","“Sect master, have you run into trouble again?” the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt asked, but he did not dare to show any displeasure.","“Thousand Soul Demon Exalt, take a look at this formation,” Jian Chen said to the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt.","By now, the formation had already recovered its disguise, merging with the mud-ridden rock. It was impossible to notice with the senses of the soul or the naked eye.","Jian Chen extended a finger. A strand of sword Qi fell down, exposing the hidden formation. Its defensive powers circulated, emitting a dazzling light that completely nullified his attack.","The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt narrowed his eyes and stared closely at the formation. Only after studying it for a while did he say slowly, “Sect master, this formation is not simple. Not only is it capable of disguising itself and defending against attacks, but it’s also hiding an extremely powerful killing formation inside.”","“The killing formation is so powerful that even if I were in my peak condition, I’d go out of my way to avoid it. I would never try to face it directly.”","The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt’s tone gradually became solemn. He turned towards Jian Chen and said seriously, “Sect master, fortunately, your attacks were only to probe it out, so you didn’t trigger the killing formation hidden inside. Once this formation receives attacks of a certain threshold, the killing formation activates. From what I’ve seen, it would be difficult to survive the formation without the strength of a Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt.”","“So it’s not that easy to get through this formation!” Jian Chen said to himself. He subconsciously thought of the Divine Formation of the Heavens. It seemed like using the Divine Formation of the Heavens to destroy the formation was the simplest method available.","The Divine Formation of the Heavens was capable of both offence and defence. Not only was it a killing formation of unparalleled might, but it was also a defensive formation.","However, when he thought of the power of the killing formation right in front of him, Jian Chen began to hesitate again.","If he used the Divine Formation of the Heavens, the killing formation would definitely be activated. The Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal disciples who assembled the formation would without a doubt fall into the trap.","After all, the Divine Formation of the Heavens was incomplete. It could not unleash its full might.","“Perhaps the Divine Formation of the Heavens can block this powerful killing formation, but there’s absolutely no need to take this risk to get through the formation in front of me.” Jian Chen made up his mind. With a flip of his hand, the high quality god artifact he had obtained on the Hall Brilliance Heaven, the Energy-devouring Furnace, appeared in his hand.","The greatest specialty of the Energy-devouring Furnace was to devour the energy of all formations.","If they ran out of energy to support it, all formations, no matter how powerful, would collapse automatically.","“Thousand Soul Demon Exalt, we’ll work together to power the Energy-devouring Furnace and drain all the spiritual Qi that supports the formation!” A vicious light appeared in Jian Chen’s eyes as he directly tossed the Energy-devouring Furnace to the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt.","The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt accepted the Energy-devouring Furnace. His tremendous energy as an Immortal Exalt immediately channelled into the Energy-devouring Furnace, making it erupt with dazzling light. It completely unleashed its might as a high quality god artifact.","He turned the Energy-devouring Furnace at the concealing formation below. As a terrifying suction force appeared, pure energy seemed to condense into a tangible stream of light. It was drawn over at a terrifying rate before entering the Energy-devouring Furnace as an endless flow.","High quality god artifacts could only unleash their full strength in the hands of Immortal Exalts. When the Void-perceiving Ancestor handed the furnace over to one of his subordinates, they could only unleash a fraction of its power.","As a result, the rate at which the Energy-devouring Furnace absorbed spiritual Qi could only be described as shocking. It was far greater than the speed it had demonstrated back then outside the Immortal Rising City.","“The furnace has yet to reach its limit. Sect master, if you add in your Chaotic Force, it can absorb energy even faster,” said the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt.","“Give me a moment. Let me set up a few warning formations in the surroundings.” Jian Chen vanished instantly. He visited the nearby paths and set up numerous formations and spatial barriers along them.","These formations and spatial barriers could not really stop anyone. Their greatest function was to serve as a warning. When someone approached them, Jian Chen would notice beforehand.","After doing all that, Jian Chen returned and pressed his hand against the Energy-devouring Furnace, letting his Chaotic Force surge inside.","In the next moment, the Energy-devouring Furnace shone a little brighter and absorbed the formation’s spiritual Qi even faster.","Jian Chen could clearly sense that bright energy crystals were being condensed one after another inside the colossal space that resembled a miniature world in the Energy-devouring Furnace.","These had all been converted from the spiritual Qi that the Energy-devouring Furnace absorbed.","However, it could only convert a very small portion of the spiritual Qi it absorbed."]},{"number":3852,"title":"Chapter 3852: The Scholar Capital Master","paragraphs":["Looking at the energy crystals that the Energy-devouring Furnace constantly produced, Jian Chen could not help but smile. He was clearly extremely satisfied with the power of the Energy-devouring Furnace.","He placed one hand on the Energy-devouring Furnace and channelled in his Chaotic Force. He took out an energy crystal from the furnace, pinching it between his fingers and bringing it closer to his eyes to study.","The energy crystal was transparent, as bright as a rock crystal. The energy it contained was so pure that it even surpassed supreme grade immortal crystals.","Its quality was between supreme grade and coloured immortal crystal.","However, the greatest difference between it and supreme grade immortal crystals was that supreme grade immortal crystals bore the presence of the Immortals’ World.","Meanwhile, the energy crystals produced by the Energy-devouring Furnace only contained pure energy, without any other elements present.","The concealing formation began to shine brilliantly as the Energy-devouring Furnace drained its power, dimming bit by bit.","Despite the entire process seeming extremely gradual, this was a tremendous formation that could threaten mid Immortal Exalts after all. The energy supply of such a powerful formation could be described as unimaginable.","But right now, the formation was dimming bit by bit, which only indicated just how terrifyingly fast the Energy-devouring Furnace absorbed energy.","“The killing formation hidden inside will only activate when it receives powerful attacks. By devouring the energy used to maintain the formation, I can avoid this killing formation perfectly.” Jian Chen smiled gently as he looked at the formation below.","“These formations all replenish their energy by absorbing the spiritual Qi in the surroundings. It’ll come down to whether the Energy-devouring Furnace can absorb energy faster than the formation can replenish it or not.” The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt chuckled.","“We’ll know very soon,” said Jian Chen. There was a hint of anticipation in his eyes. He knew that many formations were capable of absorbing the surrounding spiritual Qi to prolong their functions, but he was certain that the Energy-devouring Furnace would devour the formation’s power faster than it could replenish it.","That was because the Energy-devouring Furnace was being powered by both him and the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt. It drained energy far faster than what most Immortal Exalts could achieve by attacking the formation.","However, after another half a minute, the concealing formation seemed to sense its energy was running out. Its ability to absorb spiritual Qi was activated. The surrounding spiritual Qi turned into clouds of white mist, rushing towards the formation like a whirlpool.","It absorbed spiritual Qi quickly, but it was still quite far off from the devouring rate of the Energy-devouring Furnace.","“The replenishing speed is only equivalent to a fifth of the Energy-devouring Furnace’s devouring speed.” The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt shook his head. He could already tell that the formation was not far off from collapsing on itself.","Afterwards, Jian Chen and the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt continued to power the Energy-devouring Furnace with their full strength, allowing it to drain the formation of its energy at full speed.","With each passing second, numerous energy crystals would condense in the expansive space within the Energy-devouring Furnace. The amount it produced after each day was frightening.","In a single day, a small mountain of energy crystals had formed inside the Energy-devouring Furnace, amounting to over a hundred thousand.","Even when Jian Chen had already accumulated a tremendous amount of resources that could leave Immortal Exalts envious, his mouth still hung agape when he saw the production rate.","After all, only a day had passed. If the Energy-devouring Furnace continued like this for several months, years, or even decades and centuries...","Jian Chen could no longer imagine just how many energy crystals the Energy-devouring Furnace would be able to accumulate by then. He even wondered whether he would end up draining the entire Skyscraping World dry.","For the next few days, the Energy-devouring Furnace condensed over a hundred thousand energy crystals each day. Under the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt’s full support, they only used a little over half a month to drain over ninety percent of the energy from the formation.","From beginning to end, the killing formation hidden inside was never activated.","At this moment, the glow of the formation had already become extremely dim. On the brink of running out of energy, the formation even lost its most basic ability to hide itself. It was possible to make out a pitch-black tunnel hidden inside.","After another two hours, the formation finally ran out of energy, and the pitch-black tunnel was completely exposed before Jian Chen.","At the same time, Jian Chen sensed an extremely special presence. It was the result of a mixture of presence from a heavenly resource and the Way of the Sword.","However, Jian Chen was not in a rush to go inside. Instead, he turned his attention to the formation banners at the entrance of the cave.","There were a total of eight formation banners, all palm-sized. They were placed in a special arrangement that contained the truths of the world. It was very profound.","The powerful formation that Jian Chen spent over half a month draining was assembled from the eight formation banners.","But at this moment, the eight formation banners were all dim. They had already run out of all of their energy.","Jian Chen made his way over. He was about to collect the eight formation banners when an old man in grey robes suddenly appeared from one of the banners.","The old man’s figure was transparent. He was only a wisp of a soul that inhabited the formation banner.","“I am the Scholar Capital Master of the Modest Silence Heaven. Fellows, I discovered this heavenly resource first and protected it with this formation, allowing it to grow successfully. As such, it technically belongs to me. Please show some grace and leave it be,” the Scholar Capital Master’s soul clone said.","“Hehehehe, this is the Skyscraping World. Everything in the Skyscraping World was left behind by the Skyscraping Sword Venerable. It all comes down to your ability whether you can claim it or not. Why are we supposed to let you have it just because you asked?” The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt stared at the Scholar Capital Master and laughed, “Speaking of which, we went through so much trouble to get through your formation. How can we return with nothing?”","When he heard that, the Scholar Capital Master’s eyes shone coldly. His voice turned cold as he said, “The heavenly resource here is extremely important to me. If you really want to bite off more you can chew and take it, you will become my mortal enemy.”","“Scholar Capital Master, if you were here in person, perhaps we’d have some qualms, but you’re just a soul clone right now, so how are you supposed to frighten us away?” Jian Chen said. He was very calm and composed. After extending a finger, a strand of sword Qi flew out and dissipated the Scholar Capital Master’s soul clone.","“Alright! Alright! Alright! I’ve remembered your presences...” The Scholar Capital Master could only let out a furious howl before dissipating.","“Thousand Soul Demon Exalt, what do you think the Scholar Capital Master’s strength is approximately?” Jian Chen arrived before the eight formation banners and stowed them all away. The quality of the formation banners were quite high. They were worth quite a lot, so he obviously did not want them to go to waste.","“His soul clone was extremely feeble. It had slumbered in the formation banner for several hundred thousand years at the very least. I was unable to accurately discern his cultivation. However, he claimed that he was from the Modest Silence Heaven. There are only so many Immortal Exalts on each heaven. If you want his exact details, you only need to find someone and ask them about him,” said the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt."]},{"number":3853,"title":"Chapter 3853: The Divine Sword of the Immortal Soul","paragraphs":["“ The Modest Silence Heaven? I just happen to have an Immortal Emperor from the Modest Silence Heaven in the Primeval Divine Hall, ” Jian Chen thought. After stowing away the formation banners, they made their way into the depths of the cave slowly.","Jian Chen split his focus, diverting a strand of the senses of his soul into the Primeval Divine Hall.","At this moment, eight balls of light glowed brightly in a spacious area of the Primeval Divine Hall. The spiritual Qi in the surroundings was drawn to them constantly.","There were a total of nine Immortal Emperors in the Primeval Divine Hall. The leader of the Hall of Alchemy, Dan Chenzi, spent all day and night refining various kinds of God Tier pills. Meanwhile, the eight other Immortal Emperors had all been arranged to stay together by Jian Chen. With that, they were ready to establish the Divine Formation of the Heavens at any time.","Seven of the Immortal Emperors had been rescued from the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants. They had all become members of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens now.","The last person was Lin Sen who tried to control the Immortal Devouring Orchid using Spirit Transformation pills. Instead, he was reduced to an alchemy slave for the Immortal Devouring Orchid. He was also responsible for offering his strength to the Divine Formation of the Heavens.","Lin Sen happened to be from the Modest Silence Heaven. He was one of the three ancestors of the Divine Wood clan, a large clan on the Modest Silence Heaven.","“Lin Sen!” With a flash, Jian Chen’s figure condensed from a wisp of his soul appeared silently in front of Lin Sen.","With Jian Chen’s calling, the cultivating Lin Sen immediately opened his eyes. When he realised who had come to visit, he grew solemn and said politely, “Greetings, sect master!”","“Lin Sen, I want to ask you about someone. This person is an Immortal Exalt from the Modest Silence Heaven. His name is the Scholar Capital Master. Have you heard about him?” Jian Chen asked.","“The Scholar Capital Master?” Lin Sen was surprised. Deep fear appeared in his eyes. “Sect master, the Scholar Capital Master is quite renowned on the Modest Silence Heaven. He’s a supreme expert who stands at the very peak of the Modest Silence Heaven. It’s said that his cultivation has already reached the Sixth Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt. He’s honoured as one of the three sages of the Modest Silence Heaven.”","“A Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt? One of the three sages? Don’t tell me the Modest Silence Heaven has two other Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts?” Jian Chen asked curiously.","“That’s right, sect master. The three of them are the strongest experts on the Modest Silence Heaven,” Lin Sen said honestly.","......","...","After obtaining the information he was after from Lin Sen, Jian Chen exited the Primeval Divine Hall with the wisp of his soul. He began to contemplate how he would deal with the lurking threat from the Scholar Capital Master.","“ There are more and more Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal disciples for arranging the Divine Formation of the Heavens. The formation is constantly being perfected as well. Its power grows with each passing day. It’s no longer a question that it threatens Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts. The only thing that needs to be resolved now is to stop the enemy from escaping. After all, killing a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt won’t be as easy as dealing with a Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt... ” Jian Chen thought. The Divine Formation of the Heavens could not be assembled in complete form. There were many of its functions that he still could not use. Otherwise, this would not be a problem for him.","However, unbeknownst to Jian Chen, soon after he had destroyed the Scholar Capital Master’s wisp of soul, a deafening rumble erupted from a mountain covered in numerous formations on the distant Modest Silence Heaven. As a powerful shockwave of energy rocked the surroundings, boulders collapsed from the top of the mountain.","The divine hall that stood atop the mountain had already shattered. A small part of the peak had been reduced to dust.","“What’s going on? Don’t tell me the experts of the Modest Silence Alliance are attacking?”","“That’s impossible. This is the headquarters of our Alliance of the Immortals. Not only are there numerous experts stationed here, but we even have the Scholar Capital Master, known as one of the three sages of the Modest Silence Heaven. Where could the Modest Silence Alliance find the courage to attack us?”","“That’s not right. The explosion s-seemed to be from the Scholar Capital Master’s divine hall...”","......","...","Powerful presences erupted from the surroundings. Not only were there many Immortal Monarchs and Immortal Emperors, but there were even Immortal Exalt ancestors.","As they discussed, they all looked at the peak of the mountain in the central region. Their eyes were filled with shock.","The Immortal Monarchs and Immortal Emperors all hesitated, afraid to rashly approach the mountain. It seemed like a forbidden ground, one that they could not approach so easily without permission.","That was because the mountain was where the Scholar Capital Master cultivated in seclusion.","As a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, as well as one of the three Saints of the Modest Silence Heaven, the Scholar Capital Master possessed extraordinary status here.","In the end, only the Immortal Exalt Ancestors made their way towards the peak of the mountain after hesitating for a moment.","An old man in grey robes stood among the dilapidated ruins at the top of the divine hall. His clothes ruffled as his hair danced. His sombre eyes hid raging fury.","He was the Scholar Capital Master, one of the three sages of the Modest Silence Heaven!","“Master, may I ask what has happened that has actually infuriated you so much?” a Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt ancestor asked carefully as they approached him.","The other early Immortal Exalt ancestors paused nearby, as the Scholar Capital Master’s presence was so powerful that it prevented these early Immortal Exalts from getting any closer.","All of them could tell that the Scholar Capital Master was absolutely furious.","That piqued their curiosity. They did not know what had happened that had actually set off one of the three sages of their Modest Silence Heaven like this.","“None of your business. You’re dismissed!” The Scholar Capital Master waved his hand in annoyance. His face was sunken.","When they heard that, the Immortal Exalts present exchanged glances. No one had the courage to utter an additional word. They all clasped their hands at the Scholar Capital Master before silently leaving.","After they left, the Scholar Capital Master stared into the empty space, gazing in the direction of the Conquering Judgement Heaven. The fury in his eyes burned brighter and brighter, together with terrifying killing intent that could be described as devastating.","“ I entered the Skyscraping World a total of two times before finally finding the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing that the Skyscraping Sword Venerable had planted after so much difficulty. I left behind several tens of thousand God Tier heavenly resources for the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing to absorb, accelerating its growth. I planned on harvesting it in a million years’ time after the fruit had ripened... ”","“ I never thought that the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing that I spent so much effort nourishing would actually end up in the hands of someone else. Dammit. God dammit... ”","The Scholar Capital Master clenched his fists firmly. His sharp nails dug deeply into his flesh. Whenever the Skyscraping World opened while the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing grew, he did not enter, but he would stand guard outside to prevent anything from happening to the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing.","With the opening of the Skyscraping World this time, he was required to watch over the Modest Silence Heaven at all times due to the war on the heaven. As a result, he did not venture to the Skyscraping World as usual, yet this just happened to be when things went wrong.","With a flip of his hand, a dazzling God Tier sword immediately appeared in the Scholar Capital Master’s hand.","God artifacts were divided into four categories. Despite all being high quality god artifacts, a difference still existed among them.","The high quality god artifact sword in the Scholar Capital Master’s hand had already reached the peak of high quality god artifacts.","“ The Divine Sword of the Immortal Soul requires the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing to return to peak condition. Once the sword returns to its peak condition and the sword spirit is in perfect shape, I can grasp the Immortal Soul Annihilation technique through the sword spirit. As long as I know the Immortal Soul Annihilation technique, I’ll be able to contend with those at the Seventh Heavenly Layer as a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. ”","“ Without the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, I might as well forget about all this. ”","Thinking up to there, the Scholar Capital Master’s killing intent surged.","The Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing was an extremely rare heavenly resource, one that rarely appeared even over a million years. Whenever it appeared, it would always end up in the hands of the Immortal Sect of Myriad Swords. Despite being one of the three sages of the Modest Silence Heaven, he did not have the courage to contend against the Immortal Sect of Myriad Swords.","As a result, the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing in the Skyscraping Heaven could be described as his only hope.","The Scholar Capital Master swept his gaze across the Modest Silence Heaven. Whenever his gaze reached, he saw various battles of big and small everywhere. He also saw cultivators of various strengths perishing at basically every moment.","Suddenly, he seemed to make a decision. He gritted his teeth. “I can’t afford to lose the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing. I need to watch over the entrance of the Skyscraping World. I can’t afford to care so much about the war on the Modest Silence Heaven anymore.”","As soon as he said that, the Scholar Capital Master vanished. With a few flashes, he disappeared into the sea of stars, rushing off towards the Conquering Judgement Heaven."]},{"number":3854,"title":"Chapter 3854: The Modest Silence Heaven","paragraphs":["The Scholar Capital Master left the Modest Silence Heaven, but he did not intentionally conceal his presence. Perhaps this was a result of habit or he was far too panicked. As a result, many Immortal Exalts on the Modest Silence Heaven sensed his swift departure.","In another region under the control of the Alliance of the Immortals, another mountain reached into the clouds. A woman in a white dress sat there and gave off a gentle gaze. She unintentionally radiated with a tremendous presence that could bring many Immortal Exalts chills.","She was the Dreaming Autumn Nun, a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, one of the three sages of the Modest Silence Heaven!","The Dreaming Autumn Nun opened her eyes slowly. She gazed in the direction that the Scholar Capital Master departed towards and furrowed her brows firmly. She said softly, “The Scholar Capital Master has left the Modest Silence Heaven? He’s left in such a hurry that he hasn’t even bothered to notify anyone. What’s going on?”","“Greetings, Dreaming Autumn Nun!” At this moment, several Immortal Exalts visited her. They first bowed towards her politely before one of them said, “Your holiness, we just sensed that the Scholar Capital Master has left the Modest Silence Heaven. We’re currently at a critical juncture in our war against the Modest Silence Alliance, so we’re all very concerned about the disadvantages that the Scholar Capital Master’s absence will cause.”","“If the Scholar Capital Master is only gone for a short time, then it’s fine, but if he doesn’t return any time soon, we’ll be in trouble,” another Immortal Exalt said with a face filled with worry.","The Dreaming Autumn Nun did not budge, remaining in the same seated posture as before. Seriousness filled her different gaze. She said slowly, “The Scholar Capital Master is not unfamiliar with the situation of the Modest Silence Heaven, so you don’t have to worry about this.”","The Dreaming Autumn Nun continued, “However, our Alliance of the Immortals has indeed weakened drastically with the Scholar Capital Master’s temporary absence, so we need to raise our vigilance during this time and prevent the Modest Silence Alliance from taking advantage of us.”","“It’s just as the Dreaming Autumn Nun has said. We need to increase our vigilance during this time, just in case the Modest Silence Alliance launches a counterattack.”","“The experts of the Modest Silence Alliance are all hiding in the Eight Lightning Venerable’s lightning formation. Who knows if the Scholar Capital Master’s sudden departure will lure them out?”","The Immortal Exalts took their leave. The Dreaming Autumn Nun’s gaze returned to the direction that the Scholar Capital Master had left. A hint of worry flashed through the depths of her eyes.","......","...","Elsewhere on the Modest Silence Heaven, a colossal formation of lightning basically enveloped a quarter of the entire Modest Silence Heaven.","At this moment, a divine hall crackling with violet light hovered in the centre of the lightning formation. Powerful bolts of lightning wove through the surroundings, and the pressure of a high quality god artifact filled the air.","An old man in violet robes stood inside the divine hall. He gazed into the distant sky as if he could see through galaxies and peer into the deepest depths of space.","“Why is the Scholar Capital Master leaving the Modest Silence Heaven at a time like this? Without him, the Alliance of the Immortals cannot stop me with just the Dreaming Autumn Nun,” the old man in violet robes said gently.","He was the last sage of the Modest Silence Heaven, the Eight Lightning Venerable!","At the same time, he was the undisputed greatest expert on the Modest Silence Heaven. Neither the Dreaming Autumn Nun nor the Scholar Capital Master could match him alone in combat.","Of course, if the two of them worked together, the Eight Lightning Venerable would be forced to flee.","“Don’t tell me the Scholar Capital Master has intentionally left the Modest Silence Heaven so that they can lure me into launching a proactive attack against the Alliance of the Immortals? When I’m caught up in battle with the Dreaming Autumn Nun, will he make a return and heavily injure me with that opportunity?” The Eight Lightning Venerable guessed. With the lightning formation, he could stop both the Dreaming Autumn Nun and the Scholar Capital Master.","However, if he left the lightning formation, he would be overwhelmed.","“Eight Lightning Venerable, the Scholar Capital Master has already left the Modest Silence Heaven. The Alliance of the Immortals has suffered a severe blow to their forces. I suggest we use this opportunity to attack. Don’t become locked in battle with the Dreaming Autumn Nun and instead concentrate your strength on killing some of their Immortal Exalts,” an Immortal Exalt ancestor outside the divine hall wrapped in lightning said.","“Yeah, we’ll retreat after that attack. Once the raid is complete, it’ll be useless even if the Scholar Capital Master returns.”","......","...","In a cave that meandered downwards inside the Skyscraping World, Jian Chen stood alone beside a small pool. He was in thought.","The pool beside him was only ten metres across. At this moment, it shone so brightly that it resembled the sun. It dyed the dark cave snowy-white. Even making direct eye contact with it was difficult.","There was no fluid in the pool. There was only virtually endless sword Qi, resembling a limitless supply.","A special plant grew in the centre of the sword Qi. It was only three metres tall and seemed to be composed of sword Qi, shining with blinding light. A fruit that resembled a sword grew from its very top.","The fruit was the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing. It was nourished by endless sword Qi; it grew by devouring sword Qi. It was a heavenly resource that specially targeted sword spirits.","Even across the Immortals’ World, this was an extremely rare variety. It was very seldomly seen.","“ Master, at this growth rate, it’ll only take around three hundred years before the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing goes up another grade. However, if you add some special heavenly resources to the sword pool, the time of growth will shorten drastically, ” the voices of the twin swords rang out in Jian Chen’s head with excitement and elation.","The Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing was already a high grade God Tier fruit, but there were varying levels of strength among high grade God Tier fruits as well.","God Tier fruits could be divided into finer grades, like how first to third grade was low grade, fourth to sixth grade was mid grade, and seventh to ninth grade was high grade!","The Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing was currently at the seventh grade, which was the lowest grade among high grade God Tier heavenly resources. If it increased further, it would reach the eighth grade.","“ You know exactly what kind of heavenly resources there are inside the Primeval Divine Hall. If I nourish it liberally, how soon can it reach the eighth grade? ” Jian Chen asked. He was obviously aware that the higher the grade of the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, the more helpful it would be to the sword spirits.","“ If you nourish it liberally, then it’ll need three years at most, ” said Zi Ying.","“ Less than three years? ” Jian Chen made up his mind. He gritted his teeth. “ Zi Ying, Qing Suo, pick out the heavenly resources from the Primeval Divine Hall and make the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing reach the next grade as quickly as possible according to your method. ”","“ Not a problem. However, master, now that the concealing formation at the entrance is gone, the presence here will leak out, and it’ll draw over nearby experts. We need to take precautions for that, ” Qing Suo said in worry.","When he heard that, Jian Chen took out the formation banners he had collected at the entrance with a flip of his hand.","Looking at the set of formation banners, Jian Chen felt a little powerless.","The formation created by the formation banners was of a very high quality. It could basically conceal the presence here perfectly, but he obviously could not set it up without the corresponding method.","Naturally, he could not deduce the method for arranging the formation banners in such a short amount of time.","“ I’ll have to hope that no one passes by this place in the next three years. After all, with my current ability, the isolating formations I cast can fool some weaker cultivators, but if I encounter some stronger Immortal Emperors or even Immortal Exalts, setting up a formation here would be no different from public advertisement, ” Jian Chen thought to himself. Isolating formations were different from concealing formations. Isolating formations could block off all senses from passing through, but they could still be detected.","Meanwhile, concealing formations were for deception, creating a situation where it was impossible to discern them through the senses of the soul or through vision."]},{"number":3855,"title":"Chapter 3855: Lingering Will of the Sword Venerable","paragraphs":["After considering his options, Jian Chen still ended up deciding to gamble.","He did not make this decision out of recklessness. After all, he knew that not a lot of Immortal Exalt experts had entered the Skyscraping World. Basically all of them were early Immortal Exalts, with an extremely small number of mid Immortal Exalts.","Meanwhile, he had the Divine Formation of the Heavens. Even if he fought against mid Immortal Exalts, Jian Chen was confident about stealing it under their noses.","Jian Chen sat with his legs crossed near the sword pool. He stared straight at the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing that grew in the centre of the sword pool as God Tier heavenly resources appeared one after another in his hand.","He had obtained all of these heavenly resources from the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants. Now, in order to accelerate the growth of the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, he did not hold back at all. He turned all of these God Tier heavenly resources into fertiliser to accelerate the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing’s evolution.","Despite the tremendous waste, Jian Chen felt that it was worth it no matter how great the cost was if he could provide the sword spirits with a higher quality Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing.","As he cast the God Tier heavenly resources into the sword pool, they turned into a swathe of energy that entered the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing under the effects of the sword pool.","Seated by the sword pool, Jian Chen could sense very clearly that the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing’s growth rate had increased substantially.","“ I’ll have to guard this place for three years. Perhaps I’ll have to kill whoever I encounter during these three years. ” There was a hint of viciousness in Jian Chen’s eyes. He could not let anything to happen to the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing.","“ Master, we have a piece of bad news for you. ” At this moment, the sword spirits’ voices rang out in Jian Chen’s head. It was rather grim.","Jian Chen frowned when he heard that. He asked, “ What’s the matter? ”","“ Master, according to our original estimates, we only needed three years before the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing increased in grade successfully with the resources master possesses, but with our observations now, we’ve discovered that the grade of the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing is even greater than we imagined. The higher the grade, the more resources it needs when growing. ”","“ As a result, as it seems right now, the resources on master are no longer sufficient for the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing’s evolution. ”","“ The Primeval Divine Hall has millions of heavenly resources. Even they’re not enough to accelerate the growth of this one Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing? ” Jian Chen asked in surprise.","“ Master, there are a lot of heavenly resources in the Primeval Divine Hall but less than one percent of the varieties can be used to accelerate the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing’s growth. Most of them are of lower grade. They would be completely sufficient for ordinary grade Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing. ”","“ However, the grade of the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing here is already very high. I-it seems to be evolving. ”","“ Please look, master! Isn’t there a pattern on the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing? ”","Jian Chen looked over, peering through the blinding light that erupted from the sword pool. Sure enough, he saw a faint pattern on the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing that resembled a miniature sword.","“ That’s a marking left behind by the ways. This Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing has already become unique. If you give it a little more time, it might even develop full consciousness and take a human form, allowing it to cultivate like cultivators and strengthen itself... ” Qing Suo said.","Jian Chen sank into his thoughts after hearing the sword spirits’ explanation. Right now, he faced two options. The first was to give up on the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing’s evolution and harvest it right now, preventing any potential problems.","His other option was to take a gamble and find a way to make the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing rise up to a higher grade quickly.","That was because the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing could provide even greater assistance to the sword spirits after rising to a higher grade.","“ Spiritual Fruits of Sword Nurturing can only ever be chanced upon through luck. Whenever there is one, it’s a tremendous source of opportunity. A rare treasure like that obviously needs to have its full value realised. ” Very soon, Jian Chen made up his mind and turned around to leave the sword pool.","“ There are a few Immortal Exalts who entered the Skyscraping World. With how valuable the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing is, no one can resist this kind of temptation. As a result, I can only spread the news of the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing. I will let these Immortal Exalts devote resources to nurturing it before stealing it from their hands, ” Jian Chen thought. He could not come up with any better ideas for the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing to complete its breakthrough before the Skyscraping World shut again.","However, right when Jian Chen left the cave and returned to the outside world, he shuddered and came to a forceful halt.","A slender figure stood in front of him, clutching a sword wrapped in cloth as if she had been waiting there for a very long time.","Jian Chen was not unfamiliar with this lady. She was the daughter of the Heavenly Emperor of the Heavenly Star Palace of the twelve courts of heaven, Xing Caijian! Ra𐌽оꞖÈS","“What are you doing here? Don’t tell me you’ve also come for the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing?” Jian Chen asked. Xing Caijian had once tried to help him again and again, so he struggled to develop any animosity towards her.","However, as soon as he thought of the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, Jian Chen became troubled.","There was only one Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing after all!","Xing Caijian glanced past the cave with her cold eyes. The depths of her eyes rippled, clearly also rather tempted, but her gaze soon returned to Jian Chen. With a hint of mixed emotion, she said, “I’ve specially come here because a senior wishes to see you in person.”","When he heard that, Jian Chen immediately became solemn. Clearly, he had already realised that the senior Xing Caijian mentioned was anything but ordinary.","At this moment, Xing Caijian raised her hands slowly and brought the sword in her arms before her. She said politely, “Senior, the person before me is the successor of the Azulet swords!”","With that, an illusionary figure appeared from the cloth-wrapped Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star.","He was a ruddy old man, giving off a sagely demeanor. A unique presence radiated from him. He had a dominating bearing that could stun the world.","In particular, his eyes seemed to hide endless sword intent.","However, Jian Chen noticed from a single glance that the illusionary figure was only a lingering will. It could not even be considered as a soul.","“This is senior Skyscraping Sword Venerable!” Xing Caijian said to Jian Chen.","When he heard that, Jian Chen became solemn and bowed politely towards the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s lingering will.","“Little brother, are you really the one chosen by the Azulet sword spirits?” The Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s gaze was fixed on Jian Chen the entire time. His expression was mixed, filled with melancholy.","Before Jian Chen could answer, Zi Ying and Qing Suo’s figures appeared. They looked at the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s lingering will with faces also filled with melancholy.","“Skyscraping g-greets the two of you.” The Skyscraping Sword Venerable bowed towards the sword spirits with mixed expressions.","“Skyscraping, you have already perished for many years. Why have you intentionally left behind an undying will?” Zi Ying asked him like a senior questioning a junior.","“I had an agreement with the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor, which is why I left a lingering will that has persisted until now. As for the reason behind that, I’m afraid I can’t tell you,” said the Skyscraping Sword Venerable. Shortly afterwards, he looked at Xing Caijian below and said melancholically, “If my lingering will hadn’t been awakened, it probably would have survived for over ten million years.”","“But now that it has been awakened, it’ll probably dissipate for good before long. However, I should be able to uphold my past agreement with the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor before it dissipates...”"]},{"number":3856,"title":"Chapter 3856: The Sword Venerable’s Gratitude","paragraphs":["After hearing the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s words, Xing Caijian immediately became filled with apology and guilt. “Senior, I truly must apologise. I was not aware that awakening your lingering will would prematurely bring upon your end. If I had known that, I would have never disturbed you, senior.”","The Skyscraping Sword Venerable waved his hand. He was unconcerned. “There’s no need to blame yourself. This is an agreement that I had with your father. Even if you didn’t awaken my lingering will today, someone else would have done it.”","“I’m just surprised that after all these years, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor has actually had a daughter. If you weren’t carrying the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star as evidence, I would have never believed this.”","The Skyscraping Sword Venerable looked at Xing Caijian with a hint of affection like he was treating her as his own descendant. Shortly afterwards, he looked at Jian Chen again, and his expression became mixed. “Back then, when I faced the experts of the Saints’ World, I was heavily surrounded and on the brink of death. At that critical juncture, it was the twin swords that burst through space and destroyed the formations set up by the experts of the Saints’ World with a single sword Qi, which allowed me to survive.”","“But unfortunately, my injuries were far too heavy. I was long beyond help. I managed to survive that battle, but I would follow the footsteps of my predecessors before long...”","Reaching there, the Skyscraping Sword Venerable seemed to remember some matters of the past. He could not help but say, “Our Immortals’ World was far more vulnerable during the war back then. Whether it was Immortal Monarchs, Immortal Emperors, or Immortal Exalts, the Saints’ World completely outnumbered us. As a result, as soon as the war began, our Immortals’ World suffered tremendous casualties with many experts dead.”","“If the old senior had not sent the twin swords to slay a large number of experts from the Saints’ World at that critical juncture, shrinking the difference in strength between the two sides, the consequences would have been unimaginable.”","“It was a pity that I didn’t manage to survive the aftermath of that war...”","Towards the end, the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s face was filled with pain and pity.","Jian Chen obviously knew who the old senior that the Skyscraping Sword Venerable referred to was. He was clearly the previous master of the twin swords.","In the Saints’ World, the old master of the twin swords had swathes of enemies because he killed many of their experts during that war.","But in the Immortals’ World, the old master of the twin swords possessed an extraordinary reputation, having made significant contributions to the world. Many supreme figures treated him as their saviour.","As a matter of fact, many of the ancient traditions and legacies had only managed to be preserved to the current day because of the old master of the twin swords.","Otherwise, who knew how many great organisations of the Immortals’ World would have faced decline.","“Sigh, a lot of time has already passed since the war back then. I wonder how the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens is doing now. However, regardless of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens’ current situation, I’m certain the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens will return to the peak sooner or later now that the twin swords have emerged again... Hmm? Little fellow, you seem to cultivate the Chaotic Body?” The Skyscraping Sword Venerable who was amidst his reminiscence suddenly paused and stared at Jian Chen in complete surprise.","“You are correct, senior. I do indeed cultivate the Chaotic Body.” Jian Chen smiled. He obviously understood why the Skyscraping Sword Venerable would respond like that.","The Skyscraping Sword Venerable looked at Jian Chen in confusion. “Throughout history, no one who cultivated the Chaotic Body has been able to reach Immortal Exalt. Since you were recognised by the twin swords, you are obviously a man of great fortune. You had such a great starting point, so why did you choose to practise a cultivation method that limited your future?”","“The master we chose is anything but ordinary. We’re confident that a miracle will occur with our master,” Qing Suo said before Jian Chen could respond.","“Since he is recognised by you, I have nothing more to say.” The Skyscraping Sword Venerable looked past Jian Chen and the sword spirits and saw the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing behind them. He was surprised. “After all this time, I never thought the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing that I planted here would actually evolve.” RàΝO͍ВĚS","“If I were still alive, I’d definitely do everything that I could to assist the two of you, helping you return to your peak conditions in the shortest amount of time possible.”","“Unfortunately, all that remains of me is a feeble lingering will. My powers are limited. I am unable to be of much help. As a result, I can only use the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing to repay your kindness from before...”","“Although a mere Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing is completely insignificant compared to the kindness you showed me in the past, this is all that I can do now...”","The Skyscraping Sword Venerable was guilt-ridden. After saying that, his lingering will split into two. One portion turned into white mist and flew to the bottom of the cave, merging with the sword pool.","Immediately, the entire sword pool seemed to boil. Surging sword Qi radiated out. Extremely pure spiritual Qi in the criss-crossing spiritual veins deep underground seemed to receive some kind of order. They all began to amass towards the sword pool like rivers flowing towards the ocean.","At that moment, if someone could pass through the various formations inside the Skyscraping World, it would be quite obvious to see that the immeasurable spiritual Qi deep underground was all surging towards one direction.","The terrifying spiritual Qi accumulated in the sword pool, turning into a blinding ball of light that encased the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, which made it grow at a startling rate.","At this speed, the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing would climb to a higher grade in less than a year, let alone three.","“This will make the world run dry sooner, but all of this is worth it as long as I can help the two of you...” the other half of the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s lingering will hovered above the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star and said emotionally.","Compared to before, he seemed even more feeble now. He was like a wisp of smoke that could disperse in the wind at any moment.","“Skyscraping, we heard that you left behind a few seeds of ways in the past. If you really want to help us, then give us the seeds of ways. Our master is in need of them.” Zi Ying demanded without holding back.","The Skyscraping Sword Venerable became troubled. “I did indeed leave behind some seeds of ways in the past, but these seeds of ways are protected by numerous formations. These formations are so powerful that even Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts would struggle to breach them. These formations will only open once the corresponding conditions are met, and then they will cast out a seed of ways...”","“If I were still alive, retrieving the seeds of ways would not be difficult, but I’m just a feeble wisp of lingering will now. I’ve lost many of my abilities. All I can do is barely accelerate the growth of the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing. Everything else is already beyond my abilities.”","The Skyscraping Sword Venerable bowed deeply towards the sword spirits and said, “After splitting off a part of my lingering will, the time I have left was shortened even further, so I cannot remain here for much longer. Otherwise, I’m afraid that I would not be able to uphold my past agreement with the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor.”","“Little fellow, there isn’t a lot that I can do for you, so let me teach you a technique. With this technique, you can control the spiritual Qi within a range of ten thousand kilometres in this world. Hopefully, it will be of help...”","After leaving behind a secret technique, the Skyscraping Sword Venerable and Xing Caijian left."]},{"number":3857,"title":"Chapter 3857: Spiritual Qi as Eyes","paragraphs":["After the Skyscraping Sword Venerable had left, Jian Chen stood where he was and shut his eyes. A dazzling imprint shone on his forehead. Jian Chen rapidly absorbed the information it contained.","This imprint contained the small technique that the Skyscraping Sword Venerable had passed onto Jian Chen!","A while later, the imprint vanished, as all the information inside had been completely absorbed by Jian Chen.","Jian Chen shut his eyes slowly. In such a short amount of time, he had already grasped the technique from the Skyscraping Sword Venerable completely.","Suddenly, Jian Chen’s eyes shone. He formed a seal with one hand and began using the secret technique that he had just learnt.","As soon as he used the secret technique, Jian Chen felt a strange connection develop between his consciousness and the spiritual Qi within ten thousand kilometres of him. With his thoughts, the spiritual Qi in that range all began to gather together, turning into a huge swirl of spiritual Qi around Jian Chen.","Shortly afterwards, with another thought, the spiritual Qi from a range of ten thousand kilometres completely vanished once again in a split second as if it had all been repulsed, without leaving a single wisp behind.","At that moment, there was not a single wisp of spiritual Qi left within ten thousand kilometres of Jian Chen.","“ Hmm? ” Suddenly, Jian Chen seemed to discover something. A hint of surprise and joy immediately appeared in his eyes. As he controlled his mind, the spiritual Qi began to surge again.","Jian Chen shut his eyes and maintained his control over the spiritual Qi, but very soon, he began to smile resplendently.","“ In the beginning, I was still very doubtful over why the Skyscraping Sword Venerable would give me this useless and unnecessary technique. Turns out he had his own intentions. ”","“ In the Skyscraping World, the senses of everyone’s souls are suppressed by formations, so they're all limited to a range of a hundred kilometres. With this technique from the Skyscraping Sword Venerable, the senses of my soul are still constrained, but I can use the spiritual Qi as my eyes and sense everything in the surroundings through my control over spiritual Qi. ”","Jian Chen's smile gradually deepened. “ This way, I'll always be ahead of everyone in the Skyscraping World. I can always take them by surprise. ”","“ Others can’t sense me, while I can observe their every move from several thousand kilometres away... ”","“ The Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s technique is no different from giving me exactly what I require right now. ” Jian Chen was in a great mood. He turned around and returned to the sword pool in the cave.","By now, the entire place had already been enveloped in dense spiritual Qi. With the sacrifice of a part of the Skyscraping Sword Venerable's lingering will, he had mobilised the tremendous amounts of spiritual Qi in the Skyscraping World to accelerate the growth of the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing.","“ Originally, I was even prepared to spread the news of the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing to draw over some Immortal Exalts to feed it resources, which would accelerate the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing’s breakthrough. Now, with the Skyscraping Sword Venerable's lingering will, it'll probably only take a year or two at most before it completely ripens. ” Jian Chen felt very content as he gazed at the sword-shaped fruit in the middle of the pool.","Drawing over other Immortal Exalts came with tremendous risk, as he did not know at all if they would have the patience to feed the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing. What if they directly picked the fruit and fled with it?","Although Jian Chen had the confidence to stop them with the Divine Formation of the Heavens before they could pick it, it was nowhere near as good of a plan anymore.","“ All I need to do now is wait patiently. I can't let anyone approach this place during this time. ” With that, Jian Chen vanished from beside the sword pool silently with a sway.","He did not use the Divine Armour of Heavenflight to mask his presence. Instead, he used the secret technique that the Skyscraping Sword Venerable had taught him to turn all the spiritual Qi within a range of ten thousand kilometres into his eyes, closely watching out for any disturbances in the surroundings.","For the next period of time, Jian Chen began to leave the region where the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing grew. He patrolled the surroundings, watching over a region of a hundred thousand kilometres.","In the outside world, a hundred thousand kilometres was but a step away to even lowly Golden Immortals, let alone Immortal Emperors and Immortal Exalts.","However, this was the Skyscraping World. Even Immortal Exalts could only expand the senses of their soul to a hundred kilometres away, which was at times even less than what they could see. As a result, a hundred thousand kilometres was already an extremely spacious region, enough for many experts to miss out on opportunities.","In the blink of an eye, more than half a year had passed. The Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing's breakthrough was becoming closer and closer. Meanwhile, Jian Chen never discovered a single person within the hundred thousand kilometres he patrolled. ṝÂƝŎΒĚS","On this day, Jian Chen discovered a figure thirty thousand kilometres away from the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing. He was a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor. As he searched through his surroundings, he entered Jian Chen's range of observation.","The two of them were only several thousand kilometres apart, but he clearly had not discovered Jian Chen as the senses of his soul and his vision was affected. Meanwhile, Jian Chen learnt of his existence through the spiritual Qi he controlled.","“A Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor. Do I kill him or not?” Jian Chen murmured to himself in thought before letting out a gentle sigh. “So be it. The Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing has not been exposed yet. Let's see if I can draw him away.”","Jian Chen hid himself with the Divine Armour of Heavenflight and directly flew towards the Immortal Emperor. A few hundred kilometres away from the Immortal Emperor, he took a turn down a fork in the road.","After travelling around a hundred kilometres, he stopped. With a flip of his hand, he took out a low grade God Tier heavenly resource in his possession and carefully planted it in the ground, hiding all of his traces.","At this moment, the Immortal Emperor was gradually approaching him. With each step he took, he could traverse a hundred kilometres. Whenever he advanced, he would pause for a moment, searching the surroundings carefully with the senses of his soul.","Very soon, he arrived at the fork. Before him were two paths that led off in different directions.","But right when he hesitated over which path to take, he seemed to sense something. His expression changed as joy flooded his face. He chose the same path as Jian Chen without any hesitation.","Very soon, he discovered a heavenly resource a hundred kilometres away. Despite not being particularly impressive at only low grade God Tier, it was still a harvest.","Right when he picked the heavenly resource, he sniffed the air heavily and seemed to sense something else. After advancing another two hundred kilometres, he discovered a second heavenly resource.","“My luck is not bad. I actually discovered two heavenly resources one after another. It’s just a pity that their quality is a little low. Whatever, at least it’s better than nothing,” the Immortal Emperor muttered to himself. He did not change directions, following the path beneath his feet. In the end, after travelling another two hundred kilometres, he discovered a third heavenly resource.","And it was also a low grade God Tier heavenly resource this time!","Just like that, Jian Chen set down several heavenly resources in front of the Immortal Emperor and managed to lure him further and further away.","Only when the Immortal Emperor gradually travelled away did Jian Chen expose himself again. He gazed at the figure that was already several thousand kilometres away, about to leave the range of spiritual Qi he could control. He murmured to himself, “I think I have an impression of this person from outside earlier. He’s from a peak organisation.”","“Though, if I can use a few heavenly resources that aren’t particularly valuable to avoid a feud with peak organisations, it’s all worth it.”"]},{"number":3858,"title":"Chapter 3858: Alarming Everyone","paragraphs":["After luring the Immortal Emperor away, Jian Chen returned along the same path as before. He did not care at all about the few God Tier heavenly resources he had lost.","He could be considered as quite wealthy now. A few low grade and mid grade God Tier heavenly resources could not even leave a mark on his wealth.","Afterwards, Jian Chen did not relax. He continued to patrol the area around the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, using the spiritual Qi as his eyes to pay close attention to the surroundings.","However, the Skyscraping World was sparsely populated. After over half a year, Jian Chen only found two cultivators who entered this region. Apart from the earlier Immortal Emperor, there was an Immortal Monarch, but Jian Chen managed to draw him away along a different path using the same method, making him lose his chance with the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing.","“ With the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s secret technique, I have an utter advantage in the Skyscraping World. Nothing that occurs within ten thousand kilometres of me can escape my senses, ” Jian Chen gained a deep realisation of the secret technique’s wonders, which left him overjoyed.","Before long, Jian Chen returned to the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing after patrolling the area. He stood by the shining sword pool and stared straight at the sword-shaped fruit that grew there. His smile gradually deepened. “ With the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s assistance, the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing’s growth rate has increased substantially. It’s already reached a critical juncture of its growth. ”","But when he thought up to there, sword intent flooded his face, immediately enveloping the entire cave.","The Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing erupted with light, filling the surroundings with a special presence of the Way of the Sword.","In that split second, the presence reached a hundred kilometres away before expanding even further like an unstoppable storm.","Jian Chen was completely unable to stop the presence from leaking out. Even when he formed an area with the Laws of Space, the presence passed through with ease.","“ Has it finished growing? And reached the eighth grade? ” Jian Chen was surprised. He gradually became stern.","The Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing created far too great of a disturbance. Even if he wanted to hide it, he could not anymore.","“ I can’t stay here for long, or it’ll only lead to problems! ” Jian Chen immediately decided, reaching out to pick the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing.","“ You can’t, master. Now is still not the time to pick the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing. It’s still evolving. It’s in an extremely unstable state. If you pick it now, it’ll be equivalent to destroying it completely ” the sword spirits said in time, stopping Jian Chen.","“ I can’t pick it right now? According to this disturbance, it’ll probably draw over a few Immortal Exalts. ” Jian Chen’s heart sank slightly. He looked at the evolving Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing and became even more grim.","However, he could not come up with any better ideas. All he could do was watch this place and constantly use the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s secret technique to pay close attention to the surroundings.","The presence of the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing spread further and further. This was a high grade God Tier heavenly resource after all. The disturbance it created when evolving was far greater than usual. It was sensed by some cultivators nearby very soon.","“Hmm? This presence... seems to be some kind of heavenly resource. It’s actually spread so far, so it must be of high quality...”","“This presence came from the foot of the mountain. Quick, follow the presence. We can get there before others. As long as we’re fast enough, we can flee as soon as we pick it. No one will know what we’ve done...”","“This presence... is from a high grade God Tier heavenly resource at the very least. The presence has actually spread so far. Whatever, you need the strength of an Immortal Emperor at the very least to compete for something like this. I’m only an Immortal Monarch, so I’m not going to get involved in this mess...”","......","...","In the nearby region, there were already several Immortal Emperors rushing over. Some travelled alone, while others were in groups. Every single one of them covered a hundred kilometres with each moment, so they moved extremely quickly.","At the same time, a long staircase trailed up the side of a mountain. There were several tens of thousand steps to it like a path to the heavens that led to the top of the mountain.","The steps were the only way up to the top of the mountain in the Skyscraping World.","There were many mountain paths in the Skyscraping World, criss-crossing across the entire place like an enormous spider web.","However, the stone steps were the only path that led to the top!","“The Skyscraping World is very large. While the senses of our souls are suppressed, finding a person is indeed no different from finding a needle in a haystack.” Three figures sat on the stone steps, radiating with the pressure of Immortal Exalts.","The three Immortal Exalts were one of the five ancestors of the Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights, the Profound Spirit Master, the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt from the Hall Brilliance Heaven, and the Black Wind Immortal Exalt of unknown origins!","The speaker was the person who sat in the middle, the Profound Spirit Master.","The Profound Spirit Master paused for a moment. He glanced at the long trail of steps and smiled faintly. He continued, “However, this is the only way to reach the peak. Only by passing through here do they possess the right to contend for the seed of ways.”","“Since that junior called Yang Yutian has boasted that he will contend for the seed of ways, he will definitely pass through here. If I guard this place, I refuse to believe he won’t show up here eventually.”","“Yang Yutian, what exactly are you hiding? I’m very curious...”","The Profound Spirit Master confessed his intentions without holding back at all. In this world where strength was everything, the strong preying on the weak had already become all too common.","“Actually, I’m also very curious why the honourable daughter of a heavenly emperor, Xing Caijian, would treat Yang Yutian in such a special way,” said the city lord of the Yi Immortal City from the Hall Brilliance Heaven, the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt. He too was intrigued.","For someone like the Profound Spirit Master, there were not a lot of things left in the Skyscraping World that could interest him and looking for them was almost impossible. Basically everyone like them had come for the seed of ways, so they were not concerned at all about the time they wasted here. They all waited patiently.","As for the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt, he completely followed the Profound Spirit Master in the Skyscraping World. He wanted to consolidate his connection with the Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights.","They were not the only three people waiting on the steps. At various other locations, there were several other Immortal Exalts meditating with their eyes shut, but who knew whether they shared the same sentiment as the Profound Spirit Master or if they had other intentions in mind.","At this moment, a skinny, middle-aged man seated above the Profound Spirit Master opened his eyes. The moment he snapped his eyes open, they shone with blinding light.","A sword appeared out of nowhere above his head, radiating with light and releasing startling sword Qi.","The middle-aged man was delighted. Without any hesitation, he rushed down the mountain, vanishing with a few flickers.","His actions surprised the other Immortal Exalts seated on the steps, but very soon, they seemed to sense something. They all stood up in surprise.","“An extremely rare item of wonder has emerged!” the Profound Spirit Master cried out. With a flip of his hand, a high quality god artifact sword appeared in his hand. After communicating with the sword spirit, his eyes lit up. In the next moment, he flew out and rushed towards the foot of the mountain.","The Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt and the Black Wind Immortal Exalt followed closely behind."]},{"number":3859,"title":"Chapter 3859: Obstructing the Enemy","paragraphs":["Many Immortal Exalts waited on the long steps. With the skinny middle-aged man and the Profound Spirit Master’s sudden departure, the other Immortal Exalts had no idea what had happened but were alerted. They all followed behind them with various ideas in mind, also leaving the stone steps and making their way towards the bottom of the mountain.","In a split second, not a single person was left on the stone steps!","“Fellow Profound Spirit, what has happened? Why have you left with such urgency?” the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt and the Black Wind Immortal Exalt caught up with the Profound Spirit Master and asked curiously.","The Profound Spirit Master’s eyes shone extremely brightly, with hints of excitement and emotion. “My Cloud-gathering sword has told me that it sensed the presence of a Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing below this mountain, and it’s not just a regular Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing either. Its grade is very high, so high that fruits of such quality rarely ever appear.”","“What? A Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing? Special heavenly resources that specifically target sword spirits are extremely rare in our Immortals’ World. It’s said that whenever a Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing appears, even the Immortal Sect of Myriad Swords of the twelve courts of heaven will contend for it.” The Black Wind Immortal Exalt was surprised. Although he was not a sword wielder, he understood exactly how precious the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing was even if it was useless to him.","Let alone all of its other properties, just the fact that the Immortal Sect of Myriad Swords, one of the twelve courts of heaven, treated it as treasure was enough to see how special it was.","“My Cloud-gathering sword needs it. The sword spirit of the Cloud-gathering sword has told me that the presence of the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing has spread extremely far. Sword spirits can sense it and are attracted to it in a special way, so many people must have sensed it. A struggle will be unavoidable. The two of you, I hope you can lend me a hand when the time comes so that I can claim it!” the Profound Spirit Master said to the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt and the Black Wind Immortal Exalt.","As one of the five ancestors of the Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights, as well as a Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, he possessed several high quality god artifacts.","A huge stone tablet several dozen metres tall stood in a certain location on the side of the mountain. It was engraved with over a hundred sword movements. Each move and form contained the truths of the world, hiding the paths of the ways. It was extremely profound.","This was clearly a rather deep secret technique of the Way of the Sword. The sword moves were like a creation of nature, completely flawless in appearance. It seemed like they were manifesting the world, displaying the creation of the universe.","A person sat beneath the stone tablet. The Laws of the Sword permeated his surroundings as the pressure of an Immortal Exalt filled the woods.","He was the city lord of the Immortal Rising City of the Hall Brilliance Heaven, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu!","Immortal Exalt Tan Yu opened his eyes slowly. He stared at the stone tablet before him deeply and sighed gently. “These are sword moves left behind by the Skyscraping Sword Venerable after all. They’re far too profound. With my mastery at the Second Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt, I struggle to comprehend the mysteries it contains.”","“I think that without several decades of thought and contemplation, I’ll probably struggle to even gain a basic grasp over it.”","“This stone tablet should be one of the nine secret sword techniques that the Skyscraping Sword Venerable left behind. Whenever the Skyscraping World opens, the nine secret sword techniques will appear in different locations. Encountering them comes down to pure luck.”","“Looks like I’ll have to stay here for a very long time.”","When he reached there, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu exhaled and smiled gently. “Originally, I came here for the seed of ways. Now that fellow Yang Yutian is contending for it, I have no chance at all anymore. I encountered one of the nine secret sword techniques that the Skyscraping Sword Venerable left behind, so you can say that this is quite a worthwhile trip.”","At this moment, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu’s expression changed. In the next moment, a sword suddenly appeared in front of him. The sword churned with light, radiating with the pressure of a high quality god artifact.","After a simple conversation with the sword spirit, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu immediately began to hesitate.","“Whatever. Since you desire the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing so much, I’ll visit it. If I can claim it, I’ll leave you satisfied. However, there are many experts in the Skyscraping World, so don’t hold your hopes too high.” Immortal Exalt Tan Yu made up his mind. After saying that to the sword spirit, he made a note of the stone tablet’s location before vanishing with a flash. ꞦÄŊǒbЁś","......","...","Jian Chen furrowed his brows firmly as he stood around the sword pool that supported the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing. He became even more grim. From time to time, he would glance back at the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing at the bottom of the cave. He was concerned.","“More and more experts are being drawn over by the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing’s presence.” Jian Chen sighed gently. He used the spiritual Qi as his eyes, so he could sense all of the disturbances within ten thousand kilometres of him. He had already detected the presence of three Immortal Emperors rapidly approaching this place from different directions.","Five seconds later, the first person finally arrived. He was a Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor. He was the closest, so he was the first person to reach within a hundred kilometres of the sword pool.","“Hahaha, there’s probably no one who’s arrived here before me. Looks like this heavenly resource is mine.” The Immortal Emperor swept the surroundings with the senses of his soul, but he failed to sense Jian Chen. He could not help but laugh excitedly, already ready to pick the heavenly resource before fleeing immediately.","Due to the special environment of the Skyscraping World, as long as he fled far enough, no one would know he was the one who picked the fruit.","At this moment, a streak of light flashed over. A powerful pressure enveloped him, making the Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor who had arrived here first feel the presence of death envelop him.","In that critical moment, he took out a shield and blocked.","The shield was a medium quality god artifact. It shone with resplendent light, turning into a powerful barrier.","Boom! With a rumble, the streak of light landed on the shield, cutting it in half like butter. Afterwards, the streak of light continued onwards and swept past the Immortal Emperor.","Blood sprayed through the air. The Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor had been directly bisected along his waist.","However, an injury like that was not fatal to Immortal Emperors. He was in great shock, immediately controlling the top half of his body to retreat.","Only now did he notice that a figure clad in ancient armour had appeared silently. The armour covered his entire body. Only a pair of eyes remained exposed.","He clutched a shining high quality god artifact sword in his hand.","That was Jian Chen wearing the Divine Armour of Heavenflight!","“Leave here, or you will lose your life!” Jian Chen stared at the Immortal Emperor coldly and said indifferently.","“Thank you for sparing my life!” The Immortal Emperor was not a fool. He was aware that Jian Chen’s attack earlier was completely enough to kill him. Without any hesitation, he left with the lower half of his body in his arms.","Ten seconds after the Immortal Emperor had left, a second Immortal Emperor reached this place. He was an Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor.","However, when he reached within a hundred kilometres of the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, he was met with a blinding streak of light.","Spurt! The Immortal Emperor immediately sprayed blood. The medium quality god artifact on him shattered to pieces.","“Leave! You cannot contend for it!” Jian Chen said.","“Hahaha, whether I can contend for this heavenly resource is not up to you to decide.” The Immortal Emperor sneered. Shortly afterwards, he took out a tablet, planning on threatening Jian Chen. “I am...”","But before he could finish what he was saying, Jian Chen suddenly thrust out with the Heaven-lifting sword. Faced with the startling strike of a high quality god artifact, the Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor old man stood no chance at all. He was cut in half along his chest.","“No matter what organisation you come from, even if you’re a great elder of the twelve courts of heaven, only death awaits you if you don’t leave.” Jian Chen’s icy voice was devoid of emotion."]},{"number":3860,"title":"Chapter 3860: The Seven Lambs Ancestor","paragraphs":["When he heard that, the Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor old man’s face sank. He snorted coldly. “Sir, who exactly are you? Which organisation are you from? You are so out of your mind that you don’t even take the twelve courts of heaven seriously. Aren’t you being a little too arrogant?”","However, the reply he received was a powerful strand of sword Qi that shimmered like a waterfall, glowing like a galaxy. As the strand of sword Qi sliced through space, it seemed to split the heavens from the earth.","The Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor old man’s eyes narrowed. From the attack, he could sense a chilling pressure, as well as the aura of death that even made his soul tremble.","“ I-is this really an Immortal Emperor? Even those experts who have already reached the Ninth Heavenly Layer of Immortal Emperor are nowhere near as shocking in might, right? ” The Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor old man was in shock. Jian Chen’s attack actually gave him the impression that he was facing an Immortal Exalt.","That was because Jian Chen cultivated Chaotic Force. His battle prowess had always been great, enough to be regarded as invincible among his peers. Coupled with powering the Heaven-lifting sword with Chaotic Force, he could unleash eighty percent of the high quality god artifact’s power. As such, he completely surpassed the Ninth Heavenly Layer of Immortal Emperor.","With the Heaven-lifting sword in hand, Jian Chen was already no weaker than newly-broken-through Immortal Exalts.","At that moment of life or death, the Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor tossed out an ancient talisman. The talisman burned in the air and released a shocking energy, immediately forming a barrier around him.","After using the talisman, the old man was very much pained, as that was one of his very few life-preserving measures. It could withstand the attack of a First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, which made it quite precious.","Boom! With a startling rumble, the sword Qi produced by the Heaven-lifting sword slammed into the energy barrier from the talisman, immediately making the barrier shake violently. In the end, it shattered after lasting for a few seconds.","However, before the barrier had shattered, the Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor had already fled without any hesitation, vanishing in a split second.","Jian Chen used the spiritual Qi there as his eyes, so he obviously could see him clearly, but he did not pursue him.","That was because even more Immortal Emperors had already entered the ten thousand kilometres range from all directions, rushing towards the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing.","“ Immortal Emperors form the majority of the people that roam the surroundings. The Immortal Exalts should all be higher up, so those that arrive here first will be Immortal Emperors. However, as time goes on, Immortal Exalts will come too. ”","“ If they’re just Immortal Emperors, then I can stop them, but if several Immortal Exalts come, I’ll be in trouble. ” Jian Chen remained right by the side of the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing. He was rather worried.","“ I hope the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing can finish evolving before those Immortal Exalts get here, ” Jian Chen thought. He had already begun contemplating whether he should call out the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt for assistance.","However, once the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt showed himself, he would expose his secret of the sovereign god artifact divine hall.","That was because there were only so many Immortal Exalts that entered the Skyscraping World. Basically all of them could be identified. If someone appeared out of nowhere, it was very easy for others to deduce things.","The mask from the Illusionary Daemon race could deal with this issue perfectly, but he was in greater need of this heavenly resource!","At this moment, Jian Chen’s expression changed slightly. He had already noticed that an Immortal Exalt’s presence had entered his range of detection.","It was a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt that he had met outside. It was said that his original form was a Rainbow Antelope, so people called him the Seven Antelope Ancestor. He was a native immortal beast and the leader of a sect, but he did not have a particularly powerful background.","“This presence... seems to be a Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing. Such a high grade Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing is extremely rare in the Immortals’ World. If I offer this Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing up to the Immortal Sect of Myriad Swords, that’ll be a colossal favour.” By now, the Seven Antelope Ancestor was only a few thousand kilometres away from the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing. He wrinkled his nose as he became excited.","“The Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing is useless to me, but I can forge a connection with the Immortal Sect of Myriad Swords through it, which is better than any of the fortunes here...”","“I have to obtain this Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing no matter what, even if I end up offending some organisations that I can’t afford to provoke.”","The Seven Antelope Ancestor made up his mind. His eyes shone with burning desire as he moved even faster.","......","...","At this moment, three Immortal Emperors arrived within a hundred kilometres of the sword pool at the same time. They all noticed Jian Chen who stood at the entrance of the cave with the Heaven-lifting sword while clad in the Divine Armour of Heavenflight.","The three of them glanced past Jian Chen before directly looking at the cave that led to the sword pool behind him. Afterwards, without uttering a single word, they drew their god artifacts and flew towards the sword pool at the same time.","None of them were fools. They all knew that the presence of the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing had drawn over many people. They all wanted to obtain this heavenly resource as quickly as possible before fleeing, using the special environment of the Skyscraping World to cover themselves.","“All of you, piss off. A treasure like this is not something that the likes of you can even touch.” At this moment, the Seven Antelope Ancestor arrived. His presence as a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt flooded the surroundings. He struck out directly, swinging his hand at the three Immortal Emperors from afar.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","With three grunts, the three Immortal Emperors were all knocked away, spurting blood with pale faces.","“I am a great elder of the Daoist Sect of Immortal Fortune. Seven Antelope Ancestor, are you trying to make an enemy out of our Daoist Sect of Immortal Fortune?” a late Immortal Emperor middle-aged man among the three Immortal Emperors asked sternly.","When he heard him mention the Daoist Sect of Immortal Fortune, the Seven Antelope Ancestor clearly hesitated. That was a peak organisation he could not afford to offend.","However, his hesitation only appeared for a split second before being replaced by determination. “The treasures of the world obviously go to those who are capable. Stop trying to use the organisation behind you to threaten others. If everyone is supposed to follow that rule, just who can compete against the daughter of the heavenly emperor, princess Xing Caijian, this time?”","The great elder from the Daoist Sect of Immortal Fortune’s face sank. “Seven Antelope Ancestor, once I get back, I’ll definitely report this to the ancestor!”","The Seven Antelope Ancestor ignored him. He did not hesitate at all, immediately rushing towards the sword pool where the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing grew.","“You can move aside too!” As he approached Jian Chen near the entrance, the Seven Antelope Ancestor bellowed out and launched a palm strike. The pressure of an Immortal Emperor even made the surrounding space collapse!","That attack was enough to threaten any Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor!","Jian Chen did not retreat. Chaotic Force surged through his body wildly. The Heaven-lifting Sword shone with blinding light as he slashed out with his full strength!","Boom!","With a deafening boom, a wild storm of energy surged through the surroundings.","Jian Chen was knocked back. The Heaven-lifting sword in his hand dimmed considerably as his presence fluctuated. Even his organs churned.","The Seven Antelope Ancestor also came to a halt.","Jian Chen has forcefully blocked him with that attack.","“Are you really an Immortal Emperor?” The Seven Antelope Ancestor was astounded. He was a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, so his battle prowess was well beyond a First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt’s. He had never imagined that an Immortal Emperor could block his attack without suffering any injuries.","It was just a casual strike, but logically speaking, that still was not something that an Immortal Emperor could block.","The three Immortal Emperors who had been injured by the Seven Antelope Ancestor were surprised as well. They stared at Jian Chen in shock.","By now, Jian Chen had already recovered. The Heaven-lifting sword in his hand shone with blinding light as endless sword intent flowed around him.","“Since you won’t move aside, you better not blame me for what happens next.” The Seven Antelope Ancestor’s face turned cold. He formed a fist and struck out with a terrifying storm of energy.","The power behind his attack this time was beyond anything that his previous strike to compare to.","At the same time, Jian Chen immediately slashed out with the Heaven-lifting sword. He used the Shadowless Lifetaking Strike. The Laws of the Sword and the Laws of Space merged together. The sword slashed into space and bypassed the distance between them, as well as all of the Seven Antelope Ancestor’s defensive measures. The powerful sword Qi directly erupted inside the Seven Antelope Ancestor.","The Seven Antelope Ancestor’s face changed drastically. His eyes were filled with shock and disbelief. With a grunt, his body shuddered violently as a smear of blood flowed out from the corner of his lips."]},{"number":3861,"title":"Chapter 3861: Immortal Exalts Gather","paragraphs":["“H-how is that possible... You can actually injure me! What is this secret technique!?” the Seven Antelope Ancestor said in shock. The way he looked at Jian Chen immediately changed.","He was a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, yet he had actually been injured by an Immortal Emperor junior today. On top of that, the Immortal Emperor was still a fair bit off from the Ninth Heavenly Layer. This was definitely unprecedented.","As a matter of fact, if news of this spread, he would even be reduced to a laughing stock.","“Senior, please stop here!” Jian Chen said forcefully, filled with determination.","At that moment, he stood outside the cave with the Heaven-lifting sword in hand like a wall. He seemed like he was ready to hold off whoever that came at him.","Even if he faced Immortal Exalts, he would not be backing down!","An Immortal Emperor had actually said something like that to an Immortal Exalt, which immediately left the Seven Antelope Ancestor exasperated. His face immediately turned cold as he said frostily, “Junior, the secret technique you used earlier is indeed extraordinary. Even I could not block it. However, if you think you can stop me with this secret technique, you’d be far too naive.”","“The secret technique can indeed harm me, but it’s no different from a scratch. If you have your wits about you, move aside now, or I definitely won’t show any mercy at all,” the Seven Antelope Ancestor replied firmly.","From the presence and disturbance alone, he could tell how extraordinary the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing up ahead was. If he offered it up to the Immortal Sect of Myriad Swords, the contribution would be tremendous. It would lead to endless benefits to both him and his organisation.","As a result, the Seven Antelope Ancestor had already developed the determination to cut down everything in his way.","Even if he provoked a few powerful enemies, so what? If he could form a connection with the Immortal Sect of Myriad Swords, all of these difficulties and obstacles would vanish.","“You can’t get it!” Jian Chen said sternly.","Nearby, the three Immortal Emperors injured by the Seven Antelope Ancestor were stunned. This was the first time they had ever witnessed such a firm reply from an Immortal Emperor to a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. To think that an Immortal Emperor could remain so composed and unfazed when facing an Immortal Emperor.","“What a joke. You’re a mere Immortal Emperor, yet you think you can stop me?” The Seven Antelope Ancestor understood that time was tight. He no longer wasted any more time. He formed a seal with both hands and dazzling, rainbow light immediately appeared, turning into a seven-coloured arrow that pierced the air with startling pressure, rushing straight towards Jian Chen.","This was one of the Seven Antelope Ancestor’s secret techniques. With that being used, it meant the Seven Antelope Ancestor was already using his full strength.","Jian Chen’s Divine Armour of Heavenflight began to glow. He pushed its defences as a high quality god artifact to the limit. At the same time, the Heaven-lifting sword in his hand erupted with light, slashing out with full strength.","Boom!","With a bang, the Heaven-lifting sword dimmed again. Jian Chen was completely blown away. The Divine Armour of Heavenflight was undamaged, but the powerful force passed through the armour and entered his body, rupturing his organs.","He grunted and blood welled up in his throat before he forced it back down.","But shortly afterwards, the power of the Source of Life appeared. It cycled through Jian Chen’s body with a great regenerative energy. Immediately, his injuries began to heal at an unbelievable pace. RαꞐộBËṩ","Instantly, Jian Chen made a complete recovery. All of his injuries were gone!","The eyes of the Seven Antelope Ancestor who sensed Jian Chen’s changes narrowed slightly. He felt surprised, but shortly afterwards, he gritted his teeth, and his hands began to dance around in front of him. He formed seal after seal. A terrifying presence radiated from him.","Immediately, a tremendous might of the world filled the surroundings. The colossal and valiant figure of an antelope appeared behind him.","This was a God Tier Immortal Technique!","God Tier Immortal Techniques could often be used to defeat those stronger than the caster. A God Tier Immortal Technique used by a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt could already pose a certain level of threat to Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts!","Of course, that would only apply to regular Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts!","“The Seven Antelope Ancestor actually used a God Tier Immortal Technique against an Immortal Emperor. Isn’t this overkill...”","“How can an Immortal Emperor withstand a God Tier Immortal Technique used by a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt? This person is dead for sure now...”","“Yeah, even if he’s protected by a high quality god artifact armour, it’s useless. He can’t unleash the full power of the armour at all as an Immortal Emperor. He’ll be shaken to death by the attack.”","The expressions of the three Immortal Emperors spectating nearby all changed. Following their shock, they were filled with pity, acting as if Jian Chen was already dead to them.","As Jian Chen watched the Seven Antelope Ancestor use the God Tier Immortal Technique, he did not panic at all. Instead, he began to smile mysteriously.","He immediately mobilised his ultimate will, turning it into an invisible blade that slashed down in a manner that no one else present could sense. He immediately severed the connection between the God Tier Immortal Technique and the ways of the world.","The Seven Antelope Ancestor’s God Tier Immortal Technique went from devastating in might with a shocking disturbance to a deflated balloon, collapsing on itself. All of the pressure vanished before dissipating as a great ball of spiritual Qi.","“W-what is this?” The Seven Antelope Ancestor widened his eyes and stared at the collapsed God Tier Immortal Technique in shock. He blanked out.","As the Seven Antelope Ancestor was dumbfounded, Jian Chen did not waste any time as well. He swung the Heaven-lifting sword and used the Shadowless Lifetaking Strike. The Laws of the Sword and the Laws of Space merged together, bypassing all of the Seven Antelope Ancestor’s defences and directly attacking his body.","The Seven Antelope Ancestor grunted and blood flowed from the corner of his lips. His organs were injured once again.","“ Damn you! ” He returned to his senses and cursed inside. He became irritated. He had never imagined that a mere Immortal Emperor could reduce him to such a sorry state.","Right when he was about to take action, he suddenly sensed something. He looked into the distance as his face became ugly.","Jian Chen’s heart sank as well. Using the spiritual Qi in the surroundings, he had already noticed the presence of a second Immortal Exalt several thousand kilometres away.","And, right when the Immortal Exalt appeared, another Immortal Exalt entered his range from another direction.","More and more Immortal Exalts arrived here. As time went on, this number continued to increase!","Jian Chen glanced back at the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing at the bottom of the cave behind him. He let out a gentle sigh. He felt powerless.","The Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing had still not completed its breakthrough!","And it still could not be picked yet, or everything would be ruined!","“Dammit! Get out of my way!” The Seven Antelope Ancestor began to panic. He did not hold back, completely erupting with his cultivation as a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt as he rushed towards Jian Chen unstoppably.","It was getting more and more urgent. He needed to obtain the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing before the other Immortal Exalts arrived.","Jian Chen was undaunted. He shone brightly as he also charged towards the Seven Antelope Ancestor with the Heaven-lifting sword in hand!","With his strength as an Immortal Emperor, the courage and boldness he demonstrated when he swung his sword towards a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt fearlessly deeply shocked the Immortal Emperors nearby.","Boom!","With that, Jian Chen was knocked back once again. His armour dimmed as blood sprayed from his mouth.","But by the next moment, he had made another full recovery.","Meanwhile, the Seven Antelope Ancestor had been stopped by Jian Chen at the cost of his injuries!","“Hahaha, Seven Antelope, looks like you’re not fated to obtain this item!” At this moment, a booming voice erupted in the surroundings. The presence of an Immortal Exalt radiated out. A figure had already arrived beside the Seven Antelope Ancestor like he had teleported over.","It was a middle-aged man in blue robes. He carried a high quality God Tier sword and radiated with the presence of a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt.","“And I had thought I was the first Immortal Exalt to get here. I never thought that I’d still be a step late.” Another elderly voice rang out. A third Immortal Exalt reached here. He was a ruddy old man, also a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt.","They directly looked past Jian Chen, gazing right into the cave. Their eyes were filled with greed, but when they glanced at the other two Immortal Exalts present, they began to hesitate again.","There were three Immortal Exalts present, and they were all evenly-matched. At a time like this, none of them dared to move carelessly, as whoever moved first would become the target of the other two.","“Have so many fellows arrived already? Looks like it’ll be quite difficult to split the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing.” A gruff voice rang out. A fourth Immortal Exalt appeared, a First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt.","Shortly afterwards, a figure that Jian Chen was extremely familiar with arrived as well. It was the city lord of the Immortal Rising City, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu!","“There are marks of battle here. Seven Antelope Ancestor, don’t tell me you were stopped by this Immortal Emperor?” The First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt laughed. He was a burly middle-aged man. He looked at Jian Chen in interest and curiosity.","Because Jian Chen was entirely clad in the Divine Armour of Heavenflight with only his eyes exposed, coupled with his presence hidden by the mask from the Illusionary Daemon race, all of the Immortal Exalts present could only discern Jian Chen’s strength through his Laws of the Sword, but they could not identify him through his presence.","“Hmph. This Immortal Emperor is not simple,” the Seven Antelope Ancestor said coldly. He looked at Jian Chen in hatred.","When they heard that, the other Immortal Exalts all looked at Jian Chen. When Immortal Exalt Tan Yu saw the Heaven-lifting sword in Jian Chen’s hand, his expression immediately changed slightly.","Through the Heaven-lifting sword, he had already identified Jian Chen, but he did not expose him.","“Little brother, are you planning on stopping all of us from entering at the same time with your strength as an Immortal Emperor?” The First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt looked at Jian Chen in interest and smiled gently.","“With my measly strength, I obviously cannot stop you from advancing past me. I will move aside right now. However, before I go, I have something to warn you. The Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing down below is reaching a new grade. Before it completes this process, it cannot be harvested, or you’ll only destroy it,” Jian Chen said calmly. He seemed to have given up on the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, stowing his sword away as soon as he said that. Then he left while everyone was watching, vanishing to a hundred kilometres away in the blink of an eye.","By now, over a dozen Immortal Exalts had already gathered.","If there was just one Immortal Exalt, perhaps they could fight for the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing without any regard, but now that enough Immortal Exalts had arrived, none of them had the courage to take any actions for the moment due to a balance of strength.","“Our Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights will be reserving this Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing in advance. I hope you can all do our Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights this favour.” At this moment, the Profound Spirit Master from the Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights arrived here as well with the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt and the Black Wind Immortal Exalt. The Profound Spirit Master glanced at everyone and declared with some arrogance.","Out of all the Immortal Exalts present, only he was at the Fourth Heavenly Layer. The rest were all early Immortal Exalts."]},{"number":3862,"title":"Chapter 3862: The Battle for the Spiritual Fruit","paragraphs":["When the Profound Spirit Master said that, the expressions of a few of the Immortal Exalts present immediately changed. The Seven Antelope Ancestor’s face also became extremely ugly.","They were all leaders of sects, figures who stood at the apex of their respective heavens, possessing lofty statuses.","However, the Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights that the Profound Spirit Master originated from was still an existence that they feared deeply.","That was because the Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights was no regular peak organisation. Even among peak organisations, there were only a handful that could rival the Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights. Very few people had the courage to provoke them.","Aside from that, just the Profound Spirit Master’s personal strength was enough to overwhelm most of them. At the very least, the Profound Spirit Master was one of the handful of mid Immortal Exalts that had entered the Skyscraping World!","“Everyone knows exactly how precious the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing is, let alone the fact that the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing here has already reached such a high grade. Such a precious treasure is not something that you can claim with just a word, Profound Spirit Master,” a voice rang out from afar. It was cold, even a little scornful.","The Profound Spirit Master’s face immediately darkened. He subconsciously followed the voice and glanced over. He saw a burly, middle-aged man make his way over at a steady pace. His hands were crossed behind him; his chest was bare, exposing his firm muscles, which seemed to contain explosive power.","The middle-aged man’s strength was not outstanding. He was only a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt.","However, when the Profound Spirit Master recognised him, the malice on his face immediately vanished, replaced by a gentle smile. He clasped his fist and said, “So it’s fellow Zuo Dao. Looks like fellow Zuo Dao is interested in the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing as well.”","“Who wouldn’t want something as unique as a Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing?” Zuo Dao glanced at the Profound Spirit Master and snorted gently.","The Profound Spirit Master could obviously tell that Zuo Dao was quite rude to him. If any other Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt tried to talk to him like that, perhaps the Profound Spirit Master would have issued a slight punishment.","However, Zuo Dao possessed the immense background of the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens, which the Profound Spirit Master feared very much. As a result, the Profound Spirit Master was forced to ignore Zuo Dao’s coldness. Instead, he even smiled apologetically. “Fellow Zuo Dao is completely correct. Spiritual Fruits of Sword Nurturing have always been rare in the Immortals’ World, let alone one of such high grade.”","The Profound Spirit Master paused. He looked at the depths of the cave and said, “Except we have so many people here, while there’s only a single Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing. In your opinion, how do you think we should split the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, fellow Zuo Dao?”","Zuo Dao narrowed his eyes and turned towards the bottom of the cave. He sank into his thoughts.","At this moment, a group of Immortal Exalts gathered over. The situation sank into a delicate balance. They did not begin fighting.","“Everyone, an Immortal Emperor junior said that the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing is still in the process of reaching a higher grade right now. They claimed it cannot be picked before this process is complete, or it’ll ruin the heavenly resource. In my opinion, why don’t we check on the exact situation before discussing how to allocate the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing?” An Immortal Exalt suggested.","“That’s not a bad idea. We can sense the presence of the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, but we need to see it for ourselves before we can come to a conclusion about its exact state.”","“Fair enough. Let’s be patient and check up on it first...”","Everyone agreed with the suggestion very quickly. With that, all of the Immortal Exalts gathered there made their way down to the bottom of the cave.","As the Immortal Exalts entered the cave, only a few Immortal Emperors were left outside.","“Let’s all disperse. With so many Immortal Exalts here, the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing won’t end up in our hands no matter what.”","“This is no longer something that we can participate in. Once the Immortal Exalts start fighting, we’ll only suffer from the backlash if we’re too close. C’mon, c’mon, let’s go. We’re not destined to obtain this heavenly resource.”","“Sigh, there’s none of our business here anymore. If we decide to be stubborn and bite off more than we can chew, we’ll only lose our lives...”","......","...","The Immortal Emperors gathered there all shook their heads and sighed before dispersing one by one.","At this moment, at the end of the cave, over a dozen Immortal Exalts gathered around the sword pool where the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing grew. Their eyes were glued to the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing that was breaking through, burning with interest. ṝάΝOBËS","“No wonder it caused such a great disturbance. So it’s not a regular Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing. It is one that has undergone an evolution such that its nature has changed slightly.”","“Heavenly resources that have evolved are as rare as they come in the Immortals’ World. These heavenly resources are worth at least ten times or even dozens of times more than before they evolved.”","“The Immortal Emperor was right. It’s true that we can’t pick the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing right now, or it’ll be completely destroyed. We need to wait until this is all completed.”","The group of Immortal Exalts discussed among themselves around the sword pool. With their insight and knowledge, they could obviously tell what situation the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing was currently in.","“If the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing manages to survive today and continues growing, perhaps there will a day in the future where it has the slightest possibility of transforming into a cultivator, where it will be able to take a human form, absorb the energy of the world, and cultivate just like us. A pity, what a pity...” An Immortal Exalt sighed and shook his head. He already understood that the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing could not escape the fate of being harvested.","Once it was picked from its main body, all of the possibilities and hopes of the future would be lost.","“Everyone, if you can let our Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights have this Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, then I can promise to all of you that everyone will receive a bountiful gift from our Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights once we leave here. Of course, if we really can’t reach an agreement, we’ll just have to compete for it once the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing ripens,” the Profound Spirit Master suddenly said to the people in the surroundings.","“I discovered the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing first, and I was the first one to arrive here too,” the Seven Antelope Ancestor said reluctantly. His face was extremely ugly. He utterly resented the Immortal Emperor who obstructed him.","Even when he found out that the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing was not ripe, even when he knew that he could not pick it even if he was the first one here, he still hated Jian Chen to the bone.","At this moment, one of the Immortal Exalts present suddenly took action. With a flick of his finger, a bolt of lightning shot out, heading right towards the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing.","He was a First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. He knew that with his strength, he would struggle to obtain the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, so he wanted to destroy it.","“Stop!”","“How dare you!”","“You want to destroy the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing? You’re asking to die!”","The nearby Immortal Exalts bellowed. The Profound Spirit Master responded very quickly. With a swing of his hand, surging energy swept out. It moved even faster than the attack, directly shattering the First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt’s flick. At the same time, his left hand darted out and erupted with the might of a Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, flying towards that person mercilessly.","At the same time, a few of the Immortal Exalts nearby also took action, furiously attacking the Immortal Exalt who tried to destroy the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing.","“Hehehehe, you can forget about obtaining something that I can’t obtain.” The First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt sneered. He had been prepared from the moment he took action. He immediately vanished, avoiding everyone’s attacks before teleporting directly above the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, slamming down with his hand.","“Galaxial Curtain!” At that critical moment, Zuo Dao from the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens bellowed out. He formed a fist and terrifying energy gathered before he directly swung out.","The power of the fist filled the air. It was extremely startling. A galaxy seemed to be conjured, containing the profound powers of the stars.","Boom!","With a grunt, the First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt above the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing was directly sent flying by Zuo Dao. The powerful energy storm wreaked havoc in the cave.","Immediately, several Immortal Exalts took action, casting down an energy barrier around the sword pool to block the devastating storm of energy.","The Profound Spirit Master took action as well. He produced a huge net that radiated with the might of a high quality god artifact, immediately enveloping the entire sword pool. It glistened with light and formed a thick barrier."]},{"number":3863,"title":"Chapter 3863: The Sword Sect of Yang Soul","paragraphs":["A storm of energy wreaked havoc in the bottom of the cave, slamming against the walls with a devastating presence while emitting tremendous rumbles.","The tiny cave had abruptly become the centre of a storm. Several Immortal Exalts struck out. Just the storm of energy alone could heavily injure Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperors.","Let alone Immortal Emperors, even the First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts around the sword pool had to unleash their full strength to protect themselves.","Some of the weaker First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts had even stumbled backwards uncontrollably.","“Galaxial Curtain! This is one of the ultimate secret techniques of the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens. It’s said that it was created by a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt ancestor in the history of the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens. It has the power to mobilise the powers of galaxies...”","An Immortal Exalt sighed in amazement. Most of the rampaging energy in the cave was created by Zuo Dao’s secret technique.","The presence of the First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt who tried to destroy the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing immediately waned after enduring Zuo Dao’s secret technique. His body had almost collapsed from the attack.","With just a single attack, the First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt was basically left half-dead!","But in the next moment, essence blood sprayed from his mouth. The essence blood turned into an eerie cloud that enveloped him. Shortly afterwards, he vanished into thin air, having fled already.","With his departure, the battle that unfolded at the bottom of the cave came to a halt. The violent energy storm slowly subsided.","The energy barrier that the Immortal Exalts had cast towards was still present around the sword pool. On the outside, there was even the protection from the Profound Spirit Master and a high quality god artifact.","Everyone’s combined efforts to protect the sword pool made it virtually impenetrable.","The cave itself was undamaged as well. Powerful formations criss-crossed this place. Let alone the battle between a few early and mid Immortal Exalts, even late Immortal Exalts would struggle to damage this place.","By now, a few more Immortal Exalts had arrived .","“Everyone, I come from the Sword Sect of Yang Soul on the Wondrous Success Heaven. This Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing is extremely important to our Sword Sect of Yang Soul, so I hope you can let our Sword Sect of Yang Soul take it!” At this moment, an old man in fiery-red robes stood forward slowly. He looked around. His elderly voice was filled with vigour.","“The Sword Sect of Yang Soul of the Wondrous Success Heaven? It’s said that they’re a peak organisation with a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, who also happens to be an expert of the Way of the Sword. They’re extremely powerful, no weaker than the strongest ancestor of the Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights at all...”","“Wasn’t the Profound Spirit Master trying to overwhelm everyone with his background? He’s met his opponent now...”","......","...","Many of the Immortal Exalts present had heard about the Sword Sect of Yang Soul, which made their faces change rapidly. The pressure that came from the competition for the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing had increased substantially yet again.","The Profound Spirit Master’s face changed slightly. At this moment, the Immortal Exalt from the Sword Sect of Yang Soul suddenly looked towards Zuo Dao from the Divine Valley of the Nine heavens and smiled gently. He clasped his fist and said, “Fellow Zuo Dao, I never thought you’d be here too. I hope you can lend me some assistance. The Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing truly is extremely important to our Sword Sect of Yang Soul.” RÀNοBЁṨ","Zuo Dao’s expression changed before nodding rather stiffly. He agreed to the request silently.","Zuo Dao’s attitude left some of the Immortal Exalts surprised. They found it unbelievable.","What kind of organization was the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens? They had an Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt and had once reigned over the Wondrous Success Heaven for countless years. During their peak, they even had a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. Even throughout the Immortals’ World, they were renowned.","Meanwhile, the Sword Sect of Yang Soul happened to be one of the peak organisations of the Wondrous Success Heaven, but their strongest expert was only a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. They were not weak, but they came nowhere close to the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens.","As a result, Zuo Dao’s attitude towards the Sword Sect of Yang Soul seemed extremely illogical in everyone’s eyes.","The Profound Spirit Master’s eyes shone. He looked over and said, “You should be the Heavenloss Master of the Sword Sect of Yang Soul. Every single one of us wants the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, so I struggle to understand just why your Sword Sect of Yang Soul is capable of making us all stand down?”","The Heavenloss Master from the Sword Sect of Yang Soul smiled and said, “If this were a million years ago, I’d obviously never even try something like this. In fact, I would not even have the courage to compete against fellow Profound Spirit with my strength as a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt.","“However, our Sword Sect of Yang Soul has become completely different now.”","The Heavenloss Master smiled mysteriously and confidently, but he did not elaborate.","“How so? Don’t tell me that fellow from the Sword Sect of Yang Soul has already broken through and reached the Seventh Heavenly Layer?” The Profound Spirit Master narrowed his eyes slightly. He still did not find it logical. Even if he reached the Seventh Heavenly Layer, there was no reason for Zuo Dao of the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens to be so cautious around him.","“Fellow Zuo Dao, I think it’s best if you explain it to everyone.” The Heavenloss Master looked at Zuo Dao with a smile.","Zuo Dao said seriously, “The Sword Apostle of the Sword Sect of Yang Soul tied the knot with the fifth princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance one million years ago. The Sword Apostle also happened to be a direct descendant of fellow Heavenloss.”","“What, a disciple of the Sword Sect of Yang Soul married a princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance?”","Many of the Immortal Exalts present were shocked when they heard what Zuo Dao said.","The Sword Apostle of the Sword Sect of Yang Soul was equivalent to a holy maiden or chosen disciple of other sects. They enjoyed significant status. However, the part that shocked them was not the Sword Apostle of the Sword Sect of Yang Soul, but the person he married.","They had heard about the fifth princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance before. She was not outstanding, having only reached the First Heavenly Layer of Immortal Monarch.","However, her eldest sister was a terrifying figure that could bring chills to countless experts in the Immortals’ World!","After learning about this connection, the Profound Spirit Master from the Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights gasped as well. His heart skipped a beat as he made a decision without any hesitation at all. He clasped his fist towards the Heavenloss Master. “Congratulations! Congratulations! Fellow Heavenloss, since your Sword Sect of Yang Soul is in need of the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, our Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights will back down from the competition.”","The Seven Antelope Ancestor who had been willing to offend some peak organisations and still wanted to compete for the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing had completely given up on hope now.","When it came to some peak organisations, he could take a risk and compete against them, but there were other peak organisations that he could not afford to have a scuffle with.","“The Sword Apostle of the Sword Sect of Yang Soul has married the first princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance. That means that they’ve forged a rigid tie with the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance. In this current age, just which ignorant bastard is still bold enough to offend the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance...”","“Exactly. Even the flagrant and haughty Sacred Beast clan still ended up humiliating themselves before the Heavenly Palace of Great Brilliance. The Heavenly Palace of Great Brilliance is as prominent as the midday sun right now...”","“Who knows what kind of luck this Sword Apostle of the Sword Sect of Yang Soul has. He actually managed to capture the heart of the fifth princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance...”","Many of the Immortal Exalts were envious."]},{"number":3864,"title":"Chapter 3864: Outcome Unknown","paragraphs":["“As a representative of the Sword Sect of Yang Soul, I thank fellow Profound Spirit for your sacrifice. Once we leave the Skyscraping World, I will definitely visit with rich gifts in thanks!” The Heavenloss Master was in high spirits. His face was filled with undisguised pride and arrogance. However, he did not become complacent, still clasping his fist and thanking him modestly.","“Hahahaha, our Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights will definitely welcome you at any time. We will receive you with the force of the entire sect.” The Profound Spirit Master laughed aloud. In the past, there was no reason for their Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights to treat the Sword Sect of Yang Soul like this. After all, the Sword Sect of Yang Soul was weaker than the Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights, and also far too distant. They never really had any contact.","But it was different now. The Sword Sect of Yang Soul had forged a tie with the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance, which forced them to change how they treated the Sword Sect of Yang Soul.","Regardless of whether the Immortal Exalts present actually knew each other or not, they all reached an oddly-uniform agreement. They all expressed their salutations for the Heavenloss Master.","Everyone had given up on competing for the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing.","The Heavenloss Master was in a fantastic mood. He smiled from ear to ear, thanking every single person politely. Shortly afterwards, he turned his attention to the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing in the sword pool and said, “Actually, our Sword Sect of Yang Soul doesn’t want this Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing for ourselves. We want to offer it up to the elder princess!”","When they heard the elder princess, all of the Immortal Exalts present gasped. Their hearts skipped a beat.","Very clearly, the words “elder princess” possessed extremely great power over everyone present, where just hearing her name would strike fear into their hearts.","“With the elder princess’s status, very few items in the world can still interest her. Even high grade God Tier heavenly resources are useless. Although the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing here is a high grade God Tier heavenly resource, it’s just too rare, which is why it would serve as the best present,” the Heavenloss Master continued. He was in a great mood.","It was as if being able to approach the elder princess was something of utmost glory, something that could even make Immortal Exalt ancestors feel proud.","“ So this item is for the elder princess... ”","“ Since this is for the elder princess, wouldn’t we be stealing from the elder princess if we try to take it for ourselves? ”","“ The elder princess’s influence in the Immortals’ World has probably already surpassed the Immortal Sect of Myriad Swords. With that, even the people who want to give this item to the Immortal Sect of Myriad Swords should completely give up on too. ”","Many of the Immortal Exalts sighed inside. Since the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing would be connected to the elder princess, it had become a very touchy object. No one could afford to lay a finger on it.","That was because the elder princess was different from the Immortal Sect of Myriad Swords. If this item was offered to the Immortal Sect of Myriad Swords, the Immortal Sect of Myriad Swords would definitely welcome them warmly, as they were in desperate need of Spiritual Fruits of Sword Nurturing. Basically whenever a battle over Spiritual Fruits of Sword Nurturing occurred outside, there would be numerous disciples of the Immortal Sect of Myriad Swords involved.","However, not everyone could give gifts to the elder princess. They needed to have a certain level of connection to her.","“The Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing should go to the Sword Sect of Yang Soul. I’ll be the last person to spare anyone who tried to steal it.” The Seven Antelope Ancestor adjusted his mind state quickly.","“Before the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing is picked by fellow Heavenloss, our Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights will also do everything we can to watch over this place, just in case any other person tries to destroy the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing.” The Profound Spirit Master from the Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights chuckled.","The Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt and the Black Wind Immortal Exalt who stood by his side had mixed feelings. They glanced at the Heavenloss Master from time to time. They were filled with envy.","In order to forge a connection with the Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights, the two of them had already racked their brains. They even followed the Profound Spirit Master like servants in the Skyscraping World.","Yet in the end, a great-grandson of the Heavenloss Master had married the fifth princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance. Suddenly, they had become an organisation that even the Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights was afraid to provoke.","Comparing all of this, the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt and the Black Wind Immortal Exalt were filled with a multitude of feelings.","Immortal Exalt Tan Yu in the crowd sighed to himself as well. The sword spirit in his god artifact constantly transmitted its desires over to him, but how could he have the courage to contend for it?","Immortal Exalt Tan Yu did not leave either, remaining right by the sword pool without budging just like everyone else, trying to use this opportunity to create a good impression with the Sword Sect of Yang Soul.","During the next few days, a few more Immortal Exalts arrived here, but when they learnt about the relationship between the Sword Sect of Yang Soul and the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance, they immediately dismissed their desires for the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing. They either left or stayed behind to help the Sword Sect of Yang Soul guard the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing until it ripened.","All was calm.","The Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing spent almost half a month breaking through. Finally, the surging spiritual Qi in the sword pool began to settle down. The Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing that had been cloaked in thick mist was clearly presented before everyone.","Its external appearance did not change. The only difference was it had reached a higher grade, which made it shine brightly.","The Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing had completed its growth process! It had formally reached the eighth grade!","“The Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing is already ripe. Everyone, we will remove the formations so that the Heavenloss Master can harvest it,” the Profound Spirit Master said. Shortly afterwards, with a flip of his hand, the net around the sword pool was removed.","With that, the other Immortal Exalts all began to remove their powers as well.","As the various energy barriers that had been cast around the sword pool vanished, the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing was exposed before everyone defencelessly.","But now, no one dared to fight for it any more.","“Heavenloss Master, please go for it!” The Profound Spirit Master made an inviting gesture to the Heavenloss Master. He was extremely polite.","Looking at the surrounding leaders of sects who clearly desired the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing yet lacked the courage, the Heavenloss Master was immediately filled with a great sense of pride. He smiled resplendently, tidying his clothes without any urgency. Then he took out some spiritual fluid from his Space Ring to wash his hands as if he was afraid that the grime on his hands would dirty the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing.","He did this all very slowly and thoroughly as if he enjoyed this feeling of veneration very much. After all, the people who gathered here were not nobodies. There were even ancestors of sects that were stronger than him.","Only after completing all that did the Heavenloss Master take out a delicate jade box. Then he slowly approached the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing.","However, right when the Heavenloss Master was about to pick the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, an armoured hand silently extended out with a ripple of the Laws of Space. It picked the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing with lightning speed before the Heavenloss Master could before instantly vanishing again.","From beginning to end, it did not give off any presence. Despite all the Immortal Exalts gathered here, none of them sensed anyone hidden away in the shadows.","The Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing had already vanished from the sword pool. Meanwhile, the Heavenloss Master was left stunned with his arm half extended as if he had never anticipated that someone would be so bold that they would steal a gift for the elder princess.","“Who is it!? Get out here right now!” The Profound Spirit Master was the first to react. With a bellow, his pressure as a Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt swept out, directly striking the space with his hand. He stirred up a terrifying storm of energy in the cave.","The Immortal Exalts in the surroundings all used their energy to fend off the pressure. Some First Heavenly Layer and Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts stumbled back uncontrollably.","A grunt rang out from the space there. As the space twisted violently, a figure clad in armour appeared. The armour wrapped around him firmly, with just a pair of eyes exposed.","“It’s you!” Seeing who it was, the Seven Antelope Ancestor’s anger immediately surged. He had already recognised him as the Immortal Emperor who had intercepted him at the entrance."]},{"number":3865,"title":"Chapter 3865: Stealing From Jaws of a Tiger","paragraphs":["“How bold of this little Immortal Emperor. To think that you’d even be bold enough to steal from her majesty the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Brilliance,” the Seven Antelope Ancestor bellowed. Despite utterly hating Jian Chen, he could not help but feel admiration for the boldness and daring that he showed right now.","After all, just which Immortal Emperor was bold enough to steal from a group of Immortal Exalt ancestors?","And which Immortal Emperor would be unfazed by the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance, stealing from the jaws of a tiger?","The Heavenloss Master did not take action. He looked at Jian Chen who was clad in the Divine Armour of Heavenflight and folded his arms slowly. He said coldly, “With the protection of something like this, you must have some background. However, before you tried to steal the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, shouldn’t you have first tried to understand who this item belongs to? Otherwise, rashly stealing it would only bring endless disaster to the organisation behind you.”","Jian Chen did not say anything. He activated the ability of the Divine Armour of Heavenflight again and immediately vanished without leaving any trace behind. He could not even be detected through the senses of the soul.","He had discovered the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing. It was all because of him that the Skyscraping Sword Venerable had sacrificed part of his lingering will, which allowed the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing complete its breakthrough in such a short amount of time.","However, no one cared about this. Without sufficient strength, even if treasures already entered their possession, it would only be stolen by someone stronger.","As a result, Jian Chen could only rely on his abilities to compete for the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing if he wanted it.","Seeing how Jian Chen had vanished again, the Heavenloss Master’s face immediately sank.","“You want to leave? It won’t be that easy! Leave behind the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing!” the Profound Spirit Master bellowed furiously. He struck out once again. His surging cultivation as a Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt swept through the surroundings violently like a volcano eruption. It was particularly vicious, making the space in the cave twist violently.","Severely disturbed, Jian Chen was forced out from the space once again, but in that split second, he had already reached the entrance of the cave.","Spurt! Blood sprayed out from his mouth. He was already quite injured.","Despite only suffering from the shockwaves of the Profound Spirit Master’s indiscriminate attacks that affected the entire region, the devastating power was still not something that any Immortal Emperor could endure.","At this moment, the Profound Spirit Master had already locked onto Jian Chen at the entrance. Suddenly, he smiled mysteriously as if he had already recognised Jian Chen through certain details and special characteristics.","“ Yang Yutian, oh Yang Yutian. I didn’t end up encountering you on the only way up the mountain. Instead, I encountered you here, and you even came to steal the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing like a fool. Haven’t you given me the perfect reason to capture you? ” the Profound Spirit Master thought to himself. The Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing was a gift for the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance. If he used this reason to move against Jian Chen, he would not have to worry about the qualms from the Heavenly Star Palace.","However, he did not expose Jian Chen either. He purposefully acted ignorant. As energy surged in his hand, his turbulent cultivation erupted once again, turning into a huge hand that descended from above in an attempt to crush Jian Chen.","Immortal Exalt Tan Yu who witnessed all of this clenched his fists firmly. His eyes flickered with hesitation and uncertainty. He wanted to assist him, but he also had second thoughts.","He could not afford to provoke the Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights or the Profound Spirit Master.","Clad in the Divine Armour of Heavenflight, the Heaven-lifting sword appeared in Jian Chen’s hand silently with a flip, radiating with the power of a high quality god artifact. He did not try to dodge the Profound Spirit Master’s attack. As a matter of fact, he directly ignored it, only slashing the Heaven-lifting sword towards the Profound Spirit Master!","The Shadowless Lifetaking Strike!","“You’re a mere Immortal Emperor, yet you want to attack me? You’re out of your mind!” The Profound Spirit Master sneered in disdain, but in the next moment, his expression suddenly changed. His eyes were filled with disbelief as his body stiffened.","That was because a powerful sword Qi pierced through all of his defences, slashing through his body without any prior signs and causing him some injuries.","This attack disrupted his hand of energy that tried to overwhelm Jian Chen to a certain degree. It went from an attempt at restraint to just an attack.","With a boom, Jian Chen was slammed heavily into the ground, immediately spraying with blood.","But very soon, the injuries recovered at an unbelievable rate. Basically as soon as he had been smashed into the ground, he stood right up as if nothing had happened to him at all.","“Very impressive secret technique. With your mere strength as an Immortal Emperor, you actually managed to harm me. I sure have underestimated you a little.” The Profound Spirit Master’s face was ugly. With a wave of his hand, a huge net immediately appeared from nowhere, shining with dazzling light and hurtling towards Jian Chen with a powerful pressure.","As the net fell, the entire world seemed to be frozen. A tremendous and mysterious power seemed to seal up everything inside.","Jian Chen became stern. He had a very strong feeling that if the net caught him, he would struggle to escape.","By then, he would be forced to prematurely expose even more trump cards.","He did not hesitate at all. He activated the Divine Armour of Heavenflight once more, and he vanished again.","“Hmph, you won’t be getting away from me this time.” The Profound Spirit Master sneered. The high quality god artifact net suddenly closed up, completely seizing the space where Jian Chen resided. Everything in there seemed to be sealed up.","At that moment, everyone’s eyes were glued to the net. Because the concealment from the Divine Armour of Heavenflight fooled all of their senses, none of them knew whether the Profound Spirit Master had caught the person who stole the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing or not.","Standing in the crowd, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu’s heart had risen to his throat. He was extremely worried for Jian Chen’s safety.","“ If fellow Yang Yutian truly does end up being caught by the Profound Spirit Master, I’ll have to go and find Xing Caijian. In the Skyscraping World, probably only Xing Caijian has the ability to save him, ” Immortal Exalt Tan Yu thought. With his strength as a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, he was completely incapable of stopping the Profound Spirit Master. On top of that, as soon as he took action, he would become everyone’s enemy and be accused of a crime that he could not bear. As a result, he could only wait and see.","“Fellow Profound Spirit, the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing is a gift for the elder princess. We can’t afford anything to go wrong here,” the Heavenloss Master said from the side. After gaining the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance as an ally, he did not even have to personally take action anymore. Someone would come and offer their services instead.","“Please don’t worry, fellow Heavenloss. I obviously understand the severity of the matter.” The Profound Spirit Master smiled gently before immediately making the net shrink, trying to force out anyone hidden in the space there.","However, by the time the net had shrunk to the size of a fist, it was still empty inside. There was not a single person to be seen.","The Profound Spirit Master’s face immediately sank. He bellowed furiously, “Dammit, he still managed to escape. However, he can’t be far. Chase after him!”","As soon as he said that, the Profound Spirit Master immediately appeared outside the entrance. He directly struck out with his hand. A terrifying storm of energy erupted, making the space within a hundred kilometres shake with great instability.","The Heavenloss Master lost his composure as well. His face became extremely ugly. He turned towards the Immortal Exalts around the sword pool and clasped his fist. “Fellows, please lend me a hand in retrieving the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing together. Once I obtain the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, I will definitely sing praises of your service before the elder princess.”","“Being able to serve the elder princess is our honour...”","“Then we’ll have to trouble the Heavenloss Master with putting in a good word with the elder princess for us in the future...”","......","...","Immediately, many Immortal Exalts answered his request before frantically rushing out. They all chose a direction and moved out.","Their method of search was simple and crude. They used their energy to strike the space, destablising the area in an attempt to force out Jian Chen."]},{"number":3866,"title":"Chapter 3866: Returning with Nothing","paragraphs":["With the departure of these Immortal Exalts, the people in the cave rapidly plummeted in number until only a few remained in the end.","The city lord of the Immortal Rising City, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu, and Zuo Dao from the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens were among them.","“Fellow Zuo Dao, your Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens dwells on the same heaven with the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance. Now that the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing for the elder princess has been stolen, aren’t you going to help them search so that you can do the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance a favour?” At this moment, one of the Immortal Exalts there smiled amicably and clasped his fist towards Zuo Dao.","When he heard that, Zuo Dao sneered slightly and said, “Offering up the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing to suck up to the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Brilliance is just the Heavenloss Master’s one-sided, wishful thinking. With the elder princess’s terrifying strength that has already reached the apex, what treasure can’t she obtain? Why would she care about a Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing that’s useless to her?”","Zuo Dao continued, “If the Heavenloss Master want to use this Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing to gain the good graces of everyone else from the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance, it would be more than enough, but it doesn’t even come close if it’s the elder princess.”","“Fellow Zuo Dao’s analysis is very logical. In my opinion, the Heavenloss Master is just trying to connect the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing to the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance somehow. He wants us to develop second thoughts and not compete with him. Once he actually obtains the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, we can’t even be sure that he’ll actually give it away. We don’t even know if he can meet with the elder princess at all,” another Immortal Exalt added as soon as Zuo Dao had finished speaking.","“Although the Heavenloss Master’s descendant tied the knot with the fifth princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance, the fifth princess is the fifth princess, while the elder princess is the elder princess. In the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance, is there anyone else apart from the elder princess Fang Jing who actually raises your attention?”","“You’re exactly right. It’s entirely because the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance produced the elder princess that they now possess such a lofty status...”","“According to my understanding of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance, the fifth princess has no influence over the elder princess at all. The Heavenloss Master will probably struggle to gain the good graces of the elder princess with the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing,” an Immortal Exalt said.","Before, they refused to compete for the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing purely as a show of respect towards the Sword Sect of Yang Soul. The fifth princess’s status was nowhere near enough for them to go running after the Sword Sect of Yang Soul.","Afterwards, the Immortal Exalts that remained near the sword pool all dispersed. They went off to find their own opportunities and fortunes.","As for the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, they all gave up on competing for it. Even if it had not ended up in the hands of the Sword Sect of Yang Soul, they had still dismissed all thoughts of obtaining it.","That was because they could already tell that the Immortal Emperor bold enough to steal the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing right in front of them might not have been powerful, but he definitely was no ordinary person.","They obviously would not go and provoke a new enemy for no good reason for a Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing that did not truly belong to them even if they obtained it.","“City lord Tan Yu, the Immortal Emperor who came with you is anything but simple. He actually managed to slip away right under the watch of a Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. Let alone an Immortal Emperor, even some weaker Immortal Exalts will struggle to achieve that.” Standing outside the cave, Zuo Dao from the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens suddenly looked at Immortal Exalt Tan Yu after all the Immortal Exalts had left.","“Yang Yutian truly is anything but simple. When I was swallowed by the Starflame Demon Lion, it was all because of Yang Yutian that the Illusionary Ancestor from the Waymight clan saved me from its belly.” Immortal Exalt Tan Yu sighed gently. When he recalled this, he still found it surreal.","Zuo Dao’s eyes narrowed. He stared straight at Immortal Exalt Tan Yu and cried out, “What did you say? The Illusionary Ancestor saved you back then because of Yang Yutian?”","“Yeah, if fellow Yang Yutian had not changed the Illusionary Ancestor’s mind back then, why would the Illusionary Ancestor care about my fate given the circumstances?” Immortal Exalt Tan Yu said before leaving without any hesitation. He followed the imprint he had initially left behind and returned to the stone tablet to continue his comprehension.","Meanwhile, Zuo Dao remained where he was, recalling what Immortal Exalt Tan Yu had said again and again.","“The Illusionary Ancestor holds him in special regard. Even the daughter of the heavenly emperor from the Heavenly Star Palace, Xing Caijian, treats him extremely differently. What exactly is Yang Yutian’s background?” Zuo Dao felt more and more curious, but at the same time, he felt a little puzzled. He murmured, “If he really does have an impressive background, why doesn’t he announce it directly and avoid all of these problems?”","......","...","During this time, the Skyscraping World lost its peace. Over a dozen Immortal Exalts spread out, basically using their powers to attack the space in every place they passed by, leading to extremely great instability in the space in an attempt to force out any people hiding there.","As these Immortal Exalts struck out recklessly, the Immortal Emperors and Immortal Monarchs who encountered them suffered quite a bit. Even when these Immortal Exalts intentionally held back, reluctant to injure those unrelated, it was still unavoidable for some innocent Immortal Emperors and Immortal Monarchs to be affected to some degree.","“Dammit, have these Immortal Exalts gone bad? How can they treat us like this? Once I leave the Skyscraping World, I’ll definitely report this to the ancestor and get an explanation for this.”","“Hush, be quiet. Don’t let these Immortal Exalt seniors hear you. I just received news from my ancestor that an Immortal Emperor stole a Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing. This Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing is a gift for the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance. They can’t afford to lose it, which is why these Immortal Exalts are pursuing the person who stole the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing.”","“What? This is actually connected to an organisation like the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance? Looks like we have to put up with this then...”","Many Immortal Emperors complained. Some of them came from organisations that were extremely powerful. Despite only being Immortal Emperors, they were not particularly fearful of regular Immortal Exalts.","The disturbance in the Skyscraping World lasted for only three days before gradually subsiding. After those three days, the Immortal Exalts searching for Jian Chen all returned to the sword pool. Many of them were powerless.","Only the faces of the Profound Spirit Master from the Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights and the Heavenloss Master from the Sword Sect of Yang Soul were extremely sunken.","“His concealment is flawless. Once he’s hidden himself, he can’t be detected through any secret techniques or the senses of the soul at all. Coupled with the unique environment of the Skyscraping World that limits us, he’s managed to escape successfully.” The Profound Spirit Master ground his teeth. The chance this time was a heaven-sent opportunity, yet he still failed to capture him, which filled him with regret and resentment.","“The formations of the Skyscraping World limits our abilities. The senses of our souls can only cover a range of a hundred kilometres. No one can be sure about the situation beyond that. Otherwise, how could a mere Immortal Emperor slip away under our watch?”","“I’ve already spread the news. This person has stolen a gift for the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance. He will definitely become a target for everyone. He can still hide around in the Skyscraping World, but once he leaves here, I’d like to see where he can run off to.”","The Immortal Exalts present all spoke up. To them, this was a fantastic opportunity to form a positive connection with the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance, so none of them wanted to give up on this.","Taking a step back, even if they could only establish a good relationship with the Sword Sect of Yang Soul, it would be worth the effort.","“Fellow Heavenloss, please don’t worry. We will return the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing to your possession sooner or later.”","“Once we leave the Skyscraping World, we will use everything we have to investigate this Immortal Emperor.”"]},{"number":3867,"title":"Chapter 3867: Ingesting the Spiritual Fruit","paragraphs":["At this moment, an old man sat in the icy dark space outside the Skyscraping World. Extremely powerful senses of the soul radiated from him, reaching billions of kilometres away, constantly examining this space.","The old man was known as one of the three sages of the Modest Silence Heaven, the Scholar Capital Master, a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt expert!","“ The Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing in the Skyscraping World is my possession. No one can think about taking it away. ” The Scholar Capital Master’s sharp gaze constantly swept through the space there, radiating with icy, undisguised killing intent.","He had entered the Skyscraping World before. Although he did not possess a Skyscraping Sword Scripture right now, which prevented him from entering the independent space, he still remembered its rough location.","“ Dammit. If I had known earlier that something like this would happen during the opening this time, I would have never bothered with those shitty matters on the Modest Silence Heaven. ”","“ Without me, the situation on the Modest Silence Heaven will be extremely disadvantageous, but how can it compare to the Divine Sword of the Immortal Soul’s recovery? ”","“ Once the artifact spirit of the Divine Sword of the Immortal Soul recovers, I’ll be able to grasp the Immortal Soul Annihilation technique through the sword spirit. By then, who on the Modest Silence Heaven will still be my opponent... ”","“ I just regret that I was too concerned with the situation on the Modest Silence Heaven, which led to an accident with the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing in the Skyscraping World... ” the Scholar Capital Master thought to himself.","His eyes glistened with cold killing intent, feeling concern and uneasiness at times.","If the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing had just been picked, it would not be too much of a problem. He guarded this place personally, so he could just steal it back when the time came.","He was afraid that the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing would be used.","If it were used, even killing the person would be useless.","“ You better not use it. The Immortal Sect of Myriad Swords has basically developed a monopoly over all the Spiritual Fruits of Sword Nurturing that appear in the Immortals’ World. It really isn’t easy for me to obtain one. ” The Scholar Capital Master prayed inside.","......","...","At this moment, a white-robed figure sat in the canopy of a large tree in a forest surrounded by dense spiritual Qi. His eyes were shut.","That was Jian Chen!","After stealing the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, he used the spiritual Qi to navigate his path, inspecting the path ahead of him. Coupled with the Divine Armour of Heavenflight, he escaped the pursuit of the Immortal Exalts with ease.","After all, compared to him, the Immortal Exalts were like a group of old men in the Skyscraping World. Their vision was limited, and the senses of their souls could only reach a hundred kilometres away.","At this moment, Jian Chen was more than ten million kilometres away from where the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing grew. In the outside world, this distance would merely be a step away for any Immortal Exalt.","But in the Skyscraping World, it was as if they were worlds apart.","“ Master, we’re already prepared. We can consume the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing. ” At this moment, Zi Ying and Qing Suo’s voices rang out in Jian Chen’s head.","In the next moment, two streams of light, one violet and one azure, erupted out from above Jian Chen’s head, immediately condensing into a male and female figure.","They were the sword spirits that Jian Chen was familiar with.","Although the sword spirits were in an illusionary form right now, they seemed to be extremely consolidated.","They had already adjusted their conditions to their peak. They were filled with energy, prepared to absorb the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing in their optimal conditions.","“Then let’s begin.” Jian Chen opened his eyes slowly in the canopy. He took out a delicate jade box and opened it carefully. Resplendent light poured out from the jade box with dazzling light, like it held a supreme treasure.","Within the jade box rested a palm-sized sword.","Of course, that was just the shape of the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing. It was actually a special kind of fruit, one that was highly beneficial to sword spirits!","“Zi Ying, Qing Suo, just absorb away without any worry. Before you finish absorbing it, no one will disturb you,” Jian Chen said confidently. With the secret technique from the Skyscraping Sword Venerable, he was not the strongest in the Skyscraping World, but no one even came close to him in terms of his range of observation.","“The Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing can allow us to recover quite a bit, but as we recover, we’ll need to absorb large amounts of spiritual Qi, so please help us out, master,” said Zi Ying.","Jian Chen smiled at that. “Don’t worry. In the Skyscraping World, the last thing you’ll be lacking is spiritual Qi. I will gather all the spiritual Qi within ten thousand kilometres to assist you in your recovery.”","Zi Ying and Qing Suo said nothing more. They extended their fingers gently towards the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, and the fruit immediately levitated from the jade box, hovering between them.","Zi Ying and Qing Suo shut their eyes slowly like cultivating immortals, crossing their legs and meditating away.","Shortly afterwards, a unique kind of spiritual Qi flowed out from the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, turning into two white streams of pure sword intent that merged with the sword spirits.","After absorbing this power, Zi Ying and Qing Suo’s illusionary bodies visibly seemed to become slightly stronger.","On top of that, as they absorbed the special spiritual Qi from the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, the presence that they gave off gradually strengthened as well.","This Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing was of extremely high grade. It had even evolved, so it had become unique a long time ago. As a result, it was of tremendous assistance to the sword spirits.","The Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing gradually began to dim. The special energy it contained was being rapidly absorbed.","At the same time, Jian Chen used the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s secret technique and began controlling the spiritual Qi in the surroundings to gather towards the sword spirits.","At that instant, a huge storm of spiritual Qi brewed where they were. As a matter of fact, spiritual rain even began to fall within a range of a hundred metres.","Every droplet of rain had been formed from dense spiritual Qi.","The sword spirits furiously absorbed the spiritual Qi in the surroundings. Their strength grew with each passing moment. Although they were still quite far off from their peak condition, they had never recovered as quickly as now.","Without any exaggeration, they had made as much progress as they had made during the past thousand years, or even more, in less than half an hour.","In the Skyscraping World, many Immortal Exalts continued to cooperate with the Heavenloss Master, searching for the whereabouts of the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing.","Outside the Skyscraping World, the Scholar Capital Master of the three sages of the Modest Silence Heaven waited anxiously for them to come out.","But unbeknownst to them, someone was already consuming the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing that they all cared so much about."]},{"number":3868,"title":"Chapter 3868: Trials in the Observance Heaven City","paragraphs":["As the sword spirits absorbed the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, Jian Chen took on the responsibility of guarding them. As he gathered the surrounding spiritual Qi towards the sword spirits, he observed the distance through the secret technique from the Skyscraping Sword Venerable.","Once someone entered his range, he could shrink the area he gathered spiritual Qi from at any time to prevent anyone from detecting them.","As a matter of fact, he was already prepared to change locations at any time.","That was because the sword spirits could not afford to be disturbed at all.","“ Although there won’t be any accidents if the sword spirits absorb the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing in the Primeval Divine Hall, it won’t be as convenient to gather spiritual Qi. ” Jian Chen glanced at Zi Ying and Qing Suo who were surrounded by light from time to time and smiled gently.","“ The Sword Sect of Yang Soul originally wanted to offer up the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing to Fang Jing, yet I’ve stolen it instead. I wonder if this counts as stealing from Fang Jing. ” Jian Chen thought of that familiar figure again. A hint of mixed emotions flashed through his eyes.","Even to this day, he could still clearly remember the situation when he first encountered Fang Jing in the Saints’ World. Back then, she was still a little girl who made a living by selling maps. She was pitiful.","But now, she had already reached a height that he could only look up to. She was so powerful that even the leaders of major sects in the Immortals’ World racked their brains in an attempt to befriend her.","The tremendous transition in identity left Jian Chen sighing.","“ The Heavenloss Master only had a descendant of who knows how many generations apart marry the fifth princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance. A connection like that was already enough for a group of Immortal Exalts to treat him so politely. Meanwhile, I’ve basically fought alongside the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance, escaping from the Ice Goddess together. I wonder if this relationship with her holds any weight among these Immortal Exalts. ”","“ That’s not all. Near the Grand Sovereign Heaven, Fang Jing even gave me a tablet before she left... ”","“ That’s a tablet that the elder princess gave away personally. With her current influence in the Immortals’ World, I wonder if these Immortal Exalts will become dumbstruck if I take out this tablet... ”","Jian Chen smiled gently, but he never considered doing this. He had obtained the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing through his own abilities. Why did he have to borrow someone else’s influence?","There was an intrinsic difference between items obtained through his personal ability compared to items obtained through using someone else’s name.","......","...","At this moment, on the Reverent Observance Heaven, a terrifying storm of energy wreaked havoc through an empty space created by the power of the Observance Heaven City. Rumbling sounds rang out endlessly.","Through the storm of energy, it was possible to see two figures locked in intense combat in the centre.","One of them was a middle-aged woman. She wore black clothes, dignified and graceful in appearance. She could unleash devastating power as she wished.","She was the second ancestor of the Waymight clan, the Illusionary Ancestor!","Locked in battle against her was a blurry figure.","Despite it being an illusionary figure seemingly condensed from energy and laws only, it gave off an extremely tangible feeling like a living person with flesh and blood.","Under the influence of her tribulation of decline, the Illusionary Ancestor could barely maintain her secondary body at the Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt; it was extremely unstable. She seemed like she could drop from the Fifth Heavenly Layer to the Fourth Heavenly Layer at any time.","Despite that, the battle prowess she demonstrated even far surpassed some Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts.","That was because her usage of the ways and her control over her energy was well beyond anything that a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt could rival.","The figure who fought the Illusionary Ancestor was also a Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. Its control and usage of the ways was no weaker than the Illusionary Ancestor. It even surpassed her.","As they fought, their strength and cultivation were similar, but the Illusionary Ancestor lost the upper hand.","During this process, the Illusionary Ancestor used numerous ancient secret techniques and powerful God Tier Immortal Techniques, but they were all nullified by the figure one by one.","Suddenly, the Illusionary Ancestor’s face changed slightly. In the next moment, her presence bled away, immediately dropping from the Fifth Heavenly Layer to the Fourth Heavenly Layer, and then to the Third Heavenly Layer.","In the span of a few seconds, the Illusionary Ancestor’s strength had declined to the Third Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt!","“ The influence from the tribulation of decline is growing. I can’t keep it suppressed any longer. ” The Illusionary Ancestor sighed gently inside. She had already fought against this figure for many years now. Gradually, she felt that her strength was insufficient.","However, as the Illusionary Ancestor’s strength receded, the presence from the figure she faced also declined soon after, remaining at the same level as the Illusionary Ancestor.","“ I’ve spent so much effort in this battle. I have to win no matter what. ” Resolve suddenly appeared in the Illusionary Ancestor’s eyes. In the next moment, another illusionary figure appeared behind her.","Unlike the illusionary figure she was facing, the illusionary figure behind the Illusionary Ancestor was identical to her in both presence and appearance.","In the next moment, the illusionary figure suddenly merged together with the Illusionary Ancestor.","From the moment they merged together, the Illusionary Ancestor’s presence suddenly changed as if her primary and secondary body had fused together. She immediately seemed to become whole again.","Her cultivation remained at the Third Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt, but the presence she gave off became even vaster and more tremendous. Shortly afterwards, she began to shine with dazzling light. The ways wove together and turned into a huge, snowy-white blade that sliced space, slashing towards the illusionary figure with unbelievable speed.","The illusionary figure extended its hand and the laws circulated as if it could control the paramount force in the world, pressing gently towards the Illusionary Ancestor’s colossal blade of light.","That gentle gesture seemed to hide great force. The palm strike seemed to be able to collapse space and overwhelm the ways.","In the next moment, the two attacks collided, locking into a stalemate in the space there. The two terrifying forces constantly collided and wore down one another.","But in just a few seconds, the Illusionary Ancestor’s colossal blade of light shattered the power from the illusionary figure before slashing through in an unstoppable manner.","Afterwards, the illusionary figure stopped all of its attacks. It seemed no different from before, without any injuries. As a matter of fact, its figure did not even fade away. Its power still seemed as great as before.","Dazzling light slowly dispersed several tens of thousand kilometres away. The Illusionary Ancestor in black clothes appeared again. She looked at the illusionary figure with blurred facial features behind her. There were mixed feelings in her eyes, as well as respect.","“Senior, I’ve won!” Suddenly, the Illusionary Ancestor clasped her fist towards the illusionary figure.","In the next moment, the illusionary figure vanished silently, merging back into the surroundings as a wisp of the laws. It seemed as if it had never existed in the first place but also seemed omnipresent.","“Throughout all this time, many peak experts have come to challenge the trials left behind by master but very few ever pass. You are very impressive. You are one of the few people who have passed the first trial.” A cold and clear voice rang out in the space there. A woman in a long white dress silently appeared before the Illusionary Ancestor.","She seemed like a goddess, radiating with a celestial sense of pureness as if she had transcended humanity.","Her appearance was alluring, beautiful beyond words. Her exquisite facial features were flawless like they were a gift from heaven. She was perfection.","The woman was the artifact spirit of the Observance Heaven City!","“May I ask how much of senior’s former strength did the lingering will I faced just now possess?” The Illusionary Ancestor seemed to be acquainted with the artifact spirit of the Observance Heaven City already. She was not surprised by the artifact spirit’s appearance at all. Instead, she clasped her fist and asked with her regular composure.","“The power of the lingering will left behind by master only possesses thirty percent of his former strength!” the artifact spirit said.","“What? Only thirty percent of senior’s former strength?” The Illusonary Ancestor was surprised when she heard that. Soon after, she became depressed as if she had suffered a severe setback.","The illusionary figure from earlier was the power of a lingering will left behind by the original master of the Observance Heaven City. It could be understood as an embodiment of the master of the Observance Heaven City’s strength","With the same cultivation, the Illusionary Ancestor needed to use her full strength to only defeat an embodiment of thirty percent of his former strength. That had quite an effect on her.","“Master had grasped numerous ways, so you should feel proud enough for being able to defeat a clone condensed from thirty percent of his strength. After all, only a handful of people have ever been able to achieve this throughout history,” the artifact spirit of the Observance Heaven City said blankly.","It then continued, “According to the rules, you can choose a reward for overcoming the first test set down by master. The reward includes heavenly resources, cultivation methods, legacies, and some ancient secret techniques.”","“Tell me, what do you want?”","The Illusionary Ancestor shook her head gently and said, “I come from the Waymight clan. With the heritage and strength of our Waymight clan, why would we lack those things?”"]},{"number":3869,"title":"Chapter 3869: Getting to the Bottom of the Matter","paragraphs":["“Then why have you come? Don’t tell me you’re thinking of trying the next trial?”","“With your strength, you don’t have any hope of passing the next trial,” the artifact spirit of the Observance Heaven City said indifferently. Its cold voice was mechanical, devoid of any emotion.","“Even the first trial was already so tough for me, so even if you didn’t tell me, I knew I’d never pass the second trial. However, I did not come here to attempt the second trial.” The Illusionary Ancestor looked at the artifact spirit of the Observance Heaven City. Her presence fluctuated with great instability, having dropped down from the Third Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt to the Second Heavenly Layer already, and it continued to fall.","Under the influence of the tribulation of decline, her strength grew weaker and weaker.","However, the Illusionary Ancestor was completely unfazed, seemingly accustomed to it. She said to the artifact spirit of the Observance Heaven City, “I attempted this trial with only one objective in mind, which is to ask you for some information.”","“The Observance Heaven City is a sovereign god artifact, while you are its artifact spirit. You are proud. Only Grand Exalts are enough for you to treat them seriously, so if I came to you directly to ask about some information, I’d probably return empty-handed despite being the second ancestor of the Waymight clan.”","“That was why I went through so much effort to attempt these trials that only late Immortal Exalts have access to.”","“Having passed the first trial, you can ask me about some ancient secrets but not all of them. What do you want to know?” The artifact spirit of the Observance Heaven City’s mechanical voice rang out.","“I want to know what the person who recently obtained the Divine Formation of the Heavens offered in exchange. Aside from that, since you could give the Divine Formation of the Heavens to him freely, you must know this person extremely well,” said the Illusionary Ancestor.","When it heard that, a rare hint of surprise actually appeared in the artifact spirit of the Observance Heaven City’s cold eyes. “The person who exchanged for a copy of the Divine Formation of the Heavens was just an Immortal Emperor. With your identity and status, you’ve gone through so much effort to attempt master’s path of trials just for a trifling matter like this?”","“This is indeed a trifling matter in your eyes but to me...” When she reached there, the Illusionary Ancestor paused and recalled the situation when she first encountered Jian Chen. She had already become filled with questions. “To me, this... seems to be very important... I must get to the bottom of this.”","“You are a peak Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, only a step away from the Ninth Heavenly Layer. Immortal Emperors are no different from ants in your eyes, yet you are saying he’s very important to you?” the artifact spirit of the Observance Heaven City said in surprise. She looked at the Illusionary Ancestor in a strange light. Who knew what it was thinking.","“Yes. In my eyes, Immortal Emperors are like ants. Even some Immortal Exalts are only slightly larger ants to me, but he’s different-” the Illusionary Ancestor murmured gently. She seemed to realise that there was no need for her to ramble uselessly to an artifact spirit, so she immediately halted. Afterwards, she looked at the artifact spirit in interest and said, “I’ve already passed the first trial. My little request hasn’t exceeded the limits of the rules, has it?”","“Since you want to know so much, I’ll tell you!” The artifact spirit of the Observance Heaven City happily agreed. In the next moment, numerous heavenly resources appeared, ranging from Immortal Tier to God Tier. They varied in grades as well.","However, these heavenly resources were not physical items. They were constructs of energy, only showing off their appearance.","The Illusionary Ancestor glanced past these heavenly resources. With her rich knowledge, she obviously recognised these heavenly resources one by one, together with their value. She became more and more surprised.","In the end, she looked at the artifact spirit of the Observance Heaven City in disbelief and asked, “He just used these things to exchange for a copy of the Divine Formation of the Heavens? Since when did the Divine Formation of the Heavens become so worthless?”","“These heavenly resources themselves aren’t particularly valuable, but the Xuanhuang Qi on them is extremely precious. You can say that he used the Xuanhuang Qi to exchange for the formation scroll of the Divine Formation of the Heavens. On top of that, the copy of the formation scroll has limited use,” the artifact spirit of the Observance Heaven City said.","“Xuanhuang Qi? I see.” The Illusionary Ancestor understood. “Who is this person?”","“He’s a past Thousand Immortal General, Chang Yang!” The artifact spirit glanced at the Illusionary Ancestor deeply and said, “I can only tell you this. As for the greater details, I do know about them, but it involves significant matters. Just passing the first trial is nowhere near enough for me to tell you. You must pass the second trial.”","“However, you have no hope of passing the second trial. As a matter of fact, you won’t even be able to last ten seconds during the second trial.”","“ Chang Yang? Yang Yutian, is Chang Yang your true identity? ” The Illusionary Ancestor stood where she was in deep thought.","By now, the artifact spirit had already vanished silently, together with the empty space that had been created from the power of the Observance Heaven City.","The Illusionary Ancestor appeared in a certain corner of the Observance Heaven City. It was quiet, with no one around.","Her tribulation of decline became even more severe. Her strength had already plummeted to the First Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt.","However, she remained unconcerned despite her receding strength, as this was only temporary. Once the tribulation of decline had passed, she would immediately return to her peak condition!","At this moment, she erased her presence, strolling through the Observance Heaven City at a leisurely pace like a regular person.","She seemed to be on a stroll, but she actually moved extremely quickly. She could cover an extremely vast distance with each step.","“Chang Yang? Yang Yutian? Jian Chen? The Sword Sect of Violet Heavens?” Before long, the Illusionary Ancestor’s face changed.","To this day, there were still people discussing matters regarding Thousand Immortal General Chang Yang in the Observance Heaven City.","As a matter of fact, the search for him had never ceased in the Observance Heaven City.","It was not because of Chang Yang’s identity as Jian Chen, the sect master of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens.","Nor was it due to the fact that the Immortal Feather sect had placed a bounty on Chang Yang.","Instead, it was because he possessed a treasure that could absorb Stainless Qi!","A treasure like that had already attracted every single expert and organisation who wanted to enter the sacred land of the Observance Heaven City.","Despite so many years passing, people still remembered the treasure that could absorb Stainless Qi, and they still lusted after it.","With the Illusionary Ancestor’s current cultivation, as long as she confirmed that Yang Yutian was Chang Yang, she could easily investigate many of the matters that had occurred in the Observance Heaven City before. Ra𐌽ő฿ĘṨ","“ You are Chang Yang. I can basically confirm that. Despite the differing appearance and presence, many of your special features match up perfectly. ” Unknowingly, a gentle smile appeared on the Illusionary Ancestor’s face. She let out the smile completely unconsciously, such that even she herself had not noticed it.","But shortly afterwards, her smile turned icy. Coldness flashed through her eyes.","At that instant, the surrounding temperature on the street seemed to plummet. Many of the cultivators on the street shivered uncontrollably.","“ So cold. What’s going on? Why do I suddenly feel a chill in my bones? ”","“ What’s going on? For a split second, I felt like my heart was about to explode... ”","......","...","Many cultivators were secretly alarmed. They all became extremely stern.","“ The Immortal Feather sect has actually placed a bounty on you! ” As for the root of this, the Illusionary Ancestor was completely unaware, or perhaps she was completely unconcerned with how her emotional fluctuations affected the cultivators in the surroundings. She could not help but ball her fists. She was furious.","But shortly afterwards, she suddenly stiffened. All of her emotions immediately vanished. She furrowed her brows firmly. She was confused. “ What’s wrong with me? ”","The Illusionary Ancestor stopped in the middle of the street. Her expression changed. She was uneasy.","A few seconds later, she took a step, and she seemed to vanish from the streets. When she reappeared, she was already standing in the Pavilion of Heavenly Secrets.","A middle-aged man in white robes stood there as if he had already spent a long time waiting.","Behind him were numerous members of the upper echelon of the Pavilion of Heavenly Secrets. Even the weakest of them were Immortal Emperors.","The middle-aged man was the vice pavilion master, Liao Chen.","“Welcome, Illusionary Ancestor!” The vice pavilion master clasped his fist towards the Illusionary Ancestor. He was extremely polite.","The upper echelon standing behind him all bowed towards the Illusionary Ancestor as well.","After all, the person before them was no regular peak expert but the second strongest ancestor of the Waymight clan!","In the past, the second ancestor of the Waymight clan would never receive such treatment. At the very least, she would not be received by the vice pavilion master like this.","However, the Waymight clan was now different from before!","“You knew I’d come?” The Illusionary Ancestor looked at Liao Chen.","Liao Chen smiled and said, “It’s all due to the pavilion master’s remarkable calculations. He foresaw that a valued guest would visit today, so he specially ordered me to wait here for you!”","“Take me to your pavilion master!” the Illusionary Ancestor said.","“Please, Illusionary Ancestor!” Liao Chen turned gently to the side and made an inviting gesture.","At the same time, a crack silently appeared beside him, instantly forming a gate that led straight into the miniature world that belonged to the Pavilion of Heavenly Secrets.","On a mountain peak in the miniature world of the Pavilion of Heavenly Secrets, the pavilion master sat by a cliff with his legs crossed. Before him on the tea table was a pot of tea that had just been made.","“Greetings to the pavilion master from junior Daowei Huanru!”","The Illusionary Ancestor silently appeared before the pavilion master. Her expression was filled with respect towards the pavilion master, proactively bowing and greeting him.","“There’s no need for such courtesy, Illusionary Ancestor. Please take a seat!” The pavilion master smiled gently and lifted the tea he had just made, personally pouring a cup for the Illusionary Ancestor.","The Illusionary Ancestor did not hold back, taking a seat with great composure. She was not uneasy at all.","Towards the pavilion master, she only possessed respect for him, but she did not fear him at all.","“Sure enough, the pavilion master’s foresight is divine. You even knew that I would be visiting the Pavilion of Heavenly Secrets. I just wonder if the pavilion master knows why I have visited?” the Illusionary Ancestor smiled gently and said with composure. From how relaxed she was, it did not seem like she was facing a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. Instead, she acted like he was only a regular old man who could not be any more ordinary."]},{"number":3870,"title":"Chapter 3870: The Illusionary Ancestor’s Investigation","paragraphs":["“You must be joking, Illusionary Ancestor. I might have been able to anticipate the arrival of an important guest today, but I’m not omnipotent or omnipresent. As a result, I’d obviously be unaware of what brought you here.” The master of the Pavilion of Heavenly Secrets smiled. He spoke to the Illusionary Ancestor as an equal.","The Illusionary Ancestor picked up the tea cup on the table and took a steady sip. Right when she was about to say something, she stiffened. In the next moment, her presence deflated like a balloon, plummeting once more and falling from Immortal Exalt to Immortal Emperor.","Afterwards, she went from the Ninth Heavenly Layer to the Eighth Heavenly Layer. She continued falling to the Seventh Heavenly Layer before finally stabilising.","However, her presence continued to fluctuate as if her cultivation could fall again at any time.","“Looks like your tribulation of decline is quite severe this time.” The master of the Pavilion of Heavenly Secrets gazed at the Illusionary Ancestor deeply.","“This tribulation of decline really occurred at a terrible time, which is why it’s more severe than any of the times in the past. Before long, I assume the tribulation of decline will make me re-experience the world of Immortal Monarchs.” The Illusionary Ancestor smiled wryly. She was powerless.","“When the tribulation of decline arrives, you should focus on recuperation. You shouldn’t fight too much, yet you just had to visit the path of trials in the Observance Heaven City at a time like this.” The master of the Pavilion of Heavenly Secrets shook his head gently as if he found everything that the Illusionary Ancestor did to be extremely perplexing.","The Illusionary Ancestor did not dwell on this topic. Suddenly, she looked at the pavilion master in interest and said, “Pavilion master, you should be familiar with the Thousand Immortal General Chang Yang who once stirred up a storm in the Observance Heaven City, right?”","The pavilion master furrowed his brows. After a moment of thought, he said, “I have heard of him, but he’s only an Immortal Emperor. May I ask why the Illusionary Ancestor has suddenly begun caring about someone like him?”","“I heard that when he competed for the position, he received a bye every single round. All of the byes during that competition went to him. In my understanding of the Observance Heaven City, this is extremely rare. I was wondering why the Observance Heaven City took such great care of him?” the Illusionary Ancestor asked.","“Illusionary Ancestor, you’ve asked the wrong person. You should be asking the artifact spirit of the Observance Heaven City,” the pavilion master said calmly.","The Illusionary Ancestor stared at the pavilion master’s elderly face and said, “I want to know everything regarding Chang Yang. You can freely name your price.”","The pavilion master stared at the Illusionary Ancestor in surprise. “Why have you suddenly developed such an interest in an Immortal Emperor?”","“Because I want to get to the bottom of something. If I can’t get to the bottom of this, I cannot find peace,” the Illusionary Ancestor said sternly.","After some consideration, the pavilion master called to the empty space behind him, “Liao Chen!”","The vice pavilion master, Liao Chen, silently appeared. He bowed towards the pavilion master.","“Go, fetch all the information regarding Chang Yang!” The pavilion master instructed.","“Yes, pavilion master!” Liao Chen clasped his fist towards the pavilion master and the Illusionary Ancestor before silently vanishing.","After Liao Chen had left, the pavilion master said to the Illusionary Ancestor, “A few years ago, a colossal incident occurred on our Observance Heaven City. Basically all of the disciples of the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants were slain. Only a few dozen ended up surviving. Out of rage, the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants went on a bloody rampage on the Reverent Observance Heaven, which led to the deaths of many Immortal Exalts. Even Sword Heart from the Immortal Sect of Myriad Swords was injured due to this.”","“In the end, this incident led to a devastating battle between the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance and the four Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts of the Sacred Beast clan.”","“You should be familiar with this, Illusionary Ancestor.”","When she heard that, the Illusionary Ancestor was dazed, but soon afterwards, she smiled gently and said proudly, “That matter shook up all the peak experts in the Immortals’ World. I am obviously aware of it.”","“I just never expected that in just ten thousand years, Jing’er’s strength would actually reach such an unbelievable level. She faced off against the four supreme ancestors of the Sacred Beast clan who were wielding sovereign god artifacts, not only holding her ground against them but even defeating them...”","“It was unbelievable, truly unbelievable...”","The Illusionary Ancestor was filled with amazement.","“The elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance was standing up for the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. After over three million years, there really aren’t a lot of people left who are still bold enough to stand up and speak for the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens.” The pavilion master sighed gently.","The Illusionary Ancestor’s eyes shone. She stared at the pavilion master with a slight smile. “You’re worried that I’ll go after the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens?”","“I do indeed have that worry. After all, the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens has shown the Immortals’ World far too much kindness. The entire Immortals’ World owes them,” the pavilion master said.","“Since your Pavilion of Heavenly Secrets cares about the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens so much, just stand forward directly as the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens’ backing. Other people aren’t aware of your Pavilion of Heavenly Secrets’ heritage, but I know it very well. Once you use the Tablet of Divine Secrets, who do you still fear?” the Illusionary Ancestor said.","“It’s not like the Illusionary Ancestor doesn’t know about the ancestral teachings of the Pavilion of Heavenly Secrets. Unless we truly face destruction, our Pavilion of Heavenly Secrets will never use the Tablet of Heavenly Secrets. On top of that, our Pavilion of Heavenly Secrets never partakes in the conflicts of others,” said the pavilion master.","“Since you refuse to become involved in any conflicts, why do you worry about the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens? Since you refuse to stand up for them, what’s the point of worrying?” the Illusionary Ancestor said.","The pavilion master sighed and fell silent.","Seeing how powerless the pavilion master seemed, the Illusionary Ancestor smiled gently and said, “But there is something that you don’t have to worry about, pavilion master. I am investigating Chang Yang and not the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. In other words, this has nothing to do with the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens.”","“Pavilion master, here is all the information regarding Chang Yang.” At the same time, Liao Chen suddenly appeared and personally handed a jade slip over to the pavilion master.","The pavilion master dismissed Liao Chen before handing the jade slip in his hand over to the Illusionary Ancestor.","But very soon, the Illusionary Ancestor frowned. She slowly set down the jade slip in her hand. She stared at the pavilion master and asked, “Your Pavilion of Heavenly Secrets has only gathered this much information on Chang Yang? The information here is no more than what I found by investigating elsewhere.”","“Don’t tell me your Pavilion of Heavenly Secrets is intentionally hiding something?”","“Chang Yang is extremely special. He seems to have appeared from thin air in the Immortals’ World. There has been absolutely no news about him from the past. At the same time, it’s impossible to peer into any matters regarding him.” The pavilion master raised his head to look at the Illusionary Ancestor and continued, “You came to our Pavilion of Heavenly Secrets for news probably because you also tried to peer into his matters. You know exactly what happened.”","“Did you try the Technique of Heavenly Secrets?” the Illusionary Ancestor asked with furrowed brows.","“I obviously did, but I still found nothing,” the pavilion master said powerlessly.","The Illusionary Ancestor’s face changed before she closed her fingers forcefully and crushed the jade slip in her hand. She immediately vanished, having left already.","Even with her fall in cultivation, some of her abilities were still beyond Immortal Emperors.","The pavilion master gazed in the direction that the Illusionary Ancestor had vanished in. Only after a while did he say, “Liao Chen, what do you think is going on with the Illusionary Ancestor? Why has she suddenly developed such a deep interest in Jian Chen?”","The vice pavilion master, Liao Chen, silently appeared. He bowed slightly and stood behind the pavilion master politely. “Actually, I’m very perplexed as well. The Illusionary Ancestor is a very lofty figure. Why would a supreme figure like her take interest in an Immortal Emperor for no reason?”","“If she’s already discovered Jian Chen’s secret, then that would make sense, but it doesn’t seem to be the case.”","The pavilion master nodded slowly and said, “The Illusionary Ancestor must have met Jian Chen somewhere. If she discovered the twin swords, she would have countless different ways to deal with him even with her strength weakened due to the tribulation of decline.”","“If we take one step back, Jian Chen’s true identity would have been given away already if she discovered the twin swords. Why would she do something so unnecessary and go to such lengths to investigate Jian Chen’s origins?”","Liao Chen furrowed his brows in thought. He was also rather confused.","Although they were the Pavilion of Heavenly Secrets, able to peer into the heavenly secrets and foresee the future and past, possessing great secrets, they were not omnipotent after all.","Let alone a supreme expert like the Illusionary Ancestor!","The matters and people connected to the Illusionary Ancestor were also related to colossal ties of karma, so they could not peer into her so easily either.","“Artifact spirit, have you discovered anything?” The pavilion master raised his head and looked at the sky.","The artifact spirit of the Observance Heaven City silently appeared and said slowly, “I feel like she cares very much about him, the kind without any malice at all.”","“Cares?” The pavilion master and vice pavilion master could not help but exchange glances. They were both stunned.","......","...","Near the entrance of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens in the Sword Region of Violet Heavens, a woman in black appeared silently. She stood outside the entrance and stared at the sect that had already sank into ruins. Her eyes shone with a strange light.","A while later, she began walking towards the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens step by step, just like a regular mortal.","She was the Illusionary Ancestor!","But right now, under the influence of the tribulation of decline, the Illusionary Ancestor’s strength had fallen once again. It had already plummeted to the Third Heavenly Layer of Immortal Emperor.","Very soon, the Illusionary Ancestor arrived before the entrance of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. When she took another step forward, she seemed to cross into some kind of forbidden zone. A terrifying pressure descended.","“Who dares to set foot here!” A furious bellow rang out from the sky. The pressure of an Immortal Exalt swept into the surroundings. Shortly afterwards, five colossal pillars descended from above, landing around the Illusionary Ancestor like a prison. They trapped her there.","The Illusionary Ancestor’s face immediately sank. Icy-cold killing intent was released from her eyes.","That was true killing intent, the kind from the bottom of her heart. When the killing intent appeared, the surroundings seemed to be sealed in ice. As a sense of desolation pervaded the area, even Immortal Exalts could not help but shiver inside.","Despite her cultivation plummeting yet again, the Illusionary Ancestor was still a peak Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt after all. She still had the same comprehension as before, so the pressure she gave off was obviously as terrifying as when she was at her peak condition.","The five pillars that trapped the Illusionary Ancestor shook violently as if they were somewhat hesitant.","“Space-splitting, how bold of you!” the Illusionary Ancestor said icily with a sunken face.","Silently, a figure appeared in front of the Illusionary Ancestor. He was the strongest ancestor of the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants, the Space-splitting Venerable!","At this moment, the Space-splitting Venerable hovered before the Illusionary Ancestor. He was astounded and uncertain.","But very soon, as if he had finally recognised who the puny little “Immortal Emperor” in front of him was, his face changed drastically."]},{"number":3871,"title":"Chapter 3871: Thoughts","paragraphs":["“I-Illusionary Ancestor, w-w-what brings you here?” At this moment, the Space-splitting Venerable no longer hovered in the middle of the sky, looking down from above arrogantly. He frantically landed on the ground with some fear, immediately withdrawing all of his presence and arriving before the Illusionary Ancestor, bowing politely.","The Illusionary Ancestor stood there and stared at the Space-splitting Venerable coldly. She said emotionlessly, “Space-splitting, are you planning on seizing me?”","The Space-splitting Venerable’s heart trembled in fright. He said softly, “Never, never. Even if I were a hundred times bolder, I’d never disrespect you, Illusionary Ancestor. It’s a misunderstanding, all a misunderstanding. I’m willing to accept whatever punishment that you have for me.”","“Hmph, if it weren’t for my tribulation of decline which has drastically reduced my strength, I’d definitely teach you a proper lesson. Why don’t you piss off right now?” the Illusionary Ancestor growled.","“Thank you for your mercy, Illusionary Ancestor. I’ll piss off right now. I’ll piss off immediately...” The Space-splitting Venerable did not possess any backbone at all before the Illusionary Ancestor. Despite being a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, he did not dare to show any signs of disrespect.","In the past, even if the Illusionary Ancestor was the second ancestor of the Waymight clan, even if the Space-splitting Venerable had qualms about her, he would have never behaved so spinelessly.","The reason for this tremendous change in attitude was not just because the Waymight clan had gained a Grand Exalt. There was another important reason, which was that the Illusionary Ancestor happened to be Daowei Chengqing and Fang Jing’s great-grandmother!","As a result, when he faced the Illusionary Ancestor, the Space-splitting Venerable felt like he was facing a higher authority.","After the Space-splitting Venerable had backed away, the Illusionary Ancestor did not remain there. She walked towards the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. As she travelled along the meandering mountain path, she peered into the fortunes before using divination to study the past here.","The Space-splitting Venerable gazed at the Illusionary Ancestor as she moved further and further into the distance from outside the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. He furrowed his brows heavily.","“ That’s strange. Why has the Illusionary Ancestor suddenly come to the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens? And from how she is acting, she appears to be very interested in the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. ”","“ Don’t tell me there’s something here that has drawn her over? ”","“ That’s impossible. With the Illusionary Ancestor’s status, how could she take an interest in the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens’ dilapidated ancestral grounds? ” the Space-splitting Venerable thought to himself. The Illusionary Ancestor’s actions left him puzzled.","“ Don’t tell me that under Fang Jing’s influence, the Illusionary Ancestor has also begun to sympathise with the Sword Sect of Violet Heaven’s predicament and wants to support them? ” When he thought of that, the Space-splitting Venerable’s face immediately became ugly.","From a certain perspective, the Illusionary Ancestor’s attitude and influence was even more useful than the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance’s.","She was the second ancestor of the Waymight clan after all. The authority she possessed was so great that she could even influence a Grand Exalt to a certain degree!","“ Illusionary Ancestor... She’s the Waymight Grand Exalt’s younger sister. If she wants to protect the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, then... can we still even get our revenge? ”","The Space-splitting Venerable’s heart weighed extremely heavily.","......","...","By now, the Illusionary Ancestor had already arrived on the main peak of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. She studied every inch of land and every bit of space before looking at a certain direction above the main peak.","Her gaze seemed to penetrate the layers of space, allowing her to see a mountain hidden in the very depths.","That was an Energy-gathering Divine Mountain. As the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens declined, their last ancestor, the Star Clustered Ancestor, used his abilities to merge it with this space. He prevented people from taking away the final Energy-gathering Divine Mountain so easily.","The Illusionary Ancestor noticed the Energy-gathering Divine Mountain hidden there with ease.","However, she clearly was not interested in this high quality god artifact. She only glanced at it before looking away and scanning the back mountain of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens.","In just a split second, the Illusionary Ancestor arrived on the back mountain and stopped in front of a boulder.","That was where the Immortal Devouring Orchid took root.","“ The lingering will of the Grand Exalt in the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens has basically dispersed. Through the various obstacles, I can vaguely see what occurred here in the past but only traces of you are nowhere to be found... ”","“ Yang Yutian, what exactly are your origins? And why did you come to the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, proactively shouldering all of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens’ karma? ”","“ After all the disciples of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens left with you, they seemed to have vanished from the world. They can’t be found no matter what abilities or secret techniques are used. It seems as if they’ve been perfectly hidden away by an invisible power. That can only mean you possess a spatial god artifact of extremely high quality, enough to obstruct all ties of fate... ”","“ When you unleashed the Divine Formation of the Heavens on the Hall Brilliance Heaven, you must have used the disciples of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens to arrange the formation... ”","The Illusionary Ancestor sank into her thoughts. Her mind seemed to be filled with unresolvable mysteries.","After remaining in the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens for a while, the Illusionary Ancestor left before visiting various places on the Observance Heaven City. She investigated everything that was connected to the sect master of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, Jian Chen.","As a matter of fact, she visited the Observance Heaven City multiple times, visiting the city lord, Jiang Pingtian, the five commanders, and the numerous Thousand Immortal Generals.","Despite the influence from the tribulation of decline which made her strength fall constantly, all members of the upper echelon of the Observance Heaven City knew who she was. The vice city lord, the Master of Fire Virtue, even boldly declared that he would personally lead the way for the Illusionary Ancestor. Even when it came to the cultivators who did not know the Illusionary Ancestor, they would still treat her with great respect due to the Master of Fire Virtue by her side, obediently handing over all the information they possessed to the Illusionary Ancestor.","Despite already knowing these pieces of information, the Illusionary Ancestor still listened to them patiently.","It was as if she was extremely interested in anything that was related to Jian Chen.","The Illusionary Ancestor basically gained a grasp over everything that Jian Chen had done on the Observance Heaven City effortlessly.","Despite still failing to find out about Jian Chen’s origins, the accumulation of all these clues and pieces of information seemed to allow the Illusionary Ancestor to come to some kind of conclusion. Her brows would often be furrowed and even her expression became uncertain.","“Jing’er’s actions seemed a little irregular back then outside the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. Does she know something?” the Illusionary Ancestor said softly. Despite not being present during the time, there had been far too many spectators, so it was very easy to learn about the details.","“Looks like I should pay a visit to the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance and personally find Jing’er to talk about this. I can also get confirmation about my thoughts at the same time. After all, Jing’er possesses the unfathomable Dominion’s Brush. Perhaps she can find some things that I can’t sense,” the Illusionary Ancestor said softly. It seemed like she had already made up her mind, but suddenly, her expression stiffened. She could not help but smile wryly. “With my current strength, it’ll take quite a lot of time to travel from here to the Wondrous Success Heaven.”","“Looks like I’ll have to take a teleportation formation...”","“Sigh, I don’t even remember how many years it’s been since I last took a teleportation formation...”"]},{"number":3872,"title":"Chapter 3872: The Sword Spirits After Their Strength Increased Drastically","paragraphs":["When the Illusionary Ancestor vanished into the teleportation formation, the Space-splitting Venerable slowly looked away. Currently, he sat cross-legged after hiding himself in the void, staying far away from the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. Then he sank into his thoughts.","He was a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. The senses of his soul were extremely powerful. If he wanted to, not a single disturbance on the entire Reverent Observance Heaven could escape his senses. As a result, the Space-splitting Venerable was completely aware of what the Illusionary Ancestor did on the Reverent Observance Heaven.","Of course, he did not have the courage to directly spy on the Illusionary Ancestor through the senses of his soul. Instead, he relied on his powerful senses to avoid any disrespect towards the Illusionary Ancestor.","“The Illusionary Ancestor seems to care very much about the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. The reason why she went to the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens seems to be due to a single person, which is the sect master of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, Jian Chen!”","“Sect master of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, Jian Chen... Immortal Thousand General of the Observance Heaven City, Chang Yang... Just which of these identities is your true identity? Or perhaps neither...”","“However, why is the Illusionary Ancestor so interested in you? With her lofty status, she actually went as far as to personally investigate you. Now that is rare...”","“It’s not just the Illusionary Ancestor. Even crown prince Daowei Chengqing cares so much about you...” the Space-splitting Venerable murmured to himself.","Shortly afterwards, he looked at the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens below. Cold light flashed through his eyes.","......","...","The dense spiritual Qi formed a thick mist that permeated the Skyscraping World, leaving it a hazy white that severely limited vision.","At this moment, a figure rapidly moved through the dense mist. He moved extremely quickly. With every flash, he could cover a hundred kilometres. In just a few flashes, he had already travelled a thousand kilometres.","He was Jian Chen!","He had already sensed a cultivator in the range of where he stayed earlier through the spiritual Qi. For the sake of safety, Jian Chen chose to change his location without any hesitation.","This time, he travelled for several hours before stopping in a pile of boulders. Afterwards, he casually chose a large, flat rock to sit on. He began using the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s secret technique to control the spiritual Qi in the surroundings.","Blinding azure and violet light flickered over his head. The sword spirits were still absorbing the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, but their figures were clearly far more consolidated after all these days of recovery. Their presences were far stronger than before as well.","Now, the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing hovering between the sword spirits was close to running out of energy.","“ Before they ingested the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, the strength of the spirits of the twin swords was barely compatible with medium quality god artifacts. Controlling the swords as high quality god artifacts was an extremely tedious task. Now that they’ve absorbed an entire Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, they still aren’t completely compatible with high quality god artifacts but at least it won’t be as overwhelming as before. ”","Jian Chen looked up at the sword spirits. He felt glad inside. Fortunately, the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing had evolved and had been elevated to an entirely new level. Otherwise, regular Spiritual Fruits of Sword Nurturing would never allow the sword spirits to strengthen so much.","At this moment, the presence of the sword spirits suddenly changed. The spiritual Qi Jian Chen had gathered in the surroundings began to vanish at a terrifying rate. It had been completely absorbed by the sword spirits in a very short moment.","It was as if at that moment, the sword spirits absorbed spiritual Qi at an entirely new speed.","All the dense spiritual Qi within a hundred kilometres had actually been mostly drained in just a few seconds, which made the mist fade away at a visible rate.","After half a minute, even the spiritual Qi within a thousand kilometres could not replenish in time. It rapidly ran out.","It was as if the sword spirits’ demand for spiritual Qi had reached an entirely new peak.","In order to provide the sword spirits with sufficient spiritual Qi, Jian Chen immediately changed locations, quickly appearing in a place dense with spiritual Qi several thousand kilometres away.","Shortly afterwards, he used the secret technique from the Skyscraping Sword Venerable to gather the spiritual Qi in the surroundings.","However, he only gathered the spiritual Qi within a thousand kilometres, as","it was not too far away. It would not take too long to draw over the spiritual Qi.","That was because the sword spirits absorbed spiritual Qi at a far too startling rate. He no longer had the time to wait for the spiritual Qi further away to gather.","When the spiritual Qi within a thousand kilometres began to thin out again, Jian Chen used the Laws of Space to travel, continuing to the next region.","Just like that, Jian Chen constantly moved around. In the end, he only stopped after switching locations almost a hundred times.","By now, the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing had completely vanished. It had been completely devoured by the sword spirits.","They had already stopped absorbing energy. Their bodies almost took on a tangible form, giving off powerful sword intent. They seemed like they possessed almost physical bodies.","“Zi Ying, Qing Suo, congratulations on your strength increase!” Jian Chen smiled brightly. It was entirely from the bottom of his heart. He could sense the strength of the sword spirits. To him, the stronger Zi Ying and Qing Suo were, the greater help they were to him.","Of course, the increase in strength of the sword spirits did not just mean greater battle prowess to him. More importantly, they had already become companions who had gone through thick and thin. Their unshakeable and indestructible friendship had already surpassed all else.","Jian Chen obviously wished for the wellbeing of such close companions.","“This Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing was indeed extremely helpful to us. Master, with our current states, we’re completely compatible with high quality god artifact swords. It won’t be as arduous as before anymore.” Qing Suo also smiled brightly. It was just a few days, but it saved them many years of slow recovery, so she was obviously in an extremely good mood.","“Master, the only thing you have to worry about is the fusion of the twin swords now. As we recover, the power of the fusion will grow stronger as well. If you can’t make a further breakthrough with the Chaotic Body, even if you remove the saint cores on the twin swords and limit them to the strength of medium quality god artifacts, the backlash will still surpass the limits of what you can withstand, master,” Zi Ying said to Jian Chen sternly.","Jian Chen nodded. He obviously understood that, but now he had the Divine Formation of the Heavens as a trump card, he no longer relied on the fusion of the twin swords so much.","He had already purchased enough materials from the Merchant Union of Star Brilliance back then on the Hall Brilliance Heaven. As long as he had enough time, he could assemble the fifty thousand Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals needed for the Divine Formation of the Heavens. By then, the strength of the Divine Formation of the Heavens would definitely rise to a whole new level.","“ During the time between leaving the Hall Brilliance Heaven and entering the Skyscraping World, I’ve already created many Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal disciples through the high grade Godking pills. As a result, the Divine Formation of the Heavens should be much stronger than when I killed the Space-purging Ancestor back then on the Hall Brilliance Heaven. ”","“ At the very least, it’ll be more than enough to deal with Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts. However, when it comes to experts like that, heavily injuring them isn’t difficult. The difficult part is killing them in a single strike, ” Jian Chen thought.","As soon as he thought of the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, a figure appeared in his head. He thought of the Scholar Capital Master who had set up the concealing formation outside the cave where the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing was located.","The Scholar Capital Master had discovered the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing before him. However, he had not picked it, letting it continue to grow. Once the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing had reached a high enough quality, the Scholar Capital Master would come and pick it.","However, Jian Chen managed to beat him to it, so he knew that the Scholar Capital Master would utterly resent him.","“ I’ve already formed a grudge with the Scholar Capital Master. I just wonder whether he’ll come over to the Skyscraping World and wait outside for me. ” When he thought up to there, Jian Chen could not help but smile. He had many trump cards on him, which were completely enough for him to ignore any threats from Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts.","The sword spirits had already vanished. They returned to the swords.","However, from the moment they returned to the swords, Jian Chen suddenly shuddered. As the master of the twin swords, he could clearly sense their strength.","Despite still being high quality god artifacts, Jian Chen felt that there was a tremendous difference in strength in the twin swords compared to before. Even the Heaven-lifting sword, which also happened to be a high quality god artifact, seemed like an infant before them.","At this moment, the Heaven-lifting sword that Jian Chen had subdued also sensed the presence of the twin swords. The entire weapon trembled, dimming its glow uncontrollably and backing down silently to the very edge.","“ Despite all being high quality god artifacts, the twin swords completely overwhelm the Heaven-lifting sword. ” Jian Chen could not help but sigh when he sensed this situation.","The twin swords right now seemed to bear a hint of the special characteristics of sovereign god artifacts already. They could overwhelm and pressure other high quality god artifacts naturally.","In other words, if Jian Chen used the twin swords, his battle prowess would undergo a drastic transformation. It would be far beyond his strength when he wielded the Heaven-lifting sword.","“ The twin swords have grown stronger, so I can’t fall too far behind myself. Otherwise, even if I possess such powerful weapons, I won’t have the strength to wield them, ” Jian Chen smiled wryly before subconsciously looking at the top of the Skyscraping World. There was his opportunity to reach the eighteenth layer of the Chaotic Body."]},{"number":3873,"title":"Chapter 3873: A Change in the Skyscraping World","paragraphs":["However, whenever the Skyscraping World opened, the seed of ways would only appear in the final moment as the ultimate prize.","After the competition for the seed of ways had concluded, it would be the closing of the Skyscraping World as well. By then, the formations would activate, and everyone in the Skyscraping World would be transported outside.","“ According to the previous cases, it will take several years or even several decades to compete for the seed of ways. In order to obtain the seed of ways, not only do you need to face powerful cultivators but there is also the seed of ways itself... ”","“ Without sufficient opportunity and fortune, even Immortal Exalts might not be able to touch the seed of ways. ”","“ The Skyscraping World is far too large, and the seed of ways will automatically flee as well. Once it escapes the range of senses of Immortal Exalts, finding the seed of ways is anything but easy in this special environment where the senses of the soul are suppressed... ”","......","...","Jian Chen recalled all the information regarding the seed of ways. None of the information in the Skyscraping World was a secret anymore. He had already found out about most of it on the Hall Brilliance Heaven. After all, this place had opened several times before. Many rules had already been thoroughly identified.","“ I have the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s secret technique. As long as I control the spiritual Qi in the surroundings, I can use them as my eyes and sense all disturbances. With this secret technique, at least I’ll have an advantage when it comes to finding the seed of ways once it flees. ”","“ As long as the seed of ways falls into my hands, it’ll be almost impossible for these Immortal Exalts to steal it again. ” Jian Chen could not help but smile confidently. The seed of ways would be his.","At this moment, the entire Skyscraping World began to shake. The ground rocked violently as the spiritual Qi churned. It seemed as if the entire world was experiencing an intense earthquake.","The shaking was so intense that it even affected the internal space of the Skyscraping World. The space rippled like water.","The ripples were present everywhere. They had basically spread through the entire Skyscraping World.","“What’s going on? Don’t tell me the seed of ways has emerged?”","“Impossible. According to the past descriptions, the seed of ways can’t cause such a great disturbance when it emerges, much less make the entire Skyscraping World shake...”","“The records regarding the Skyscraping World have never mentioned such an intense tremor inside the Skyscraping World...”","“Don’t tell me there are supreme experts outside attacking the Skyscraping World...”","......","...","At this moment, all of the cultivators in the Skyscraping World stopped what they were doing, staring at the surroundings in surprise and uncertainty. No one knew what was happening.","Even some of the mid Immortal Exalts had no idea what was happening.","Jian Chen’s face changed too. He studied the surroundings with uncertainty. He could not help but recall the scene that had occurred when he accidentally found Xing Caijian and the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s lingering will outside the cave.","“ Don’t tell me this is connected to the promise that the Skyscraping Sword Venerable was referring to? ” Jian Chen thought.","As soon as he thought of that, Jian Chen’s eyes narrowed. He looked at the space around him.","The originally dense mist around him began to thin out at a visible rate.","As the spiritual Qi gradually vanished, visibility improved drastically. It went from being highly limited before gradually fading to a hundred metres and then a thousand metres of visibility.","With the changes in the mist, Jian Chen could clearly sense that the dense spiritual Qi in the entire Skyscraping World was depleting at an unbelievable rate.","Jian Chen was not the only person who noticed this phenomenon. All the cultivators in the Skyscraping World did.","That was because the spiritual Qi did not just thin out in a single region. Instead, it affected the entire Skyscraping World.","The spiritual Qi in the Skyscraping World continued to weaken. This lasted for three whole days before finally stabilising.","After three days, the mist in the surroundings had almost faded away completely. The cultivators in the Skyscraping World felt like the sun had shone through the mist. Their visibility opened up all of a sudden, allowing them to see five hundred kilometres away.","That had already surpassed the range that the senses of their souls could encapsulate.","Jian Chen did not pay too much attention to the Skyscraping World. He wandered aimlessly, searching for opportunities.","Along the way, he came across a few heavenly resources. None of them were particularly precious, coming nowhere close to the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing. They must have grown since the last opening of the Skyscraping World by absorbing the abundant spiritual Qi.","Jian Chen also came across several stone tablets that were engraved with imprints of the Way of the Sword left behind by the Skyscraping Sword Venerable. Whenever he found one, he would pause for a moment, carefully sensing the markings on there.","Although Jian Chen’s strength did not increase substantially, comprehending the stone tablets consolidated his foundations in the Way of the Sword.","In the blink of an eye, two months had already passed since the mess stirred up by the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing. The Heavenloss Master from the Sword Sect of Yang Soul and the group of experts continued to search for the person who took the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, but who knew how far away Jian Chen was from them already.","On this day, Jian Chen’s expression suddenly changed as he advanced through the Skyscraping World. A huge stone tablet stood several hundred kilometres in front of him. The stone tablet was almost three hundred metres tall.","This was the first time Jian Chen had come across such a large stone tablet since he entered the Skyscraping World.","Jian Chen immediately accelerated, arriving before the stone tablet in a few flickers.","Seven figures sat beneath the stone tablet, comprehending the secrets that it hid.","When Jian Chen glanced past them, he was mildly surprised.","He discovered a few familiar figures. One of them was called Chi Yutian, the son of the city lord of the Yi Immortal City on the Hall Brilliance Heaven, the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt. Chi Tianyu was a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor.","Out of the six remaining people, Jian Chen had quite a deep impression of two of them.","That was because they came from the Immortal Feather sect. They were great elders of the Immortal Feather sect, both late Immortal Emperors.","As for the last four people, they were a mid Immortal Emperor and three Immortal Monarchs.","At this moment, the mid Immortal Emperor sensed Jian Chen’s arrival. He subconsciously opened his eyes. When he recognised Jian Chen, he was taken aback at first before standing up with a smile across his face. He clasped his fist. “So it’s fellow Yang Yutian. I must say that it is quite the destiny to encounter fellow Yang Yutian here in the expansive Skyscraping World.”","Seeing how Jian Chen’s attention was focused on the two great elders of the Immortal Feather sect and how he never even glanced at him, the Immortal Emperor could not help but feel rather awkward. However, he did not lose his temper, clasping his fist again. “I am Shi Yingqi. I come from the Sword Sect of Star Pointing on the Scholarly Attainment Heaven. Fellow Yang Yutian, the secret technique recorded in this stone tablet is one of the nine great secret techniques that the Skyscraping Sword Venerable left behind. It possesses unfathomably power. If you can grasp it successfully, your strength will definitely increase by multiple folds. Even defeating those stronger than you won’t be an issue. You’ll be unmatched among your peers.”"]},{"number":3874,"title":"Chapter 3874: Threatening a Court of Heaven","paragraphs":["Jian Chen was obviously aware of the nine great secret techniques left behind by the Skyscraping Sword Venerable.","The reason why the Skyscraping World could attract so many experts was definitely not due to the seed of ways alone.","After all, only a single seed of ways would appear with each opening, and it would basically all be taken by the powerful. The weaker cultivators did not even have a single chance at obtaining it.","As a result, some of the weaker cultivators did not enter the Skyscraping World for the seed of ways but for the various secret techniques, legacies, and heavenly resources that the Skyscraping Sword Venerable had left behind.","The nine secret techniques happened to be one of the core legacies of the Skyscraping World.","As Shi Yingqi enthusiastically introduced the nine secret techniques to Jian Chen, the cultivators in the surroundings all opened their eyes as well. The three Immortal Monarchs stood up in a hurry, clasping their fists towards Jian Chen to greet him as his juniors.","They obviously did not know Jian Chen. Their greeting was not out of respect for Jian Chen’s background or identity but because he was an Immortal Emperor!","At this moment, Jian Chen clearly sensed a hostile gaze land on him. He looked over and saw the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt’s first son, Chi Yutian. He was gazing at him coldly as if he had a great grudge against him.","“Looks like you have quite an opinion of me. If it’s because of your father’s entry spot to the Skyscraping World, you better forget about it. Otherwise, not only will you die here, but your father will suffer consequences as well,” Jian Chen said emotionlessly. His voice was filled with deep disdain.","It was as if he had never taken Chi Yutian or his father, the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt, seriously.","Chi Yutian’s face immediately sank. Anger stirred within him.","Despite the fact that he was tempted to immediately teach this mere mid Immortal Emperor junior a lesson, he also had several qualms when he recalled how the daughter of the heavenly emperor, Xing Caijian, treated Jian Chen. He also recalled the numerous rumours regarding Jian Chen on the Hall Brilliance Heaven.","“ Calm down! Calm down! This kid is nowhere near as strong as me, but his backing is very powerful, well beyond what our Yi Immortal City can afford to provoke. ” Chi Yutian warned himself. Right now, their Yi Immortal City’s greatest source of confidence was his seventh brother, Chi Yun, who had entered the Courtyard of Ways as a student.","However, he also understood that perhaps that identity could elevate the status of their Yi Immortal City significantly, such that other organisations of the same strength would look at them in great regard, but it was nowhere near the point where they could do as they pleased.","“The seventh son of the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt, Chi Yun, is a student of the Courtyard of Ways. Yang Yutian, with how haughty you seem, don’t tell me even the Courtyard of Ways means nothing in your eyes?”","The two great elders of the Immortal Feather sect sitting on the ground opened their eyes at the same time and both looked at Jian Chen. One of them spoke up aloofly with the tone of a senior lecturing a junior.","“What a joke. A student of the Courtyard of Ways is enough to represent the Courtyard of Ways in their entirety?” Jian Chen snorted in contempt. He did not hold back.","When he said that, the expressions of the cultivators present immediately changed slightly. If he spoke to regular cultivators like that, it would not be a problem at all, but the two people here were great elders of the Immortal Feather sect. They were people of great status. Even some of the Immortal Exalts who entered the Skyscraping World had to show them some respect.","“Fellow Yang Yutian, they’re great elders of the Immortal Feather sect. They possess significant status. You shouldn’t provoke them, much less offend them...” Shi Yingqi, the person who had proactively greeted Jian Chen earlier, communicated to Jian Chen sternly, seemingly afraid that Jian Chen did not know about their identities.","Chi Yutian was surprised as well. He knew that Jian Chen’s background was powerful, at least to the extent where their Yi Immortal City could not afford to provoke him, but he never expected Jian Chen to actually be so rude even when facing great elders of the Immortal Feather sect.","Did he even look down on the courts of heaven?","“Hmph, how dare you speak to us like this. Yang Yutian, do you know who we are? Do you really think that you can do whatever you want just because you gained the good graces of Xing Caijian?” the other great elder of the Immortal Feather sect barked with hostility.","Perhaps the daughter of the heavenly emperor’s good graces towards Jian Chen could make some experts have second thoughts, but that definitely did not include the Immortal Feather sect.","Sensing the anger of the two great elders, Chi Yutian on the side let out a sigh of relief. He began to wait eagerly, hoping that he could borrow the Immortal Feather sect’s strength to teach a proper lesson to Yang Yutian.","“ Hmph, our Yi Immortal City can’t afford to provoke you, but you just had to provoke the Immortal Feather sect. Yang Yutian, oh Yang Yutian. Your background is impressive, but before a court of heaven, it’s nothing. ” Chi Yutian rejoiced inside.","Jian Chen stared at the two of them indifferently and smiled mysteriously. “Of course, I know who you are. Aren’t you just great elders of the Immortal Feather sect?”","However, when they noticed Jian Chen’s smile, the two great elders immediately shivered inside. A chill ran down their spines. They could sense tremendous danger.","“You and I have no grievances, but who can help the fact that you’re great elders of the Immortal Feather sect? Since you are from the Immortal Feather sect, then the two of you must die today!” Jian Chen’s voice immediately became icy-cold. As soon as he said that, the Heaven-lifting sword appeared in his hand.","Everyone in the surroundings was dumbstruck. Shi Yingqi from the Sword Sect of Star Pointing subconsciously rubbed his ears. He thought he was hallucinating.","Chi Yutian’s eyes narrowed. He became dazed. His thought process halted.","The two great elders from the Immortal Feather sect were stunned as well, almost failing to respond.","In the vast Immortals’ World, just how many people had the courage to oppose a court of heaven?","Even if there really were people bold enough to look down on the courts of heaven, they definitely did not have the courage to publicly kill great elders of the Immortal Feather sect.","That was because great elders were no longer regular people. They were already regarded as true members of the upper echelon of courts of heaven. They held great authority and influence. Any deaths of great elders would be bound to stir up a storm.","Across the Immortals’ World, apart from a handful of peak organisations and experts, no one could bear the wrath of a court of heaven.","However, before the two great elders could think much of it, a streak of light had already swept over. The sword Qi permeated the air, immediately enveloping the two of them.","Jian Chen had already struck. He swung the Heaven-lifting sword, and the pressure of a high quality god artifact filled the surroundings. The chilling killing intent made everyone feel like they had been plunged into a cavern of ice."]},{"number":3875,"title":"Chapter 3875: Both Dead","paragraphs":["“How audacious. Looks like you’re tired of living since you’re opposing our Immortal Feather sect.”","The two great elders of the Immortal Feather sect responded rapidly. After a violent bellow, they took action decisively. Energy surged out from their bodies as immortal feather armour appeared, radiating with the pressure of medium quality god artifacts. Afterwards, they formed seals with their hands. As a profound power emerged, a meteor rapidly took shape in front of one of them, hurtling towards Jian Chen with heavy pressure.","The meteor only seemed to be the size of a head, but the tremendous presence it gave off was comparable to a huge planet at least.","The other great elder used a secret technique to condense a pure-white feather. As it dazzled with light, it was possible to vaguely make out the patterns of ways on it. It seemed to outline the order of the world, which was highly profound.","With a swish, the feather flew out. It seemed to bypass all notions of distance, arriving instantly with terrifying killing intent.","It had to be mentioned that not only were the attacks of the two great elders swift, they were extremely powerful as well, enough to heavily injure opponents of the same level.","“ Sure enough, the secret techniques of the Immortal Feather sect are extraordinary. The battle prowess demonstrated by these two great elders who have only reached the Seventh Heavenly Layer of Immortal Emperor recently is no weaker than an Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor’s. ” Chi Yutian who watched from the side was amazed by the power of the two secret techniques from the Immortal Feather sect. With the battle prowess they demonstrated right now, even when he already possessed the strength of a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor, he would probably be momentarily overwhelmed.","“ Both their cultivation methods and secret techniques are extraordinary. They truly are experts who have emerged from a court of heaven. Everything they know is what experts of the Immortals’ World envy .” Chi Yutian sighed inside.","Boom! Boom!","At this moment, deafening explosions suddenly erupted. With the Heaven-lifting sword in hand, Jian Chen first made contact with the incoming feather. Shortly afterwards, tremendous energy erupted from the pure-white feather, which had been cut into countless fragments by the Heaven-lifting sword effortlessly, turning into a violent storm of energy.","Shortly afterwards, the meteor created by the secret technique arrived. Despite the startling disturbance created by the meteor, it seemed utterly flimsy before Jian Chen. It had been cut into several pieces, turning into energy that swept through the surroundings.","Jian Chen did not slow down. The Heaven-lifting sword swept towards the two great elders with terrifying sword intent.","In that critical moment, the two great elders bellowed out at the same time before activating a shield together and lifting it over their heads. Their energy flowed into the shield turbulently, making it shine with gorgeous colours.","The shield was a high quality god artifact. With their strengths after recently breaking through to the Seventh Heavenly Layer, it would be extremely arduous of them to power it alone. Even when they poured their strength together, they could only unleash less than half of the high quality god artifact’s power.","Boom!","Powered by Chaotic Force, the Heaven-lifting sword already demonstrated eighty percent of its might as a high quality god artifact. When it slashed against the high quality god artifact shield with terrifying sword Qi, the entire shield dimmed, immediately falling down from above and landing onto the two great elders.","Spurt! Blood sprayed from their mouths at the same time as they paled. They were already quite injured.","They were from the Immortal Feather sect, so both their cultivation methods and secret techniques were extremely extraordinary, but they had only just reached the Seventh Heavenly Layer of Immortal Emperor after all. Compared to Jian Chen whose battle prowess already rivalled Immortal Exalts, there was obviously a tremendous difference.","“Y-you...” A great elder pointed at Jian Chen. He was so stunned that he was unable to speak. They could all tell that Jian Chen’s cultivation had yet to reach late Immortal Emperor. After all, they could tell from the level of laws he used. However, they struggled to imagine how he could erupt with such terrifying battle prowess with his measly cultivation.","However, before they could think too much about it, sword Qi swept over again. The Heaven-lifting sword was wrapped in light, slashing over again.","The two great elders activated the high quality god artifact shield again. At the same time, they formed seals with their hands sternly, using secret techniques again.","Boom! The Heaven-lifting sword slashed against the shield viciously with the force of lightning. Terrifying energy swept through the surroundings. Afterwards, the high quality god artifact shield that protected the two great elders was flung far away, directly vanishing from their range of visibility.","But by now, the two great elders had completed their secret techniques. One of them was sheet-white as if their vitality had been drained. Meanwhile, a tall and terrifying demonic figure rapidly condensed behind him. It was like the ruler of the world, giving off a supreme bearing like it stood unparalleled.","When the tall, demonic figure appeared, the presence it gave off even seemed to influence the ways in the surroundings, making the laws pulse within ten thousand kilometres of it.","The demonic figure was the historic Grand Exalt of the Immortal Feather sect who had passed away who knew how many years ago. At this moment, he had been summoned again through a secret technique.","If this secret technique was used by the supreme ancestor of the Immortal Feather sect, then it really would possess some of the paramount might of a Grand Exalt, enough to easily overwhelm Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts!","However, the secret technique’s power was limited to the caster’s cultivation, so it was obviously much weaker than it seemed.","“ This technique is already enough to threaten Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperors. ” Chi Yutian, who had retreated several dozen kilometres, was stern. He stared straight at the tall demonic figure.","The early Immortal Emperor, Shi Yingqi, as well as the Immortal Monarchs, were all frightened. They had already retreated to a hundred kilometres away.","At this moment, a streak of light shot towards the demonic figure like a bolt of lightning. Surging sword intent erupted, rushing towards the demonic figure.","Immediately, the demonic figure began to collapse part by part. In the end, under the great elder’s gaze of disbelief, it shattered.","After shattering the demonic figure, the streak of light did not halt at all. It rapidly fell straight down, slicing through the great elder’s skull and destroying his soul.","All of this occurred in a split second. The second great elder had not even noticed that his companion had already perished. By now, he had completed his technique as well. As a tremendous pressure spread through the surroundings, a violent storm of energy had already begun brewing. Afterwards, it condensed into a pitch-black sword.","Jian Chen did not use his ultimate will to sever the technique. A God Tier Immortal Technique cast by a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor was nothing in his eyes. He drew the Heaven-lifting sword and directly slashed down.","Boom!","The God Tier Immortal Technique was shattered by Jian Chen with a single blow. When the terrifying storm of energy swept over, Jian Chen slashed out again. Sword Qi criss-crossed together and sliced apart the incoming storm, which swept past Jian Chen with devastating power.","“Y-y-you’ve actually killed a great elder of our Immortal Feather sect. Our Immortal Feather sect will never spare you!” At this moment, the great elder who used the God Tier Immortal Technique finally noticed the death of his companion, which left him both startled and enraged.","However, Jian Chen had overcome their powerful secret techniques twice completely unscathed, which deeply astounded him. He immediately lost the courage to fight, using an escape technique that involved his essence blood without any hesitation.","Right when he had been enveloped by a cloud of blood, about to escape into the distance, Jian Chen acted. He seemed to have anticipated his actions, slashing out with the Heaven-lifting sword from afar.","The Shadowless Lifetaking Strike!","Jian Chen rarely ever used the Shadowless Lifetaking Strike against opponents of the same strength. He either used it on Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperors or Immortal Exalts.","As a result, when the great elder who had only reached the Seventh Heavenly Layer of Immortal Emperor recently received the Shadowless Lifetaking Strike, the damage was obviously severe. As the sword Qi from the Shadowless Lifetaking Strike erupted inside him, he let out a terrible cry. The blinding sword Qi pierced through his flesh, emerging from his countless pores. He suffered severe injuries.","He collapsed down on one knee, staring at Jian Chen with a pale face. His eyes were filled with deep hatred. He ground his teeth. “W-who exactly are you? Aren’t you afraid of retribution from our Immortal Feather sect for publicly opposing us like this?”","Jian Chen sneered. “Do you really think that everyone in the Immortals’ World fears retribution from your Immortal Feather sect? I’m not afraid to tell you that none of the three experts from the Immortal Feather sect who entered the Skyscraping World will be leaving here alive. Before long, the third person will be following in your footsteps.”","“You will regret opposing our Immortal Feather sect. The organisation behind you, everyone you’re familiar with, whether it’s your friends or your family, will die because of you...” The great elder roared hysterically before abandoning his body without any hesitation and fleeing with his soul.","Jian Chen extended a finger. A strand of sword Qi immediately caught up, destroying the soul."]},{"number":3876,"title":"Chapter 3876: One of the Nine Secret Techniques, the Hundred Superimposition Sword (1)","paragraphs":["After personally witnessing the deaths of two great elders from the Immortal Feather sect, both Chi Yutian and Shi Yingqi’s faces paled. Blood had basically drained from their faces.","Despite both being Immortal Emperors, possessing great mental fortitude, they had been quite startled by the events that unfolded here. Their hearts surged violently.","That was because the people who died here were not regular Immortal Emperors but great elders of the Immortal Feather sect. They possessed great status and authority. They were well and truly figures of significance.","Now that two of them had died all of a sudden, they struggled to imagine just how vicious the wrath of the Immortal Feather sect would be.","Probably everyone who entered the Skyscraping World, apart from the daughter of the heavenly emperor, Xing Caijian, would face intense interrogation from the Immortal Feather sect.","Even the students of the Courtyard of Ways could not avoid it.","“Y-Yang Yutian, y-you’ve gotten yourself involved with tremendous problems...” Chi Yutian stared at Jian Chen with a pale face. At that moment, there was not a single shred of resentment or hatred in his gaze anymore. All there was was deep dread.","Extremely deep dread, as well as... fear...","He could even kill great elders of the Immortal Feather sect on a moment’s whim, without batting an eye, without any hesitation, so just what kind of a demon was this person?","He did not even take a court of heaven, the Immortal Feather sect, seriously. In retrospect, what was their Yi Immortal City, an organisation with only an early Immortal Exalt, supposed to be in Jian Chen’s eyes?","At this moment, all Chi Yutian could think of was the sight of the two great elders perishing. As for the outstanding battle prowess Jian Chen had demonstrated, he had already forgotten about it subconsciously.","“F-f-fellow, we have no grudge with you. D-d-don’t tell us you plan on silencing us...” Shi Yingqi returned to his senses. His pale face was filled with grimness as he stared at Jian Chen nervously.","To him, the only way to hide the deaths of the two great elders was to kill all of the people present. With the battle prowess that Jian Chen had demonstrated, that would not be difficult to achieve.","As soon as Shi Yingqi said that, not only did the expressions of the Immortal Monarchs nearby change, even the Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor Chi Yutian became extremely stern.","At this moment, Jian Chen had already completely withdrawn the surging sword intent he gave off. He had stowed the Heaven-lifting sword away as well. Afterwards, he collected the Space Rings from the two great elders without any rush and smiled gently. “Why would I silence you? All I did was kill two Immortal Emperors from the Immortal Feather sect. It’s not like this is a big deal. Why do I have to hide it?”","“I’ve only killed Immortal Emperors right now. In the future, I’ll be killing Immortal Exalt ancestors of the Immortal Feather sect...”","When Jian Chen said that, everyone present was left speechless.","In particular, Chi Yutian felt like his entire body had become icy-cold; he felt like his blood had frozen.","He even looked down on a court of heaven, wanting to kill their Immortal Exalt ancestors. Just how powerful was his background?","For a moment, Chi Yutian only felt his back tingle. He was shaken up.","“ I-I haven’t offended him, have I? ” At this moment, Chi Yutian began to think of himself before closely recalling everything that had occurred between him and Jian Chen. He did not miss any details at all.","As he recalled that, his hands and feet gradually became clammy. He became unsettled as well.","After a moment of deliberation, he finally seemed to make up his mind. He gritted his teeth and bowed decisively towards Jian Chen. He said with sincerity, “Fellow Yang Yutian, I acted with ignorance earlier. If I ever offended you, please show forgiveness and spare me this time.”","“I can guarantee to you that something like this definitely won’t occur a second time in the future.”","Jian Chen glanced at Chi Yutian and said, “You didn’t do anything that angered me, but due to your father, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu was humiliated by the Profound Spirit Master. His arm was even severed because of this.”","When he heard that, Chi Yutian immediately took out his sword and slashed it at his own arm without any hesitation. As blood sprayed out like a fountain, his right arm fell to the ground.","That was not all. He opened his mouth and exhaled. Flames surged out with terrifying heat, immediately reducing his severed arm to ash.","“I will make up for senior Tan Yu’s pain of having his arm severed. On top of that, I will guarantee right now that before I leave the Skyscraping World, I will not be recovering this arm!” Chi Yutian said firmly.","He completely ignored his injury that was still spraying with blood and looked up at Jian Chen. “Fellow Yang Yutian, is this sufficient?”","Jian Chen glanced at Chi Yutian deeply. Only after a moment of silence did he say slowly, “In the future, as long as the people of your Yi Immortal City do not provoke me, I obviously won’t come after you either.”","Jian Chen’s words immediately made Chi Yutian feel like he had just been spared from a death sentence. His entire body relaxed before he said, “You don’t have to worry about that, fellow. From today onwards, fellow Yang Yutian is an esteemed guest of our Yi Immortal City...”","Chi Yutian was not the city lord of the Yi Immortal City, but he made this decision in place of his father without any hesitation.","In the past, Jian Chen’s reputation on the Hall Brilliance Heaven also gave them qualms. They did not have the courage to provoke him without good reason.","But after Jian Chen had fearlessly killed two great elders of the Immortal Feather sect, Chi Yutian had truly developed fear.","“S-s-senior, w-we were wondering if we could leave...” one of the Immortal Monarchs trembling in fear stuttered.","They had also been frightened out of their wits, such that they did not even have the courage to leave without permission.","Jian Chen looked at the Immortal Monarchs and smiled gently. “It’s not like I’m restricting your freedom. You can leave if you want to. However, the nine great secret techniques left behind by the Skyscraping Sword Venerable aren’t that easy to come across. Since you’ve encountered one, it’s a pity if you don’t comprehend it.”","After saying that, Jian Chen turned his attention away from everyone. With a step, he immediately vanished.","But in just a few seconds, he returned again. He returned with an item in his hand.","That was the high quality god artifact shield used by the two great elders earlier!","“ This high quality god artifact, combined with the resources in the two Space Rings, amount to another several hundred thousand five-coloured immortal crystals, ” Jian Chen calculated to himself. Just from the various spoils of battle alone, he had earned over a million five-coloured immortal crystals from the Skyscraping World, and that was without taking the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing into account.","Afterwards, Jian Chen sat down in front of the stone tablet like no one else was around, gathering his focus to comprehend the secret technique.","“ Very few people have successfully comprehended the nine great secret techniques left behind by the Skyscraping Sword Venerable. This is not just due to the depth of the secret techniques but also because of how briefly the Skyscraping World remains open... ”","“ I wonder if I will have the fortune to grasp this secret technique. However, I can only stay until the seed of ways appears... ” Jian Chen thought to himself.","Immediately, he opened up his mind and submerged himself in the mysteries of the Way of the Sword contained within the stone tablet.","Chi Yutian, Shi Yingqi, and the Immortal Monarchs looked at the figure that sat in front of the stone tablet. They were filled with a multitude of emotions. They wanted to stay here and continue comprehending the secret technique on the stone tablet very much. After all, what Jian Chen said was true. Coming across the nine great secret techniques left behind by the Skyscraping Sword Venerable in the Skyscraping World was not easy. It required immense luck.","However, when they saw the corpses of the two great elders from the Immortal Feather sect on the ground, how could they still have the courage or be in the mood to stay? As a result, after a moment of hesitation, they all left silently, including Chi Yutian."]},{"number":3877,"title":"Chapter 3877: One of the Nine Secret Techniques, the Hundred Superimposition Sword (2)","paragraphs":["After everyone had left, Jian Chen slowly opened his eyes as he sat on the ground. Looking at the empty surroundings, he could not help but shake his head.","Afterwards, he looked at the corpses of the two great elders from the Immortal Feather sect. Only after a moment of hesitation did he collect their corpses with some disdain.","As cultivators who had only reached late Immortal Emperor, they were even somewhat lacking to be fed to the Immortal Devouring Orchid.","Ever since the Immortal Devouring Orchid reached Immortal Exalt, the effects of Immortal Emperor corpses were almost negligible to it.","Afterwards, Jian Chen began to focus on comprehending the mysteries of the Way of the Sword in the stone tablet. Jian Chen was completely unconcerned with whether the people who had left would spread the news that he killed the two great elders of the Immortal Feather sect or not.","That was because the Skyscraping World was completely sealed in. People could not enter from the outside. As long as no late Immortal Exalts appeared, he could easily escape even if he could not defeat the other experts.","He also possessed the mask from the Illusionary Daemon race and the Divine Armour of Heavenflight. As he wandered through the Immortals’ World, he could assume various identities and disguises. He did not have to worry about being found by the Immortal Feather sect at all.","Without any concerns, Jian Chen remained by the stone tablet for several months.","By now, he was no longer alone. Apart from him, there was an Immortal Monarch. A Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal also managed to find this place. They sat several kilometres away from Jian Chen, also comprehending the mysteries in the stone tablet.","As for the Immortal Monarchs who witnessed the murder of the great elders from the Immortal Feather sect, all of them kept their mouths shut, perhaps because they were concerned about retribution from Jian Chen, or perhaps because they did not want to get involved at all. They did not mention a single word about the deaths of the two great elders.","Only Chi Yutian managed to successfully reunite with his father, the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt, through the connection of his bloodline.","When he found the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt, the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt continued to accompany the Profound Spirit Master in their search for the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing in the Skyscraping World.","Chi Yutian called the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt over to one side individually and informed him about the deaths of the two great elders from the Immortal Feather sect in an extremely discreet manner.","“ What did you say? Yang Yutian killed two great elders from the Immortal Feather sect? ” When he received the news, the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt was startled. He was in disbelief.","“ It’s not just the great elders of the Immortal Feather sect. Based on his tone, he even claimed that he would kill the Immortal Exalt ancestors of the Immortal Feather sect in the future... ” Chi Yutian was stern as he described Jian Chen’s attitude and tone truthfully, without sparing any details.","That was because he understood a certain principle very well. If this matter was handled inappropriately, their Yi Immortal City would be doomed.","The Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt immediately became extremely stern. He stood there in silence for a very long time. His eyes shone with uncertainty. Who knew what he was thinking about.","“ Father, we can’t afford to offend someone like that. I think that we shouldn’t make ourselves such a terrifying enemy over an entry spot to the Skyscraping World... ” Chi Yutian said sternly.","When he heard that, the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt exhaled deeply. He said to Chi Yutian, “ Tian’er, I already know what I need to do. You don’t have to worry. I have lived for all these years after all. I know how to consider the costs and benefits. Under these circumstances, I know the appropriate actions. ”","......","...","Jian Chen had completely entered a meditative state as he sat in front of the stone tablet that recorded the secret technique. Vaguely, his spirit and consciousness seemed to merge with the stone tablet, becoming inseparable.","Under this state, his defences and senses of the outside world plummeted. He was basically completely defenceless.","However, he had three sovereign god artifacts to protect him, so even when he had already entered such a deep state, Jian Chen was not worried about his safety at all.","“ This move is called the Hundred Superimposition Sword! ”","Suddenly, a resonant voice rang out in the depths of Jian Chen’s head, filled with undefiable authority. It boomed through his entire soul and even made his mind sway.","In the next moment, a bolt of lightning seemed to shoot through Jian Chen’s head, illuminating the entire world.","He appeared in a chaotic space. It was like witnessing the creation of the universe, when everything had yet to come into existence. The endless laws and ways wove together, manifesting into a large, colourful world.","A towering figure hovered in this chaotic space, both illusionary and blurry. It seemed completely surreal. Its presence swept through the surroundings, giving off a sense of invincibility.","“ The Skyscraping Sword Venerable! ” Jian Chen’s mind shuddered, immediately recognising the true identity of the blurry figure. After all, he had seen the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s lingering will before. It was very easy for him to make the comparison.","At this moment, the Skyscraping Sword Venerable closed his hand, and the power of ways in the surroundings gathered to form a sword of blinding light in his hand. He slowly lifted the sword in his hand and slashed out at the empty space in front of him.","When he slashed out, numerous blurs appeared before merging together.","After the blurs had merged together, a terrifying presence radiated out. It was devastating, making the chaotic space tremble violently. The laws sank into a mess. Everything was pulverised.","The power of the slash immediately multiplied, reaching a shocking level.","The Skyscraping Sword Venerable was a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. Even a regular attack from him possessed unimaginable power.","If his foundations had been further multiplied, then it would be absolutely shocking.","“The Hundred Superimposition Sword was not created by me. Instead, I obtained it through a coincidence in my early days. It took me many years before I even gained a basic grasp over it...”","“Each superimposition strengthens the attack by one fold. The Hundred Superimposition Sword can overlap a hundred times, so the strength of attacks can be strengthened by a hundred fold...”","“However, even at the end of my life, I was only able to superimpose the Hundred Superimposition Sword eight times in total...”","“After reaching the Ninth Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt, just the eighth superimposition was enough for me to rival the twelve heavenly emperors. If I could superimpose a hundred times... then... it would virtually be beyond imagination...”","The Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s booming voice rang out in the space there, filled with emotion and anticipation.","It was as if he was also anticipating just how startling the power of the Hundred Superimposition Sword would become once it superimposed a hundred times.","But unfortunately, by the time of his death, he had only managed to reach the eighth superimposition!","After demonstrating the Hundred Superimposition Sword again, the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s illusionary figure shattered into pieces with a bang. Each fragment contained the profound truths of the ways, hiding the various manifestations of the laws.","Jian Chen dismissed his thoughts and immediately tried to comprehend these fragments of the ways, but as soon as he made contact with the first fragment, he was overcome with dizziness.","The laws that these fragments touched on were far too profound. Even with Jian Chen’s current comprehension of the Ways of the Sword, trying to comprehend a single fragment seemed extremely difficult."]},{"number":3878,"title":"Chapter 3878: One of the Nine Secret Techniques, the Hundred Superimposition Sword (3)","paragraphs":["“ What a profound secret technique. Initially comprehending the Hundred Superimposition Sword would require the strength of an Immortal Emperor or even Immortal Exalt... ” Jian Chen was secretly amazed. It took him great effort before he finally managed to steady his mind, enduring the sensation of dizziness that came with the first fragment. An obscure and indescribable truth entered his mind.","“ It’s too difficult. Probably even Immortal Exalts won’t be able to grasp this technique before the closing of the Skyscraping World given the level of truth it touches on. ” Jian Chen furrowed his brows deeply. The difficulty of comprehending the Hundred Superimposition Sword had surpassed his imaginations.","“ The Hundred Superimposition Sword is indeed difficult to grasp, but once you do grasp it, the benefits are immense. ” The Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s voice rang out again in the chaotic space, filled with sentiment and emotion. “ In the past, the Profound Sword Qi invented by the old senior from the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens shocked both the Immortals’ and the Saints’ World, striking fear into the hearts of many Grand Exalts. I never grasped the Profound Sword Qi, but I can say with confidence that the power of the Hundred Superimposition Sword will definitely surpass the Profound Sword Qi once it has been mastered to the utmost level! ”","“Is it you that’s speaking, senior sword venerable?” Jian Chen shuddered inside.","“My lingering will is already close to its end. It will completely dissipate very soon. Originally, I wanted to guide you here in my final moments, but I never thought you would find this place yourself, which saved me a lot of effort.”","“Don’t talk. Don’t ask any questions either. I really don’t have any time left...”","“ Listen up. You must gain a basic grasp over the Hundred Superimposition Sword. Even if you fail this time, you must come here the next time that the Skyscraping World opens, as it is indeed an extremely profound secret technique of the Way of the Sword. It is so powerful that even the Authority of the Grand Exalt grasped by disciples of Grand Exalts come nowhere close... ”","“ Although I could only use the secret technique up to the eighth superimposition, I only ever used the eighth superimposition once in my life... ”","“ That was during the war with the Saints’ World. I was encircled by three Ninth Heavenly Layer Grand Primes. With no other choice, I used the Hundred Superimposition Sword. ”","“ In the end, that attack alone slew three experts at the same cultivation as me. Even though the three Ninth Heavenly Layer Grand Primes were not the most powerful there were, with a drastic difference compared to the Saint Monarchs of the Saints’ World, neither the Saint Monarchs of the Saints’ World nor the heavenly emperors of our Immortals’ World could kill a cultivator of the same level in a single attack, much less three of them... ”","“ Following that battle, I realised that even with just the eighth imposition, I was already no weaker than heavenly emperors. ”","“ However, if you grasp this technique, do not use it so easily. Once you do use it, do not leave anyone alive, just in case someone begins to covet it. ”","“ As for the stone tablet that recorded the Hundred Superimposition Sword, I had set up numerous restrictions in the past, withholding many details. It will be very difficult for others to find out about all the secrets regarding the Hundred Superimposition Sword, but I will hold nothing back with you and share everything that I know. ”","......","...","“ In order to carry out my promise with the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor, the Skyscraping World has exhausted a tremendous amount of spiritual Qi. At this rate, even with my boundless wealth and resources, the Skyscraping World probably won’t be able to last for many years. As a result, I have a request for you, which is to destroy as many medicinal gardens in the Skyscraping World as you can. ”","“ These medicinal gardens set up by the various organisations of the Immortals’ World have already become tremendous parasites, accelerating the decline of the world... ”","“ I also requested for the daughter of the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor, Xing Caijian, to do this, so she will cooperate with you. Of course, if you refuse, that’s fine too. After all, doing this will cause you significant trouble. You don’t have Xing Caijian’s background. If those organisations come for revenge, it’ll be very difficult for you to fend them off with your current capabilities. ”","“ Time is up... The final wisp of lingering will that I’ve left in this world is about to dissipate completely. This is a bit of my understanding of the Hundred Superimposition Sword from when I was alive. Although this understanding doesn’t even come close to one ten-thousandth of what I was capable of when I was still alive, this is all I can do now... ”","After the Skyscraping Sword Venerable said that, Jian Chen’s mind suddenly cleared up. It felt like everything had sunk into silence as time came to a standstill. His surroundings became quiet.","Vaguely, he seemed to sense that some information and memories had entered his head. They were very profound, containing the comprehension of the ways and the usages of the laws...","Vaguely, he seemed to see an elderly figure roam through the world, traverse through space, training the sword arduously in different places, in different situations, and in different environments.","Jian Chen knew that the figure in his head was the Skyscraping Sword Venerable in his early days.","Back then, the Immortals’ World did not possess a Skyscraping Sword Venerable. He had yet to reach his peak cultivation either. In order to grasp the Hundred Superimposition Sword, the Skyscraping Sword Venerable had spent an extremely lengthy time and endless effort before mastering the basics.","At this moment, Jian Chen felt like he had become the Skyscraping Sword Venerable from back then, experiencing everything he had gone through in the past through a different method.","Of course, without any exceptions, all of these experiences were connected to the Hundred Superimposition Sword.","Under this state, Jian Chen forgot about time. He could not sense the passage of time at all. During the time he spent merged with the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s memories, it felt like countless years had passed, yet also like only a split second had passed. In the end, when Jian Chen roused, he had already absorbed and digested all of the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s understanding towards the Hundred Superimposition Sword that he had left behind.","Jian Chen’s understanding and comprehension of the Hundred Superimposition Sword immediately increased significantly.","It was just a pity that the understanding from the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s lingering will was less than one ten-thousandth of when it was complete.","Trying to grasp the Hundred Superimposition Sword successfully through this was clearly a little far fetched.","“ The Hundred Superimposition Sword is actually using the same move a hundred times at the same time before completely merging these one hundred attacks into one... ”","“ With my current speed, I can complete a hundred attacks in a split second even if I don’t use the Laws of Space. I can even do it a thousand times. However, no matter how many attacks I unleash, each strike is independent. The power behind each attack is fixed as well. Even when I can merge the countless attacks into one through speed, that’s only a visual effect. ”","“ Meanwhile, the Hundred Superimposition Sword is truly merging all those attacks together, such that their power becomes stacked together... ”","“ The eight superimpositions that the Skyscraping Sword Venerable could achieve in the past was actually merging together eight attacks, such that the attack becomes eight times more powerful from its very foundations... ”"]},{"number":3879,"title":"Chapter 3879: Comprehending the Sword for Eighteen Years","paragraphs":["After learning about the wonders of the Hundred Superimposition Sword, Jian Chen could not help but recall a Heaven Tier Battle Skill called Nature’s Stolen Fortune that he had obtained back then on the Tian Yuan Continent. That battle skill could also multiply his strength, which bore similarity to the Hundred Superimposition Sword.","However, the wonders of Nature’s Stolen Fortune only worked on low level cultivators from the lower world. If their strength neared the top or peak of the lower world, Nature’s Stolen Fortune would basically become useless.","However, the Hundred Superimposition Sword was completely different. This was a profound secret technique that even Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts could only comprehend to the eighth superimposition.","“ Just comprehending up to the eighth superimposition already makes you on par with heavenly emperors, even achieving what heavenly emperors cannot attain. If you completely comprehend all one hundred superimpositions, wouldn’t that mean you can fend off Grand Exalts who had already become an embodiment of the heavenly ways and risen above all else as a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt? ” Thinking up to there, Jian Chen could not help but gasp.","Grand Exalt! Just how superior and divine of an existence was that? They were the undisputed paramount sovereigns of a major world. The first standard for gauging the strength of a major world was the number and quality of Grand Exalts they possessed.","Throughout history, the opponents of Grand Exalts were always figures of the same level. There had yet to be any Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts who managed to rival Grand Exalts despite being weaker. Not even supreme prodigies, no matter how deviously talented they were.","Jian Chen who deeply understood the value of the Hundred Superimposition Sword also became overcome with an irrepressible sense of desire. He immediately settled his mind and cast aside all other thoughts, using less than one ten-thousandth of the Skyscraping Sword Sovereign’s comprehension as a foundation to begin comprehending.","At that moment, Jian Chen seemed to depart from the world and all conflict, rising beyond all matters. He forgot about the various opportunities and fortunes in the Skyscraping World and also forgot about his ultimate objective for entering this place, the seed of ways!","At this moment, only a single goal remained in his mind, which was to comprehend the Hundred Superimposition Sword!","Its importance even exceeded the seed of ways!","That was because without the seed of ways, he could still break through with the Way of the Sword. It would just take longer.","However, if he did not grasp the Hundred Superimposition Sword, then he would have to wait several hundred thousand years until the Skyscraping World opened once again.","That was also dependent on the Skyscraping World remaining complete. If the world shattered or was destroyed, then he would potentially lose the opportunity right in front of him.","After all, he was uncertain whether the Hundred Superimposition Sword would be preserved.","Or perhaps it would be taken by someone else!","Time trickled by slowly. Jian Chen meditated in front of the stone tablet year after year. He seemed to become a statue. He did not budge at all.","During this time, many cultivators of various strengths found this place as well. After recognising the stone tablet to be one of the nine secret techniques left behind by the Skyscraping Sword Venerable, they sat down in delight and all tried to comprehend it.","Some of these cultivators lasted for several years before leaving in pity.","They had already understood the difficulty of comprehending the Hundred Superimposition Sword. They were aware that they could not grasp its secrets before the closing of the Skyscraping World, so they refused to waste their remaining time here. They went off to search for their fortunes elsewhere.","There were also others who refused to give up, remaining here and continuously trying. All they knew was that it was one of the nine secret techniques that the Skyscraping Sword Venerable had left behind.","They were completely unaware of any further details.","Over the years, there had not been any major incidents in the Sky Scraping World. The seed of ways still did not appear. The cultivators beneath Immortal Exalt were active in the lower regions of the Skyscraping World. Very few people set foot in the higher regions.","As for the Immortal Exalts, most of them gathered in the higher regions. These people did not care about the various resources available in the Skyscraping World at all. They found a quiet place to patiently wait for the appearance of the seed of ways.","There were also people who watched the only path leading up to the top of the mountain like they were hunting.","During those years, the mess created by the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing gradually settled down. Apart from the Profound Spirit Master and a select few Immortal Exalts, no one went out of their way to investigate this matter anymore.","The two Immortal Exalt ancestors who followed the Profound Spirit Master had now been reduced to just the Black Wind Ancestor. It had been a very long time since the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt from the Hall Brilliance Heaven had appeared with them.","It was a mystery how he managed to leave the Profound Spirit Master’s side without displeasing him.","Outside the Skyscraping World, one of the three sages of the Modest Silence Heaven, the Scholar Capital Master, continued to sit in the cold and dark outer space. He was clearly not as calm as he seemed on the surface. He would open his eyes from time to time, glancing back and forth between this region of space and the Modest Silence Heaven with clear anxiety and concern. He would also check how much time had passed from time to time, calculating when the Skyscraping World would reopen.","The Scholar Capital Master truly experienced what days passing like years meant during the time he spent waiting outside the Skyscraping World.","Jian Chen continued to sit without budging in front of the huge stone tablet that recorded the Hundred Superimposition Sword inside the Skyscraping World. He had already spent eighteen years there.","The few faces that Jian Chen first saw here had all left already. They had given up on comprehending this secret technique.","At this moment, there was only another Immortal Emperor here apart from Jian Chen. He was an old man with a ruddy appearance. He wore the robes of a daoist priest and possessed a peaceful countenance, as well as an extraordinary bearing. He seemed like an orthodox daoist priest.","He had also spent a decade here. He sat several kilometres away from Jian Chen, also in the middle of comprehending.","At this moment, the old man slowly opened his eyes. He looked at the huge stone tablet. There was a deep sense of helplessness and pity on his face. “How difficult. The nine secret techniques left behind by the Skyscraping Sword Venerable are truly too unfathomable. I’ve spent a decade here, yet I’ve made no progress at all.”","“If I had enough time, I could spend tens of thousands of years, hundreds of thousands of years, or even millions of years here, but I just don’t have that much time in the Skyscraping World...”","“Sigh, looks like I’m fated to not obtain this secret technique...”","The old man sighed as he stood up slowly, about to leave. Despite being filled with intense reluctance, he was forced to accept this cruel truth.","At this moment, powerful sword intent suddenly appeared, which made the old man halt. He subconsciously looked over. Several kilometres away, Jian Chen basked in hazy light as powerful sword Qi wrapped around him.","From the level of the laws, the sword Qi only belonged to a mid Immortal Emperor. It did not reach late Immortal Emperor.","However, the old man whose cultivation had already reached the Eighth Heavenly Layer sensed an intense threat from the sword Qi, which actually gave him chills.","“W-what exactly is this sword Qi? The laws are clearly weaker than mine, yet it gives me intense uneasiness.” The old man was startled.","At this moment, Jian Chen suddenly opened his eyes after eighteen years of comprehension. His eyes were snowy-white, shining with blinding light, such that it was impossible to meet his gaze.","He took out the Heaven-lifting sword; his presence instantly rose to the peak. Afterwards, he unleashed a regular strike towards the tall stone tablet before him.","When he struck out, numerous blurs immediately appeared in the space around him before superimposing together and merging with the Heaven-lifting sword in his hand. As each blur overlapped, the strength behind his attack multiplied.","The attack had produced a total of five blurs!"]},{"number":3880,"title":"Chapter 3880: Presence of the Hole of Reincarnation","paragraphs":["When the five blur overlapped, the power behind his attack immediately reached a new peak. The terrifying power and surging might it contained made the Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor old man pale in fright.","Boom!","Jian Chen’s attack struck the stone tablet heavily and produced a deafening boom. A terrifying storm of energy soon followed, which actually pushed the old man backwards. His feet left behind two long trails in the ground.","“ I-is this really the strength that a mid Immortal Emperor should possess? ” The old man was shocked. His heart surged.","This was just far too unbelievable. With his strength as an Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor, he could not even withstand the side effects of this attack, having been pushed back several hundred metres.","The sweeping storm of energy slowly subsided, revealing Jian Chen standing in front of the stone tablet with the Heaven-lifting sword in hand and a brilliant smile on his face.","“ Sure enough, the Hundred Superimposition Sword’s power is terrifying. I’ve only grasped up to the fifth superimposition, yet it’s already so powerful. If I reach the hundredth superimposition... the Skyscraping Sword Venerable was right. The Hundred Superimposition Sword already surpasses the Profound Sword Qi in strength, ” Jian Chen thought. He struggled to imagine just who had managed to come up with such a powerful secret technique.","From the five superimpositions, his Chaotic Force strengthened by five times, the power of the Heaven-lifting sword strengthened by five times, and even his Laws of the Sword strengthened by five times.","Of course, the level of his Laws of the Sword did not change at all, but its power changed drastically!","“ Zi Ying, Qing Suo, what do you think of the Hundred Superimposition Sword? ” Jian Chen was in a great mood.","However, the sword spirits remained silent. They did not respond even after a very long time.","“ Master, this technique is extremely extraordinary. It can be considered heaven-defying. Its origins must be beyond imagination. ” Only a while later did Jian Chen receive a reply from the artifact spirit of the Primeval Divine Hall, which was filled with undisguised sternness and shock.","The Primeval artifact spirit’s response left Jian Chen stunned.","Extremely extraordinary?","Considered heaven-defying?","Origins beyond imagination?","Even if the Skyscraping Sword Venerable said something like that, Jian Chen would not feel as shocked as right now. After all, it was the artifact spirit of the Primeval Divine Hall who gave such high praise!","It was an artifact spirit of Primeval Qi who had accompanied a Grand Exalt in the past, experiencing times of change. It had grown accustomed to upheavals, even surviving several aeons!","“ Master, the Primeval artifact spirit is right. This technique’s profoundness is indeed beyond imagination. It has already surpassed our understanding of all techniques in the world. ” Only at this moment did the sword spirits reply slowly, also filled with sternness. As powerful sword spirits that once accompanied a Grand Exalt, both their insight and knowledge surpassed Jian Chen’s.","“ That’s because not only is the multiplicative effect from the Hundred Superimposition Sword effective on Immortal Exalts, it’s probably equally as effective on Grand Exalts too. ”","When the sword spirits said that, Jian Chen’s heart lurched violently.","At that moment, his breathing seemed to seize up. He was dumbfounded.","The Hundred Superimposition Sword was even effective with Grand Exalts. Didn’t that mean if Grand Exalts grasped this technique, they too could stack their attacks like the Skyscraping Sword Venerable?","Strength between Grand Exalts mostly differed by the type and number of ways they had grasped. The more ways they had grasped, the stronger they obviously were.","If a Grand Exalt of the Way of the Sword grasped this technique, wouldn’t they become truly invincible with the Laws of the Sword alone?","At that moment, Jian Chen had truly become stunned.","All of the techniques in the world had a strict upper limit, just like how the Nature’s Stolen Fortune he had obtained in the lower world only had an effect on weaker cultivators. As his strength increased, the effects of Nature’s Stolen Fortune weakened until it became completely useless.","All of the cultivation methods, battle skills, god artifacts, and pills across the Immortals’ and Saints’ World were like this. Low quality god artifacts corresponded to Immortal Monarchs and would greatly lose their power in the hands of Immortal Emperors. If Immortal Exalts used them, they would be completely fragile, shattering from the slightest touch.","God Tier Battle Skills also had this division. The different grades corresponded to varying levels of strength. Low grade God Tier Immortal Techniques were useless against stronger immortals.","When it came to Grand Exalts, then basically all the techniques in the world would be useless to them.","That was because even the strongest of abilities were created by existences on the same level as them at most. If they tried to learn techniques created by existences at the same level of them, it would not lead to a substantial change in their battle prowess even if the technique was compatible with the laws they had comprehended.","Yet the Hundred Superimposition Sword could even increase the strength of Grand Exalts drastically. That was indeed unbelievable.","At this moment, a round, palm-sized jade disc suddenly fell out from the huge stone tablet, falling right in front of Jian Chen’s feet.","Jian Chen’s gaze was drawn over to the jade disc. He was confused. He had sat in front of the stone tablet for all these years. He had grasped every single detail on the jade tablet. There was no such thing like this.","Yet, the jade disc just managed to appear out of nowhere.","In the next moment, he bent down slowly and picked up the jade disc from the ground.","The jade disc seemed simple. It did not possess any special glow or give off any kind of energy. It seemed like a regular object, the kind that would not raise any attention if it was thrown into a pile of objects.","However, when Jian Chen touched the jade disc, his mind shuddered. A profound feeling filled his mind.","“ I-is this the Hundred Superimposition Sword that the Skyscraping Sword Venerable happened to obtain in the past? ” Jian Chen’s eyes shone brightly. From the ordinary jade disc, he could clearly sense a profound presence that bore great similarity to the Hundred Superimposition Sword.","After a moment of hesitation, Jian Chen sent the senses of his soul inside. He began to explore the secrets that it was hiding.","But very soon, Jian Chen was left stunned yet again. He was extremely dumbfounded.","He sensed a unique presence from the inconspicuous jade disc that was both familiar and unfamiliar.","The appearance of the presence made Jian Chen think of his journey towards the Reverent Observance Heaven from the Grand Sovereign Heaven when he first arrived in the Immortals’ World.","During that time, he had made a temporary stop outside the Hole of Reincarnation.","In particular, when he stood outside the Hole of Reincarnation, he was overwhelmed by an emotion that even he himself was uncertain about. Even to this day, it was fresh in his mind. It was unforgettable.","From the jade disc, Jian Chen discovered a unique presence that belonged to the Hole of Reincarnation.","“ Don’t tell me the jade disc comes from the Hole of Reincarnation? ” Jian Chen could not help but think of that.","“Fellow, I am unable to hold back my curiosity, so I wanted to ask what the name of the secret technique that the Skyscraping Sword Venerable left behind in this stone tablet is called? I was wondering if you could satiate my curiosity.” A voice interrupted Jian Chen’s thoughts. The Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor old man who remained on the side arrived before Jian Chen and asked sincerely.","There were still hints of fear in his gaze towards Jian Chen.","It was as if he had been frightened by the five superimpositions Jian Chen used earlier."]},{"number":3881,"title":"Chapter 3881: Extraordinary Origins","paragraphs":["Jian Chen looked at the old man and smiled gently. “If you can comprehend it, then you’ll obviously find out which of the nine secret techniques this is. If you can’t, then does it matter even if you do find out?”","“I am simply curious. Could you satisfy this small request of mine?” The old man smiled wryly.","The old man had a kind appearance and friendly demeanor, so Jian Chen was not irritated by his persistent questioning. He shook his head gently and said nothing more before shifting his attention to the jade disc in his hand.","“ The Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s lingering will made no mention of this jade disc... ” Jian Chen gently stroked the jade disc in his hand as he closely recalled everything that the Skyscraping Sword Venerable had said.","However, whenever he thought of how the jade disc came from the Hole of Reincarnation, Jian Chen struggled to remain calm.","That was because the Hole of Reincarnation was a place filled with wonder in the Immortals’ World. It was a special place that had once devoured Grand Exalts, a place that even Grand Exalts were unable to see through and reluctant to set foot in.","Throughout history, only Daowei Chengqing had ever set foot in the Hole of Reincarnation and emerged alive.","On top of that, the items he brought out from the Hole of Reincarnation were known to have changed the entire situation and fate of the Immortals’ World.","The Book of the Populace had created a Grand Exalt like Daowei Fatian, allowing the Waymight clan that was once one of the twelve courts of heaven to rise up and become a paramount sovereign clan respected by all!","The birth of a Grand Exalt could indeed have a tremendous impact on the entire Immortals’ World!","Meanwhile, the Dominion’s Brush had produced a peak expert like the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance, Fang Jing. With the Dominion’s Brush, she had defeated the four supreme ancestors of the Sacred Beast clan. Even when they all wielded sovereign god artifacts, becoming no weaker than heavenly emperors, they were still crushed by Fang Jing.","The two of them had achieved such outstanding feats entirely due to the two items from the Hole of Reincarnation.","And now, Jian Chen had also obtained an item from the Hole of Reincarnation, so how could he not be delighted?","“ Master, how are you certain that the jade disc comes from the Hole of Reincarnation? ” the sword spirits who learnt about the origins of the jade disc from Jian Chen asked in surprise.","“ The jade disc contains a presence unique to the Hole of Reincarnation. Zi Ying, Qing Suo, don’t tell me you’re unable to sense it? ” Jian Chen was clearly in a fantastic mood.","When they heard that, the sword spirits began to sense it closely, but they shook their heads in the end. They did not sense the presence of the Hole of Reincarnation that Jian Chen spoke of.","In the end, even the Primeval artifact spirit and the Source of Life took part, but the end result was identical to the sword spirits. Apart from noticing the extraordinary material the jade disc was made of, they did not discover anything else.","“ There is indeed a hint of presence from the Hole of Reincarnation inside the jade disc. I can’t be wrong about this. I had close contact with the Hole of Reincarnation before. I’m extremely familiar with this presence. ”","“ Don’t tell me you can’t sense it because you’re artifact spirits? ”","Jian Chen was confused. Whether the jade disc came from the Hole of Reincarnation was extremely important.","If it did not come from the Hole of Reincarnation, then no matter how extraordinary the jade disc was, its potential was still limited in the very end.","However, if it really did come from the Hole of Reincarnation, then its quality would be unbounded.","Under the influence of the Dominion’s Brush and the Book of the Populace, any object that was connected to the Hole of Reincarnation would be enshrined as a divine object in the eyes of all cultivators in the Immortals’ World.","“ Should I find some cultivators who have approached the Hole of Reincarnation in the past to confirm this? ” Jian Chen began to think of the Immortal Monarchs and Immortal Emperors in the Primeval Divine Hall. There must have been several people who had visited the Hole of Reincarnation before. They should be extremely familiar with the presence of the Hole of Reincarnation.","However, when he thought of that, he still gave up on the idea in the end. Although these people would remain in the Primeval Divine Hall and there would be no risk of leaking any news, he definitely could not let a second person find out if this item really did come from the Hole of Reincarnation.","Jian Chen had stopped being an ignorant fool a long time ago. He understood exactly how precious the items that emerged from the Hole of Reincarnation were. Even if a rumour of it got out, the consequences would be extremely terrifying.","That was because even some peak experts who no longer cared about much at all, remaining neutral to all conflicts, would probably be tempted by something like this.","Their temptation for this would be even greater than the twin swords!","That was because fusing the twin swords came with a tremendous backlash. It could not be used so easily. Their existence was more for deterrence.","Meanwhile, the objects that had emerged from the Hole of Reincarnation had the Book of the Populace and the Dominion’s Brush as prior examples at the very least, which made it seem much more reliable and without so many limitations and problems.","Jian Chen understood the value of the jade disc. He did not dare to be careless at all. He immediately placed it inside the Primeval Divine Hall before specially instructing the artifact spirit to keep a close eye on it.","The time in the Skyscraping World was short and precious. Since he had already gained a basic grasp over the Hundred Superimposition Sword, Jian Chen planned on using the remaining time to fulfill the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s final request. As for the mysterious jade disc that recorded the Hundred Superimposition Sword and was suspected to be from the Hole of Reincarnation, Jian Chen planned on studying it closely once he left the Skyscraping World.","Jian Chen left the place he had spent eighteen years meditating. Only the Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor old man remained. His gaze shifted between Jian Chen’s figure and the stone tablet that recorded one of the nine secret techniques. He hesitated.","He had also noticed the mysterious jade disc in Jian Chen’s hand, but it seemed completely ordinary on the surface. It did not give off any precious signs, so the old man was unaware of its origins.","But at this moment, his mind was filled with the secret technique. The unimpressive jade disc did not raise his attention that much.","“ Do I leave or not? But the secret technique here is frighteningly strong. The power from a mid Immortal Emperor after grasping it even gives me chills. If I learnt it as well, wouldn’t I be undefeatable among Immortal Emperors? Even Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperors won’t be my opponent any more... ”","“ Whatever, I can go without the other resources in the Skyscraping World. I’m not going anywhere in the next period of time. I won’t stop until I grasp this technique. I will stay here until the Skyscraping World closes... ”","After a moment of hesitation, the old man made up his mind and returned. He sat back down in front of the stone tablet. He was already determined to spend the rest of his time here.","But this time, he opened his eyes slowly soon after he began comprehending. He was slightly confused. He murmured, “That’s strange. Why is it much easier compared to before...”","“This feels like a mysterious power that was previously obstructing any comprehension attempts has now suddenly vanished. Originally, it was riddled with difficulties, without a single starting point visible, but now, there’s a clear path about it...”"]},{"number":3882,"title":"Chapter 3882: The Second Medicinal Garden","paragraphs":["Jian Chen continued to wander through the Skyscraping World without a direction in mind. He moved extremely quickly. He only needed a few steps to travel a thousand kilometres.","“ The Hundred Superimposition Sword has a total of a hundred superimpositions, while I have only grasped five superimpositions so far. It’s more than enough to threaten late Immortal Emperors, but it’s probably still lacking a little before it can threaten Immortal Exalts... ” Jian Chen closely recalled the power of the five superimpositions along the way and gained a rough estimate very quickly.","He recalled the situation when he faced the Seven Antelope Ancestor. Outside the cave where the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing grew, he had momentarily obstructed the Seven Antelope Ancestor. Faced against a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, he could only rely on the Source of Life to heal himself. Without the Shadowless Lifetaking Strike, he could not even leave a scratch on the Seven Antelope Ancestor even if he used his full strength.","He was only a mid Immortal Emperor after all. The difference between him and a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt was so large that it could not be made up for by the Chaotic Body and high quality god artifacts.","Although he had grasped five superimpositions of the Hundred Superimposition Sword, allowing his battle prowess to multiply by five, the increase only applied to regular attacks. It could not make the Shadowless Lifetaking Strike five times stronger.","It was not just the Shadowless Lifetaking Strike. The Profound Sword Qi could not be strengthened either.","As a result, the Hundred Superimposition Sword did not bring Jian Chen too great of a strength increase currently.","“ The Hundred Superimposition Sword is actually a secret technique. Secret techniques can’t be used on secret techniques. However, it has plenty of room for growth. If I can comprehend up to the seventh or eighth superimposition, then it should be able to rival the Shadowless Lifetaking Strike. ”","“ If I can reach the tenth superimposition, then it’ll definitely have surpassed the Shadowless Lifetaking Strike and the tenth superimposition is only a tenth of the Hundred Superimposition Sword’s full power... ”","Jian Chen was eager for the future. He had already made up his mind about devoting great effort towards comprehending the Hundred Superimposition Sword after leaving the Skyscraping World. He had to comprehend it to the tenth superimposition at the very least as soon as possible.","At this moment, Jian Chen sensed the surroundings using the secret technique from the Skyscraping Sword Venerable, and he seemed to notice something. After a short pause, he changed directions.","Several seconds later, Jian Chen had arrived ten thousand kilometres away. Hazy light rose up in front of him as the spiritual Qi in the surroundings gathered towards this place.","This was a medicinal garden established by a major organisation in the Immortals’ World.","The medicinal garden was protected by a powerful formation. As the formation operated, it rapidly gathered the spiritual Qi in the surroundings, which greatly diminished the spiritual Qi in the Skyscraping World. However, the medicinal garden was abundant with spiritual Qi, having already formed a thick white mist. From time to time, there would even be condensed droplets of spiritual Qi falling as rain.","Through the mist, Jian Chen could vaguely make out heavenly resources swaying gently and shining with hazy light.","Jian Chen stared at the heavenly resources through the formation. He could not help but think of the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s final request.","That was to clear up all the medicinal gardens that had been established in the Skyscraping World.","These medicinal gardens absorbed the spiritual Qi of the Skyscraping World greedily. Before the Skyscraping Sword Venerable had completed his promise with the Heavenly Star Palace, there was obviously enough spiritual Qi in the Skyscraping World to support them all.","But now, the spiritual Qi through the entire Skyscraping World had diminished drastically. If these medicinal gardens remained, the Skyscraping World would face destruction before long.","“ The Immortal Cloud Tower! ” Jian Chen raised his head and discovered a stone tablet hovering thirty metres in the air. Three large words were engraved on there in fancy writing.","Jian Chen had heard of the Immortal Cloud Tower before. They were a peak organisation. It was said that they possessed a Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. One of the people who entered the Skyscraping World this time came from the Immortal Cloud Tower.","However, they were only an early Immortal Emperor great elder, so Jian Chen did not pay too much attention to him.","“ Thousand Soul Demon Exalt, there’s work to do. ” Without any further thoughts, Jian Chen called the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt out from the Primeval Divine Hall.","Over the years, the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt had spent all of his time recovering in the Primeval Divine Hall. He had absorbed most of the soul from the Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt he had devoured, so when Jian Chen saw the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt again, he could clearly sense that his presence had become much more consolidated.","“Hehehehe, sect master, how may I be of service again?” The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt stood by Jian Chen’s side. There was actually a rare hint of respect in his tone.","Over the years, he seemed to understand many things. As a result, his attitude towards Jian Chen was silently changing.","It was as if he had already begun to place his status beneath Jian Chen’s subconsciously.","“Power the Energy-devouring Furnace and drain the spiritual Qi from this formation!” Jian Chen handed the Energy-devouring Furnace over to the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt. The high quality god artifact would only demonstrate its full strength in the hands of an Immortal Exalt like the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt.","The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt chuckled. He did not say anything more, accepting the Energy-devouring Furnace from Jian Chen and activating it.","As the Energy-devouring Furnace came into effect, a terrifying force engulfed the formation before them and began to rapidly drain its energy.","Jian Chen also made use of the secret technique from the Skyscraping Sword Venerable. Immediately, he seemed to become the ruler of this place. He controlled the spiritual Qi in this region.","Under his control, the spiritual Qi within several thousand kilometres of them rapidly vanished as if it had been repelled by an invisible force.","Very soon, the region of several thousand kilometres seemed to turn into a void. There was no spiritual Qi at all, which isolated the protective formation and prevented it from absorbing spiritual Qi from the surroundings.","Not only could the secret technique from the Skyscraping Sword Venerable gather spiritual Qi, but it could also purge spiritual Qi.","“Hmm? Sect master, that’s impressive.” The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt’s eyes lit up; he could not help but let out a gasp of amazement. The protective formation required energy to continue running. Now that Jian Chen had drained the region of spiritual Qi, it was basically on its last legs.","At this moment, the loss of spiritual Qi seemed to trigger a protective mechanism in the formation. The formation rapidly began to operate faster. Some of its hidden functionalities had been activated as well. It began to absorb spiritual Qi from further away at an even more terrifying rate, continuing until it managed to draw over spiritual Qi from thousands of kilometres away.","When he saw that, Jian Chen sneered. This was the Skyscraping World, a place personally created by the Skyscraping Sword Venerable. The formation before him might have been of high quality, but no one could match the owner of this place when it came to competing for spiritual Qi.","Afterwards, Jian Chen continued to use his secret technique to control the spiritual Qi, firmly fixing the spiritual Qi in the furthest outskirts. No matter how furiously the formation operated, it was nowhere near enough when faced with the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s secret technique.","“Hehehehe, I’m not worried about the formation replenishing its spiritual Qi, as I have the Energy-devouring Furnace. It won’t be faster than the furnace no matter how quickly it absorbs spiritual Qi, but if it can’t absorb anything at all, then it’ll fall much faster.” The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt laughed."]},{"number":3883,"title":"Chapter 3883: Reincarnation Fruit","paragraphs":["Afterwards, Jian Chen and the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt began to work together. The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt was responsible for powering the Energy-devouring Furnace, while Jian Chen controlled the spiritual Qi in the Skyscraping World to prevent the formation from replenishing its energy supply.","However, the secret technique that the Skyscraping Sword Venerable taught Jian Chen only allowed him to control the spiritual Qi in the Skyscraping World. Jian Chen had no control over the spiritual Qi in the formation.","Fortunately, the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt had recovered much of his strength. As a result, despite powering the Energy-devouring Furnace alone, he was not much slower compared to when he powered the furnace with Jian Chen together last time.","The dense spiritual Qi had been forcefully stripped from the sky above the Immortal Cloud Tower’s medicinal garden, forming an almost tangible stream of light that was entirely absorbed by the Energy-devouring Furnace.","The Energy-devouring Furnace seemed to become a bottomless hole despite its size. No matter how much spiritual Qi it absorbed, it never reached capacity.","The tremendous and pure spiritual Qi gathered inside it before being condensed into extremely pure energy crystals.","However, the energy crystals only contained a small fraction of the spiritual Qi absorbed by the Energy-devouring Furnace.","Under the Energy-devouring Furnace’s effects for over ten days, the formation finally ran out of energy. As the formation collapsed on itself, the numerous heavenly resources it protected were clearly revealed before Jian Chen. They were within arm’s reach now.","Jian Chen glanced over them quickly. There were several hundred heavenly resources in total, encompassing a large variety. Half of them were low grade God Tier, while the other half was mid grade God Tier.","As for high grade God Tier heavenly resources, there were only a dozen or so.","“ This is a Twin-headed Lotus, a high grade God Tier Twin-headed Lotus. It’s far more precious than any of the other heavenly resources here. ” With a flash, Jian Chen immediately arrived at the very centre of the medicinal garden. He carefully dug out the Twin-headed Lotus before him.","He did not pick the Twin-headed Lotus. Instead, he dug up a huge chunk of the surrounding earth with all of its roots, moving it into the Primeval Divine Hall as one piece.","That way, the Twin-headed Lotus could potentially evolve once again.","Jian Chen repeated this with the other heavenly resources and moved over a hundred of them into the Primeval Divine Hall. These heavenly resources all possessed tremendous space for growth and huge future potential. If they were nurtured appropriately, they would evolve further.","As for the remaining heavenly resources that Jian Chen believed to have no more value in nurturing, he picked them all and stored them in jade boxes.","Before long, the medicinal garden that belonged to the Immortal Cloud Tower had been cleaned out by Jian Chen.","However, the Immortal Cloud Tower’s medicinal garden was only the beginning. In order to complete the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s request, to uproot the parasites that constantly drained the Skyscraping World’s spiritual Qi, Jian Chen was already prepared to clean up the entire place.","“ I’ll offend a lot of organisations with this, but the benefits make the risk worth it, ” Jian Chen thought. Eliminating these medicinal gardens could not only complete the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s request and lengthen the lifespan of the Skyscraping World, but it could also bring him a bountiful harvest and replenish his resources, so wasn’t that for the best?","The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt had already returned to the Primeval Divine Hall. Jian Chen continued to search through the Skyscraping World alone.","But now, his goal had changed. He began to specially search for medicinal gardens set up by various organisations.","Having tasted the benefits of this, Jian Chen’s appetite grew unknowingly. Often, he would come across a God Tier heavenly resource or two along the way and he would not even bother to stop to pick it up. After all, he did not want to waste the time.","Finding a medicinal garden often meant hundreds, thousands, or even more heavenly resources, and their quality would all be very high. Basically every medicinal garden would have some high grade God Tier heavenly resources.","In comparison, the one or two low grade God Tier heavenly resources he came across obviously were not worthy of his attention.","At this moment, Jian Chen’s expression suddenly changed. He used the spiritual Qi to inspect the surroundings. He clearly sensed the presence of three Immortal Exalts rapidly approaching from several thousand kilometres away. It seemed like one of them was fleeing with the other two pursuing.","Coincidentally, they were traveling in Jian Chen’s direction.","In just a few seconds, the three figures appeared in Jian Chen’s view. The Immortal Exalt who fled at the front was at the Second Heavenly Layer. He was covered in blood, and his body was covered with vicious wounds. He was heavily injured.","As for the people pursuing behind, one of them was at the Second Heavenly Layer and the other was at the First Heavenly Layer!","Jian Chen recognised all three of them. The fleeing Immortal Exalt was with the Crouching Dragon Master. Outside the Skyscraping World when the Crouching Dragon Master tried to rope in Immortal Exalt Tan Yu, the former had already formed an alliance with the Crouching Dragon Master.","“Zhou Yunzhuang, hand over the Three Lives Samsara Fruit. With your current state, you definitely won’t be able to hold onto it. If you continue with such obstinance, you might not be able to emerge from the Skyscraping World again.” At this moment, a yell rang out. The pursuing Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt bellowed out furiously. With that, the high quality god artifact sword in his hand shone with blinding light, producing a glorious strand of sword Qi that caught up with the fleeing Zhou Yunzhuang, leaving behind a bowl-sized hole in his chest.","Zhou Yunzhuang staggered and almost fell to the ground. He coughed up blood uncontrollably.","He was severely injured. In his current state, he could not even stop a First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, much less a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt who had grasped the Way of the Sword.","With that delay, Zhou Yunzhuang’s speed greatly diminished. The distance between them immediately reduced substantially.","At this moment, Zhou Yunzhuang also noticed Jian Chen in front of him. Without any further thought, he took out a delicate jade box from his Space Ring and tossed it to Jian Chen. “Quick, take the Three Lives Samsara Fruit and leave here. I’ll draw them away.”","The jade box directly smashed against Jian Chen’s chest before falling into his hands.","Under these circumstances, Jian Chen did not even have the choice of refusing the jade box.","“Run! What are you waiting for?” Seeing how Jian Chen was blanked out on the spot, Zhou Yunzhuang could not help but roar out furiously.","“Hahaha, we saw it all. Zhou Yunzhuang, are you afraid that we won’t be able to obtain the Three Lives Samsara Fruit, which is why you handed it over to an Immortal Emperor?” The pursuing Immortal Exalts laughed aloud. Taking the Three Lives Samsara Fruit from Zhou Yunzhuang would still take some strength.","However, taking it from the hands of an Immortal Emperor was like taking candy from a baby. It would be effortless.","Zhou Yunzhuang’s gaze towards Jian Chen was slightly cold. He did not say anything, turning around and continuing to flee into the distance.","“Little brother, hand over the jade box that contains the Three Lives Samsara Fruit.” The two Immortal Exalts did not continue pursuing Zhou Yunzhuang. Instead, they arrived before Jian Chen and forced out a smile at him.","“You’ve been fooled.” Jian Chen’s expression did not change at all as he opened the jade box. It was empty inside. There was no Three Lives Samsara Fruit to be seen.","“Dammit. Zhou Yunzhuang, how are you still playing tricks on us!” When they saw this, the two Immortal Exalts were irritated. Fortunately, the Immortal Emperor had not fled. Otherwise, by the time they had caught up with the Immortal Emperor, Zhou Yunzhuang would have escaped from their range of senses already.","“You damned junior. How dare you waste our time. You almost screwed us over,” the Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt cursed furiously and directly kicked Jian Chen in the stomach. Afterwards, he continued to chase after Zhou Yunzhuang without sparing a second glance at Jian Chen.","Jian Chen did not defend. He was kicked several hundred metres away before falling to the ground. Afterwards, he stood up like nothing had happened at all. He looked in the direction that the Immortal Exalt had fled as his gaze became icy."]},{"number":3884,"title":"Chapter 3884: The Ghost Immortal Cult","paragraphs":["The Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt did not use his full strength with that kick, but it could still heavily injure a mid Immortal Emperor.","The difference in strength was far too great. Let alone a mid Immortal Emperor, even a late Immortal Emperor would struggle to block a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt to the degree where they emerged unscathed.","“We had no grudge. You were merely tricked by someone, yet you could act so heavy-handed. How vicious of you.” Jian Chen’s voice was stern. A hint of killing intent gradually appeared in his icy-cold gaze, growing stronger and stronger.","Afterwards, he used the secret technique from the Skyscraping Sword Venerable, using the spiritual Qi here as his eyes to observe everything going on in the area.","Due to the limitations of the environment in the Skyscraping World, neither Zhou Yunzhuang nor the two pursuing Immortal Exalts managed to escape Jian Chen’s range of control in such a short amount of time. As a result, Jian Chen could clearly grasp their every movement through the secret technique.","He immediately activated the Divine Armour of Heavenflight and silently vanished from the world. He did not give off any presence at all, concealing himself flawlessly.","Afterwards, Jian Chen chased after them at lightning speed.","The Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt at the front, Zhou Yunzhuang, fled desperately. He coughed up blood from time to time as his presence grew more and more feeble.","He had suffered extremely heavy injuries, and he was unable to heal himself at this time. Coupled with fleeing at full speed, his injuries constantly worsened.","The longer the delay, the worse his injuries would become.","“ Dammit junior. Why didn’t you run? Why didn’t you run? If you chose to run, I definitely would have managed to escape, ” at this moment, Zhou Yunzhuang constantly cursed inside, exasperated by Jian Chen’s decision.","He could only use this trick once. Once it failed, the enemy would definitely be aware of it, so he would struggle to succeed again.","At this moment, Zhou Yunzhuang suddenly came to a halt. He looked ahead with an ugly expression as despair gradually filled his eyes.","A hunched-back old woman stood quietly a hundred kilometres in front of him with a dragon-headed cane as if she had been waiting there for a very long time.","The old woman’s presence was also at the Second Heavenly Layer, but when he faced the old woman, Zhou Yunzhuang could not develop any thoughts of resistance.","“Zhou Yunzhuang, you’re already done for. Hand over the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit,” the old woman said indifferently. Her hoarse voice gave off a hint of undeniable authority.","“W-where’s the Crouching Dragon Master and the others?” Zhou Yunzhuang said with a sunken expression.","“They’ve all been defeated by me already. They’ve fled with heavy wounds. If it weren’t for the fact that the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit wasn’t on them, they would not even have a chance at escaping,” the old woman said. Her eyes were very small. Only a crack remained, so it was like a venomous snake’s eyes, giving off a chilling cold light.","“Not even a chance at escaping? Hmph, maybe not the others, but the Crouching Dragon Master is from the Crouching Dragon Manor on the Polar Jade Heaven!” Zhou Yunzhuang said sternly. When he mentioned the Crouching Dragon Manor, there was clearly some fear and respect in his eyes.","“The Crouching Dragon Manor? The organisation that ranks third on the Polar Jade Heaven? Hehehehe, let alone the measly third, even the Jiang family that’s renowned as the strongest organisation on the Polar Jade Heaven can’t invoke any fear in our Ghost Immortal cult.” The old woman laughed aloud. Shortly afterwards, she seemed to think of something as she said, “The Crouching Dragon Manor may have the existence of the mysterious manor lord but so what? Before our Ghost Immortal cult, they’re still nothing.”","Zhou Yunzhuang fell silent. He recalled the strength of the Ghost Immortal cult, as well as the glorious history of the Ghost Immortal cult.","The Ghost Immortal cult truly possessed the strength to look down on everyone.","“Greetings, cult leader Lan!”","At this moment, the two Immortal Exalts who pursued Zhou Yunzhuang arrived here as well. They blocked off Zhou Yunzhuang’s path of retreat as they clasped their fists towards the old woman. They were filled with politeness.","It was as if despite also being Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts, the old woman’s status was much higher than theirs.","“Spare the courteous gestures. I’ve troubled you with this, fellows. However, I am only a vice cult leader. Please do not call me cult leader so easily. If the cult leader hears of this, I won’t be able to bear the consequences,” said the old woman.","“You are too polite, cult leader Lan. Others may not be aware of it, but we’re very familiar with this. Your esteemed cult leader has already decided to pass the position to you. He’s just waiting for a suitable moment,” the Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt continued.","“Enough. We can talk about this later. Now is not the time. Zhou Yunzhuang, I’ll give you one last chance to live. Do you want to die or not? You can decide for yourself.” The old woman looked at Zhou Yunzhuang.","“If I hand over the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit, can I really leave here alive?” Zhou Yunzhuang said sternly. With his strength as a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, even those stronger than him, let alone those at the same level as him, would struggle to kill him. He would always have a chance at survival if he paid a heavy price.","However, when he faced this old woman, he seemed to know that there was no chance for him to escape.","“Will you really let me go if I hand over the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit?” Zhou Yunzhuang looked at the old woman in interest.","“I have no major grudge against you, so I obviously will not kill you for nothing,” said the old woman. It appeared as if she was also afraid that Zhou Yunzhuang would try and destroy the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit if he ran out of options.","“Alright. I’ll give you the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit.” Zhou Yunzhuang gritted his teeth and finally made up his mind, taking out a delicate jade box from his Space Ring.","“Cult leader Lan, be careful of any tricks,” the two Immortal Exalts who pursued Zhou Yunzhuang warned in a hurry.","“Open it!” The old woman’s eyes shone brightly.","Zhou Yunzhuang did not hesitate. He opened the jade box, and a profound presence spread out, bearing the aura of reincarnation.","A walnut-sized fruit rested in the jade box quietly, shining with black and white light. It was very beautiful.","“Sure enough, it’s the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit!” The old woman smiled faintly.","“I’ll give you the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit. I hope you can hold your word!” Zhou Yunzhuang shut the jade box and pushed it out gently. The jade box immediately drifted towards the old woman.","The old woman subconsciously raised her hand, about to catch the jade box.","But at this moment, a figure clad in armour silently appeared right between the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit and the old woman.","No one present managed to sense how this person had appeared, as they could not sense the figure’s existence at all apart from seeing him.","The figure was Jian Chen clad in the Divine Armour of Heavenflight!","Jian Chen reached out. Under everyone’s stunned gazes, he stowed away the jade box with the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit. He said with ease, “Zhou Yunzhuang had already gifted me the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit earlier, so it belongs to me.”"]},{"number":3885,"title":"Chapter 3885: Remains of the Ghost Immortal (1)","paragraphs":["When he heard that, Zhou Yunzhuang was immediately taken back. He was also confused. Why did he give the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit to him?","Meanwhile, a dangerous light shone in the crack-wide eyes of the old woman from the Ghost Immortal Cult. Intense killing intent flashed within.","At this moment, Jian Chen’s Divine Armour of Heavenflight slowly disappeared. His appearance and presence was clearly exposed before everyone.","“I-it’s actually you!” Without the Divine Armour of Heavenflight, Zhou Yunzhuang immediately recognised him. Wasn’t he the Immortal Emperor junior he had just run into?","However, he was fleeing for his life back then, so he did not closely distinguish the Immortal Emperor’s identity.","Not that he saw Jian Chen again, he felt a sense of familiarity.","The two Immortal Exalts who pursued Zhou Yunzhuang also narrowed their eyes. They stared straight at Jian Chen. Shortly afterwards, they seemed to recall something. Their eyebrows became firmly locked together as their gazes towards Jian Chen became conflicted.","“It’s you, Yang Yutian!” the old woman from the Ghost Immortal cult said slowly. Her deep voice contained surprise.","“Yang Yutian... it is actually him, the junior who received the close attention of the daughter of the heavenly emperor, Xing Caijian.” Zhou Yunzhuang finally understood who the Immortal Emperor was, and he shuddered inside.","If he were just an Immortal Emperor, there was no need for these Immortal Exalts to pay such close attention to him. It was entirely because of the halo that had been granted to him by the daughter of the heavenly emperor, Xing Caijian.","Xing Caijian’s actions had lifted Jian Chen to the centre of attention of these Immortal Exalts despite being relatively unimportant previously.","Everyone could tell that Xing Caijian did not recognise Jian Chen at all previously, yet the concern she showed for Jian Chen was even enough for her to seize the seed of ways for him. She was even prepared to fight a group of Immortal Exalts for him.","These signs only indicated that Jian Chen possessed something that Xing Caijian valued very much.","At this moment, the old woman from the Ghost Immortal cult smiled. “I’ve suddenly remembered something. Many years ago, there was a rumour that spread through the Skyscraping World like wildfire. It was said that an Immortal Emperor junior secretly approached the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing through some kind of treasure that could perfectly hide his traces and presence. He managed to steal it from under the watch of a group of Immortal Exalts.”","“If I’ve guessed correctly, that person should be you, Yang Yutian!”","When they heard that, the three other Immortal Exalts present all narrowed their eyes. They stared at Jian Chen in disbelief.","They had all heard of this rumour. An Immortal Emperor junior successfully stole the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing from a group of Immortal Exalts. If it were not for the confirmation of so many Immortal Exalts, no one would have believed it.","Yet right now, the Immortal Emperor who stole the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing appeared right before them, so how could they not be shocked?","“That’s right. The person you speak of was indeed me, but there is something you got wrong. I didn’t steal the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing. I claimed it rightfully, as I was the first person to discover the Spiritual Fruit of Nurturing Ways. The Immortal Exalts were all just latecomers.” Jian Chen openly admitted it.","After receiving personal confirmation from Jian Chen, the Immortal Exalts present could not help but gasp. Even the way that the old woman from the Ghost Immortal cult looked at Jian Chen changed slightly.","Although the strength of an Immortal Emperor was nothing in their eyes, his courage and daring gained their admiration.","That was because even they would not have the courage to steal from the jaws of tigers under those circumstances.","Even if they were a hundred times bolder, they would never try to claim something connected to the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance.","There were some treasures that they could take a risk and compete for, but there were other items that they could not even try to touch.","For a moment, the surroundings sank into an eerie silence. After several seconds, the old woman from the Ghost Immortal cult said slowly, “Yang Yutian, I don’t care about the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing. I only want the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit. If you give me the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit, I’ll leave immediately.”","“If you want the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit, then you’ll have to give me something in exchange,” said Jian Chen.","“You took my possession, yet you still want me to give you something in exchange?” The old woman laughed out of anger. “Yang Yutian, I don’t want to make an enemy out of you in consideration of princess Xing Caijian, but you better not push things too far and intentionally provoke me.”","“Immortal Exalt Zhou Yunzhuang gifted the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit to me, yet you want me to hand it over to you. Looks like your Ghost Immortal cult wants to seize it by force as well.” Jian Chen glanced at Zhou Yunzhuang and sneered.","“Y-you’re lying. Since when did I give you the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit?” Zhou Yunzhuang argued back feebly, but his voice grew softer and softer. Originally, he wanted to use Jian Chen to get away, but he never thought the situation would develop like this.","“Our Ghost Immortal cult is determined to obtain the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit. Since you refuse to hand it over, we’ll have to offend you.” The old woman could tell that Jian Chen refused to hand over the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit, so icy light immediately shone in her crack-like eyes.","In the next moment, she silently appeared in front of Jian Chen; her skinny hand darted towards Jian Chen’s forehead with lightning speed.","Immediately, a terrifying pressure filled the surroundings. The old woman’s attack even filled the surrounding space with a restraining force that pressed towards Jian Chen as layers.","If it had been a regular Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor, they could never escape from the old woman’s attack. The restraining force that silently appeared in the surroundings was not something that a regular Immortal Emperor could break free from.","Jian Chen’s Chaotic Force surged, erupting like a primordial beast. With the Heaven-lifting sword in hand, he directly slashed out.","The gorgeous light was like a galaxy, shining resplendently and beautifully. It sailed through the air with several blurs, causing the space to shake violently.","The blurs merged together one after another. With each blur, the attack multiplied in strength.","When the five blurs merged together, the attack became so powerful that even the expressions of the Immortal Exalt ancestors present changed slightly.","“ Is... is this really a mid Immortal Emperor? ” The old woman from the Ghost Immortal cult shivered inside as well. She was shocked. Although the attack still could not threaten her, it did come from a mere Immortal Emperor after all.","Boom!","The Heaven-lifting sword collided against the old woman’s skinny hand with devastating force, immediately producing a storm of energy that swept through the surroundings. Jian Chen was knocked away uncontrollably as he shook violently.","Meanwhile, the old woman did not budge. She remained exactly where she was like a mountain.","However, she had already become stern. There was also a hint of undisguised shock on her face."]},{"number":3886,"title":"Chapter 3886: Remains of the Ghost Immortal (2)","paragraphs":["“That strike was actually on par with a First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt! This is unimaginable. A Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor actually possesses such unbelievable battle prowess,” the old woman from the Ghost Immortal cult said in shock.","To the people present, this was already an extraordinary feat, but to Jian Chen, it was slightly disappointing.","The power of five superimpositions still paled in comparison to the Shadowless Lifetaking Strike slightly.","“You are indeed a prodigy. Coupled with your connection to the daughter of the heavenly emperor, our Ghost Immortal cult would try and avoid offending someone like you usually. However, we need to recover the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit.” The old woman composed herself very quickly and struck once again. She shone with brilliant light, slashing towards Jian Chen from afar like a sword.","With that slash, the world shook, and the surrounding space twisted violently. If it were not for the powerful formations that protected the Skyscraping World, the place probably would have been split into two.","At the same time, Jian Chen suddenly struck out with the Heaven-lifting sword. Against an expert that even a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt like Zhou Yunzhuang feared significantly, he did not dare to be careless at all. He directly used the Shadowless Lifetaking Strike.","The Shadowless Lifetaking Strike bypassed all of the old woman’s defences and arrived as soon as it was unleashed, erupting as a powerful strand of sword Qi in the old woman’s body and making her shudder.","“Dammit! What is this technique?” the old woman cried out as her expression changed drastically. She was filled with shock.","But that was it. Jian Chen’s Shadowless Lifetaking Strike did not seem to injure her at all.","On the other side, Jian Chen was launched away by the old woman’s sword Qi with a rumble. His body surged as his organs ruptured.","But in the next moment, he rapidly healed from all of his injuries, making a full recovery in a very short time.","At this moment, he seemed to sense something. The way he looked at the old woman changed drastically. There was great seriousness.","Even when he faced the Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, the Profound Spirit Master, or even the Space-purging Ancestor from the Daoist Sect of Heavenly Embodiment, Jian Chen had not reacted like this.","That was because both the Profound Spirit Master and the Space-purging Ancestor would not be able to withstand a single blow from the Divine Formation of the Heavens.","But when he faced the Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt old woman, he was stern for once.","“ She’s actually hiding a tremendous power inside her body. This power completely surpasses the Profound Spirit Master! ” Jian Chen was astounded.","“Yang Yutian, looks like you’ve sensed something. You better hand over the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit obediently. I won’t make things difficult for you.” The old woman from the Ghost Immortal cult did not continue with any attacks. Instead, she tried to persuade him again. Her eyes were filled with deep surprise. She completely refused to believe the person before her was actually a mid Immortal Emperor. His various extraordinary powers left her dumbfounded.","Jian Chen’s heart skipped a beat. He studied the surroundings without attracting any attention. At this moment, he could clearly sense that the spiritual Qi in the surroundings had become rather abnormal, but he was unable to find exactly how it was abnormal. He could not sense anything even with the senses of his soul.","“ Something is off! ” Jian Chen immediately shut his eyes and began using the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s secret technique, using the spiritual Qi as his eyes to sense everything around him.","Due to the special environment created by all the formations in the Skyscraping World, even Immortal Exalts would have many of their abilities limited.","Meanwhile, Jian Chen could bypass some of these limitations through the secret technique that the Skyscraping Sword Venerable had taught him.","As a result, under this state, Jian Chen discovered blood-red threads penetrating deep into the ground from under the old woman’s feet. They spread out in all directions like a web, silently setting up some kind of formation.","Jian Chen just happened to be located in the centre of the formation.","Jian Chen’s heart immediately sank slightly with this discovery. He could sense that this formation was anything but simple. If the formation was completed, then he would be forced to use the Divine Formation of the Heavens.","“Yang Yutian, I owe a favour to the Heavenly Star Palace, so for Xing Caijian’s sake, I really don’t want to make things difficult for you... Hmm?” The old woman from the Ghost Immortal cult continued to try and persuade Jian Chen, but her face suddenly sank before she could finish what she was saying.","Jian Chen had already vanished silently, returning to the same state as before. Even with her powerful senses as an Immortal Exalt, she could not find any trace of him.","Jian Chen had already activated the Divine Armour of Heavenflight, hiding himself perfectly.","With his current strength, even some Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts would struggle to find him under the cover of the Divine Armour of Heavenflight and the mask from the Illusionary Daemon race, let alone early Immortal Exalts.","“Dammit. Don’t think about leaving here with the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit.” The old woman from the Ghost Immortal cult immediately panicked. She thought of the rumours regarding the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing from before. If Jian Chen wanted to hide, even several dozen Immortal Exalts could not capture him if they did not find him immediately.","The old woman’s heart rose up to her throat. She gritted her teeth and stomped down without any hesitation. A rumble rang out from the bedrock and red mist sprayed into the air, immediately enveloping the area.","A chilling presence radiated from the demonic and eerie red mist. When it came into contact with Zhou Yunzhuang and the two other Immortal Exalts, the red mist actually melted away their protective energy silently, sticking to their bodies.","Shortly afterwards, their bodies began to erode away at a visible rate, making them grit their teeth.","“What a pity. Time was tight, which prevented me from completing the formation. Otherwise, I would have been able to seal up this space. You would have never gotten away. However, while the formation is incomplete, it’s more than enough to locate you.” The old woman ground her teeth. Suddenly, she looked behind her and struck out without any hesitation. Surging energy erupted, directly shooting towards a certain region near the edge of the red mist.","Boom!","A rumble rang out from the air as a blood-red figure fell out of the space there. It was Jian Chen clad in the Divine Armour of Heavenflight.","But at this moment, the red mist was like glue, sticking firmly to the Divine Armour of Heavenflight like a layer of thick blood. It turned Jian Chen completely red.","He forcefully swallowed the blood that had surged up into his throat, disregarding the blood-red energy sticking to the Divine Armour of Heavenflight and activating its concealment ability again. He vanished from the space there once again and rapidly flew into the distance.","A tremendous power was lurking inside the old woman’s body. To be safe, Jian Chen did not want any meaningless conflict against her.","“You can’t escape. Yang Yutian, leave behind the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit, or I’ll never spare you,” the old woman roared furiously. She surged with energy as her tremendous cultivation as a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt shook up the surroundings. The presence of danger she gave off even gave chills to Zhou Yunzhuang who was also a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt."]},{"number":3887,"title":"Chapter 3887: Remains of the Ghost Immortal (3)","paragraphs":["Despite being a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, the old woman’s presence was so terrifying that she was no weaker than a Third Heavenly Layer expert, even surpassing them.","In the next moment, the old woman appeared several hundred kilometres away like she had teleported over. She formed a sword with her fingers as a powerful strand of sword Qi condensed. It shone with dazzling light and struck the space a hundred kilometres away like a bolt of lightning.","Boom! The old woman’s sword Qi violently shook space, forcing out Jian Chen once again. His body surged violently as his organs were directly heavily injured.","“ This person is far stronger than the Seven Antelope Ancestor. Although she’s a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, she’s no weaker than a Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, ” Jian Chen was secretly surprised. He looked back and glanced deeply at the old woman before looking at the thick blood that stuck to the Divine Armour of Heavenflight. He was surprised.","His Divine Armour of Heavenflight would only fail before an extremely small number of experts. Even most Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts could not see through it, but at this moment, a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt actually managed to lock onto him precisely.","But very soon, Jian Chen hid himself with the Divine Armour of Heavenflight again, refusing to give up. He quickly tried to flee again.","But in the next moment, the old woman caught up with even greater speed. She seemed to be able to accurately sense Jian Chen’s location. When she struck again, her sword Qi shot through the air like a streak of light, forcing Jian Chen out of hiding again.","If it were not for the powerful regeneration from the Source of Life, these two attacks from the old woman were enough to jolt any Immortal Emperor to death.","Her battle prowess was extremely powerful, already beyond what a regular Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt could rival.","“ Source of Life, purify the power on me. ” Jian Chen secretly communicated with the Source of Life. He discovered that his Chaotic Force was completely powerless over this blood-red power.","“ This is the divine power of the Ghost Immortal. It contains a wisp of a Grand Exalt’s presence. Although it’s just a wisp, the Source of Life will probably need some time to completely purify this power. ” Before the Source of Life could reply, the sword spirits answered instead.","“ What? A Grand Exalt’s presence? ” Jian Chen was startled. He was very shocked.","“ Master, the Ghost Immortal cult had also been a peak organsiation that once stood at the apex of the Immortals’ World. They had a Grand Exalt who had become an embodiment of the heavenly ways. When they stood in renown, our Sword Sect of Violet Heavens had yet to be founded. Our old master had not been born yet either, and the Nirvanic Immortal Exalt had not emerged yet... ”","“ However, eras came and went with time. The Ghost Immortal cult has long declined already. ”","The sword spirits sighed.","When he heard that, Jian Chen subsconsciously recalled the Spirit God clan in the Saints’ World. The Spirit God clan had also produced a Grand Exalt in the past, but they had also declined now, even losing the title of archaean clan.","The Ghost Immortal cult of the Immortals’ World was like the Spirit God clan of the Saints’ World. Despite their extremely glorious past, once rulers of the heavens, a sovereign clan that ruled over a major world, they had already declined. It was all in the past now.","The Sword Sect of Violet Heavens was no different.","“ This person probably had some kind of special fortuitous encounter, or they received an impressive fortune. You have to be careful, master. ” The sword spirits warned Jian Chen seriously.","“ I’ll need three days to purge this disgusting thing. ” The Source of Life’s voice rang out in Jian Chen’s head. There were hints of seriousness in her voice for once. “ This presence is very powerful. Its past owner must have been very, very powerful. ”","The Source of Life’s evaluation made Jian Chen’s heart tremble. He knew that the Grand Exalt of the Wood Spirits was an existence who had comprehended two ways to the limit in the past. She had also achieved the glorious feat of slaying the Grand Exalt of the Darkstar race, so her strength was without dispute.","But despite that, the Source of Life still gave the Grand Exalt from the Ghost Immortal cult such a high evaluation, which made him realise that even at worst, the Grand Exalt from the Ghost Immortal cult was on par with the Grand Exalt of the Wood Spirits.","The conversation with the sword spirits and the Source of Life all occurred in a split second. At this moment, Jian Chen was still flying into the distance with the old woman from the Ghost Immortal cult pursuing him closely.","Due to the reduction of spiritual Qi in the Skyscraping World, visibility had improved significantly. As a result, the two of them moved extremely quickly, covering several thousand kilometres in just a few flashes.","During this time, Jian Chen activated the Divine Armour of Heavenflight numerous times. However, the contamination from the divine power of the Ghost Immortal was like a marker on him, allowing the old woman to locate his hiding spot accurately each time. Jian Chen was left with nowhere to hide.","If it were not for the Source of Life, even First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts, or even Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts, would struggle to withstand the old woman’s numerous attacks, let alone an Immortal Emperor.","The two of them fled and pursued for several tens of thousand kilometres. Jian Chen seemed to realise that the concealment from the Divine Armour of Heavenflight had basically become useless before the divine power of the Ghost Immortal that bore a hint of a Grand Exalt’s presence, so he stopped fleeing. He stopped where he was.","In the next moment, a terrifying presence approached him, arriving in an instant. The old woman surged with energy, glowing with the power of the Way of the Sword. There were hints of blood-red light as well. She appeared before Jian Chen with a sunken face.","“You’ve withstood multiple heavy strikes from me, yet you’re actually unscathed. Yang Yutian, you’re leaving me more and more shocked. However, if I develop a grudge against someone like you, the only way to settle this is to nip you in the bud before you completely mature,” the old woman said seriously. For once, there was a hint of seriousness when she looked at Jian Chen.","However, there were also hints of greed and desire that she hid away deeply.","“ The treasures that this child possesses are extraordinary. Whether it’s his recovery rate or his flawless hiding ability, it’s all due to the treasures he carries on him. If I obtain these treasures, that would mean I would also possess these extraordinary powers! ” the old woman thought to herself. Her will had already begun to sway as if she struggled to resist this huge temptation.","But shortly afterwards, she gritted her teeth and cast aside her qualms from the daughter of the heavenly emperor. Xing Caijian. Her squinted eyes shone with sharp killing intent. Dense, blood-red mist radiated from the old woman before condensing into a huge, blood-red hand that reached towards Jian Chen.","When the blood-red hand struck out, a destructive presence erupted, shaking up the surroundings. All of the vegetation within a thousand kilometres was immediately reduced to powder. Even the dense spiritual Qi in this region dissipated as if it had been crushed by this overbearing power.","And that was the effect under the numerous formations in the Skyscraping World. If the formations were not there, just the terrifying presence alone could annihilate the space here.","That was because the power had already surpassed the limits of early Immortal Exalts. Let alone early Immortal Exalts, even Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts would be fazed by the huge, blood-red hand.","At this moment, the old woman from the Ghost Immortal cult no longer used her own strength but the tremendous power lurking within her.","However, she also paid a heavy price to use this power. All of her vitality seemed to be drained. She immediately began to wither as her presence declined.","Jian Chen was extremely stern, but he was not afraid. In the next moment, a ball of blinding light rose up around him. Several tens of thousand disciples of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens appeared around him, together with over thirty Immortal Monarchs, nine Immortal Emperors, and the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt, establishing a killing formation.","It was the Divine Formation of the Heavens!","As the Divine Formation of the Heavens was established, a terrifying pressure no weaker than the giant, blood-red hand filled the surroundings. Then it turned into a huge beam of energy and collided fiercely with the blood-red hand with enough light to drown out the world."]},{"number":3888,"title":"Chapter 3888: Remains of the Ghost Immortal (4)","paragraphs":["Boom!","The two collided and produced a tremendous rumble. Terrifying storms of energy twisted space and tore apart time, throwing the region into darkness. All light was destroyed.","Both of them had used their trump cards—the power of the clash had even surpassed the range of Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts, reaching the ranks of the Seventh Heavenly Layer.","Outside, the consequences of their attack would lead to devastating disaster on any of the thirty-three heavens.","However, this was the Skyscraping World!","Everywhere in the Skyscraping World, whether it was high up in the air or deep underground, was filled with formations. It blazed with light as a tremendous pressure descended.","In the next moment, a barrier descended from above, connecting with the ground. It formed something akin to a cage, completely isolating this region.","When the devastating storms of energy came into contact with this barrier, there were no intense collisions as originally imagined. Instead, it collapsed silently as if all of the energy had been absorbed into the barrier, merging with it perfectly.","Silently, the storm of energy produced by Jian Chen and the old woman from the Ghost Immortal cult’s trump cards had been easily nullified by the formations of the Skyscraping World.","These were layered formations cast down by multiple Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts after all. Before such high level formations, a storm of energy on par with a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt was clearly a little lacklustre.","However, neither Jian Chen nor the old woman from the Ghost Immortal cult were able to launch a second attack any time soon.","The old woman from the Ghost Immortal cult had clearly paid a heavy price. She became extremely feeble. The dragon-headed cane she clutched in her hand trembled violently.","At this moment, she completely relied on her cane to remain standing, or she would have collapsed a long time ago.","But now, the old woman completely disregarded her feebleness. Her tiny, squinted eyes had now widened to the size of golfballs. She stared ahead blankly. She was dumbfounded.","The glow of the Divine Formation of the Heavens gradually faded away. A crowd of people hovered in the air. Just the Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals alone amounted to over thirty thousand, with over thirty Immortal Monarchs, nine Immortal Emperors, and an Immortal Exalt!","The Skyscraping Sword Scripture had a total of a hundred and eight pages. Each page only corresponded to three entry spots, so only around three hundred people at most could enter the Skyscraping World each time.","Yet right now, several tens of thousand people had emerged all of a sudden, which had frightened the old woman from the Ghost Immortal cult quite a bit.","“Y-y-you actually... you actually brought so many people into the Skyscraping World with you?” The old woman from the Ghost Immortal cult was tongue-tied. Probably no one would believe her if she told them that several tens of thousand people had entered the Skyscraping World when the limit was only around three hundred.","She even rubbed her eyes subconsciously as if she struggled to believe what she was seeing was real, afraid that it was just an illusion.","By now, the Divine Formation of the Heavens had completely dimmed. All of the Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal disciples who composed the formation immediately ran out of energy. Now, all of their faces were pale as they gave off a sense of feebleness.","Even the Immortal Monarchs had used up over half of their energy.","The Divine Formation of the Heavens was incomplete, so it was only capable of a single strike right now!","Jian Chen was not in a hurry to deal with the old woman from the Ghost Immortal cult. There were still a group of disciples from the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens outside. Without the protection of the Divine Formation of the Heavens, they were all in mortal danger. Immortal Exalts could kill a great swathe of them with a swing of their hand.","As a result, as soon as the Divine Formation of the Heavens dissipated, he immediately cooperated with the Primeval Divine Hall to send everyone back inside as quickly as possible, afraid that they would perish to the old woman from the Ghost Immortal cult.","Only inside the Primeval Divine Hall could the safety of these disciples be ensured.","Immediately, the several tens of thousand disciples vanished completely, having been forcefully taken away by the power of the Primeval Divine Hall.","Although the Primeval Divine Hall would expend some energy for no good reason, there was no better option right now.","However, there was one exception—the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt. Jian Chen did not arrange for him to return to the Primeval Divine Hall","“Thousand Soul Demon Exalt, kill her for me!” Jian Chen stared at the old woman from the Ghost Immortal cult coldly and directly ordered the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt.","Since the existence of the Primeval Divine Hall had already been exposed, there was no need to keep hiding in front of the old woman.","The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt did not hesitate. A storm of energy belonging to a Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt whistled out as he shot towards the old woman with a flash.","“I understand now. So you actually bear a treasure of such a level... However, killing me is anything but easy. Hehehehe, Yang Yutian, we will meet again...” The old woman from the Ghost Immortal cult sneered. Before she had even finished speaking, she vanished eerily, only leaving behind a piece of human skin in her place.","The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt reached out and caught the piece of human skin. His eyebrows were locked together firmly.","Jian Chen’s expression changed slightly. Without any hesitation, he immediately used the secret technique from the Skyscraping Sword Immortal, using spiritual Qi as his eyes to search for traces of the old woman in the surroundings.","“ She’s actually not in my range. Looks like that secret technique has allowed her to escape quite far away. ” Very soon, Jian Chen furrowed his brows. He immediately changed locations, using the technique again ten thousand kilometres away.","Like that, he changed locations numerous times, searching through a range of a million kilometres as quickly as he could. In the end, he still could not find any traces of the old woman.","Jian Chen stopped his search. If he could not find her during this time, his chances would be even slimmer if he kept searching. It was completely sufficient for her to use this time to flee to a further place.","“ I probably can’t keep the existence of the Primeval Divine Hall hidden for much longer in the Skyscraping World. ” Jian Chen stood on a boulder and gazed deeply into the distance. He was not too concerned about exposing the Primeval Divine Hall. He had anticipated this right from the beginning.","Afterall, it was impossible to keep a secret forever. Since he was prepared to use the Divine Formation of the Heavens in the Skyscraping World, he was destined to expose the secret of the Primeval Divine Hall. It was only a matter of time.","“ Zi Ying, Qing Suo, what exactly was that thing inside the Immortal Exalt from the Ghost Immortal cult? With her strength as a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, she was actually able to launch a terrifying attack on par with the Divine Formation of the Heavens, ” Jian Chen secretly asked the sword spirits. He was wary of the power hiding inside the old woman’s body.","“ That’s the strength preserved through a special secret technique by past experts of the Ghost Immortal cult when they are about to die. It’s known as the Remains of the Ghost Immortal. Any disciple of the Ghost Immortal cult can borrow the power of the remains if they are recognised by the Remains of the Ghost Immortal. ”","“ However, the power of the remains isn’t that easy to use either. Using the power of the remains comes at a certain price. The exact price has to do with the difference in strength between the disciple of the Ghost Immortal cult and the remains. ”","“ The larger the difference is, the greater the price will be... ”","Zi Ying explained.","“ Remains of the Ghost Immortal? ” Jian Chen was interested. He could not help but ask out of curiosity, “ Since the Ghost Immortal cult once produced a Grand Exalt, do they have the remains of a Grand Exalt? ”","“ They did initially, but it was destroyed a long time ago. The Ghost Immortal cult had already declined severely before our old master and the Nirvanic Immortal Exalt were even born. However, they should still have the essence blood of Grand Exalts in their cult, as some of the ancient secret techniques of the Ghost Immortal cult requires the essence blood of Grand Exalts to practice; this includes the contamination stuck to the Divine Armour of Heavenflight, ” said Zi Ying.","Jian Chen learnt about the Ghost Immortal cult from the sword spirits as he continued to venture through the Skyscraping World. He did not wear the Divine Armour of Heavenflight. Instead, he absorbed it into his body, allowing the Source of Life to purge the presence stuck to it.","......","...","In a hidden valley extremely far away from Jian Chen, the old woman from the Ghost Immortal cult sat feebly in a bush that was even taller than her. Although her face was devoid of blood, it was filled with excitement.","“Never did I think, never did I think that originally I would come for the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit, only to find such a tremendous secret. If I manage to claim that item... Hehehe... Hehehehe...” The old woman ignored her heavy wounds. She was filled with excitement, simply sitting there and laughing to herself.","At this moment, a series of gentle footsteps rang out in the valley. Someone was walking over, trudging through the valley step by step. Their pace was slow, but they travelled very quickly.","The old woman immediately silenced herself. Cold light shone from her squinted eyes. She stared beyond the bushes without budging. She was stern.","That was because she failed to sense the approaching person with the senses of her soul.","Under her alert watch, a beautiful woman carrying an ancient sword in her arms, dressed in form-fitting clothes, appeared before the old woman.","The woman did not have any emotion. Her eyes were cold, giving off a sense of unapproachability.","When she saw the lady, the old woman from the Ghost Immortal cult immediately relaxed. She stood up with some struggle and clasped her fist with difficulty. “So it’s princess Caijian. I am a vice cult leader of the Ghost Immortal Exalt, Lan Caidie. Greetings, your highness!”","The lady was the daughter of the heavenly emperor of the Heavenly Star Palace, Xing Caijian!","Xing Caijian walked over slowly with the sword wrapped in coarse cloth. She stopped thirty metres away from the old woman and studied her with furrowed brows. “You’re a vice cult leader of the Ghost Immortal cult, Lan Caidie? I’ve heard my uncles mention you before. They said that a startling prodigy called Lan Caidie emerged from this generation of the Ghost Immortal cult, receiving the recognition of the remains of a major figure of the Ghost Immortal cult.”","“The seniors of the Heavenly Star Palace have actually mentioned me before? Your highness, is that true?” When she heard that, the old woman’s eyes immediately lit up.","It was as if being mentioned by the seniors of the Heavenly Star Palace was a tremendous honour to her!","“You have such powerful Remains of the Ghost Immortal with you, yet you still suffered such heavy wounds. What exactly happened? Who injured you?” Xing Caijian asked with some confusion.","When she heard that, Lan Caidie immediately hesitated. After some deliberation, she asked carefully, “Your highness, could I ask you a question? Exactly what relationship exists between you and that Immortal Emperor called Yang Yutian?”","When she heard that, Xing Caijian immediately frowned. Her gaze sharpened as her tone gradually turned cold. “Don’t tell me your injuries are connected to him? What exactly is this about?”"]},{"number":3889,"title":"Chapter 3889: Xing Caijian’s Warning","paragraphs":["The change in Xing Caijian’s expression made Lan Caidie’s heart sink slightly. She could clearly sense that Xing Caijian’s concern and care for Yang Yutian had completely exceeded her expectations.","Lan Caidie was a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, an ancestor even among peak organisations. However, she still seemed to show respect from the bottom of her heart towards Xing Caijian who was only a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor.","As a result, she immediately confessed the reason for her conflict with Jian Chen.","“You actually developed a feud with him over a Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit?” Xing Caijian stared at Lan Caidie like she was staring at an idiot. “If I recall correctly, there were experts publicly selling Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit outside the Skyscraping World. Since your Ghost Immortal cult is in need of it, why didn’t you exchange for it there instead of going through such great lengths here?”","“Your Ghost Immortal cult has some heritage after all. You haven’t declined to the point where you can’t even afford that.”","When she heard that, Lan Caidie let out a sigh and said, “You may not be aware, your highness, but there are also people from the Myriad Ways cult among those who have entered the Skyscraping World this time. The Myriad Ways cult has always been on terrible terms with our Ghost Immortal cult, so we do not want to express any interest in the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit at all when the people of the Myriad Ways cult are around, just in case they decide to make trouble.”","“At the same time, it is to stop the Myriad Ways cult from noticing any secrets that they cannot be permitted to know when we compete for the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit.”","“Enough, you don’t have to say anything more. That’s not what I actually care about. Tell me, what is Yang Yutian’s situation right now? Is he still alive? You better pray he’s still alive. If he were to die, even if I spare you, my father will never spare you. As for my mother, she’ll personally carve you to pieces,” Xing Caijian said rather impatiently. Her tone became more and more harsh.","“What? The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor would actually... for Yang Yutian...” Lan Caidie was completely stunned. Her sheet-white face seemed to become even paler now.","The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor had shown the Ghost Immortal cult tremendous kindness in the past. During that age filled with darkness and despair, if it were not for the Heavenly Star Palace’s protection, the Ghost Immortal cult would have perished a long time ago, vanishing from the Immortals’ World completely.","Even for a very long time after that, whenever the Ghost Immortal cult faced devastation, the Heavenly Star Palace would always stand forward in the final moments and preserve the Ghost Immortal cult.","As a result, all of the upper echelon of the Ghost Immortal cult were highly grateful towards the Heavenly Star Palace.","The master of the Heavenly Star Palace, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor, was a god-like figure in the eyes of the upper echelon of the Ghost Immortal cult. They all looked up to him.","Yet at this moment, Xing Caijian actually said that the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor and his wife would carve her to pieces if Yang Yutian died.","This conversation had a startling impact on Lan Caidie. She felt like she had let down her saviour; she felt like had committed a heinous crime.","“Then who exactly is Yang Yutian, your highness?” Lan Caidie asked wryly.","“Don’t ask what you shouldn’t ask. Tell me about Yang Yutian’s condition,” Xing Caijian said with a frown.","“Yang Yutian is fine,” Lan Caidie said wryly, “He possesses a spatial god artifact of extremely high quality, allowing him to avoid the detection of all of the formations in the Skyscraping World. He brought in several tens of thousand Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals, as well as a handful of Immortal Monarchs and Immortal Emperors, coupled with an Immortal Exalt. They instantly assembled a formation of startling power. The formation was so powerful that even when I used the power from the Remains of the Ghost Immortal, I failed to gain the upper hand.”","“What did you say? Yang Yutian brought several tens of thousand Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals in here?” Xing Caijian was shocked. Her eyes were filled with disbelief.","She only knew that Jian Chen possessed the twin swords, but the twin swords were not capable of carrying several tens of thousand immortals around.","“That’s right. Your highness, I know this is rather difficult to believe, but it is what I saw with my own eyes after all.”","“Every single formation in the Skyscraping World is of rather high quality. They’ve all been personally cast by Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts. No one can fool these formations and sneak in several tens of thousand cultivators, yet Yang Yutian achieved that. This can only mean that he possesses a spatial god artifact that surpasses the formations of the Skyscraping World in quality...”","Towards the end, Lan Caidie could not help but show some burning desire again, but she suppressed it very quickly as if she was afraid of showing it to Xing Caijian.","Xing Caijian stood where she was in silence as if she was digesting the information she had received from Lan Caidie.","That was because she had heard far too many unbelievable pieces of information from Lan Caidie.","Several tens of thousand Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals? And even an Immortal Exalt?","She never thought that the successor of the twin swords would actually be hiding such a formidable force.","The fact that he managed to fend off Lan Caidie’s power from the Remains of the Ghost Immortal through a powerful formation left her even more startled.","She understood exactly how powerful the Lan Caidie’s Remains of the Ghost Immortal were. That was a terrifying power that even many Immortal Exalt ancestors of the Heavenly Star Palace were wary of.","There were only a handful of experts among all the Immortal Exalt ancestors of the Heavenly Star Palace that could stop this power.","“So I’ve underestimated you slightly,” Xing Caijian murmured to herself. She was very surprised by Jian Chen’s trump cards.","After a pause, Xing Caijian looked at Lan Caidie and said with absolute authority, “I don’t care about what happened between you and Yang Yutian. From this moment onwards, your Ghost Immortal cult is not to oppose Yang Yutian. Do you understand?”","“If you become enemies, then I can tell you with absolute certainty that our Heavenly Star palace will only stand by Yang Yutian.”","Lan Caidie’s expression changed slightly. She was filled with anguish. “Yes, your highness. I understand.”","“However, I do have an unreasonable request, your highness. The Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit is truly extremely important to our Ghost Immortal cult.”","Xing Caijian’s eyes shone. She stared at Lan Caidie in interest and said, “The Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit is for recovering the memory of past lives for people who have reincarnated. It has no other uses apart from that. Don’t tell me a major figure of your Ghost Immortal cult has reincarnated?”","After hesitating for a moment, Lan Caidie seemed to make some kind of decision. She gritted her teeth. “This is the greatest secret of our Ghost Immortal cult. Apart from the cult leader and me, no one else in the Ghost Immortal cult knows about this. Even the other vice cult leaders have no right to know about this. But since you want to know, I’ll tell you. I hope you can keep this a secret for us, your highness.”","Xing Caijian nodded sternly.","Lan Caidie quickly set up a formation before stifling her voice. “The cult leader believes he’s found the reincarnation of the previous cult leader, which is why we need the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit.”","“The previous cult leader of the Ghost Immortal cult perished during the war between the two worlds three million years ago. Are you certain that’s the senior?” Xing Caijian’s eyes shone.","“The cult leader sensed it through the supreme secret technique passed down through the cult. He’s not completely certain, but he’s mostly sure,” Lan Caidie whispered.","“But even if it really is that senior’s reincarnation, it has been over three million years. Who knows how many reincarnations he has already been through. The Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit can only awaken memories from the past three lives.” Xing Caijian furrowed her brows.","“Even if it’s only the memories from the past three lives, it’s all we can do, as Reincarnation Fruits are just too rare in the Immortals’ World. Finding any stronger Reincarnation Fruits is very difficult.” Lan Caidie sighed gently.","It had already been over three million years since the old cult leader died. During this lengthy period, the old cult leader might have reincarnated once, or he might have reincarnated countless times already.","Xing Caijian hesitated. After a moment of silence, she said, “If the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit was in the hands of others, there would be many ways to retrieve it, but it’s with Yang Yutian now.”","“Since it’s in his hands, your Ghost Immortal cult can only find a way yourself...”","Lan Caidie glanced at the sword that Xing Caijian carried in her arms. Through the Remains of the Ghost Immortal inside her, she could vaguely sense a devastating power hiding inside the sword. The power was so great that it even petrified the Remains of the Ghost Immortal inside her.","She was clearly aware that Xing Caijian was unstoppable in the Skyscraping World if she used the sword, but she refused to help, purely because she did not want to offend the Immortal Emperor called Yang Yutian.","“Also, you are not to mention a single word about the secrets regarding Yang Yutian. Do you understand...” Xing Caijian said that in the end before leaving with the sword in her arms.","Lan Caidie sat in the bushes feebly. By now, she had temporarily set aside the matter of the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit. Her mind was filled with thoughts about Jian Chen’s origins, as well as why the Heavenly Star Palace would treat him like that.","......","...","Elsewhere, Jian Chen continued to search through the Skyscraping World for medicinal gardens. He did not wear the Divine Armour of Heavenflight, having handed it over to the Source of Life already for purification.","Over thirty thousand Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal disciples sat in an empty area inside the Primeval Divine Hall. Each one of them ingested supreme grade Immortal Tier pills to recover their expended energy.","Who knew when Jian Chen would need to use the Divine Formation of the Heavens in the Skyscraping World again, so these disciples who exhausted all of their energy were recovering as quickly as they could under Jian Chen’s orders.","Even if these Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals only ingested a supreme grade Immortal Tier pill each, that would be over thirty thousand consumed all at once. Just supplying the pills alone was not something that regular organisations could sustain.","Fortunately, Jian Chen possessed a tremendous amount of resources. Coupled with the Hall of Alchemy, he could easily make up for the consumption.","In the blink of an eye, three days had already passed. Purified by the Source of Life, the Divine Armour of Heavenflight had finally returned to normal. All of the external energy and presence had been eliminated.","Jian Chen let out a sigh of relief. With the return of the Divine Armour of Heavenflight, he no longer had to worry about the old woman from the Ghost Immortal cult tracking him down.","“Yang Yutian, so I’ve underestimated you slightly.” At this moment, a figure suddenly appeared behind Jian Chen.","Jian Chen froze slightly. His expression changed, as he had failed to sense anyone approaching him from behind.","He turned around slowly. All he saw was Xing Caijian with the ancient sword in her arms, standing thirty metres away silently.","Jian Chen’s eyes narrowed slightly. He never thought that Xing Caijian would be so close to him, which made him feel a sense of danger from her for the first time.","This sense of danger did not come from the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star but Xing Caijian herself!"]},{"number":3890,"title":"Chapter 3890: Map of the Medicinal Gardens","paragraphs":["“ She truly is a daughter of a heavenly emperor. This Xing Caijian’s strength is anything but simple, ” Jian Chen thought to himself. He had never seen Xing Caijian’s abilities, so he was unable to gauge her strength at all.","He was secretly surprised, but he showed none of it on the surface. He clasped his fist towards Xing Caijian and said, “So it’s fellow Xing Caijian. May I ask why you’re here? I’m not too sure about what you’re saying.”","Xing Caijian stared straight at Jian Chen in interest as if her gaze was particularly penetrating, wanting to see through Jian Chen’s entirety.","“Fellow, please don’t stare at me like that. It leaves me very uncomfortable.” Jian Chen smiled.","Xing Caijian was unfazed. “Before I found you, I encountered Lan Caidie from the Ghost Immortal cult.”","“Lan Caidie? The vice cult leader of the Ghost Immortal cult?” Jian Chen’s gaze changed slightly.","“That’s right. She is one of the vice cult leaders of the Ghost Immortal cult. She gained the recognition of an extremely powerful Remains of the Ghost Immortal from the Ghost Immortal cult. She possesses extremely great status in the Ghost Immortal cult, standing above thousands.”","“She has already told me about everything that occurred between you and her several days ago,” Xing Caijian said.","Jian Chen furrowed his brows slightly when he heard that. “She’s told you everything? Looks like your Heavenly Star Palace and the Ghost Immortal cult are quite close since she even told you this.”","“Our Heavenly Star Palace has shown the Ghost Immortal cult great kindness in the past, so when it comes to many matters, the Ghost Immortal cult won’t try to hide it from us at all.” Xing Caijian paused before continuing, “I heard from Lan Caidie that you have an Immortal Exalt hidden by your side?”","“That’s right!” Jian Chen did not deny it.","“The Immortal Exalt is of the demonic path?” Xing Caijian continued to ask.","Seeing how Jian Chen nodded, she immediately furrowed her brows and said, “Hiding an Immortal Exalt of the demonic path by your side is a huge source of potential trouble. With their cultivation, they’re not that easy to control. You better be careful about facing betrayal at a certain time. All of your fortunes will end up becoming theirs.”","“Thank you for your concern, fellow Xing Caijian. Since I’m bold enough to keep him by my side, I’m obviously not concerned about any betrayal,” Jian Chen said with utmost confidence. Unless he lost the Source of Life, there were no Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts that could kill him even if he simply stood there without budging.","Xing Caijian said nothing more. She stood where she was in momentary silence. She was very tempted to ask Jian Chen about the mysterious formation that rivalled Lan Caidie’s Remains of the Ghost Immortal, as well as the several tens of thousand Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals.","She was extremely curious about this, as the matter puzzled her very much.","But upon further thought, she decided against it. It seemed like she was also aware that asking about someone’s secret like this was extremely inappropriate.","“Senior sword venerable’s lingering will has already dissipated completely, but before he passed away, he should have told you about all the medicinal gardens that exist in the Skyscraping World, right?” Xing Caijian changed the topic. This was the main reason why she was looking for Jian Chen.","Jian Chen nodded and said, “The medicinal gardens have been consuming the spiritual Qi of the Skyscraping World insatiably. If these medicinal gardens remain, then the Skyscraping World won’t last for too long. As a result, senior sword venerable wanted me to cooperate with you in cleaning up these medicinal gardens.”","With a flip of Xing Caijian’s hand, a palm-sized jade disc appeared out of nowhere. It was engraved with complicated and profound patterns. She lifted up the jade disc and said, “This jade disc is connected to the formations of the Skyscraping World. It can borrow a wisp of the formations’ power. This power cannot be used against enemies. It can only be used to locate the medicinal gardens in the Skyscraping World.”","“Originally, senior sword venerable wanted me to hand this to you, as I’ve already received a secret technique from senior sword venerable. As such, I can find these medicinal gardens even without using the jade disc.”","“But in his final moments, senior sword venerable changed his mind, as he did not want you to offend even more people over this.”","Xing Caijian stared straight at Jian Chen and said sternly, “I’ve specially come to find you for one reason alone. Are you going to accept this jade disc or not?”","“If you accept it, then you will carry out senior sword venerable’s final wish and clear the Skyscraping World of medicinal gardens. The consequence is that you will offend many peak organisations.”","“If you refuse, then I’ll take this jade disc with me. I will personally clear out all the medicinal gardens in the Skyscraping World.”","“If I refuse, I’m afraid you’ll look down on me.” Jian Chen chuckled.","Xing Caijian stared straight at Jian Chen. She said nothing.","Jian Chen was right. If he refused, she would look down on him slightly. In her view, the burden he bore as the successor of the twin swords was extraordinary. Someone like him was not supposed to be overcautious or timid when handling matters.","If he was afraid of this and afraid of that, then he would only bring shame to the twin swords.","“Hand it over then. I’ve benefited from senior sword venerable’s kindness, so I obviously can’t disappoint him.” Jian Chen opened his hand.","“Before I give this to you, have you considered the consequences you will face once you do this?” Xing Caijian asked once again to confirm.","“I’ve even killed a great elder from the Immortal Feather sect. Do you think I’ll fear this?” Jian Chen laughed.","When she heard that, Xing Caijian’s eyes narrowed. She glanced deeply at Jian Chen and stopped hesitating, directly tossing over the jade disc to him.","Jian Chen caught the jade disc in his hand. As he channelled a weak flow of energy inside, an illusionary screen rose up from the jade disc before quickly taking the shape of a mountain.","Jian Chen recognised the illusionary mountain with a single glance. That was the Skyscraping World in the whole!","At this moment, various small, red specks flickered on the mountain. There were over a hundred of them.","Jian Chen’s gaze was fixated on the red dots. He clearly understood that each red dot represented a medicinal garden.","Although he knew the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s secret technique and could capture all signs of activity within an area through it, the Skyscraping World was far too large. Trying to find the medicinal gardens one by one through this technique was still like searching for a needle in a haystack.","But it was different now that he had obtained this map. Through this map, he could gain a rough grasp of the locations of all the medicinal gardens in the Skyscraping World.","Jian Chen’s lips gradually curled into a smile. Xing Caijian’s map had come at the perfect timing.","However, the map could only locate the medicinal gardens. The various other opportunities hiding in the Skyscraping World were still as mysterious as the mist.","“There just happens to be a medicinal garden several hundred thousand kilometres in front of us.” Jian Chen stowed away the jade disc and looked at Xing Caijian.","“What are you waiting for then? Go destroy it,” Xing Caijian said with no further thought. Shortly afterwards, she used the secret technique and sensed for it, confirming its location very soon. She took a step and immediately vanished.","“ Several thousand kilometres with each step! In the Skyscraping World, she’s actually even faster than me. ” Jian Chen was surprised. He immediately followed behind her.","Very soon, the two of them arrived before the medicinal garden several hundred thousand kilometres away. The medicinal garden was enveloped in a formation. Its defences were so powerful that even mid Immortal Exalts would struggle to breach it.","Over three hundred heavenly resources were growing in the medicinal garden.","“Fellow, may I ask how you will destroy this formation?” Jian Chen stood to one side, with no intention of taking action. Instead, he glanced at Xing Caijian, wishing to witness her capabilities in person."]},{"number":3891,"title":"Chapter 3891: Might of the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star","paragraphs":["“Aren’t you just asking the obvious?” Xing Caijian rolled her eyes at Jian Chen and stared at the formation before her. “Without the strength of a Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, it’ll be difficult to destroy this formation. Do you really think I can destroy this formation alone with my strength as a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor?”","Jian Chen did not say anything. He subconsciously looked at the ancient sword in her arms.","The ancient sword was wrapped in coarse cloth, hiding it away perfectly. All of its glow and pressure was contained. It did not give off any ebbs of energy. It seemed like a regular item.","However, Jian Chen knew that this ordinary-looking sword was Xing Caijian’s greatest trump card!","It was different from the twin swords. The twin swords were still in a feeble state, while Xing Caijian’s Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star was in peak condition!","“Senior Heavenly Star, I’ll have to trouble you,” Xing Caijian said to the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star. Her voice was no longer icy but filled with respect.","In the next moment, there was a crisp thrum. The resonance of a sword filled the surroundings. The Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star in Xing Caijian’s arms had already exited its sheath.","Immediately, an indescribable pressure radiated out. The pressure was not powerful. It was not the kind where it created an alarming disturbance, sweeping through the surroundings. Instead, it contained unparalleled dignity as if it looked down on the world, the laws of the world, and the three thousand ways that wove through the universe.","Jian Chen’s attention was drawn away by the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star. Although the scene when the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star emerged from its sheath conflicted with his imaginations slightly, he still did not dare to underestimate it.","He understood that if a sovereign god artifact in peak condition did not give off a terrifying pressure, it was simply because the sovereign god artifact intentionally avoided it.","After all, to a complete sovereign god artifact, the formation used to protect the medicinal garden was absolutely nothing.","As a matter of fact, it felt a little overkill to use this sovereign god artifact to destroy the formation.","Unfortunately, apart from using the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star, Xing Caijian had no other methods.","Suddenly, a dazzling streak of light shot out from the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star. It seemed to bypass the concept of distance, instantly landing on the protective formation around the medicinal garden.","Wherever the sword Qi passed by, Jian Chen could clearly sense unstable fluctuations in the laws.","Despite the startling power behind the sword Qi, the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star intentionally kept it contained, so it only affected a small range. It did not stir up the Skyscraping World.","Boom!","The sword Qi from the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star collided against the protective formation and produced a deep rumble. The protective formation around the medicinal garden tore apart easily like paper. The sword Qi pulverised all of the formation banners and precious resources for setting up the formation.","Even the heavenly resources growing inside were not spared. The precious God Tier heavenly resources were all annihilated as well.","By the time the sword Qi had dispersed, the vibrant medicinal garden from earlier had been razed to the ground.","The God Tier heavenly resources that were destroyed by the sword Qi turned into a ball of energy and returned to the world, merging back into the Skyscraping World.","Following the attack, the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star immediately stopped shining. It turned back into an ordinary sword that returned to Xing Caijian’s arms.","Looking at the annihilated medicinal garden, Jian Chen sighed inside. He felt pained.","That was several hundred God Tier heavenly resources, with plenty of mid grade God Tier heavenly resources among them. Just the amount of time to nurture them to such an extent was tremendous.","Yet, these precious heavenly resources had just been destroyed by the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star like that. That was virtually a waste.","Jian Chen rubbed his temples in a rather pained manner and said, “Fellow Xing Caijian, is this how you handle these medicinal gardens?”","“How else?” Xing Caijian looked at Jian Chen and said, “What, it hurts to watch?”","“Fair enough. Several hundred heavenly resources are indeed a sizable wealth to most cultivators, but to me, even thousands or tens of thousands of heavenly resources struggle to interest me, let alone a hundred. After all, our Heavenly Star Palace does not lack these heavenly resources at all.”","“Even if we do require them, we would never stoop to the level of stealing heavenly resources from lower organisations given our status.”","Xing Caijian paused and looked at the land. After a moment of silence, she slowly said, “There’s the most important reason as well. If these heavenly resources are destroyed, all of the essence they contain will return to this land. It’ll be able to replenish some of the energy in the Skyscraping World.”","“If I didn’t take part, were you prepared to destroy all of the medicinal gardens in the Skyscraping World like this?” Jian Chen asked.","“That’s right!” Xing Caijian said to Jian Chen, “Regardless of whether you decided to participate or not, I would have done this. Our Heavenly Star Palace is too proud to claim the resources of weaker organisations for ourselves, so I can only destroy them.”","“Fellow Xing Caijian, why don’t we discuss something? Leave all the medicinal gardens in the Skyscraping World to me to deal with, alright?” Jian Chen smiled at Xing Caijian.","“You’re the successor of the twin swords. Doing that would be beneath you.” Xing Caijian looked at Jian Chen in a strange manner. The successor of the twin swords before her was a little too miserly.","“In your eyes, the successor of the twin swords should be a lofty existence of various honours, but in reality, the successor of the twin swords spends all of his time worrying about how he can survive in the Immortals’ World and how he can increase his strength as quickly as possible to improve his ability to fend off threats.” Jian Chen smiled wryly.","When she heard that, Xing Caijian furrowed her brows. She considered it seriously for a while before saying, “You’re right. If only senior Samsara was in the Immortals’ World. If he were around, you’d be untouchable.”","“Yang Yutian, once we leave the Skyscraping World, come with me to the Heavenly Star Palace. You are the successor of the twin swords. Our Heavenly Star Palace will assist you,” Xing Caijian said seriously.","“We’ll see when the time comes...” Jian Chen was ambivalent. All he could think of right now were all the medicinal gardens in the Skyscraping World.","Although he would offend countless organisations as a result, it was far too tempting, so he could not resist it.","If he could take all of it for himself, that would be at least several times what he obtained from the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants.","Jian Chen successfully convinced Xing Caijian to stop destroying the medicinal gardens. Afterwards, he made his way to the next medicinal garden as quickly as he could according to the map he had obtained from Xing Caijian.","Very soon, Jian Chen arrived before a new medicinal garden. There were over eight hundred stalks of heavenly resources there, all at the God Tier. Mid grade God Tier heavenly resources formed a third of them.","The medicinal gardens here came nowhere close to the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants in terms of numbers, but they were all the best of the best in terms of quality.","Jian Chen repeated the same trick. He used the secret technique from the Skyscraping Sword Venerable to strip the surrounding region of spiritual Qi before getting the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt to use the Energy-devouring Furnace.","Xing Caijian did not come along. She took the complete opposite path to Jian Chen."]},{"number":3892,"title":"Chapter 3892: Plundering the Medicinal Gardens","paragraphs":["Just like that, Jian Chen worked with the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt and began harvesting medicinal gardens after medicinal gardens fearlessly in the Sksycraping World.","Each medicinal garden varied in scale. Some only had a few hundred heavenly resources, while others had upwards of the tens of thousands.","Without any exception, none of the heavenly resources in these medicinal gardens were of low quality. Basically all of them had reached God Tier. There were only a handful that remained below God Tier.","As a result, after emptying out several medicinal gardens, the Primeval Divine Hall had suddenly gained several tens of thousand heavenly resources. Jian Chen had completely replenished his supply of resources that he used on the Divine Formation of the Heavens.","However, Jian Chen did not choose to nurture these heavenly resources. Instead, he stored them in jade boxes, planning on using them directly when required.","He had no other choice but to do this because he would not have enough resources and spiritual Qi to sustain and nurture all of these resources.","At the same time, in another region of the Skyscraping World, Xing Caijian stood before a small medicinal garden. As she looked at the several hundred heavenly resources that flourished there, she could not help but let out a sigh. She seemed to be filled with a sense of helplessness.","Shortly afterwards, she swung her hand gently. Jade boxes after jade boxes flew out from her Space Ring, arranging themselves neatly before her.","She extended her finger gently. Several strands of sword Qi immediately flew out into the medicinal garden. Each heavenly resource was uprooted, placed into the jade boxes tidily under the control of the senses of her soul.","Before long, several hundred heavenly resources had been sent into the jade boxes quietly.","“How tiresome. If I could destroy the entire medicinal garden in one fell stroke, that would save so much trouble...” After dealing with several medicinal gardens, Xing Caijian finally felt a little impatient. She could not help but complain.","However, when she considered his identity as the successor of the twin swords, she could only bear with it.","At this moment, Xing Caijian seemed to sense something. She looked ahead.","Several kilometres away, three figures travelled by levitating slightly off from the ground.","The person at the front was a middle-aged man in white robes. He gave off a righteous presence and a sagely bearing. He was a Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor.","Two beautiful women followed behind him. They seemed to be in their twenties, and they were both Immortal Monarchs.","“Great elder, we’ve already spent several decades searching through the Skyscraping World, yet we haven’t even found a trace of the Fallen Sword Flower. Sigh, I’m really worried that we won’t be able to complete the ancestor’s mission.” One of the Immortal Monarch women sighed in concern.","“Don’t worry. We still have ample time. We’ll carry out a fine search of the entire Skyscraping World. I refuse to believe we won’t be able to find a Fallen Sword Flower,” said the middle-aged man.","“Actually, it’s not that we can’t find any Fallen Sword Flowers, but they are all inside the medicinal gardens of peak organisations. They are beyond our reach.” The other woman sighed gently.","But as soon as they said that, the three of them stopped at the same time. Their eyes narrowed in surprise.","Before the three of them was a ruined medicinal garden. All of the heavenly resources there had been uprooted, forming ditches of various sizes in the ground.","From this, they had clearly realised that someone had forcefully destroyed a medicinal garden run by a peak organisation.","Situations like this were extremely rare in the Skyscraping World.","All peak organisations capable of starting up a medicinal garden in the Skyscraping World would set up very powerful formations. They could not be destroyed by regular Immortal Exalts.","On top of that, there was an extremely limited number of Immortal Exalts that entered the Immortals’ World each time. Most of them were early Immortal Exalts as well. It was anything but easy for them to destroy these formations with their strength.","“You want a Fallen Sword Flower?” At this moment, a clear and cold voice rang out.","The three of them followed the voice and looked over. A woman stood gracefully several dozen kilometres away. She seemed to be in her twenties and possessed alluring beauty, but she gave off a sense of coldness and pride. She seemed a little unapproachable.","The three of them clearly recognised the woman. As soon as they saw her, they shuddered inside and immediately demonstrated respect, bowing politely.","“I am a great elder of the Cloud sect, Yun Yingshi. Beside me are two elders, Yun Lianzi and Yun Liansu. Greetings, your highness!”","The lady was the daughter of the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor, Xing Caijian!","“I just happen to have a Fallen Sword Flower here. Would you like it?” Xing Caijian opened her hand, and a metre-long heavenly resource appeared. It was a Fallen Sword Flower that great elder Yun Yingshi had been searching for.","Looking at the Fallen Sword Flower in Xing Caijian’s hands, Yun Yingshi’s breathing immediately became ragged. His gaze paused on the Fallen Sword Flower for a split second before he sighed. “I would never covet the possession of your highness. However, our Cloud sect is indeed in desperate need of a Fallen Sword Flower!”","“Since you want it, I can give it to you, but the three of you will have to help me with some matters,” Xing Caijian said seriously.","“How can the likes of us achieve something that even your highness cannot?” Yun Yingshi smiled wryly.","“You don’t have to worry about that. My task for you is very simple. You only have to pick heavenly resources for me. I can’t be bothered with it myself,” said Xing Caijian.","“Just picking heavenly resources? Is it really that simple?” The great elder from the Cloud sect was doubtful.","“Of course. Am I supposed to lie to you with my identity?”","Just like that, Xing Caijian temporarily hired three people from the Cloud sect with a single Fallen Sword Flower. Afterwards, the three of them followed behind Xing Caijian as they ventured through the Skyscraping World.","“Your highness, there’s a heavenly resource here!” Along the way, they encountered a low grade God Tier heavenly resource. Yun Liansu was just about to go and pick it.","“Don’t waste your time here. These aren’t the heavenly resources that I want you to pick.” Xing Caijian’s disdainful voice rang out, which immediately made Yun Liansu return awkwardly.","At the same time, it left the three people from the Cloud sect even more confused.","“ What exactly are the heavenly resources that she wants us to pick? Don’t tell me... ” The three of them all had their guesses, but very soon, they thought of the ruined medicinal garden from earlier. They all shuddered inside. An unbelievable thought filled their minds.","Before long, the believable thought came true. An extremely large medicinal garden appeared before the four of them. It shimmered with hazy light. The spiritual Qi turned into thick mist; it was so thick that visibility was severely limited.","This was a medicinal garden run by a rather renowned peak organisation in the Immortals’ World. There were over twenty thousand heavenly resources growing inside. No one dared to covet this place.","In the next moment, the pressure of a sovereign god artifact emanated out with a flash, striking the formation. It created a devastating glow that seemed capable of breaking apart the ways. The formation immediately shattered like glass.","“Who dares to touch our Daoist Sect of Heaven’s Inheritance’s medicinal garden!?” When the formation shattered, a resonant voice rang out. A colossal figure appeared in the centre of the medicinal garden, radiating with tremendous pressure.","Despite only being the wisp of a soul, it was possible to tell from the pressure that they were a late Immortal Exalt!","“The Daoist Sect of Heaven’s Inheritance. This is actually the Daoist Sect of Heaven’s Inheritance’s medicinal garden...” The three people from the Cloud sect were all dumbfounded. They also came from a peak organisation with Immortal Exalt ancestors.","But even to them, the Daoist Sect of Heaven’s Inheritance was a supreme existence well beyond their reach!","“Xing Caijian of the Heavenly Star Palace!” Xing Caijian held the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star in her arms with no fear."]},{"number":3893,"title":"Chapter 3893: Shaking up the Skyscraping World","paragraphs":["“Xing Caijian? The Heavenly Star Palace?” the voice in the medicinal garden murmured. After a moment of silence, he continued, “I know you. You’re the daughter of the master of the Heavenly Star Palace, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor, and Venerable Cajian of the Immortal Sect of Sacred Fire. However, I am extremely perplexed about how our Daoist Sect of Heaven’s Inheritance has offended you to the point where you are destroying our Daoist Sect of Heaven’s Inheritance’s medicinal garden.”","“The medicinal garden in the Skyscraping World took our Daoist Sect of Heaven’s Inheritance substantial effort to set up.”","“You are mistaken, senior. I am not doing this to go after any particular organisation. Instead, I am doing it under the request of senior Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s lingering will. He wants me to destroy all the medicinal gardens in the Skyscraping World. If you still have doubts, you are welcome to closely sense the spiritual Qi in the Skyscraping World,” said Xing Caijian.","“The Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s lingering will?” The voice from the medicinal garden immediately became serious. It seemed like the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s name bore some kind of power. Despite having passed away many years ago, his influence still remained. Just hearing his name was enough to leave the Immortal Exalt ancestor of the Daoist Sect of Heaven’s Inheritance wary.","“Sigh, why has the spiritual Qi in the Skyscraping World suddenly become so thin?” Shortly afterwards, the ancestor of the Daoist Sect of Heaven’s Inheritance noticed the abnormality of the spiritual Qi in the Skyscraping World and understood everything.","“The spiritual Qi of the Skyscraping World has reduced by so much. At this rate, it probably won’t be long before the Skyscraping World collapses from running out of spiritual Qi. It won’t be able to survive until the emergence of the last few seeds of ways,” the ancestor of the Daoist Sect of Heaven’s Inheritance contemplated before saying, “We can give up on our medicinal garden in the Skyscraping World, but we can’t afford to lose the heavenly resources planted here. We’ll have to wait for the next opening of the Skyscraping World before we can send in disciples.”","“It’ll be several hundred thousand years in the future before the Skyscraping World opens again. This medicinal garden will severely drain the spiritual Qi of the Skyscraping World, so we can’t wait until the next time,” said Xing Caijian.","When he heard that, the ancestor of the Daoist Sect of Heaven’s Inheritance’s voice gradually deepened. “Don’t tell me your Heavenly Star Palace plans on using this opportunity to claim the resources we’ve nurtured all this time for yourself?”","“Our Heavenly Star Palace is a court of heaven after all. Do you really think the likes of us would be interested in these mere heavenly resources?” Xing Caijian sneered. She immediately communicated with the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star mentally. A wisp of supreme sword Qi radiated out with tremendous pressure.","“T-this is...” The soul clone of the ancestor from the Daoist Sect of Heaven’s Inheritance was surprised. He seemed to recognise the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star and immediately said nothing more.","In the next moment, his soul clone departed, clearly having given up on the medicinal garden already.","“The three of you, I want you to harvest all of the heavenly resources here. Do it quickly. We’re in a rush for time,” Xing Caijian said to the three people from the Cloud sect behind her.","At this moment, the great elder and the two elders from the Cloud sect were still dumbstruck. They were overwhelmed by what had just happened. They seemed dazed, like their souls had left their bodies.","They made their way into the medicinal garden numbly and began picking the heavenly resources mechanically.","Just like that, Xing Caijian travelled through the Skyscraping World with the three elders from the Cloud sect, harvesting the medicinal gardens one by one. Due to the assistance from the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star, Xing Caijian swept through the medicinal gardens much faster than Jian Chen.","Along the way, she encountered a few more soul clones of Immortal Exalts that watched over the medicinal gardens. Most of them had reached late Immortal Exalt, or they came from peak organisations that possessed experts of such strength. However, without any exception, they all backed down and refused to object to Xing Caijian after recognising her identity, regardless of how impressive their backgrounds were.","To them, the medicinal gardens in the Skyscraping World were important, but no one wanted to provoke a court of heaven over a few heavenly resources.","Xing Caijian moved quickly and smoothly, while Jian Chen was much slower.","He made the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt use the Energy-devouring Furnace after all. The Energy-devouring Furnace would take several days to drain the energy of a formation. Cultivators would also pass by from time to time.","As a result, whenever cultivators passed by, Jian Chen was forced to make the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt hide inside the Primeval Divine Hall to hide his existence. Only after the cultivators were long gone could he let the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt out again.","Just like that, it obviously delayed everything.","In the blink of an eye, several months had already passed. During this time, Jian Chen had successfully emptied out ten medicinal gardens, harvesting a huge supply of high quality heavenly resources.","Because many passing cultivators spotted how he was plundering the medicinal gardens, rumours spread through the Skyscraping World.","“The Immortal Sect of Scarlet Sun and the Golden Sun sect’s medicinal gardens have been destroyed. The heavenly resources have all vanished. Don’t tell me Yang Yutian was behind all this...”","“When I came here, I discovered the Nine Dragons Pavillion’s medicinal garden to be in ruins as well. All of the heavenly resources were gone...”","“It’s just not them. Even the medicinal garden of the Daoist Sect of Heaven’s Inheritance has been plundered. Don’t tell me that’s also due to Yang Yutian...”","......","...","As the rumours spread through the Skyscraping World, everyone felt shocked. Even the Immortal Exalt ancestors were unable to remain unfazed.","That was because among the organisations who had their medicinal gardens destroyed, some of them were far more than simply powerful. They even left them wary, yet Yang Yutian pillaged them all.","His reckless plundering made many of the experts gasp in shock.","“What exactly is Yang Yutian’s background? How is he bold enough to provoke so many peak organisations?”","“From the daughter of the heavenly emperor’s attitude towards him, don’t tell me Yang Yutian is also from a court of heaven?”","For a while, guesses over Yang Yutian’s identity could be heard throughout the Skyscraping World.","Some people were wary, afraid to provoke him without good reason, while others fostered their greed, coveting the heavenly resources.","After all, the resources from plundering the medicinal gardens of so many peak organisations was enough for several Immortal Exalts to shed blood.","Jian Chen and the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt currently faced a huge medicinal garden, draining it with the Energy-devouring Furnace.","But at this moment, Jian Chen’s expression changed slightly. He immediately called out, “Oh no, an Immortal Exalt is approaching here rapidly. Enter the Primeval Divine Hall!”","As soon as he said that, the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt vanished, hiding away in the Primeval Divine Hall, while the Energy-devouring Furnace he controlled obviously ended up in Jian Chen’s hands.","Jian Chen acted like nothing had happened. He continued to control the Energy-devouring Furnace to drain the formation’s energy.","Around ten seconds later, a figure arrived from afar, striding over at a steady pace. With each step, he covered several hundred kilometres.","He was an old man in white robes. His face was covered in wrinkles, which made him seem very old. He gave off the pressure of a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt.","When he saw Jian Chen, the old man’s eyes lit up. He was unable to hide his excitement.","“Yang Yutian, I’ve finally found you. Hahahaha, I just knew you’d be near a medicinal garden. My efforts have paid off in the end. I searched the medicinal gardens one by one and finally came across you.” The old man in white robes stood near Jian Chen and laughed excitedly. His gaze oozed with greed as if he was staring at a mound of treasure.","Jian Chen acted like he had only just discovered the old man in white robes. He stopped powering the Energy-devouring Furnace and looked back at him with a frown.","The old man in white robes rubbed his hands and chuckled. “People call me the Hundred Nights Ancestor. Yang Yutian, I have no clan or sect, so I’m not tied down by anything. I’ve spent my life wandering the Immortals’ World, so regardless of your background, none of it is important. I’m not doing this as a means to specifically target you. I’m just after some riches. Hand over your heavenly resources. I’ll leave as soon as I get them. I won’t make it any more difficult than that for you.”"]},{"number":3894,"title":"Chapter 3894: Lan Caidie","paragraphs":["“Hundred Nights Ancestor, you’re a mighty Immortal Exalt, yet you’ve stooped to the level of robbing an Immortal Emperor junior?” Jian Chen gripped the Energy-devouring Furnace in one hand and looked at the Hundred Nights Ancestor with composure.","“You’re right. As a mighty Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, I’d be the ancestor of a sect no matter where I go, yet I’ve resorted to stealing heavenly resources from an Immortal Emperor junior. That is indeed a very embarrassing matter.”","“But who can help the fact that you’ve plundered several medicinal gardens? Now, you possess enough resources to even tempt Immortal Exalts. I’m obviously not immune to this temptation either.” The Hundred Nights Ancestor’s gaze at Jian Chen gradually sharpened. He radiated with a sense of viciousness as he said threateningly, “Yang Yutian, my patience is limited. I’ll give you ten seconds to choose. Are you going to hand over the heavenly resources or will I have to collect them myself?”","“I’ll make it perfectly clear. If I have to collect it myself, I can’t guarantee what will happen.”","“Oh right, I want the high quality god artifact in your hand as well!”","In the end, the Hundred Nights Ancestor shifted his gaze over to the Energy-devouring Furnace. His eyes were filled with undisguised greed. He could tell with a single glance that the Energy-devouring Furnace was the entire reason why Jian Chen could destroy the protective formations of so many medicinal gardens.","Even if he had no use for such a wondrous god artifact, it would fetch quite a price outside.","“Hundred Nights Ancestor, you’ve arrived here quite quickly, but I’m afraid that you won’t be able to enjoy the heavenly resources alone.” At this moment, an elderly voice rang out from afar. An illusionary figure flew over before stopping beside the Hundred Nights Ancestor in the end.","He was an old man in scarlet robes. His cultivation had not reached the Second Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt, but he was already at the peak of the First Heavenly Layer, only a step away from the second.","He stopped three hundred metres away from the Hundred Nights Ancestor, but he did not fear him.","“Skylark Master, you’ve actually found this place too?” Seeing who it was, the Hundred Nights Ancestor furrowed his brows. Despite possessing an advantage in cultivation, it would be very difficult for him to quickly capitalise on this advantage if they began fighting.","That was because the Skylark Master was different from him. Not only did he have an entire legacy behind him, but his cultivation method was extraordinary. He himself happened to be a divine beast of unique talents as well. His bloodline was powerful. Within the same realm of cultivation, only devious geniuses could overwhelm him.","“I’m not going to be greedy. I’ll take sixty percent of the resources on Yang Yutian.” The Skylark Master smiled gently.","“Sixty percent? That won’t be possible. It’ll be a fifty-fifty split at most.” The Hundred Nights Ancestor’s voice rank. He felt anguished inside as he watched the riches within his arms reach suddenly halve.","When he saw how the Skylark Master wanted to continue to bargain, the Hundred Nights Ancestor growled in discontent. “We can still split it evenly right now, but if we keep wasting time and draw over more Immortal Exalts, we won’t even get a share anymore. Skylark Master, you better not take this too far. After all, we’re not the only two people searching for Yang Yutian in the Skyscraping World right now.”","“Alright, a fair split is a fair split!” The Skylark Master agreed flatly. He turned his attention towards Jian Chen; his gaze was sharp. “Yang Yutian, you better think things through. Are you going to hand it over yourself or do we have to do it ourselves?”","Jian Chen began to laugh. “If you want to steal from me, I’m afraid a First Heavenly Layer and a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt isn’t quite enough.” When he said that, he had already secretly communicated with the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt, planning on killing the two of them in one fell stroke.","Sweeping through the medicinal gardens in the Skyscraping World came with a certain amount of risk. Jian Chen was already prepared for this.","After all, the Immortal Exalt ancestors in the Skyscraping World all coveted the heavenly resources grown in the medicinal gardens, but no one had the courage to touch them. Just the colossal organisations behind these medicinal gardens were enough to leave them wary, let alone the tremendous effort required to destroy the formations.","However, it was different if they were stealing these heavenly resources from someone else. Not only would they obtain a terrifying quantity of God Tier heavenly resources, but they would not have to worry about offending the organisations behind these medicinal gardens either.","“ Unless I can prove the fact that I have an extremely powerful Immortal Exalt behind me, the deterrence from Xing Caijian’s friendliness is limited at the end of the day. If there aren’t any conflicts of interest, these Immortal Exalts obviously won’t provoke me for the sake of Xing Caijian, but once a colossal conflict of interest arises, most of them will stop caring, ” Jian Chen thought to himself. He had understood this principle a long time ago.","“Yang Yutian, since you want to bite off more than you can chew, you better not blame us.” The Skylark Master’s face was filled with malice. His pressure flooded out as energy that resembled tidal waves surged out of his body.","Cold light shimmered in Jian Chen’s eyes. He made no attempt to hide his killing intent. He was just about to release the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt.","“You better get through me first if you want to steal from fellow Yang Yutian.”","At this moment, a voice that Jian Chen found to be rather familiar rang out from afar. With a flash, an old woman with a walking cane had already appeared.","When he saw who it was, Jian Chen furrowed his brows. He was slightly surprised.","He recognised her. She was the vice cult leader of the Ghost Immortal cult who had endured a strike from the Divine Formation of the Heavens several months ago, Lan Caidie!","Right now, Lan Caidie stood with her back towards Jian Chen. Her thin, old eyes shone with chilling light.","“It’s you! You’re the vice cult leader of the Ghost Immortal cult, Lan Caidie!” The Skylark Master narrowed his eyes violently and could not help but cry out. His expression changed drastically. He had never been so stern before.","“Vice cult leader of the Ghost Immortal cult, are you also here for a slice of the pie?” The Hundred Nights Ancestor furrowed his brows and let out a long sigh “Another person. There are fewer resources for me again.”","“Hehehe, do you think I’ve come here to split resources with you?” Lan Caidie laughed hoarsely.","When he heard that, the Skylark Master forced out a smile that was even uglier than crying. “You must be joking, cult leader Lan. Since you’ve come in person, we obviously have no business here. We’ll leave immediately. We’ll leave immediately.”","“Skylark Master, what are you afraid of? The cult leader of the Ghost Immortal cult is only a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, which is similar to my strength. If we work together, are we unable to defeat her?” the Hundred Nights Ancestor furrowed his brows and asked.","The Skylark Master’s expression changed drastically. He rapidly flew away from the Hundred Nights Ancestor like he was avoiding the plague, pulling away from him. He said in exasperation, “Hundred Nights Ancestor, you better show some respect to cult leader Lan. You might want to die, but don’t pull me down with you.”","After saying that, the Skylark Master clasped his fist towards Lan Caidie in a hurry as if he was afraid of causing even the slightest offense. He said politely, “Please forgive my rudeness earlier. I’ll leave right now, and I’ll guarantee that I won’t divulge what happened here to anyone.” As soon as he said that, the Skylark Master vanished; he seemed extremely fearful of Lan Caidie."]},{"number":3895,"title":"Chapter 3895: Unexpected","paragraphs":["The Skylark Master’s actions left the Hundred Nights Ancestor rather puzzled. He obviously knew about the Ghost Immortal cult. They were indeed a tremendous existence that he could not afford to offend. However, the person before him was only a vice cult leader at the same level as him. No matter how fearful he was of the Ghost Immortal cult, there was no reason to be frightened like that by a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt.","The Hundred Nights Ancestor stared at Lan Caidie in doubt. “Do you have some kind of leverage over the Skylark Master?”","Lan Caidie smiled mysteriously and said, “If you leave right now, you’ll be unscathed.”","“Hmph, I’m not the Skylark Master. Your Ghost Immortal cult is very powerful, but I am not tied down by anything. I spend my life wandering the Immortals’ World. I don’t fear you like the Skylark Master.” The Hundred Nights Ancestor snorted coldly. He did not show any fear at all. He glanced past Lan Caidie and looked at Jian Chen behind her. “I want half of the heavenly resources on Yang Yutian. If you refuse, then I’ll fight you and show you whether I’m worthy of the fifty percent or not.”","“But let me put this out there first. If we take too long, perhaps neither of us will be able to obtain anything.”","The Hundred Nights Ancestor reached out. A white banner appeared in his hand, radiating with the might of a high quality god artifact.","He gripped the banner with both hands as his presence surged. He stared at Lan Caidie coldly. “Vice cult leader Lan, have you finished considering?”","“To think that even a grain of rice would try to rival the moon in glow. Since you want to die, I’ll give you what you want!” Lan Caidie erupted with killing intent. In the next moment, she erupted with surging energy, immediately condensing a blood-red figure thirty metres tall. The tremendous pressure filled the surroundings, making the space shake violently.","If this had not been the Skyscraping World that was stabilised by numerous formations, perhaps the pressure that Lan Caidie erupted with would be enough to collapse this space.","“This presence... has virtually surpassed the range of the Second Heavenly Layer. No wonder Skylark fears you so much. So you’re actually this powerful already.” The Hundred Nights Ancestor immediately became stern. He said viciously, “But so what? I’m still someone who has reached the Second Heavenly Layer. Even if I can’t defeat you, I can keep you occupied until even more experts arrive here.”","“You can forget about obtaining what I can’t obtain so easily.”","The Hundred Nights Ancestor jolted his hands; the white banner in his hand immediately unfurled. A life-like sword was engraved on the banner, shimmering and radiating with a powerful and sharp sword Qi.","The Hundred Nights Ancestor formed a seal with his hands, and the sword on the banner sprang alive. It rushed out of the banner while radiating with sword Qi, shining like the sun and shooting towards Lan Caidie like a bolt of lightning.","Lan Caidie sneered. She extended her finger towards the incoming sword gently. With that, the thirty metre tall figure behind her moved as well, also extending a finger.","Lan Caidie’s finger did not possess any pulses of energy. It only seemed like a casual action, without any offensive intentions.","However, when the blood-red figure extended its finger, it produced a storm of energy. The startling pressure made the Hundred Nights Ancestor’s eyes narrow violently.","Boom!","With a huge rumble, the finger of the blood-red figure collided against the incoming sword. The sword immediately dimmed before turning into specks of light and dissipating into the surroundings. It turned back into an image on the Hundred Nights Ancestor’s banner.","The blood-red figure’s finger did not slow down at all. It continued to press towards the Hundred Nights Ancestor with great force.","The Hundred Nights Ancestor swung the white banner in his hands again and again. Sharp swords flew out one after another towards the blood-red figure.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Rumbles rang out constantly. A powerful storm of energy wreaked havoc in the surroundings. The blood-red figure destroyed all of the incoming sword Qi like it was unstoppable before striking the Hundred Nights Ancestor’s banner viciously.","Spurt!","Immediately, the high quality god artifact stopped glowing. The Hundred Nights Ancestor became sheet-white. Blood sprayed out of his mouth as he staggered backwards.","“Impossible. Impossible! We’re both at the Second Heavenly Layer, so how are you so powerful!?” The Hundred Nights Ancestor stared at Lan Caidie closely and roared hysterically as if he refused to accept this kind of failure.","He was also a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, yet he had almost been completely crushed!","Lan Caidie’s thin eyes shone with cold killing intent. She said nothing at all, arriving before the Hundred Nights Ancestor with a flash and pressing her hand down towards his head.","The blood-red figure’s huge hand swung down as well as if it was compressing space. The space there even seemed to thicken.","The Hundred Nights Ancestor roared furiously. The energy in his body surged violently. He swung his white banner and produced strands of sword Qi, fighting back at full strength.","But unfortunately, the difference in strength was far too great. When the blood-red hand fell, all of the sword Qi shattered. The radiating pressure even became an invisible force of restraint, pinning the Hundred Nights Ancestor in place firmly.","Boom!","In the end, with a deep rumble, the Hundred Nights Ancestor was pressed heavily into the ground by the huge hand. He lay on the ground with his arms and legs sprawled out, completely immobilised. Blood sprayed from his mouth.","“Impossible. This is impossible. Even against a Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, I can last for a while without losing so quickly, yet you’re clearly only at the Second Heavenly Layer...” The Hundred Nights Ancestor howled. The way he looked at Lan Caidie finally changed. There was a hint of fear.","He had discovered that he virtually did not have the ability to fight back against this vice cult leader of the Ghost Immortal cult at all.","Lan Caidie did not pay any attention to the Hundred Nights Ancestor who was raising a ruckus. Instead, she turned towards Jian Chen behind her and asked, “Fellow Yang Yutian, do you want to kill or spare this person?”","Jian Chen’s eyes flashed with light. He stared at Lan Caidie for a moment before saying slowly, “Since you captured this person, his fate is obviously up for you to decide.”","“I understand!” At this moment, Lan Caidie treated Jian Chen like he was an entirely different person from several months ago. She nodded slowly. When she looked at the Hundred Nights Ancestor, her usual passiveness vanished. It was replaced by chilling killing intent.","“Since you’ve offended fellow Yang Yutian, you can pay with your life,” Lan Caidie said coldly. Her hand turned into a claw, which swung towards the Hundred Nights Ancestor’s head mercilessly.","“Hmph, it’s true that I’m not your opponent, but you’re dreaming if you think you can kill me.” In this moment of life or death, the Hundred Nights Ancestor abandoned his body without any hesitation. His illusionary soul rose up into the sky while shining brightly. His face was contorted. “Ghost Immortal cult, I’ve remembered you. Once I leave the Skyscraping World, I’ll kill all the disciples of the Ghost Immortal cult that I encounter...”","Before he even finished speaking, the Hundred Nights Ancestor’s soul vanished into the distance. He fled at top speed.","“If you had encountered someone else, even a Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, perhaps they would struggle to keep you from running, but you just happened to encounter me.” Lan Caidie smiled eerily. Dense, blood-red mist rose up from her body and rapidly formed an ancient seal before her chest, radiating with the profound aura of ways.","As soon as the ancient seal took shape, Jian Chen’s eyes narrowed slightly. The ancient seal seemed to contain a mysterious power that could attract his soul to a certain extent. Even his soul could not help but shiver.","“Argh! W-what is this power? Release me, release me!” In the next moment, a panicked voice rang out from afar. The Hundred Nights Ancestor’s soul seemed to be drawn over by this mysterious power, flying over rapidly from afar.","His soul constantly struggled, surging violently with the power of his soul in an attempt to break free from this restraint.","But it was all for nothing.","With a face filled with horror, the Hundred Nights Ancestor’s soul became firmly stuck to the ancient seal in front of Lan Caidie."]},{"number":3896,"title":"Chapter 3896: The Hundred Nights Ancestor’s Fate","paragraphs":["Lan Caidie’s ancient seal seemed to possess an invisible force of attraction, pinning the Hundred Nights Ancestor’s soul against it firmly. No matter how furiously he struggled, he was unable to break free.","Lan Caidie’s small, thin eyes were filled with mockery. “Hundred Nights Ancestor, I just heard that you wanted to go after our Ghost Immortal cult and that you’d kill all the disciples of the Ghost Immortal cult you encounter. Is that true?”","By now, the Hundred Nights Ancestor had already become ashen. Even his soul trembled; clearly, he feared what he would be facing next.","However, he still clung onto a shred of hope and forcefully suppressed his terror. He laughed dryly. “That... that... that was just a joke made while I had a lapse in judgment. It’s not to be taken seriously, not to be taken seriously...”","“A joke? Hehehehe, Hundred Nights Ancestor, do you take me as a child?” Lan Caidie sneered.","By now, the Hundred Nights Ancestor no longer possessed the same pride as before. With a face of anguish, he begged passively, “Fellow, we don’t have any particularly deep grudges, so could you forgive me this time and do something good? It’ll be like making a friend. I will definitely repay you in the future.”","“Do you really think you still have the right to talk about befriending me with your petty strength?” Lan Caidie sneered without holding back. After a pause, she said, “However, even if you want to beg for mercy, you’re talking to the wrong person, as your fate is not in my hands.”","Lan Caidie turned over to Jian Chen. Her tone changed and became much more polite. She asked, “Fellow Yang Yutian, how would you like to handle this person?”","“You want me to decide his fate?” Jian Chen was surprised. After a few short months, the vice cult leader of the Ghost Immortal cult’s attitude towards him had changed drastically.","“His fate is obviously up for you to decide!” Lan Caidie smiled, except it was not a particularly nice sight to behold with her face full of wrinkles.","Jian Chen sank into his thoughts, pondering how to deal with the Hundred Nights Ancestor.","The Hundred Nights Ancestor was quite surprised as well. Originally, he thought that Lan Caidie wanted to claim all of the resources for herself, but that did not seem to be the case anymore. In particular, Lan Caidie’s perplexing attitude only made Jian Chen’s identity seem even more mysterious in his eyes.","“Fellow Yang Yutian, I’d like to apologise to you for what I did earlier. I was hoping you could be the bigger man and not stoop to my level. If you can forgive me, I will definitely do all that I can to assist you. I will obey all of your instructions until the closing of the Skyscraping World.” The Hundred Nights Ancestor immediately begged for mercy from Jian Chen.","“What a joke. Your body has been destroyed. You’re just a soul now. What can you even achieve in the Skyscraping World?” Lan Caidie sneered.","When he heard that, the Hundred Nights Ancestor paled. He seemed to understand that with his current state, he would already be fortunate enough if he did not become deadweight. After a moment of hesitation, he finally seemed to make some kind of difficult decision. He gritted his teeth. “As long as you spare me, I’m willing to serve you for ten thousand years.”","When she heard that, even Lan Caidie was rather tempted. Immortal Exalts were on the level of sect and clan ancestors no matter where they went. They possessed great status. Earning ten thousand years of servitude from an expert like that held great significance even to many peak organisations.","“You’re an impressive Immortal Exalt, yet you’re willing to make such a big compromise for the sake of survival. I must say that you’ve even impressed me,” said Lan Caidie. However, when she said she was impressed, it sounded particularly jarring to the Hundred Nights Ancestor. She seemed to be implying something else, which left the Hundred Nights Ancestor rather awkward.","In the Immortals’ World, many Immortal Exalts possessed a tough backbone. They would rather die standing than live kneeling, yet for the sake of survival, he actually pledged himself to an Immortal Emperor. That was indeed quite humiliating.","The Hundred Nights Ancestor’s suggestion tempted Jian Chen slightly as well. After all, this was a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. If he could join in on the Divine Formation of the Heavens, it would doubtlessly increase its power substantially.","“Fellow Yang Yutian, have you decided on how to deal with this person?” Lan Caidie asked Jian Chen again.","“Yeah, I have.” Jian Chen gripped the shrunken Energy-devouring Furnace and made his way over slowly. He arrived before the ancient seal and stared at the Hundred Nights Ancestor’s stuck soul. His eyes shone with an eerie light.","The Hundred Nights Ancestor shivered from the bottom of his heart from how Jian Chen looked at him. He was overcome with an ill omen. He felt like he was facing impending doom.","“Fellow, spare me this time. Your wish will be my command for the next ten thousand years. If you want me to do something, I’ll never even consider the contrary.” The Hundred Nights Ancestor tried his best to stay alive. He refused to give up on any glimmers of hope.","At this moment, a tremendous presence no weaker than Lan Caidie suddenly appeared. A particularly large figure silently appeared beside Jian Chen. He was dressed in black robes, radiating with powerful demon Qi.","He was the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt.","“It’s you?” As soon as the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt appeared, he saw Lan Caidie with her walking cane. After feeling slightly surprised, he let out a strange laugh. “Hehehehe, I’ve actually encountered you again. You managed to escape last time, but I’ll make sure you’re going nowhere this time.”","As he said that, the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt surged with demon Qi. The tremendous pressure of a Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt flooded the surroundings.","“Thousand Soul Demon Exalt, I didn’t call you out here to fight.” Jian Chen said, which made the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt’s presence halt.","The Hundred Nights Ancestor fell silent as well. He stared closely at the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt with widened eyes. In his memory, someone like him was not among the three hundred off cultivators that entered the Skyscraping World.","“I’ll reward this soul to you,” Jian Chen pointed at the Hundred Nights Ancestor’s soul and said to the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt.","The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt immediately shifted his attention over. His eyes lit up, but shortly afterwards, he noticed the ancient seal that trapped the soul. His eyes narrowed as he became stern.","“I’ll hand this soul over to you. You better hang onto it. Don’t let him escape.” Lan Caidie removed the ancient seal in an extremely cooperative manner. She trapped the Hundred Nights Ancestor’s soul in one hand and passed it over to the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt.","The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt did not accept it. Instead, he gazed at Lan Caidie deeply. Wariness filled the depths of his eyes.","“You don’t have to be afraid of me. As long as you’re still with Yang Yutian, you won’t be an enemy of mine.” Lan Caidie seemed to notice the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt’s wariness of her, which made her smile gently.","The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt did not say anything. Black mist swept out from his body and immediately claimed the Hundred Nights Ancestor’s soul.","“Thank you for your reward, sect master. With this soul, even if I can’t return to my peak strength, I’ll be able to return to the Fourth Heavenly Layer, albeit just barely.” The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt clasped his fist towards Jian Chen.","“You can go back first. I’ll call you when I need you again.” Jian Chen instructed him before sending the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt back into the Primeval Divine Hall.","Lan Caidie had already seen both the Primeval Divine Hall and the Divine Formation of the Heavens, so there was no need to keep hiding them in front of her.","“Tell me, why did you help me?” Jian Chen looked at Lan Caidie again. Despite having witnessed her strength that surpassed her peers, Jian Chen still was not wary, not even in the slightest."]},{"number":3897,"title":"Chapter 3897: Moving as a Trio","paragraphs":["Lan Caidie seemed extremely elderly in appearance. Her face was covered with wrinkles, and her eyes had been reduced to just a crack. She stood there with a walking cane in hand. Her presence was contained, and she hid all of her pressure. She seemed like a regular old woman devoid of any threats.","“I sincerely apologise to you for the misunderstanding several months ago. I hope you can forgive me for the offence I initially caused.” Lan Caidie bowed slightly towards Jian Chen.","As one of the vice cult leaders of the Ghost Immortal cult and someone who had received the recognition of an extremely powerful Remains of the Ghost Immortal, Lan Caidie had basically been designated as the next cult leader. Yet right now, she was performing such a great gesture of apology to an Immortal Emperor junior, which was unbelievable.","“I never thought that when we met again, your attitude would shift so drastically. This must all be due to Xing Caijian.” Jian Chen stared straight at Lan Caidie.","“It was indeed due to her highness. If it were not for what her highness said, I never would have known that fellow Yang Yutian had such a close relationship with senior heavenly emperor,” Lan Caidie said gently.","“Close?” Jian Chen was taken aback. He could not help but become curious. “What exactly did Xing Caijian tell you?”","As if she had noticed Jian Chen’s confusion, Lan Caidie said after a moment of thought, “Please forgive me, fellow. I can’t tell you about the contents of my conversation with her highness without her permission.”","“Looks like Xing Caijian occupies quite a bit of status in your heart.” Jian Chen had no plans on asking any further. He waved his hand at Lan Caidie and said, “Alright. In consideration of the small assistance you’ve given me this time, I won’t dwell on the matter from before. You can go now.”","With that, Jian Chen turned around to leave, returning to the protective formation around the medicinal garden nearby. He planned on powering the Energy-devouring Furnace to continue with draining the formation’s spiritual Qi.","Lan Caidie did not leave. Instead, she remained where she was and hesitated before finally making some kind of decision. “Fellow Yang Yutian, if you don’t mind, I’m willing to remain by your side and assist you. Although I know you have your trump cards and that you basically fear none of the threats in the Skyscraping World, I also understand that using the peerless formation comes with a sizable cost each time. You can’t use it often. If you encounter any small troublemakers, I can deal with them.”","“After all, I’m different from the Demon Exalt. I entered the Skyscraping World officially. I can act as I please in the Skyscraping World, while the Demon Exalt is an existence who must hide in the shadows. Once he’s exposed, all the experts in the Skyscraping World will know that fellow Yang Yutian possesses a treasure of that level.”","“Even with your superior strength, you’re actually willing to remain by my side and assist me?” Jian Chen was surprised. He looked back at Lan Caidie in interest and said, “Tell me, what do you want in exchange? Don’t tell me it’s the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit?”","With her thoughts read, Lan Caidie felt slightly awkward, but she still said stubbornly, “You’re right, fellow Yang Yutian. I am indeed after the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit. The Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit is extremely important to our Ghost Immortal cult, so I hope you could grant it to us.” As she said that, Lan Caidie bowed deeply towards Jian Chen, not only showing great sincerity, but also showing great humility.","Jian Chen hesitated as if he was weighing the benefits against the cost.","Lan Caidie added, “Originally, I planned on using other precious resources to exchange for the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit, but after seeing the heavenly resources you’ve gathered in the Skyscraping World, who knows how many of them you’ve already accumulated. Why would you still be interested in what I have? As a result, I came up with another plan.”","“It’ll come down to whether you’re strong enough or not if you want to assist me. If you fail to assist me, you might just end up becoming deadweight,” Jian Chen said.","Seeing how Jian Chen was showing signs of budging, Lan Caidie immediately beamed with joy. “You’ve witnessed my strength. It’s not a problem at all for me to deal with those Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts. As for the Fourth Heavenly Layer, I might not be able to defeat them but keeping them occupied for a while is no difficulty.”","“Of course, this is only limited to regular experts. If I encounter supreme prodigies who can challenge those stronger than themselves, my advantage will become negligible.”","“Can you still use that power lurking inside you?” Jian Chen asked.","Lan Caidie shook her head and said, “I won’t be able to use the power of the Remains of the Ghost Immortal any time soon, but if I ingest a Blood pill and use an ancient secret technique to stimulate it, I’ll be able to use it again in just a year’s time.”","“Then do you carry this Blood pill with you?” Jian Chen looked at Lan Caidie in interest. If she could still use that power, she could be of great help when it mattered.","“I obviously do, but these pills are quite precious, so I am reluctant to use them unless I have to,” said Lan Caidie.","“If you use one of those pills right now, then I can agree to your conditions. Assist me with your full strength before we leave the Skyscraping World. In return, I will give you the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit.” With a flip of his hand, he took out the jade box that contained the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit.","“Deal!” Lan Caidie agreed without hesitation. She immediately took out a blood-red pill from her Space Ring and ingested it.","With the pill, she only needed a year’s time to recover and use the power of the Remains of the Ghost Immortal again. It was so powerful that it could rival the Divine Formation of the Heavens at its current level.","“I want to destroy the protective formation of the medicinal garden now. You will work together with the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt to power the Energy-devouring Furnace.” Afterwards, Jian Chen roped Lan Caidie into his group of labourers as well.","However, with Lan Caidie’s participation, the Energy-devouring Furnace immediately erupted with unprecedented light as if all of its potential had been completely released. It began to absorb spiritual Qi faster than it had ever before.","Jian Chen’s rate of going through medicinal gardens immediately multiplied.","Finally, after three days, the protective formation had all of its energy drained by the Energy-devouring Furnace. It collapsed by itself.","However, as soon as the formation collapsed, Lan Caidie seemed to sense something. She immediately vanished silently before backing a thousand kilometres away.","At the same time, the power of a soul appeared in the medicinal garden. An illusionary figure silently appeared from the stone tablet in the centre of the medicinal garden, radiating with tremendous pressure.","This was a powerful Immortal Exalt who had reached the Sixth Heavenly Layer at the very least.","However, he had only left behind an insignificant shred of the power of his soul here, primarily to serve as a deterrence.","“Thousand Soul Demon Exalt!” Jian Chen called out.","The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt let out a strange laugh and took action without any hesitation. His surging demon Qi turned into a huge hand that struck the soul clone without any hesitation.","“You...”","The expert’s soul that guarded the place flew into a fury, but he only managed to utter a single word before the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt shattered him.","He had left behind a wisp of his soul primarily to learn who the intruder was. It did not possess any particularly great strength, so the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt destroyed it effortlessly.","Lan Caidie only returned after the soul had dissipated, returning to Jian Chen’s side.","“This organisation is not much weaker than our Ghost Immortal cult. In order to avoid making too many enemies, I have no other choice but to hide. Please forgive me, fellow,” Lan Caidie said apologetically to Jian Chen."]},{"number":3898,"title":"Chapter 3898: The Third Person from the Immortal Feather Sect","paragraphs":["“Not a problem!” Jian Chen was unconcerned. He pointed at the field of flourishing heavenly resources in front of him and said, “Since you’re assisting me, I’m not going to tend to them personally.”","“Just leave it to me!” Lan Caidie had no complaints. She retrieved a large number of jade boxes from her Space Ring and rushed into the field of heavenly resources, gathering them rapidly.","Jian Chen stood outside the medicinal garden and watched as Lan Caidie busied about. He could not help but say, “Vice cult leader Lan, you’re a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. You possess an extremely honourable status, yet I’m making you handle these miscellaneous matters right now. Do you really have no complaints? Is the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit really that tempting?”","When she heard that, Lan Caidie paused. After a moment of silence, she said hoarsely, “Just a Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit obviously is not enough for me to bend over backwards like this. If I wanted the fruit, I can come up with many different ways to get my hands on it. I made this choice entirely due to senior heavenly emperor.”","“Senior heavenly emperor has shown tremendous kindness to our Ghost Immortal cult. The kindness he’s shown is so great that our Ghost Immortal cult will probably never have the opportunity to repay him. Since you are so heavily favoured by senior heavenly emperor, assisting you is equivalent to helping senior heavenly emperor with his burden,” said Lan Caidie. When she recalled Xing Caidie’s words again, she entered a daze.","“ You better pray he’s still alive. If he were to die, even if I spare you, my father will never spare you. As for my mother, she’ll personally carve you to pieces... ”","Xing Caijian’s words echoed through Lan Caidie’s head like a curse. The waves it set off inside her could only be described as torrential.","“ Heavenly emperor? ” Jian Chen wondered to himself. He obviously knew who the heavenly emperor that Lan Caidie was referring to was. That had to be the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor of the Heavenly Star Palace.","However, he was extremely curious about what Xing Caijian had said to Lan Caidie that made her believe the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor favoured him so much.","After all, he had never even seen the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor who stood at the apex of the world.","Jian Chen left the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt and Lan Caidie to gather the God Tier heavenly resources in the medicinal garden. However, he did not idle around either. He stood outside the medicinal garden and used the secret technique from the Skyscraping Sword Venerable to observe the surrounding area. Nothing could escape his senses.","However, after picking all the heavenly resources, they had run out of jade boxes as well. There were extremely stringent requirements for preserving these God Tier heavenly resources. They could only be preserved over long periods of time through specially-made jade boxes. Otherwise, their efficacy would weaken with time.","At a time like this, the several hundred thousand disciples of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens in the Primeval Divine Hall came into use. Under the arrangements of elder Nong, the disciples all stopped cultivating and took part in the production of jade boxes, providing Jian Chen with a steady supply of containers for various God Tier heavenly resources.","After collecting all the heavenly resources in the medicinal garden, Jian Chen sent the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt back inside the Primeval Divine Hall to hide while he and Lan Caidie proceeded to the next medicinal garden.","The medicinal gardens in the Skyscraping World constantly decreased. By now, all of the cultivators in the Skyscraping World could clearly sense that the thinned-out spiritual Qi was gradually recovering.","Even though it was still quite far away from its original density, this was still a positive sign.","......","...","“It’s you! The vice cult leader of the Ghost Immortal cult, Lan Caidie...”","“I’ve found Yang Yutian. Sure enough, he’s fearlessly harvesting all of the medicinal gardens in the Skyscraping World, but he’s actually with the vice cult leader of the Ghost Immortal cult, Lan Caidie...”","“Dammit, don’t tell me Yang Yutian has already fallen under the control of Lan Caidie? She’s a real piece of work...”","“Lan Caidie was recognised by an extremely powerful Remains of the Ghost Immortal. It’s said that once she uses that power, even those with our cultivations will only face death...”","“We can’t provoke the Ghost Immortal cult. The heavenly resources on Yang Yutian are very tempting, but you still have to be alive to enjoy it...”","......","...","For the next period of the time, many of the experts who coveted Jian Chen’s heavenly resources came across him through a targeted search. However, when they saw Lan Caidie who accompanied Jian Chen, many of them became wary and extinguished their burning flames of greed.","Of course, the people who knew about Lan Caidie’s strength all came from extraordinary backgrounds and were extremely well-informed.","However, there were also a few Immortal Exalts who were unaware of Lan Caidie’s powers. Unable to resist the temptation and insistent on getting a share, they obviously could not avoid an intense battle with Lan Caidie.","In the end, everyone witnessed Lan Caidie’s shocking battle prowess that completely surpassed her peers. They ended up heavily injured, fleeing for their lives.","Unless they were supreme prodigies or had reached the Third Heavenly Layer, no one was Lan Caidie’s opponent.","Even a few regular Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts could be overwhelmed by Lan Caidie!","“Fellow Yang Yutian, you seem to know the Skyscraping World like the back of your hand. I’ve noticed that you’ve only been travelling along straight paths the entire time,” Lan Caidie asked curiously as they continued towards the next medicinal garden.","“I’m not familiar with the Skyscraping World. I only know where each medicinal garden is located because senior Skyscraping Sword Venerable has specially provided me with a map which clearly marks out the location of each medicinal garden.” Jian Chen confessed.","When she heard that, Lan Caidie shuddered inside. She became even more certain about Jian Chen’s extraordinary identity.","If he were someone ordinary, why would he have received the special care of someone like the Skyscraping Sword Venerable?","“ Senior Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor and Venerable Caijian favour Yang Yutian heavily. Now, even the Skyscraping Sword Venerable has shown him particular care. What exactly are Yang Yutian’s origins? ” Lan Caidie wondered. She became even more curious about Jian Chen’s true identity. She almost asked him directly several times.","Before long, Jian Chen and Lan Caidie arrived at the next medicinal garden. As soon as they approached the place, they discovered a middle-aged man in white robes who sat with his legs crossed and eyes shut outside the protective formation.","When she saw this person, Lan Caidie furrowed her brows. She was stern.","Jian Chen was surprised at first, but he smiled mysteriously the next moment.","“Great elder of the Immortal Feather sect, Tian Changji!” Lan Caidie said sternly. Her gaze was filled with caution.","The Immortal Feather sect had three Immortal Emperor great elders who entered the Skyscraping World this time. Two of them were mid Immortal Emperors, who soon reached the Seventh Heavenly Layer after entering the Skyscraping World.","The last person was a late Immortal Emperor, as well as the middle-aged man in front of them right now, Tian Changji!","Tian Changji was a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor!","At this moment, Tian Changji who sat near the medicinal garden slowly opened his eyes. His gaze was cold, devoid of any emotions. He glanced at Lan Caidie and Jian Chen and said, “Vice cult leader of the Ghost Immortal cult, Lan Caidie. I’ve heard of you. Even in our Immortal Feather sect, many people know about you. Even quite a few people of our Immortal Feather sect believe that you have an extremely high chance of reaching late Immortal Exalt!”","“It is a great honour for me to be known by the fellows of the Immortal Feather sect.” Lan Caidie clutched her fist. Despite only facing an Immortal Emperor, she did not dare to underestimate him. Instead, she was stern.","This was not due to his strength but because of his background. He was a great elder of the Immortal Feather sect!","The Immortal Feather sect was a colossal organisation on the same level as the Heavenly Star Palace. They were well beyond what the Ghost Immortal cult could provoke.","“Vice cult leader Lan, is this person under your control?” Tian Changji pointed at Jian Chen on the side and said emotionlessly.","“Fellow Yang Yutian is someone that princess Caijian favours heavily. How could I place such an important person under my control?” Lan Caidie said politely.","“That would be for the best. I’m here exactly for him. Vice cult leader Lan, step aside.” Tian Changji’s face was cold. He gave off a sense of arrogance.","As a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor great elder of the Immortal Feather sect, his status was only beneath the ancestors of the sect. He truly possessed the right to be aloof."]},{"number":3899,"title":"Chapter 3899: Tian Changji Perishes (1)","paragraphs":["Lan Caidie’s expression changed slightly. Her voice also became serious. “Tian Changji, don’t tell me you’ve also come for the resources on Yang Yutian? You’re a great elder of one of the twelve courts of heaven, the Immortal Feather sect. If you go after a junior over this petty amount of resources, I’m afraid it’ll only damage the reputation of your Immortal Feather sect if it makes it out.”","When he heard that, Tian Changji sneered. He stared at Lan Caidie and said, “There’s just the three of us here. Even if I actually do that, how will it make it out? After all, there’s no one else here.”","“Don’t tell me you will proactively spread this news and turn our Immortal Feather sect into a laughing stock who robs a junior of his resources?”","“Does your Ghost Immortal cult have that courage?”","Towards the end, Tian Changji’s tone suddenly sharpened. He used his strength as a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor to threaten a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt fearlessly.","Lan Caidie’s face was sunken. “Tian Changji, it’s true that neither I nor the Ghost Immortal cult behind me has the courage to offend your Immortal Feather sect. Unfortunately, fellow Yang Yutian is no ordinary person. Not only is he favoured by princess Xing Caijian, but he’s also favoured by senior heavenly emperor of the Heavenly Star Palace. As a result, I will not just stand by and watch fellow Yang Yutian be threatened by you. If you insist on stealing fellow Yang Yutian’s heavenly resources, then I will definitely make this matter public.”","“I’d like to see how the ancestors of your Immortal Feather sect punishes a person who drags the reputation of your sect through the mud. You better witness the power of my Remains of the Ghost Immortal instead.”","Lan Caidie’s uncooperative attitude took Tian Changji by surprise, but he soon smiled. “I never thought you’d actually make such a great sacrifice for this person, but you better not use the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor to frighten me. If Yang Yutian really was someone favoured by the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor, why would he have so little renown? Moreover, it’s not like I’m blind. While I’m also curious about why Xing Caijian treats him differently, there is something that I can be certain about. Before he came to the Skyscraping World, Xing Caijian did not know him.”","“If he really is favoured by the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor, why would Xing Caijian not recognise him as the daughter of the heavenly emperor?”","“In other words, you have your mind set on stealing fellow Yang Yutian’s heavenly resources?” Lan Caidie said sternly. At the same time, she secretly communicated with Jian Chen, sternly warning him against developing a grudge with Tian Changji. If he really ran out of options, it would be best if he gave up a portion of his heavenly resources to deal with this issue.","Lan Caijian was clearly extremely wary of courts of heaven. She did not have the courage to provoke them at all, as they were colossal existences that could bring annihilation to the Ghost Immortal cult.","Tian Changji stared at Lan Caidie and said nothing. Lan Caidie did not continue either. For a moment, the atmosphere became quite oppressive.","The silence lasted for several seconds before Tian Changji suddenly smiled. Meanwhile, the oppressive atmosphere seemed to ease up with his smile.","“Vice cult leader Lan, your courage is indeed admirable. However, there is something that you’ve mistaken. Yang Yutian has plundered several dozen heavenly resources in the Skyscraping World. The heavenly resources he’s accumulated are enough to leave everyone here envious. Even I am no exception.”","“However, my primary reason for finding Yang Yutian is not for his heavenly resources. Instead, it is to confirm a matter.” Tian Changji smiled gently. Before Lan Caidie could respond, he suddenly looked at Jian Chen; his gaze immediately sharpened. His voice became chilling. “Recently, I received a piece of news that of the three great elders from our Immortal Feather sect that entered the Skyscraping World this time, the other two have both been killed by you. Yang Yutian, is this true?”","“What did you say? Fellow Yang Yutian killed two great elders of the Immortal Feather sect?” Before Jian Chen could reply, Lan Caidie blurted out in surprise. Her face was filled with shock and disbelief before turning to deep fear.","Against an organisation like the Immortal Feather sect, even killing an ordinary, low level disciple would be catastrophic for a peak organisation.","That was because the dignity of a court of heaven could not be besmirched!","As for killing great elders, the consequences were so terrifying that even Lan Caidie did not dare to imagine it.","However, there was something that she could be certain about. If she had killed a great elder of the Immortal Feather sect, even the Ghost Immortal cult would face devastation. Not even the Heavenly Star Palace could protect them.","“Tian Changji, you better not throw accusations around like that. Fellow Yang Yutian has no feud with your Immortal Feather sect, so why would he kill two great elders of your sect for no reason?” Lan Caidie’s tone became panicked. She was extremely stern. She was obviously aware that Jian Chen had the ability, but she still hoped that this was a misunderstanding.","The consequences for killing great elders of the Immortal Feather sect were far too severe.","Tian Changji did not pay any attention to Lan Caidie. He stared sharply at Jian Chen and growled, “Yang Yutian, did the other two great elders of our Immortal Feather sect die to your hand or not?”","“ Fellow Yang Yutian, regardless of whether this is true or not, you can never admit to it. Once you admit it, there will be no more room for maneuver. ” Lan Caidie communicated to Jian Chen sternly. She was extremely cautious, afraid that Tian Changji would overhear them.","Jian Chen smiled mysteriously. He ignored Lan Caidie’s advice and met Tian Changji’s gaze. He said with ease, “That’s right. The two other people who entered the Skyscraping World from the Immortal Feather sect were indeed killed by me. They’ve both perished. Now, only you’re missing.”","Lan Caidie immediately paled. At that moment, she had no idea what to do.","Tian Changji’s face was frosty. His eyes became filled with killing intent. He flew into a fury. “How bold of you, Yang Yutian. You actually killed great elders of our Immortal Feather sect. Even the Heavenly Star Palace won’t be able to protect you this time.”","With that, Tian Changji’s presence suddenly erupted. The pressure of a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor radiated out. The light from three different laws circled around him.","He grasped three different ways. His Laws of the Sword were at the Ninth Heavenly Layer of Immortal Emperor, his Laws of Metal were at the Eighth Heavenly Layer of Immortal Emperor, and his Laws of Wood were at the Seventh Heavenly Layer of Immortal Emperor.","With the three laws, the pressure he gave off was so powerful that it directly approached the First Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt.","“This person killed two great elders of our Immortal Feather sect. His crimes cannot be forgiven. Vice cult leader Lan, if you want to bring destruction upon the Ghost Immortal cult, feel free to interfere.” Tian Changji’s voice was icy-cold. He did not even try to hide his killing intent. He held a fan in hand. As the fan unfolded, it shone brightly with the metallic glean of a sword. It turned into a silvery-white stream that swept towards Jian Chen.","Lan Caidie’s expression changed multiple times. She was uncertain and faced great conflict.","She could not afford to offend the Immortal Feather sect. Even with the power of the Remains of the Ghost Immortal, she still did not dare to face the wrath of the Immortal Feather sect.","However, Yang Yutian also happened to be a person favoured by the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor. If she simply stood by, she could not face the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor in the future."]},{"number":3900,"title":"Chapter 3900: Tian Changji Perishes (2)","paragraphs":["“This is a matter between me and the Immortal Feather sect. You only have to stand aside and watch. You don’t need to get involved,” Jian Chen said indifferently. The Heaven-lifting sword had already appeared in his hand silently. He directly rushed towards Tian Changji with the sword in hand.","Boom!","The Heaven-lifting sword freely released its pressure as a high quality god artifact, shining brightly as it clashed heavily with Tian Changji’s sword Qi, erupting with a deafening rumble. Sword Qi scattered through the space, falling like rain and slicing apart all of the vegetation within a thousand kilometres.","From their first clash, the power that the two Immortal Emperors erupted with actually rivalled a battle between Immortal Exalts!","That was because both Jian Chen and Tian Changji possessed the ability to fight those stronger than them.","“You’re a mere Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor, but through a high quality god artifact alone, you’re able to fend off my attack. I sure have underestimated you a little,” Tian Changji frowned as if he was displeased with how he had failed to injure Jian Chen with that attack. However, in the next moment, an even more terrifying power emanated from him. The folding fan in his hand shone even brighter. With a clang, one of the ribs suddenly flew out like a sword, stabbing towards Jian Chen with lightning speed.","Ding!","Jian Chen thrust out with the Heaven-lifting sword, colliding with the fan rib heavily. The fan rib was repelled, merging back into the folding fan.","Jian Chen shuddered as he stumbled back several dozen steps uncontrollably. With each step, he left behind a deep print in the ground.","Tian Changji was left rather irritated from failing to injure an opponent whose cultivation was well beneath his own. With a sneer, his gaze became even sharper. His clothes danced. He formed a seal with his hand and condensed a profound seal, sending it into the folding fan.","Immediately, the folding fan that was no more than thirty centimetres long expanded. It turned into a huge fan that hovered over him, releasing startling amounts of sword Qi.","In the next moment, the clear thrumming of swords rang out unceasingly. The folding fan produced ribs after ribs. They all shone with dazzling light, shooting towards Jian Chen in a straight line.","A total of eighteen fan ribs turned into eighteen swords. The power behind each sword had reached the First Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt.","When the eighteen swords lined up like that, it was equivalent to an Immortal Exalt unleashing eighteen attacks in a row!","Jian Chen’s eyes shone. He became rather solemn. Tian Changji was not the strongest opponent he had encountered, but he was definitely the strongest Immortal Emperor he had encountered in the Immortals’ World.","He was so powerful that he had even surpassed the first great elder of the Immortal Feather sect he had encountered when contending for the position of Thousand Immortal General, Xia Mingtian.","However, Xia Mingtian’s strength had truly reached the peak of Immortal Emperor. He was only a step away from Immortal Exalt.","Meanwhile, Tian Changji had yet to reach the very end of the Ninth Heavenly Layer of Immortal Emperor.","Jian Chen erupted with blinding light. Powerful Laws of the Sword wrapped around him. He immediately swung out with the Heaven-lifting sword, receiving the eighteen incoming swords.","Boom! Boom! Boom! Boom...","In a split second, Jian Chen slashed out eighteen times. Each strand of sword Qi was like a soaring dragon in the air, colliding with the eighteen swords violently with light that dimmed the sun. The powerful storms of energy it produced even left Lan Caidie stern as she watched on from a distance.","To her sorrow, she discovered that if she were at the same cultivation as them, she would not be either of their opponents unless she used the power of the Remains of the Ghost Immortal.","Following the eighteen swords, Tian Changji remained where he was without budging. He allowed the violent storm of energy to sweep past him. It could not budge him at all.","Meanwhile, Jian Chen retreated again and again. By the time he had blocked Tian Changji’s eighteen swords, he had already backed away by several kilometres. His clothes were tattered with many rips.","Tian Changji was very powerful, even stronger than Xia Mingtian. With Jian Chen’s disadvantage in cultivation, it was unavoidable for him to lose the upper hand.","Of course, neither of them had used their trump cards yet.","Looking at Jian Chen who remained unscathed, Tian Changji squinted his eyes. Chilling light shone from his squinted eyes. He said coldly, “The Laws of the Sword, the Chaotic Body... Yang Yutian, I know who you are. So you’re that Chang Yang, the person who defeated Xia Mingtian in the Observance Heaven City.”","Reaching there, Tian Changji paused. His voice grew even colder as his killing intent grew even heavier. “You also killed great elder Yan Gang of our Immortal Feather sect, right?”","“Yan Gang? I don’t know who he is, but it is true that more than two great elders of the Immortal Feather sect have died by my hand. There was also an Immortal Emperor who pursued me through outer space. He comprehended the Laws of Space and was at the Seventh Heavenly Layer. Are you talking about him?” Jian Chen smiled gently.","“That’s right, he is Yan Gang!” Tian Changji’s eyes reddened slightly as his teeth creaked from how hard he gritted them. He looked at Jian Chen with complete hostility and said with a voice that seemed to originate from the depths of hell, “I don’t have many close friends in the Immortal feather sect, but my relationship with Yan Gang can be described as friends of life and death, yet he died by your hand.”","“Yang Yutian, you deserve nothing but death!”","Tian Changji flew into a fury and bellowed aloud. He directly arrived in front of Jian Chen with his folding fan. The fan surged with sword Qi as they became locked in an intense battle.","Jian Chen was fearless. The Heaven-lifting sword in his hand shone with blinding light, constantly clashing against Tian Changji’s folding fan with the might of a high quality god artifact. The storm of sword Qi wreaked havoc through the surroundings as the sharp aura diced all the surrounding vegetation.","Fortunately, this was the Skyscraping World, which was protected by multiple formations. No matter how intensely they fought, they failed to harm the foundations of the place.","In the distance, Lan Caidie was completely dumbfounded. Even with her strength that had already reached the Second Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt, she was left rather stumped.","That was because she had already become completely stunned by Tian Changji’s words. Yang Yutian had actually killed more than just one great elder of the Immortal Feather sect. Before this, a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor great elder had died by his hand as well.","The other matter was regarding his identity. Yang Yutian was actually using a false identity. His true identity was Chang Yang!","Lan Caidie had heard of Chang Yang before, but she did not know much about him. She did not know about what had happened in the Observance Heaven City. She had only heard that the Immortal Feather sect had set out a bounty to the entire Immortals’ World to capture an Immortal Emperor called Chang Yang!","The Immortal Feather sect’s bounty had made countless experts and organisations throughout the thirty-three heavens of the Immortals’ World search for him in hopes of forging a tie with a court of heaven...","“ The Chang Yang that the Immortal Feather sect wants captured is actually Yang Yutian! ” Lan Caidie was left in a daze. She never thought that the person who had stirred up such a mess would appear before her eyes like this."]}]);
